window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df03"]={"id": "df03", "title": "Fokker–Planck 方程与密度演化", "focus": "从 Itô 引理与测试函数推导 Fokker–Planck 方程，给出守恒形式、弱解定义、边界通量条件与平稳分布；说明密度演化的适定性。", "claims": ["\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(x)f(x,t))+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t(x)", "\\text{守恒形式：}\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0,\\ J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t", "\\text{平稳分布 }p_\\infty:\\ \\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0"], "topics": ["Fokker–Planck 方程推导", "概率流与守恒形式", "生成元的伴随", "弱解与测试函数", "边界通量条件", "平稳分布", "与 Liouville 方程的关系", "密度演化的数值格式", "一维闭式例子", "反例：边界通量非零导致质量不守恒", "多维 FP 方程", "熵与自由能", "代码：FP 方程的有限差分解", "代码：质量守恒的数值验证", "与概率流 ODE 的接口", "本章推导链：SDE 到密度"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df03--h-Fokker-Planck-方程推导\">Fokker–Planck 方程推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-Fokker-Planck-方程推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节承接全章起点，固定如下对象与记号。设时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>。设状态空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，配以 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 与 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。设滤过概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},(\\mathcal{F}_t)_{t\\in I},\\mathbb{P})$</span> 满足通常条件。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times I\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:I\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 为确定性系数，分别称为漂移与扩散速率；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非负是扩散项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g(t)^2$</span> 的来源。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\in I}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{F}_t)$</span>-适应的标准 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维 Brownian 运动。</p>\n<p>本节只使用以下符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值连续适应过程；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下的分布密度（相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为测试函数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(f(\\cdot,t),g(t))$</span> 相配的二阶生成元；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 为其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mathrm{d}x)$</span> 形式伴随；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 为概率流。凡新符号均在首次出现处定义。</p>\n<p>本节的核心假设（H1）—（H4）如下，后续每个命题显式引用所需子集。</p>\n<p>（H1）漂移正则性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d\\times I$</span> 上 Borel 可测，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\cdot,t)$</span> 局部 Lipschitz；存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in I}\\|f(\\cdot,t)\\|_{\\infty}\\le C_f$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续。</p>\n<p>（H2）扩散正则性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:I\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in I}g(t)\\le C_g&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>（H3）分布正则性：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=1$</span>；且映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中弱连续。进一步，在推导方程的局部步骤中要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in W^{2,1}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。</p>\n<p>（H4）Itô 过程存在性：在（H1）（H2）下，SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}X_t=f(X_t,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t+g(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}W_t,\\qquad X_0\\sim p_0\\,\\mathrm{d}x$$</div>\n<p>有唯一强解，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的分布绝对连续于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x$</span>，其密度记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>（H4）在（H1）有界全局 Lipschitz 与（H2）有界下由标准 SDE 理论给出；密度绝对连续性由 Girsanov 变换与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)&gt;0$</span> 的椭圆性给出；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t_0)=0$</span>，则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0$</span> 的邻域内方程退化，本节只在下文明确要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)&gt;0$</span> 的命题中使用椭圆性，其余命题不依赖它。</p>\n<p>本节要证明的主结论是：在（H1）—（H4）及必要的附加正则性下，密度族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_t)$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(x)f(x,t))+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t(x),$$</div>\n<p>并给出其守恒形式与一个可检验的恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-从-Itô-引理到测试函数恒等式\">从 Itô 引理到测试函数恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-从-Itô-引理到测试函数恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（Itô 测试函数恒等式）</strong> 假设（H1）（H2）（H4）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in I$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi(X_t)=\\varphi(X_0)+\\int_0^t \\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi(X_s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s+\\int_0^t g(s)\\nabla\\varphi(X_s)\\cdot\\mathrm{d}W_s,$$</div>\n<p>其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi(x):=f(x,s)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac12 g(s)^2\\Delta\\varphi(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由（H1）<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界且局部 Lipschitz，（H2）<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 有界连续，SDE 强解存在且路径连续。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 具有紧支撑，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\varphi$</span> 有界。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(X_t)$</span> 应用 Itô 公式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维版本）：二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[X^i,X^j]_t=\\int_0^t g(s)^2\\delta^{ij}\\,\\mathrm{d}s$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}\\varphi(X_t)=\\nabla\\varphi(X_t)\\cdot\\mathrm{d}X_t+\\tfrac12\\sum_{i,j}\\partial_i\\partial_j\\varphi(X_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}[X^i,X^j]_t$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=\\nabla\\varphi(X_t)\\cdot f(X_t,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t+g(t)\\nabla\\varphi(X_t)\\cdot\\mathrm{d}W_t+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\varphi(X_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p>整理即得。随机积分项为鞅，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 有界，其二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t g^2|\\nabla\\varphi(X_s)|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\le C_g^2\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty^2 t&lt;\\infty$</span>，故为真鞅。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（期望形式）</strong> 假设同命题 1，且（H3）中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\varphi$</span> 有界。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_0)]+\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi(X_s)]\\,\\mathrm{d}s.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对命题 1 取期望。随机积分项期望为零（真鞅）。需交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t$</span>：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\mapsto\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi(X_s)]$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi(X_s)]|\\le C_f\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty+\\tfrac12 C_g^2\\|\\Delta\\varphi\\|_\\infty&lt;\\infty,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\mapsto \\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi(X_s(\\omega))$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span> 连续（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_s$</span> 连续），故由 Fubini（有界被积函数在有限测度空间上）可交换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 是本节推导的出发点：它把“密度的演化”转化为“对任意测试函数的期望恒等式”。注意它与命题 1 的区别：命题 1 是路径级恒等式，命题 2 是分布级恒等式；后者只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>，不涉及路径。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-由测试函数恒等式导出-Fokker-Planck-方程\">由测试函数恒等式导出 Fokker–Planck 方程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-由测试函数恒等式导出-Fokker-Planck-方程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 3（Fokker–Planck 方程，强形式）</strong> 假设（H1）—（H4），并附加：（H3'）对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in W^{2,1}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t f(\\cdot,t)\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>；（H5）对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 存在且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 中关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in I$</span> 与 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(x)f(x,t))+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi(x)p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi(x)p_0(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\int_0^t\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi(x)p_s(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}s.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导。左侧由（H5）与 Leibniz 积分法则（被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\varphi$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续且被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\varphi|\\cdot\\sup_t\\|p_t\\|_\\infty$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\varphi$</span> 紧）得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int\\varphi p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>右侧由微积分基本定理与（H5）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi(x)p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。于是对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\big(f(x,t)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\varphi(x)\\big)p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>对右端两项分别做分部积分。第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t f(\\cdot,t)\\in L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑有界，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int p_t f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\int\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)\\,\\mathrm{d}x,$$</div>\n<p>这里用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑使边界项消失，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)\\in L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}$</span>（由（H1）（H3'））。第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t\\in L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int p_t\\,\\Delta\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int\\varphi\\,\\Delta p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x,$$</div>\n<p>同样边界项消失。合并得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int\\varphi\\Big(-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t\\Big)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 任意且两侧均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}$</span>，由 du Bois-Reymond 引理得 a.e. 相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 3 的证明中，两次分部积分的边界项消失均依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑；这是本节“测试函数”方法的本质：把边界通量问题推给测试函数，而不对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在无穷远处的衰减作额外要求。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在无穷远处不衰减而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 不紧支撑，则边界项可能非零，这正是第 10 节反例节的入口。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（守恒形式）</strong> 假设同定理 3。定义概率流</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t(x):=p_t(x)f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t(x).$$</div>\n<p>则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接由定理 3 移项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot\\big(p_t f-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t\\big)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 是本章后续“概率流与守恒形式”一节的接口；本节只给出定义与恒等式，不展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的几何解释。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（质量守恒的测试函数版本）</strong> 假设同定理 3，且取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv 1$</span> 在紧集上、在无穷远处光滑截断的序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_R\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_R\\to 1$</span> 单调。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int p_0\\,\\mathrm{d}x=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在命题 2 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi=\\varphi_R$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi_R$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\varphi_R$</span> 支撑在环域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{R\\le|x|\\le 2R\\}$</span> 内，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在无穷远处有足够衰减使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{|x|\\ge R}p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\to 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int \\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi_R\\,p_s\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\to 0$</span>。由（H3）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{|x|\\ge R}p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\to 0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi_R|\\le C_f\\|\\nabla\\varphi_R\\|_\\infty+\\tfrac12 C_g^2\\|\\Delta\\varphi_R\\|_\\infty\\le C/R$</span>，故被积函数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C p_s/R$</span> 控制，积分趋于零。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi_R p_t\\to\\int p_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi_R p_0\\to\\int p_0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=\\int p_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 5 说明：在定理 3 的正则性下，FP 方程的守恒形式自动蕴含总质量守恒；这不是额外假设，而是分部积分边界项消失的推论。第 10 节将构造边界通量非零的反例，说明去掉紧支撑测试函数或去掉无穷远衰减时质量守恒如何失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-生成元与伴随-两种等价表述\">生成元与伴随：两种等价表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-生成元与伴随-两种等价表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（伴随关系）</strong> 假设（H1）（H2），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in W^{2,1}(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p f\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}_t^* p\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)\\,p\\,\\mathrm{d}x,$$</div>\n<p>其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_t^* p:=-\\nabla\\cdot(p f(\\cdot,t))+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 与定理 3 中分部积分完全相同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,f\\cdot\\nabla p\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span> 一项需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla p$</span>；正确配对是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)p\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int(f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi)p\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\tfrac12 g^2\\int(\\Delta\\varphi)p\\,\\mathrm{d}x$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=-\\int\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(p f)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\tfrac12 g^2\\int\\varphi\\,\\Delta p\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}_t^*p\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<p>边界项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 表明：FP 方程正是“密度按生成元的形式伴随演化”，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\mathcal{L}_t^*p_t$</span>。这与本章第 3 节“生成元的伴随”直接衔接；本节只建立恒等式，不讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 的谱性质。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-一个可检验的恒等式-一维高斯闭式验证\">一个可检验的恒等式：一维高斯闭式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-一个可检验的恒等式-一维高斯闭式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（一维线性漂移的闭式解）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g&gt;0$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x)=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(0,\\sigma_t^2\\big),\\qquad \\sigma_t^2=\\sigma_0^2 e^{-2\\theta t}+\\frac{g^2}{2\\theta}\\big(1-e^{-2\\theta t}\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足定理 3 的 FP 方程。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接验证。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2)^{-1/2}\\exp(-x^2/(2\\sigma_t^2))$</span>。计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}\\Big(\\frac{x^2}{\\sigma_t^2}-1\\Big)p_t,\\qquad \\partial_x p_t=-\\frac{x}{\\sigma_t^2}p_t,\\qquad \\partial_x^2 p_t=\\Big(\\frac{x^2}{\\sigma_t^4}-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big)p_t.$$</div>\n<p>右端 FP 项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\partial_x(p_t f)=\\theta\\,\\partial_x(x p_t)=\\theta p_t+\\theta x\\,\\partial_x p_t=\\theta\\big(1-\\frac{x^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big)p_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2\\partial_x^2 p_t=\\tfrac12 g^2\\big(\\frac{x^2}{\\sigma_t^4}-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big)p_t$</span>。合并右端：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big[\\theta\\big(1-\\tfrac{x^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\big(\\tfrac{x^2}{\\sigma_t^4}-\\tfrac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big)\\Big]p_t.$$</div>\n<p>左端系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}\\big(\\frac{x^2}{\\sigma_t^2}-1\\big)$</span>。比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^2$</span> 项系数与常数项系数，需</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}=-\\frac{\\theta}{\\sigma_t^2}+\\frac{g^2}{2\\sigma_t^4},\\qquad -\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}=\\theta-\\frac{g^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p>第一式乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t=-\\theta+g^2/(2\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，与第二式一致。解 ODE：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\sigma_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot u=-2\\theta u+g^2$</span>，解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t)=u_0 e^{-2\\theta t}+\\frac{g^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>，与命题陈述一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 给出可数值检验的恒等式：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的闭式代入 FP 方程两端，逐点误差应为零（在浮点精度内）。这为第 13 节代码节的有限差分解提供了解析基准。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-适定性的局部说明\">适定性的局部说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-适定性的局部说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（适定性的局部陈述）</strong> 假设（H1）（H2），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\ge g_0&gt;0$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0$</span> 成立。则对任意初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\ge 0$</span>，FP 方程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 中存在唯一弱解族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_t)_{t\\in I}$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=\\int p_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路（关键步骤）</strong> 存在性：由（H1）（H2）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\ge g_0$</span>，SDE 强解存在，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 即为弱解；命题 2 给出测试函数恒等式，定理 3 的推导在弱意义下逐字成立（只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 以分布意义理解）。唯一性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t,\\tilde p_t$</span> 为两弱解，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t-\\tilde p_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 满足线性 FP 方程且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q_0=0$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 用能量估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\|q_t\\|_{L^2}^2\\le C\\|q_t\\|_{L^2}^2$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 有界），Gronwall 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=0$</span>。非负性：由 SDE 解的密度非负；或用最大值原理。质量守恒：推论 5。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 的完整证明需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\in L^2$</span> 的能量估计，这超出本节范围；本节只把它作为“适定性在本节假设下成立”的显式陈述，完整证明留给本章第 4 节“弱解与测试函数”与第 8 节“密度演化的数值格式”的稳定性分析。这里明确标注：命题 8 的证明思路依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\ge g_0&gt;0$</span> 的椭圆性；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在某点为零，能量估计退化，唯一性需另行处理。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在（H1）—（H4）及附加正则性（H3'）（H5）下，由 Itô 引理与测试函数期望恒等式（命题 1、2）经分部积分导出 FP 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_t$</span>（定理 3），并给出守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_t f-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t$</span>（推论 4）。</li>\n<li>分部积分的边界项由测试函数紧支撑消除，由此质量守恒（推论 5）是 FP 方程守恒形式的推论而非独立假设；生成元与其形式伴随的配对（命题 6）表明 FP 方程即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\mathcal{L}_t^*p_t$</span>。</li>\n<li>一维线性漂移的闭式高斯解（命题 7）逐点满足 FP 方程，构成可数值检验的恒等式；适定性在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\ge g_0&gt;0$</span> 下由 SDE 密度表示与能量估计给出局部陈述（命题 8），完整证明留待弱解与数值稳定性小节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-弱形式与强形式的等价性\">弱形式与强形式的等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-弱形式与强形式的等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 8 的陈述使用了“弱解”一词，但本节尚未给出其精确定义。为避免与第 4 节“弱解与测试函数”重复展开，这里只给出本节推导所必需的最小定义，并证明它与定理 3 的强形式在正则性足够时等价。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9（FP 弱解）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\ge 0$</span>。称映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto p_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为 FP 方程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 上的弱解，若：</p>\n<p>（i）<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中弱连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in I}\\|p_t\\|_{L^1}&lt;\\infty$</span>；</p>\n<p>（ii）对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in I$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi(x)p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi(x)p_0(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\int_0^t\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\big(f(x,s)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac12 g(s)^2\\Delta\\varphi(x)\\big)p_s(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}s.$$</div>\n<p>定义 9 与定理 3 的区别在于：定义 9 不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 存在，也不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t$</span> 存在；它只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\varphi$</span> 有界（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑与（H1）（H2）保证），从而使右端积分有意义。这是“测试函数方法”的标准产物：把对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的微分要求转移到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 上。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（强解蕴含弱解）</strong> 假设定理 3 的全部条件。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_t)$</span> 是定义 9 意义下的弱解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 定理 3 已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}$</span> 中成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，将定理 3 两端乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上积分，左端由（H5）与 Leibniz 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p_t=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int\\varphi p_t$</span>；右端两次分部积分（边界项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑消失）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\big(f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta\\varphi\\big)p_t$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分即得定义 9（ii）。弱连续性由（H3）给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 说明定义 9 不是新对象，而是定理 3 的积分松弛。反过来，若弱解额外满足（H3'）（H5），则由 du Bois-Reymond 引理可从定义 9（ii）逐字反推定理 3，故两者在正则性足够时等价。这一等价性是本节“推导”与第 4 节“弱解”之间的接口：本节只证明强解满足弱形式，不讨论弱解在更低正则性下的存在性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-边界通量的显式计算\">边界通量的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-边界通量的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 4 的守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上积分给出质量守恒，但这一推导隐含了“无穷远处通量为零”。本节把这一隐含条件显式化，为第 5 节“边界通量条件”与第 10 节反例节提供精确表述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（有界区域上的通量恒等式）</strong> 假设定理 3 的条件，取有界开集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且外法向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 存在。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_\\Omega p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,\\mathrm{d}S,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_t f-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}S$</span> 为边界面积测度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上对守恒形式积分并用散度定理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega\\partial_t p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,\\mathrm{d}S.$$</div>\n<p>左端由（H5）与 Leibniz（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline\\Omega$</span> 上连续可微）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_\\Omega p_t$</span>。散度定理要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in C^1(\\overline\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，由（H1）（H3'）保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11 是本节最重要的“可检验恒等式”之一：它把质量变化率精确等于边界通量。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 时，右端为无穷远处的通量；推论 5 证明它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 有足够衰减时为零，故总质量守恒。命题 11 同时给出一个诊断工具：数值格式若在离散层面不满足“边界通量等于质量变化率”，则格式破坏守恒性；这正是第 14 节“质量守恒的数值验证”的判据。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 12（全空间质量守恒的充分条件）</strong> 假设定理 3 的条件，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=B_R$</span>，由命题 11，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_{B_R}p_t=-\\int_{\\partial B_R}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,\\mathrm{d}S$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1$</span> 与散度定理在无穷远截断上的应用，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,\\mathrm{d}S\\to 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>），因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\nabla\\cdot J_t=\\lim_R\\int_{\\partial B_R}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,\\mathrm{d}S$</span> 且左端有限。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_{B_R}p_t\\to 0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{B_R}p_t\\to\\int p_t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int p_t=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 12 与推论 5 的区别在于：推论 5 用测试函数截断直接证明，推论 12 用通量恒等式证明；两者结论一致，但推论 12 显式暴露了“<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1$</span>”这一条件。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\notin L^1$</span>，则无穷远通量可能非零，质量不守恒——这正是第 10 节反例节的构造目标。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-生成元的坐标表述与无坐标表述\">生成元的坐标表述与无坐标表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-生成元的坐标表述与无坐标表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节公式均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的标准坐标下写出。为与本章第 11 节“多维 FP 方程”及后续流形上的讨论衔接，这里给出坐标表述与无坐标表述的对照，并说明两者在本节假设下一致。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=(x^1,\\dots,x^d)$</span> 为标准坐标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i=\\partial/\\partial x^i$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_i\\big(p_t f^i\\big),\\qquad \\Delta p_t=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_i^2 p_t,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi=f^i\\partial_i\\varphi+\\tfrac12 g^2\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_i^2\\varphi,$$</div>\n<p>指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,\\dots,d$</span>，重复指标求和。无坐标表述为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi=\\langle f(\\cdot,t),\\nabla\\varphi\\rangle_{\\mathbb{R}^d}+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\,\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Hess}\\,\\varphi$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathbb{R}^d}$</span> 为欧氏内积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}$</span> 为 Hessian，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}$</span> 为迹。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上两者逐字相同；在一般 Riemann 流形上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 换为 Laplace–Beltrami 算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 换为关于体积测度的散度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}$</span> 换为 Levi-Civita 联络下的 Hessian，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 的表达式中会出现与曲率相关的项。本节不展开流形情形，只标注：本节所有命题的证明只用到欧氏坐标下的分部积分与散度定理，故在流形上需把这两条替换为相应的无坐标版本，结论形式不变但常数依赖度量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13（坐标不变性检验）</strong> 在（H1）（H2）下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 的坐标表述与无坐标表述在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上逐点相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle f,\\nabla\\varphi\\rangle=\\sum_i f^i\\partial_i\\varphi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Hess}\\,\\varphi=\\sum_i\\partial_i^2\\varphi$</span>，逐项比较即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 13 看似平凡，但它固定了本节符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f^i$</span> 是漂移的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个分量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i$</span> 是对第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个坐标的偏导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 是欧氏 Laplacian 而非 Laplace–Beltrami。后续第 11 节若改用流形记号，必须显式声明替换，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_t$</span> 一项的系数会因度量行列式而改变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-扩散项系数的来源-为什么是-tfrac12-g-2\">扩散项系数的来源：为什么是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-扩散项系数的来源-为什么是-tfrac12-g-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节公式中扩散项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g(t)^2$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2$</span>，其来源是 Itô 公式的二次变差系数。这一细节在工程实现中常被混淆，故在此显式推导并给出一个量纲检验。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14（二次变差与系数）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 满足（H4），<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为标准 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维 Brownian 运动。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}[X^i,X^j]_t=g(t)^2\\delta^{ij}\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 SDE，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}X^i_t=f^i(X_t,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t+g(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}W^i_t$</span>。有限变差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^i\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span> 不贡献二次变差；随机项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\,\\mathrm{d}W^i$</span> 的二次变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2\\,\\mathrm{d}[W^i,W^j]_t=g^2\\delta^{ij}\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，由标准 Brownian 运动的协变差性质。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 14 说明：Itô 公式中二阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\sum_{i,j}\\partial_i\\partial_j\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{d}[X^i,X^j]_t=\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span> 来自 Taylor 展开的二阶项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2$</span> 来自二次变差。若误写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2\\Delta p_t$</span>（漏掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span>），则命题 7 的高斯解方差 ODE 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot u=-2\\theta u+2g^2$</span>，平稳方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2/\\theta$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2/(2\\theta)$</span>，与 SDE 的平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,g^2/(2\\theta))$</span> 不符。这一量纲检验可作为代码节的断言：有限差分解的平稳方差必须匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2/(2\\theta)$</span>，否则扩散项系数写错。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15（平稳方差的系数检验）</strong> 在命题 7 的设置下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to g^2/(2\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在命题 7 的闭式中令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-2\\theta t}\\to 0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\infty^2=g^2/(2\\theta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15 是本节与第 6 节“平稳分布”的接口：平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,g^2/(2\\theta))$</span> 的方差直接读出扩散项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2$</span>。若数值解给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2/\\theta$</span>，则实现中扩散项被误写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2\\Delta p_t$</span>；这一诊断在第 14 节代码节中以 <code>assert</code> 形式出现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-从-SDE-到密度的推导链小结-本节范围内\">从 SDE 到密度的推导链小结（本节范围内）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-从-SDE-到密度的推导链小结-本节范围内\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节完成了本章推导链的第一环：SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> Itô 引理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 测试函数期望恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 分部积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> FP 方程。这一链条的每一步都有显式假设，缺一不可：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>命题 1 需要（H1）（H2）（H4），即漂移有界局部 Lipschitz、扩散有界连续、SDE 强解存在；缺（H4）则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 无定义，Itô 公式无从谈起。</li>\n<li>命题 2 需要（H3）中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑，以保证 Fubini 的被积函数有界；缺 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]$</span> 可能为无穷。</li>\n<li>定理 3 需要（H3'）（H5），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的二阶弱导数可积、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 存在；缺（H5）则无法对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导，只能停留在弱形式（定义 9）。</li>\n<li>推论 4、5 需要定理 3 的全部条件；推论 5 额外用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_R$</span> 截断序列与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的无穷远衰减。</li>\n<li>命题 11、推论 12 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in C^1$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\in L^1$</span>；缺 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1$</span> 则无穷远通量可能非零，质量不守恒（第 10 节反例）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一链条的“弱化”方向是明确的：从强形式（定理 3）到弱形式（定义 9）只需把微分转移到测试函数；从弱形式回到强形式需要 du Bois-Reymond 引理与额外正则性。本节只证明“强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 弱”（命题 10），不证明“弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 强”，后者留待第 4 节。</p>\n<p>本节尚未处理的两个接口是：其一，概率流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的几何解释与概率流 ODE 的速度场关系，留待第 2 节与第 15 节；其二，平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 的充要条件，留待第 6 节。本节只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的定义与通量恒等式（命题 11），不展开其几何内容，以避免与后续小节重复。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-概率流与守恒形式\">概率流与守恒形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-概率流与守恒形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为扩散系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 Itô 过程\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(t)\\,dB_t$$</div>\n在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的概率密度。第 1 节已由 Itô 引理与测试函数论证得到 Fokker–Planck 方程\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(x)f(x,t))+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t(x).$$</div>\n本节不再重复该推导，只处理其守恒形式与概率流的性质。</p>\n<p>本节引入的符号如下，凡后文使用必先在此定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为状态空间，取为开集，边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 超曲面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 为其外法向单位向量场。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 时约定无边界项。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为概率流密度，定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t(x):=p_t(x)f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t(x).$$</div></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}(\\Omega)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span> 的测试函数空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}'(\\Omega)$</span> 为其对偶，即分布空间。</li>\n<li>对向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot V=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_{x_i}V_i$</span>；对矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot A$</span> 表示按行散度得到的向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\nabla\\cdot A)_i=\\sum_j\\partial_{x_j}A_{ij}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节始终假设：</p>\n<p><strong>(H1)（漂移正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1(\\Omega\\times[0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\|f(\\cdot,t)\\|_{C^1}&lt;\\infty$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 无界时进一步假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 具有至多线性增长，以保证 SDE 的强解存在唯一。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2)（扩散正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C([0,T];\\mathbb{R})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\ge 0$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_*&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\ge g_*$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>（非退化扩散）。退化情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=0$</span> 在 Liouville 一节讨论。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3)（密度正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^1([0,T];L^1(\\Omega))\\cap C^2(\\Omega\\times(0,T))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega p_t=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tf$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega\\times(0,T)$</span> 上局部可积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t$</span> 作为分布良定义。</p>\n<p><strong>(H4)（边界通量条件）</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上，对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0\\quad\\text{（法向通量消失）}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 时，以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|\\to\\infty$</span> 的衰减条件替代：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)|f(x,t)|\\to 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla p_t(x)|\\to 0$</span> 足够快，使散度定理的边界项为零。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本节情境下的合理性：H1、H2 是第 1 节推导 FP 方程时已用的 SDE 适定性条件；H3 是 FP 方程古典解的标准正则性，第 4 节将放宽为弱解；H4 是本节守恒形式成立的关键，第 5 节将系统讨论其必要性，第 10 节给出其失效的反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-守恒形式的代数推导\">守恒形式的代数推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-守恒形式的代数推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.1（守恒形式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Omega$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)+\\nabla\\cdot J_t(x)=0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由第 1 节的 FP 方程，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta p_t.$$</div>\n将右端第二项改写为散度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta p_t=\\nabla\\cdot(\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，可提出散度）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)+\\nabla\\cdot(\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t)=-\\nabla\\cdot\\Big(p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t\\Big)=-\\nabla\\cdot J_t.$$</div>\n移项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.2（与第 1 节方程的区别）</strong> 第 1 节的 FP 方程是“非守恒写法”：散度只作用于漂移项，扩散项写成 Laplacian。守恒形式把两项统一进一个散度，使方程呈现“连续性方程”<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 的结构。这一改写不是恒等变形之外的额外假设，而是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta p_t$</span> 识别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t)$</span> 的结果；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 时该识别需改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2$</span> 不可提出散度，本节 H2 排除了这一情形。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.3（质量守恒的积分形式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega p_t\\,dx=\\int_\\Omega p_s\\,dx.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span>，由命题 2.1 与分部积分（散度定理，边界项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑而消失），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_\\Omega p_t\\varphi\\,dx=\\int_\\Omega\\partial_t p_t\\,\\varphi\\,dx=-\\int_\\Omega(\\nabla\\cdot J_t)\\varphi\\,dx=\\int_\\Omega J_t\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,dx.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv 1$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 的紧子集上、在边界附近光滑截断为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 支集不触及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 有界，需 H4 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS=0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_\\Omega p_t=0$</span>，积分得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.4（H4 的不可省）</strong> 推论 2.3 的证明中，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu\\ne 0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 的某正测度集上，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_\\Omega p_t=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS\\ne 0,$$</div>\n质量不守恒。第 10 节将给出具体反例。这说明守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 本身只保证“局部”守恒；全局质量守恒需要 H4。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-概率流的几何意义\">概率流的几何意义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-概率流的几何意义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 2.5（概率流）</strong> 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 为时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的概率流密度。其物理意义是：对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq\\Omega$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_A p_t\\,dx=-\\int_{\\partial A}J_t\\cdot\\nu_A\\,dS,$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内概率质量的变化率等于穿过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial A$</span> 的净流出通量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_A$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的外法向。这是连续性方程的标准解读，由命题 2.1 与散度定理直接得到。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.6（流的分解）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 可唯一分解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t=\\underbrace{p_tf}_{\\text{漂移流}}\\,-\\,\\underbrace{\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t}_{\\text{扩散流}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 2.5 直接读出。唯一性来自两项的函数形式不同：漂移流正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的乘积，扩散流正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 于某开集，则在该开集上两项线性无关（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的倍数，此时两者成比例但系数不同，仍可区分）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.7（漂移流与扩散流的符号）</strong> 扩散流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 指向密度降低的方向（从高密度流向低密度），这是扩散的“抹平”效应；漂移流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tf$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的方向输运质量。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\nabla U$</span> 为梯度场且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\propto e^{-2U/g^2}$</span> 时，两流在每点相消，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\equiv 0$</span>，此即平稳情形，第 6 节展开。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.8（流与得分的关系）</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 的区域，记得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x):=\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t=p_t\\big(f-\\tfrac12g^2 s_t\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t=p_t\\nabla\\log p_t=p_ts_t$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.9（与反向 SDE 漂移的区别）</strong> 推论 2.8 中的组合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-\\tfrac12g^2s_t$</span> 是概率流 ODE 的速度场，即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=0$</span> 时该速度场也未必为零（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\tfrac12g^2s_t$</span> 时为零）。它与反向 SDE 的漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-g^2s_t$</span> 相差一个因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span>，两者不可混同：前者描述确定性输运，后者描述随机反向过程的漂移。第 15 节将给出接口的精确陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-散度定理形式的弱恒等式\">散度定理形式的弱恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-散度定理形式的弱恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.10（弱形式恒等式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega p_t\\varphi\\,dx-\\int_\\Omega p_s\\varphi\\,dx=\\int_s^t\\int_\\Omega J_r\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,dx\\,dr.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span> 于分布意义下成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega\\partial_t p_t\\,\\varphi\\,dx=-\\int_\\Omega(\\nabla\\cdot J_t)\\varphi\\,dx.$$</div>\n右端由分部积分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑，边界项为零）等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega J_t\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,dx$</span>。左端对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分：由 H3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^1([0,T];L^1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega p_t\\varphi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\int_\\Omega p_t\\varphi=\\int_\\Omega\\partial_t p_t\\varphi$</span>（Leibniz 法则，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t\\varphi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}\\varphi$</span> 上连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}\\varphi$</span> 紧）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.11（弱形式的用途）</strong> 命题 2.10 是第 4 节弱解定义的直接来源：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 放松为分布，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 取为测试函数，恒等式成为定义。本节只把它作为古典情形下的恒等式陈述，不展开弱解理论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-流的显式计算\">具体例子：一维 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 流的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-流的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 2.12</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\mathbb{R}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\sqrt{2}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2=1$</span>）。设初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>。已知 FP 方程的解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(0,\\ \\sigma_t^2\\big),\\qquad \\sigma_t^2=\\sigma_0^2e^{-2\\theta t}+\\frac{1-e^{-2\\theta t}}{\\theta}.$$</div>\n验证命题 2.1 与推论 2.8。</p>\n<p><strong>验证</strong> 计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=\\partial_t\\Big[\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma_t^2}}\\exp\\Big(-\\frac{x^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\Big)\\Big].$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\frac{1}{Z_t}e^{-x^2/(2\\sigma_t^2)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma_t^2}$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=p_t\\Big[-\\frac{\\dot Z_t}{Z_t}+\\frac{x^2}{2}\\frac{d}{dt}\\sigma_t^{-2}\\Big].$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的表达式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2=-2\\theta\\sigma_t^2+2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\sigma_t^{-2}=-\\dot\\sigma_t^2/\\sigma_t^4=(2\\theta\\sigma_t^2-2)/\\sigma_t^4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t/Z_t=\\tfrac12\\dot\\sigma_t^2/\\sigma_t^2=-\\theta+1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=p_t\\Big[\\theta-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}+\\frac{x^2}{2}\\frac{2\\theta\\sigma_t^2-2}{\\sigma_t^4}\\Big].$$</div>\n另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\nabla p_t=p_t(-\\theta x)-p_t(-x/\\sigma_t^2)=p_t\\big(-\\theta x+x/\\sigma_t^2\\big)$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_t=\\partial_x J_t$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_x J_t=\\partial_x\\Big[p_t\\Big(-\\theta x+\\frac{x}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big)\\Big]=p_t\\Big(-\\theta+\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big)+p_t\\Big(-\\theta x+\\frac{x}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big)\\Big(-\\frac{x}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big).$$</div>\n展开第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\big(\\theta x^2/\\sigma_t^2-x^2/\\sigma_t^4\\big)$</span>。合并：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_x J_t=p_t\\Big[-\\theta+\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}+\\frac{\\theta x^2}{\\sigma_t^2}-\\frac{x^2}{\\sigma_t^4}\\Big].$$</div>\n比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\partial_x J_t$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=p_t\\Big[\\theta-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}+\\frac{\\theta x^2}{\\sigma_t^2}-\\frac{x^2}{\\sigma_t^4}\\Big]=-\\partial_x J_t.$$</div>\n逐项相等，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\partial_x J_t=0$</span> 成立。同时由推论 2.8，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=x/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f-\\tfrac12g^2s_t=-\\theta x-x/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t/p_t$</span> 的表达式一致（注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-\\tfrac12g^2s_t=-\\theta x-x/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t/p_t=-\\theta x+x/\\sigma_t^2$</span>；两者相差符号，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_t(f-\\tfrac12g^2s_t)$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\nabla\\log p_t=-x/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2s_t=+x/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，一致）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.13（平稳极限）</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to 1/\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=\\mathcal{N}(0,1/\\theta)$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty(-\\theta x)+p_\\infty(x\\theta)=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 于全空间成立，与第 6 节平稳分布条件一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-代码-流的有限差分验证\">代码：流的有限差分验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-代码-流的有限差分验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在一维 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 例上数值验证命题 2.1 的守恒形式，并检查质量守恒（推论 2.3）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 参数\ntheta = 1.0\ng2_half = 1.0          # (1/2) g^2\nsigma0sq = 0.5\nT = 0.5\ndt = 1e-4\nnx = 2001\nL = 8.0\nx = np.linspace(-L, L, nx)\ndx = x[1] - x[0]\n\ndef sigma_sq(t):\n    return sigma0sq * np.exp(-2*theta*t) + (1 - np.exp(-2*theta*t)) / theta\n\ndef p(x, t):\n    s2 = sigma_sq(t)\n    return np.exp(-x**2 / (2*s2)) / np.sqrt(2*np.pi*s2)\n\ndef J(x, t):\n    s2 = sigma_sq(t)\n    return p(x, t) * (-theta*x + x/s2)\n\n# 检查守恒形式：partial_t p + partial_x J = 0\nt0 = 0.2\neps = 1e-6\npt = (p(x, t0+eps) - p(x, t0-eps)) / (2*eps)\nJx = (J(x+eps, t0) - J(x-eps, t0)) / (2*eps)\nresidual = pt + Jx\n# 去掉边界附近（有限差分误差大）\nmask = np.abs(x) &lt; 3.0\nmax_res = np.max(np.abs(residual[mask]))\nprint(&quot;守恒形式残差最大值:&quot;, max_res)\nassert max_res &lt; 1e-4, &quot;守恒形式残差过大&quot;\n\n# 质量守恒：对 p_t 做梯形积分，比较不同时刻\nm0 = np.trapezoid(p(x, 0.0), x)\nm1 = np.trapezoid(p(x, T), x)\nprint(&quot;初始质量:&quot;, m0, &quot;末态质量:&quot;, m1)\nassert abs(m0 - 1.0) &lt; 1e-6\nassert abs(m1 - m0) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;质量不守恒&quot;\n\n# 平稳流：t 很大时 J 应趋于 0\nt_inf = 20.0\nJ_inf = J(x, t_inf)\nprint(&quot;平稳流最大绝对值:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(J_inf)))\nassert np.max(np.abs(J_inf)) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;平稳流不为零&quot;\nprint(&quot;形状:&quot;, x.shape, &quot;全部断言通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：守恒形式残差最大值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级，质量约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.000000$</span>，平稳流最大绝对值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span> 量级，形状 <code>(2001,)</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-流与生成元的坐标无关表述\">流与生成元的坐标无关表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-流与生成元的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 2.14（流的坐标无关表述）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 流形（本节只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的开集情形，但表述保持无坐标形式以备第 11 节多维推广）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上的密度，即关于某固定体积测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{vol}$</span> 的 Radon–Nikodym 导数。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为向量场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为标量函数。定义概率流为如下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(d-1)$</span>-形式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{J}_t:=p_t\\,\\iota_f\\mathrm{vol}-\\tfrac12g^2\\,\\iota_{\\nabla p_t}\\mathrm{vol},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iota$</span> 为内乘，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 由度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 确定（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\nabla p_t,V)=dp_t(V)$</span> 对所有向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>）。则连续性方程的无坐标形式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t(p_t\\mathrm{vol})+d\\mathcal{J}_t=0,$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为外微分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.15（坐标无关形式与守恒形式的等价）</strong> 在标准欧氏坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=(x^1,\\dots,x^d)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\delta_{ij}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{vol}=dx^1\\wedge\\cdots\\wedge dx^d$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_t$</span> 对应向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\mathcal{J}_t=(\\nabla\\cdot J_t)\\mathrm{vol}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 内乘定义给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iota_f\\mathrm{vol}=\\sum_{i=1}^d(-1)^{i-1}f_i\\,dx^1\\wedge\\cdots\\widehat{dx^i}\\cdots\\wedge dx^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iota_{\\nabla p_t}\\mathrm{vol}$</span> 同理。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{J}_t=\\sum_{i=1}^d(-1)^{i-1}\\Big(p_tf_i-\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_{x^i}p_t\\Big)dx^1\\wedge\\cdots\\widehat{dx^i}\\cdots\\wedge dx^d.$$</div>\n外微分作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(d-1)$</span>-形式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d\\mathcal{J}_t=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_{x^i}\\Big(p_tf_i-\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_{x^i}p_t\\Big)dx^1\\wedge\\cdots\\wedge dx^d=(\\nabla\\cdot J_t)\\mathrm{vol}.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t(p_t\\mathrm{vol})+d\\mathcal{J}_t=0$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.16（为何需要坐标无关表述）</strong> 第 11 节把 FP 方程推广到黎曼流形时，Laplacian 需换成 Laplace–Beltrami 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_h$</span>，其定义依赖度量。此时守恒形式中的扩散流应写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2\\,\\iota_{\\nabla_h p_t}\\mathrm{vol}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_h p_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 确定；若误用欧氏梯度，散度定理的边界项将不匹配。本节给出坐标无关表述，是为了让第 11 节的推广有可对接的接口，而非在本节展开流形上的证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-流的-L-1-估计与适定性接口\">流的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 估计与适定性接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-流的-L-1-估计与适定性接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.17（流的可积性）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1(\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|J_t\\|_{L^1}\\le \\|p_tf(\\cdot,t)\\|_{L^1}+\\tfrac12g(t)^2\\|\\nabla p_t\\|_{L^1}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由三角不等式逐分量，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega|J_t|\\,dx\\le\\int_\\Omega p_t|f|\\,dx+\\tfrac12g^2\\int_\\Omega|\\nabla p_t|\\,dx.$$</div>\n第一项由 H1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span>；第二项由 H3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 局部可积且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\in L^1$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是概率密度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 的支集被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的支集控制——严格地说需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\in L^1$</span>，这是 H3 的一部分）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.18（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 估计的用途）</strong> 命题 2.17 是第 4 节弱解存在性论证的入口：弱形式恒等式（命题 2.10）右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int J_r\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_r\\in L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}$</span> 才能对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 良定义。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 仅知为分布，则需先用磨光核逼近，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-散度定理的验证-有界区域上的通量恒等式\">散度定理的验证：有界区域上的通量恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-散度定理的验证-有界区域上的通量恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.19（通量恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 为有界开集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in C^1(\\overline\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,dx=\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 这是散度定理的标准陈述，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 为外法向，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dS$</span> 为曲面测度。条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in C^1(\\overline\\Omega)$</span> 保证被积函数连续到边界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.20（H4 与质量守恒的等价性，有界区域情形）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in C^1(\\overline\\Omega)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。则以下两条等价：</p>\n<p>(i) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{d}{dt}\\displaystyle\\int_\\Omega p_t\\,dx=0$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\displaystyle\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 内成立。由 Leibniz（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 有界），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_\\Omega p_t\\,dx=\\int_\\Omega\\partial_t p_t\\,dx=-\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,dx.$$</div>\n由命题 2.19，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS$</span>。故 (i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span>(ii)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.21（H4 是充分而非必要）</strong> 推论 2.20 说明：全局质量守恒只要求边界通量的<strong>积分</strong>为零，而不要求逐点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span>。H4 是逐点条件，比积分条件强。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上变号但积分为零，质量仍守恒。第 5 节将讨论“反射边界”与“吸收边界”两种逐点条件的区别；本节只指出 H4 的充分性，不声称其必要性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-一个非梯度漂移的例子-旋转流\">一个非梯度漂移的例子：旋转流<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-一个非梯度漂移的例子-旋转流\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 2.22（旋转漂移下的流）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\mathbb{R}^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=(-x_2,x_1)$</span>（绕原点的旋转场），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\sqrt{2}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2=1$</span>）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_2)$</span>。验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的显式形式并说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span> 的结构。</p>\n<p><strong>计算</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=\\partial_{x_1}(-x_2)+\\partial_{x_2}(x_1)=0$</span>，漂移是保面积的。FP 方程的解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_t^2I_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1+2t$</span>（因旋转场不改变协方差，扩散使其线性增长）。计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla p_t=-\\frac{x}{\\sigma_t^2}p_t,\\qquad J_t=p_tf-\\nabla p_t=p_t\\Big((-x_2,x_1)+\\frac{x}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big).$$</div>\n散度：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot J_t=\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)-\\Delta p_t.$$</div>\n第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)=f\\cdot\\nabla p_t+p_t\\nabla\\cdot f=f\\cdot\\nabla p_t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla p_t=(-x_2,x_1)\\cdot(-\\frac{x}{\\sigma_t^2}p_t)=\\frac{p_t}{\\sigma_t^2}(x_2x_1-x_1x_2)=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)=0$</span>。第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t=\\operatorname{tr}(\\nabla^2p_t)$</span>，对高斯密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t=p_t\\big(\\frac{|x|^2}{\\sigma_t^4}-\\frac{2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot J_t=-p_t\\Big(\\frac{|x|^2}{\\sigma_t^4}-\\frac{2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big).$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=p_t\\big[-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}+\\frac{|x|^2}{2}\\frac{d}{dt}\\sigma_t^{-2}\\big]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\sigma_t^{-2}=-\\frac{2}{\\sigma_t^4}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1+2t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2=2$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=p_t\\big[-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}-\\frac{|x|^2}{\\sigma_t^4}\\big]$</span>。比较：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot J_t=p_t\\big[\\frac{|x|^2}{\\sigma_t^4}-\\frac{2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big]$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的常数项——这看似不符，实则因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1+2t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2=2$</span>，而一般公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=p_t[-\\frac{d}{2\\sigma_t^2}+\\frac{|x|^2}{2}\\frac{d}{dt}\\sigma_t^{-2}]$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2\\sigma_t^2}=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot(-\\frac{2}{\\sigma_t^4})=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^4}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=p_t[-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}-\\frac{|x|^2}{\\sigma_t^4}]$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot J_t=p_t[\\frac{|x|^2}{\\sigma_t^4}-\\frac{2}{\\sigma_t^2}]$</span>。两者相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}-\\frac{|x|^2}{\\sigma_t^4}=\\frac{|x|^2}{\\sigma_t^4}-\\frac{2}{\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}=-\\frac{2}{\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，不成立。<strong>这说明上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 不是该 FP 方程的解</strong>：旋转漂移与各向同性扩散的联合过程，其协方差并不保持各向同性，因为旋转场虽保面积但不保二阶矩的各向同性（它使协方差矩阵产生非对角元）。正确的解需解矩阵 Riccati 方程，本节不展开。此例的用途是警示：不能仅凭 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span> 就断言漂移流无散度贡献，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla p_t$</span> 一般不为零。</p>\n<p><strong>注 2.23（例 2.22 的教训）</strong> 上例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)=f\\cdot\\nabla p_t+p_t\\nabla\\cdot f$</span>，即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla p_t$</span> 仍可非零。只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 处处正交（如纯旋转场作用于径向对称密度时）才有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla p_t=0$</span>。例 2.22 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 若保持径向对称则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla p_t=0$</span>，但旋转场破坏径向对称，故该假设不成立。这提醒：<strong>流的散度分解不能只看漂移场的散度，必须看 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla p_t$</span></strong>。第 6 节平稳分布条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 的验证必须用完整表达式，不能只用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f_\\infty=0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-守恒形式的分布意义\">守恒形式的分布意义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-守恒形式的分布意义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 2.24（分布意义下的守恒形式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\Omega\\times(0,T))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\Omega\\times(0,T);\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。称对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t)=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}'(\\Omega\\times(0,T))$</span> 成立，若对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega\\times(0,T))$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega\\Big(p_t\\,\\partial_t\\varphi+J_t\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\Big)dx\\,dt=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.25（古典解满足分布意义）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，命题 2.1 的古典解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足定义 2.24 的分布恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega\\times(0,T))$</span>，由命题 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 逐点成立。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega\\times(0,T)$</span> 上积分：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega(\\partial_t p_t)\\varphi\\,dx\\,dt+\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega(\\nabla\\cdot J_t)\\varphi\\,dx\\,dt=0.$$</div>\n第一项由 Fubini（被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t\\varphi$</span> 在紧支集上连续，故可积）与分部积分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,T$</span> 处为零）化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega p_t\\partial_t\\varphi$</span>。第二项由 Fubini 与散度定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上为零，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}\\varphi\\subset\\Omega\\times(0,T)$</span> 紧）化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega J_t\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi$</span>。合并即得定义 2.24 的恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.26（分布意义的必要性）</strong> 第 4 节将把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 放松为仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}$</span> 的情形，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span> 未必逐点存在，守恒形式只能在分布意义下陈述。命题 2.25 说明古典解是分布解的特例，故第 4 节的弱解定义与本节相容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-流的有界性估计与稳定性\">流的有界性估计与稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-流的有界性估计与稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.27（流关于初值的稳定性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{(1)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{(2)}$</span> 为同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(f,g)$</span> 下、初值分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0^{(1)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0^{(2)}$</span> 的两个古典解，均满足 (H1)–(H4)。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t:=p_t^{(1)}-p_t^{(2)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta J_t:=J_t^{(1)}-J_t^{(2)}$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t\\delta_t+\\nabla\\cdot\\Delta J_t=0,\\qquad \\Delta J_t=\\delta_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\delta_t.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 两式相减。线性性来自 FP 方程关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的线性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 固定）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.28（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 压缩性，一维情形）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\mathbb{R}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足 (H1)、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 满足 (H2)。则对任意两个初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0^{(1)},p_0^{(2)}\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R})$</span>，其解满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\delta_t\\|_{L^1}\\le\\|\\delta_0\\|_{L^1}\\qquad\\text{对所有 }t\\ge 0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 这是 FP 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 压缩性的标准结论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 满足线性 FP 方程，其解算子为 Markov 半群的差，而 Markov 半群在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 上压缩。具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=\\mathbb{E}[\\delta_0(X_t^{(\\cdot)})]$</span> 的符号保持论证给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_t\\|_{L^1}\\le\\|\\delta_0\\|_{L^1}$</span>。本节只陈述结论并指出其证明依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的非退化性（H1、H2），完整证明属第 4 节弱解适定性范畴，此处不展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.29（压缩性的用途）</strong> 推论 2.28 是第 8 节数值格式收敛性分析的基石：若数值格式的每一步都是 Markov 算子（保持非负性与总质量），则其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 误差被初值误差与截断误差控制。本节只建立连续时间的压缩性，离散版本在第 8 节给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-守恒形式与得分匹配的接口\">守恒形式与得分匹配的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-守恒形式与得分匹配的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.30（流的得分表达式与生成动力学）</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 的区域，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t=p_t\\big(f-\\tfrac12g^2s_t\\big),\\qquad \\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot\\big[p_t(f-\\tfrac12g^2s_t)\\big].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式即推论 2.8。第二式由命题 2.1 代入第一式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.31（与概率流 ODE 的接口）</strong> 命题 2.30 的第二式表明：FP 方程可写成关于速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t:=f-\\tfrac12g^2s_t$</span> 的连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=0$</span>。这正是概率流 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v_t(X_t)$</span> 的密度演化方程。因此，<strong>概率流 ODE 的密度演化与 FP 方程的密度演化是同一个连续性方程</strong>，前提是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-\\tfrac12g^2s_t$</span>。第 15 节将证明：概率流 ODE 的解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 处与 SDE 的解在边际分布意义下相同，且该 ODE 的速度场恰为上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span>。本节只建立密度层面的接口，不展开路径层面的论证。</p>\n<p><strong>注 2.32（反向 SDE 漂移的对照）</strong> 反向 SDE 的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-g^2s_t$</span>（在时间反演下），其对应的 FP 方程扩散项系数仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2$</span>，但漂移项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-g^2s_t$</span>。若把该漂移代入守恒形式，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t^{\\mathrm{rev}}=p_t(f-g^2s_t)-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t=p_t(f-\\tfrac32g^2s_t)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 不同。<strong>反向 SDE 的流与正向 FP 方程的流不是同一个对象</strong>：前者描述时间反演过程的概率流，后者描述正向过程的概率流。两者相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tg^2s_t$</span> 项。这一区别在第 15 节将用时间反演的测度变换精确陈述；本节只标记符号差异，防止混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-一维情形下的通量显式表达\">一维情形下的通量显式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-一维情形下的通量显式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.33（一维流的积分表达）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=(a,b)$</span>（可为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm\\infty$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in C^1$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Omega$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t(x)=J_t(a)+\\int_a^x\\partial_y J_t(y)\\,dy=J_t(a)-\\int_a^x\\partial_t p_t(y)\\,dy.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_y J_t(y)=-\\partial_t p_t(y)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 积分即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.34（一维平稳流的常数性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 为平稳分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\in C^1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 平稳性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_\\infty=0$</span> 代入命题 2.33 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x J_\\infty=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty$</span> 为常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.35（常数流的确定）</strong> 推论 2.34 说明一维平稳流必为常数。该常数由边界条件确定：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\mathbb{R}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 可积，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm\\infty$</span> 处必须为零（否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 不可积），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv 0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=(a,b)$</span> 有界且 H4 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 于两端），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty(a)=J_\\infty(b)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv 0$</span>。若 H4 不成立（如反射边界只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty(a)=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty(b)\\ne 0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty$</span> 为非零常数，对应非平衡稳态（NESS），第 6 节与第 10 节将分别讨论。本节只建立常数性，不展开 NESS 的构造。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 由第 1 节 FP 方程把扩散项改写为散度得到，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 是漂移流与扩散流之和；该改写不引入新假设，只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。</li>\n<li>全局质量守恒需要边界通量条件 H4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span>）；守恒形式本身只保证局部守恒，H4 失效时质量以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS$</span> 的速率泄漏，第 10 节给出反例。</li>\n<li>概率流可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_t(f-\\tfrac12g^2s_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 为得分；该组合是概率流 ODE 的速度场，与反向 SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-g^2s_t$</span> 相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span>，两者不可混同。</li>\n<li>守恒形式在坐标无关表述下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t(p_t\\mathrm{vol})+d\\mathcal{J}_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_t=p_t\\iota_f\\mathrm{vol}-\\tfrac12g^2\\iota_{\\nabla p_t}\\mathrm{vol}$</span>；欧氏坐标下退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>，该等价性由命题 2.15 逐项验证。</li>\n<li>全局质量守恒的充要条件（有界区域、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in C^1(\\overline\\Omega)$</span>）是边界通量积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS=0$</span>（推论 2.20）；H4 的逐点条件是其充分条件而非必要，反射边界与吸收边界的区别留待第 5 节。</li>\n<li>流的散度分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)=f\\cdot\\nabla p_t+p_t\\nabla\\cdot f$</span> 表明：即使漂移场无散度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla p_t$</span> 仍可贡献非零散度（例 2.22）；平稳条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 必须用完整表达式验证，不能只看 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f_\\infty$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-生成元的伴随\">生成元的伴随<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-生成元的伴随\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已固定的记号，并只在此处补入生成元及其伴随所需的符号。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>状态空间：<span class=\"math-inline\">$E=\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>；Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(E)$</span>；Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。</li>\n<li>漂移场：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:E\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(x):=f(x,t)$</span>。</li>\n<li>扩散系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，标量；扩散矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2 I_d$</span>。</li>\n<li>时间区间：<span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n<li>密度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(X_t\\in\\cdot)$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度的密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1(E)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_E p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=1$</span>。</li>\n<li>测试函数空间：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 上紧支撑光滑实值函数全体；<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^2(E)$</span> 表示二阶连续可微且有界、一阶与二阶导数有界的函数全体。</li>\n<li>生成元：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(x):= f_t(x)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\varphi(x).$$</div></li>\n<li>伴随：在 Hilbert 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(E,\\mathrm{d}x)$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 的形式伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 由\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle \\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle_{L^2}=\\langle \\varphi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle_{L^2},\\qquad \\varphi,\\psi\\in C_c^\\infty(E),$$</div>\n确定；其中内积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle u,v\\rangle_{L^2}=\\int_E u(x)v(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出并在命题中引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(H1) 漂移正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1(E\\times[0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f_t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{x_i}f^j_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j=1,\\dots,d$</span>）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 上有界。</li>\n<li><strong>(H2) 扩散正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C([0,T];\\mathbb{R})$</span>，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\underline{g}\\le\\overline{g}&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\underline{g}\\le |g(t)|\\le\\overline{g}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</li>\n<li><strong>(H3) 密度正则性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in W^{1,1}(E)\\cap L^2(E)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\in L^1(E;\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^2(E;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>；映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(E)$</span> 中弱连续。</li>\n<li><strong>(H4) 通量可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t:=p_t f_t-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1(E;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</li>\n<li><strong>(H5) 边界通量消失</strong>（在需要分部积分无边界项时使用）：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 取为有界开区域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 时，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot n=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上成立，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 为外法向；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 时，该条自动满足，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 的支撑与无穷远处边界不相交。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心对象是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span>。它与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 的区别在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 作用在测试函数上、描述可观测量的期望的瞬时变化率；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 作用在密度上、描述密度的瞬时变化率。二者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 对偶联系起来，而 Fokker–Planck 方程正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t$</span> 的展开形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-定义-L-2-形式伴随与强伴随\">定义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 形式伴随与强伴随<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-定义-L-2-形式伴随与强伴随\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（形式伴随）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 固定。若存在线性算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast:\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)\\subset L^2(E)\\to L^2(E)$</span>，使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span> 有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_E (\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(x)\\,\\psi(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_E \\varphi(x)\\,(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi)(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x,$$</div>\n则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(E,\\mathrm{d}x)$</span> 中的形式伴随。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(E)$</span> 中稠密且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 为闭算子，则称其为强伴随。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：（i）形式伴随只要求在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 上成立等式，不要求定义域稠密或闭性；（ii）强伴随是 Hilbert 空间算子理论意义下的真伴随，需满足定义域稠密与闭性；（iii）本节主要使用形式伴随，因为 Fokker–Planck 方程的弱形式只需在测试函数上配对，而不需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 的闭扩张。这一区分在后续“弱解与测试函数”一节会被进一步利用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-1-形式伴随的显式表达\">命题 1：形式伴随的显式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-1-形式伴随的显式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（形式伴随的显式表达）</strong> 在假设 (H1)、(H2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(E,\\mathrm{d}x)$</span> 中的形式伴随由下式给出：对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi)(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot\\big(\\psi(x)f_t(x)\\big)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\psi(x),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 为散度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 为 Laplacian，均关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 取。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi,\\psi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 的定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_E (\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(x)\\,\\psi(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E \\big(f_t(x)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)\\big)\\psi(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\int_E \\Delta\\varphi(x)\\,\\psi(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n逐项处理。第一项：由 (H1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f_t$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi,\\psi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 使被积函数紧支撑且有界，故可积。对每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span>，分部积分（即 Gauss–Green 公式在紧支撑下的特例，边界项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\psi$</span> 紧支撑而消失）给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_E f^i_t(x)\\,\\partial_{x_i}\\varphi(x)\\,\\psi(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=-\\int_E \\varphi(x)\\,\\partial_{x_i}\\big(f^i_t(x)\\psi(x)\\big)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_E \\big(f_t\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\big)\\psi\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=-\\int_E \\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n第二项：由 (H2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2$</span> 为常数。两次分部积分，边界项因紧支撑消失：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_E \\Delta\\varphi\\,\\psi\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E \\varphi\\,\\Delta\\psi\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n这里使用了 Leibniz 公式与紧支撑条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\varphi\\psi)=\\varphi\\Delta\\psi+2\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot\\nabla\\psi+\\psi\\Delta\\varphi$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(\\varphi\\psi)$</span> 外为零，故边界项为零。合并两项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_E (\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)\\psi\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E \\varphi\\Big[-\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\psi\\Big]\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n右端方括号内的函数属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(E)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 紧支撑、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t\\in C^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 连续），故属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(E)$</span>。由定义 1，形式伴随即为方括号内的表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 1 中未使用 (H3)、(H4)、(H5)，因为配对的两个函数均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 中，紧支撑自动使所有边界项消失。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 不再紧支撑（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi=p_t$</span>）时，需 (H3)、(H4)、(H5) 保证分部积分合法，这将在命题 2 中处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-2-Fokker-Planck-方程作为伴随演化\">命题 2：Fokker–Planck 方程作为伴随演化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-2-Fokker-Planck-方程作为伴随演化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（密度演化的伴随刻画）</strong> 在假设 (H1)–(H5) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}X_t=f(X_t,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t+g(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}W_t$</span> 的解在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的密度，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_E \\varphi(x)\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E (\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(x)\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E \\varphi(x)\\,(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t)(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n特别地，在分布意义下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t$</span>，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot\\big(p_t(x)f_t(x)\\big)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t(x).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分三步。</p>\n<p><strong>第一步：Itô 引理给出期望的瞬时变化率。</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span>，由 Itô 公式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^2$</span> 且各阶导数有界，满足 Itô 公式的正则性要求），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi(X_t)-\\varphi(X_0)\n=\\int_0^t (\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi)(X_s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s\n+\\int_0^t g(s)\\nabla\\varphi(X_s)\\cdot\\mathrm{d}W_s.$$</div>\n取期望。随机积分项为零：由 (H2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 有界，被积过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(s)\\nabla\\varphi(X_s)$</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega\\times[0,t])$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^t g(s)\\nabla\\varphi(X_s)\\cdot\\mathrm{d}W_s=0$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_0)]\n=\\int_0^t \\mathbb{E}[(\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi)(X_s)]\\,\\mathrm{d}s.$$</div>\n由 (H3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto p_t$</span> 的弱连续性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_s)]=\\int_E \\varphi(x)p_s(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 连续；由 (H1)、(H2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi)(x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s,x)$</span> 连续且有界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\mapsto \\mathbb{E}[(\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi)(X_s)]$</span> 连续且有界。因此上式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可微，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]\n=\\mathbb{E}[(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(X_t)]\n=\\int_E (\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(x)\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n这一步使用了 Leibniz 法则（积分上限求导），其合法性由被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 连续且有界保证。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步：分部积分将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 转移到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 上。</strong> 由 (H3)、(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in W^{1,1}(E)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t f_t\\in L^1(E;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\in L^1(E;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1(E;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。由 (H5)，边界通量消失。于是对每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，Gauss–Green 公式给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_E f^i_t(x)\\,\\partial_{x_i}\\varphi(x)\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=-\\int_E \\varphi(x)\\,\\partial_{x_i}\\big(p_t(x)f^i_t(x)\\big)\\,\\mathrm{d}x,$$</div>\n其中边界项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}\\varphi\\,p_t f^i_t\\,n_i\\,\\mathrm{d}\\sigma$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 时）或 (H5)（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=\\Omega$</span> 时）为零。同理，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\in L^1$</span> 与 (H5)，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_E \\Delta\\varphi(x)\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E \\varphi(x)\\,\\Delta p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x,$$</div>\n边界项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}(\\varphi\\,\\partial_n p_t-p_t\\,\\partial_n\\varphi)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\sigma$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑或 (H5) 为零。合并：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_E (\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(x)\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E \\varphi(x)\\,\\Big[-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t\\Big](x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n右端方括号内的函数由 (H1)–(H3) 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(E)$</span>，且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 配对可积。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步：识别为伴随作用。</strong> 比较命题 1 的表达式，方括号内正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t$</span>。因此\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_E \\varphi\\,p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E \\varphi\\,(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$$</div>\n对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 成立。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(E)$</span> 的对偶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty(E)$</span> 中弱稠密（更准确地说，若两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 函数与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty$</span> 函数配对相等，则它们几乎处处相等），故在分布意义下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 2 的证明中，第一步与第二步的交换次序是关键。第一步将期望的求导转化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 作用的期望，依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi$</span> 的有界性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的弱连续性；第二步将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 转移到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 上，依赖 (H3)–(H5) 保证分部积分无边界项。若 (H5) 失效，第二步会出现非零边界通量，这正是本章第 10 节反例的主题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-推论-守恒形式与概率流\">推论：守恒形式与概率流<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-推论-守恒形式与概率流\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1（守恒形式）</strong> 在命题 2 的假设下，定义概率流\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t(x):=p_t(x)f_t(x)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t(x),\\qquad x\\in E,\\ t\\in[0,T].$$</div>\n则 Fokker–Planck 方程可写为守恒形式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)+\\nabla\\cdot J_t(x)=0,$$</div>\n且在 (H5) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_E p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t=\\nabla\\cdot(\\nabla p_t)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla\\cdot(\\nabla p_t)\n=-\\nabla\\cdot\\Big(p_t f_t-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t\\Big)\n=-\\nabla\\cdot J_t.$$</div>\n此即守恒形式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 积分并利用 (H5)（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的衰减使边界项为零），由 Gauss–Green 公式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_E p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=-\\int_E \\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=-\\int_{\\partial E} J_t\\cdot n\\,\\mathrm{d}\\sigma=0.$$</div>\n这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial E=\\emptyset$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot n=0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=\\Omega$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：推论 1 表明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span>，即伴随算子作用在密度上等于负的概率流散度。这一恒等式是后续“平稳分布”一节中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 的直接来源，也是“与概率流 ODE 的接口”一节中比较反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度的出发点。注意：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 是概率流，不是速度场；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t/p_t=f_t-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 才是概率流 ODE 的速度，二者不可混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的伴随验证\">具体例子：一维 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程的伴随验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的伴随验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\sqrt{2}$</span>（常数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$E=\\mathbb{R}$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi(x)=-\\theta x\\,\\varphi'(x)+\\varphi''(x)$</span>。由命题 1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi(x)=\\theta\\,\\psi(x)+\\theta x\\,\\psi'(x)+\\psi''(x)\n=\\theta\\,\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\big(x\\psi(x)\\big)+\\psi''(x).$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(x)=e^{-x^2/2}/\\sqrt{2\\pi}$</span>（标准正态密度），直接计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi(x)=\\theta\\,\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\Big(x\\frac{e^{-x^2/2}}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\Big)+\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2}{\\mathrm{d}x^2}\\frac{e^{-x^2/2}}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}.$$</div>\n第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}(x e^{-x^2/2})=(1-x^2)e^{-x^2/2}$</span>，故第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(1-x^2)\\psi(x)$</span>。第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi''(x)=(x^2-1)\\psi(x)$</span>。相加得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi(x)=0$</span>。这与平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty(x)=-\\theta x\\,\\psi(x)-\\psi'(x)=-\\theta x\\psi(x)+x\\psi(x)=0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=1$</span>；一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 时平稳分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,1/\\theta)$</span>，其密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\theta(x)=\\sqrt{\\theta/2\\pi}\\,e^{-\\theta x^2/2}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi_\\theta=0$</span>。此例验证了命题 1 的显式表达与推论 1 的守恒形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-3-伴随算子的耗散性\">命题 3：伴随算子的耗散性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-3-伴随算子的耗散性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中的耗散性）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2)、(H5) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle \\psi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle_{L^2}\n=-\\int_E \\psi(x)\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi(x)f_t(x))\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\int_E |\\nabla\\psi(x)|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f_t\\ge 0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 上成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle \\psi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle_{L^2}\\le 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\psi$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle \\psi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle\n=-\\int_E \\psi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\int_E \\psi\\,\\Delta\\psi\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n第二项由分部积分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 紧支撑，边界项为零）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_E \\psi\\,\\Delta\\psi\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\int_E |\\nabla\\psi|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n第一项无进一步化简；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f_t\\ge 0$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\int_E \\psi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=-\\int_E \\psi^2\\,\\nabla\\cdot f_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x-\\int_E \\psi\\,f_t\\cdot\\nabla\\psi\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0$</span>；第二项符号不定，故不能直接断言整体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：命题 3 的耗散性断言需附加条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 为梯度场且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 选取使交叉项消失。为避免不完整断言，将命题 3 限定为恒等式陈述，耗散性作为其特例：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t\\equiv 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle \\psi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle=-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\|\\nabla\\psi\\|_{L^2}^2\\le 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 3 的恒等式本身是可检验的推论，其耗散性部分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t\\equiv 0$</span>（纯 Brownian 情形）下成立。一般漂移下的耗散性需借助 Poincaré 不等式或 Bakry–Émery 判据，这属于本章第 12 节“熵与自由能”的范围，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-4-伴随算子的定义域与闭性\">命题 4：伴随算子的定义域与闭性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-4-伴随算子的定义域与闭性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 只给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 上的作用公式，但一个算子要成为强伴随，还需其定义域在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(E)$</span> 中稠密且算子闭。本节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 的一个自然扩张，并证明其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中的闭性。这一结论在后续“弱解与测试函数”一节中将被用来定义 Fokker–Planck 方程的弱解空间。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 的闭扩张）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2) 下，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast):=\\Big\\{\\psi\\in L^2(E):\\ \\psi f_t\\in L^2(E;\\mathbb{R}^d),\\ \\nabla\\psi\\in L^2(E;\\mathbb{R}^d),\\ \\Delta\\psi\\in L^2(E)\\Big\\},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\psi$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\psi$</span> 按分布意义理解。则：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(E)\\subset\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(E)$</span> 中稠密；</p>\n<p>(ii) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi:=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\psi$</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(E)$</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle_{L^2}=\\langle\\varphi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle_{L^2};$$</div></p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)\\to L^2(E)$</span> 的算子在图范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\psi\\|_{L^2}+\\|\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\|_{L^2}$</span> 下是闭的。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 紧支撑光滑函数显然满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi f_t\\in L^2$</span>（由 (H1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 有界）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\psi,\\Delta\\psi\\in L^2$</span>（紧支撑有界），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(E)\\subset\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span>。稠密性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(E)$</span> 中稠密是标准事实（<span class=\"math-inline\">$E=\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 为有界开区域时均成立），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)\\supset C_c^\\infty(E)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span> 稠密。</p>\n<p>(ii) 由 (H1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f_t$</span> 有界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)=(\\nabla\\cdot f_t)\\psi+f_t\\cdot\\nabla\\psi$</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(E)$</span>（两项分别为有界函数乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 函数与有界向量场点乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 向量场）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\psi\\in L^2$</span> 由定义域条件给出。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\in L^2(E)$</span>。配对恒等式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span>，由命题 1 的证明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle=\\langle\\varphi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 时成立；对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty$</span> 序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_n\\to\\psi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中逼近，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi$</span> 有界（由 (H1)、(H2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi,\\psi_n\\rangle\\to\\langle\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle$</span>；同时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varphi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi_n\\rangle\\to\\langle\\varphi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi_n\\to\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中成立，这由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_n\\to\\psi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{2,2}$</span> 中（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_n$</span> 为磨光）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi_n f_t)\\to\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 有界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f_t$</span> 有界）保证。因此恒等式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>(iii) 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_n\\in\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_n\\to\\psi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi_n\\to\\chi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中。需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi=\\chi$</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span>，由 (ii)，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\varphi,\\chi\\rangle=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\langle\\varphi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi_n\\rangle=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\langle\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi,\\psi_n\\rangle=\\langle\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi$</span> 作为分布等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi$</span>（按分布意义）。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi\\in L^2(E)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\in L^2(E)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\psi$</span> 在分布意义下成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi\\in L^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)\\in L^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\psi\\in L^2$</span>（后者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi$</span> 与前者属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\ne 0$</span> 推出）。还需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi f_t\\in L^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\psi\\in L^2$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)=(\\nabla\\cdot f_t)\\psi+f_t\\cdot\\nabla\\psi\\in L^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\nabla\\cdot f_t)\\psi\\in L^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 有界），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t\\cdot\\nabla\\psi\\in L^2$</span>；再由 (H1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 各分量有界且不全为零（否则退化情形单独处理），不能直接推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\psi\\in L^2$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：闭性证明需将定义域加强为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast):=\\{\\psi\\in W^{2,2}(E):\\ \\psi f_t\\in L^2(E;\\mathbb{R}^d)\\}$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\psi\\in L^2$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{2,2}\\subset W^{1,2}$</span> 自动成立，闭性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{2,2}$</span> 的完备性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 的连续性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f_t$</span> 有界）直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 4 的 (iii) 在加强定义域后成立；若坚持分布意义下的弱定义域，闭性需附加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 的一致椭圆型条件或非退化条件，这属于本章第 4 节“弱解与测试函数”的范围。本节只陈述加强定义域下的闭性，以避免不完整断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-5-伴随与时间反演的配对恒等式\">命题 5：伴随与时间反演的配对恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-5-伴随与时间反演的配对恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>生成元的伴随在扩散生成模型中有一个直接可用的推论：正向 SDE 的密度演化与反向 SDE 的密度演化通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 的配对联系起来。本节给出一个纯算子层面的恒等式，不涉及反向 SDE 的具体构造（后者属于“与概率流 ODE 的接口”一节）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（时间反演的配对恒等式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为正向 SDE 的密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 为任意满足 (H3)、(H4) 的密度族。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_E \\varphi(x)\\,q_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E (\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(x)\\,q_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n+\\int_E \\varphi(x)\\,\\big(\\partial_t q_t-\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast q_t\\big)(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_t$</span>，右端第二项为零，回到命题 2。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (H3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto q_t$</span> 的弱连续性与 (H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_E\\varphi\\,q_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可微（Leibniz 法则，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\,q_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 弱连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑有界）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_E\\varphi\\,q_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_E\\varphi\\,\\partial_t q_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n另一方面，由命题 2 第二步的分部积分（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 同样适用，因 (H3)、(H4)、(H5) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 成立），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_E(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)\\,q_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_E\\varphi\\,(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast q_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n两式相减即得恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 5 的意义在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t q_t-\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast q_t$</span> 度量了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 偏离 Fokker–Planck 演化的程度；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 取为反向 SDE 的密度时，这一偏差与反向漂移的修正项直接相关。本节只给出恒等式，不展开反向 SDE 的构造，以免与“与概率流 ODE 的接口”一节重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-6-伴随算子的谱下界\">命题 6：伴随算子的谱下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-6-伴随算子的谱下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>作为命题 3 的补充，本节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中的一个可检验谱性质：当漂移为梯度场且扩散系数为常数时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 的谱位于某个半平面内。这一性质在后续“平稳分布”一节中用于判断平稳分布的指数收敛性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（梯度漂移下的谱下界）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2)、(H5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=-\\nabla V_t$</span> 对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t\\in C^2(E)$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g$</span> 为常数。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\psi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle_{L^2}\n=-\\int_E\\psi^2\\,\\Delta V_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x-\\tfrac12 g^2\\int_E|\\nabla\\psi|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta V_t\\le 0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 上成立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t$</span> 为凹函数），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\psi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle\\le 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 3 的恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=-\\nabla V_t$</span> 时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\int_E\\psi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E\\psi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi\\nabla V_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E\\psi^2\\,\\Delta V_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\int_E\\psi\\,\\nabla V_t\\cdot\\nabla\\psi\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_E\\psi\\,\\nabla V_t\\cdot\\nabla\\psi\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\tfrac12\\int_E\\nabla V_t\\cdot\\nabla(\\psi^2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\tfrac12\\int_E\\psi^2\\,\\Delta V_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>（分部积分，紧支撑边界项为零）。代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\int_E\\psi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\tfrac12\\int_E\\psi^2\\,\\Delta V_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<strong>结论</strong>：上式符号需验算。直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=-\\nabla V_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)=-\\nabla\\psi\\cdot\\nabla V_t-\\psi\\Delta V_t$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\int_E\\psi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n=\\int_E\\psi\\,\\nabla\\psi\\cdot\\nabla V_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\int_E\\psi^2\\,\\Delta V_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\tfrac12\\int_E\\nabla V_t\\cdot\\nabla(\\psi^2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\tfrac12\\int_E\\psi^2\\,\\Delta V_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。合并得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\int_E\\psi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\tfrac12\\int_E\\psi^2\\,\\Delta V_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n代入命题 3 的恒等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\psi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle=\\tfrac12\\int_E\\psi^2\\,\\Delta V_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x-\\tfrac12 g^2\\int_E|\\nabla\\psi|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta V_t\\le 0$</span> 时，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\psi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle\\le 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 6 的结论与命题 3 的注一致：梯度漂移下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 的耗散性由势函数的凹性保证。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t$</span> 为凸函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta V_t\\ge 0$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 不一定耗散，此时需借助 Poincaré 不等式或对数 Sobolev 不等式，这属于“熵与自由能”一节的范围。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-7-伴随算子的坐标无关表述\">命题 7：伴随算子的坐标无关表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-7-伴随算子的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 在一般黎曼流形上的坐标无关表述，以备“多维 FP 方程”一节使用。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M,\\mathbf{g})$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维光滑黎曼流形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{vol}_{\\mathbf{g}}$</span> 为黎曼体积测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 为光滑向量场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 为标量函数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（流形上的伴随）</strong> 在流形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M,\\mathbf{g})$</span> 上，生成元\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi=\\mathbf{g}(f_t,\\nabla\\varphi)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta_{\\mathbf{g}}\\varphi$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(M,\\mathrm{vol}_{\\mathbf{g}})$</span> 中的形式伴随为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi=-\\mathrm{div}_{\\mathbf{g}}(\\psi f_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta_{\\mathbf{g}}\\psi,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{div}_{\\mathbf{g}}$</span> 为黎曼散度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathbf{g}}=\\mathrm{div}_{\\mathbf{g}}\\circ\\nabla$</span> 为 Laplace–Beltrami 算子。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi,\\psi\\in C_c^\\infty(M)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 的定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_M(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)\\,\\psi\\,\\mathrm{vol}_{\\mathbf{g}}\n=\\int_M\\mathbf{g}(f_t,\\nabla\\varphi)\\,\\psi\\,\\mathrm{vol}_{\\mathbf{g}}\n+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\int_M(\\Delta_{\\mathbf{g}}\\varphi)\\,\\psi\\,\\mathrm{vol}_{\\mathbf{g}}.$$</div>\n第一项：由黎曼散度的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{div}_{\\mathbf{g}}(\\psi f_t)=\\psi\\,\\mathrm{div}_{\\mathbf{g}}f_t+\\mathbf{g}(\\nabla\\psi,f_t)$</span>，以及散度定理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_M\\mathrm{div}_{\\mathbf{g}}(X)\\,\\mathrm{vol}_{\\mathbf{g}}=0$</span> 对紧支撑向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 无边或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\psi$</span> 紧支撑使边界项消失），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_M\\mathbf{g}(f_t,\\nabla\\varphi)\\,\\psi\\,\\mathrm{vol}_{\\mathbf{g}}\n=-\\int_M\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{div}_{\\mathbf{g}}(\\psi f_t)\\,\\mathrm{vol}_{\\mathbf{g}}.$$</div>\n第二项：Laplace–Beltrami 算子自伴，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_M(\\Delta_{\\mathbf{g}}\\varphi)\\,\\psi\\,\\mathrm{vol}_{\\mathbf{g}}=\\int_M\\varphi\\,(\\Delta_{\\mathbf{g}}\\psi)\\,\\mathrm{vol}_{\\mathbf{g}}$</span>（紧支撑边界项消失）。合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 7 表明，命题 1 的欧氏表述在流形上只需将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{div}_{\\mathbf{g}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathbf{g}}$</span>、Lebesgue 测度替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{vol}_{\\mathbf{g}}$</span>。这一坐标无关表述在“多维 FP 方程”一节中用于写出流形上的 Fokker–Planck 方程，并保证其与欧氏情形的一致性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-8-伴随算子与质量守恒的等价刻画\">命题 8：伴随算子与质量守恒的等价刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-8-伴随算子与质量守恒的等价刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>作为本节与“边界通量条件”一节的接口，本节给出质量守恒的一个算子层面等价刻画：质量守恒当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 在常数函数上的配对为零。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（质量守恒的算子刻画）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 (H3)，则以下两条等价：</p>\n<p>(i) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_E p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(E)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv 1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p_t)$</span> 的某个邻域内，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_E(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t)\\,\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(ii)：由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_E p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_E(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv 1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p_t)$</span> 邻域内，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_E\\varphi\\,(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_E(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>）。由 (i) 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_E(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0$</span>，即 (ii)。</p>\n<p>(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv 1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p_t)$</span> 邻域内，由 (ii) 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_E(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0$</span>，再由命题 2 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_E p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 8 将质量守恒转化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t$</span> 与常数函数的配对为零，而后者等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_E\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0$</span>，即边界通量为零。这正是“边界通量条件”一节的核心条件；本节只给出算子层面的等价刻画，不展开边界通量的具体分析，以免与后续节重复。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(E,\\mathrm{d}x)$</span> 中的形式伴随为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\psi$</span>，其证明仅需 (H1)、(H2) 与紧支撑分部积分；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 不再紧支撑时，需 (H3)–(H5) 保证边界项消失。</li>\n<li>Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t$</span> 是密度演化的伴随刻画，其守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_t f_t-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 为概率流；在边界通量消失条件下质量守恒。</li>\n<li>伴随算子的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\psi,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi\\rangle=-\\int\\psi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\|\\nabla\\psi\\|_{L^2}^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t\\equiv 0$</span> 时给出耗散性；一般漂移下的耗散性需附加条件，留待熵与自由能一节处理。</li>\n<li>生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 的形式伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast\\psi=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\psi$</span> 在加强定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)\\subset W^{2,2}(E)$</span> 下构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中的闭算子，其配对恒等式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Dom}(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast)$</span> 成立。</li>\n<li>Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t$</span> 的守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_t f_t-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 为概率流；质量守恒等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t$</span> 与常数函数的配对为零，即边界通量为零。</li>\n<li>伴随算子在梯度漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=-\\nabla V_t$</span> 下的谱下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int\\psi^2\\Delta V_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x-\\tfrac12 g^2\\|\\nabla\\psi\\|_{L^2}^2$</span> 给出，凹势函数保证耗散性；流形上的坐标无关表述将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{div}_{\\mathbf{g}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathbf{g}}$</span>，为多维 FP 方程一节备用。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-弱解与测试函数\">弱解与测试函数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-弱解与测试函数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为扩散系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_t f-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 为概率流。生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 及其伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 已在前节定义。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}:=C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，测试函数空间，即紧支撑光滑函数全体。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varphi\\|_\\infty=\\sup_x|\\varphi(x)|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty=\\sup_x\\|\\nabla\\varphi(x)\\|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Delta\\varphi\\|_\\infty=\\sup_x|\\Delta\\varphi(x)|$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_T:=(0,T)\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，时空柱体；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}_T:=C_c^\\infty(Q_T)$</span>，时空测试函数空间。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le p&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^p(0,T;L^p(\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span> 为 Bochner 空间，范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|u\\|_{L^p(0,T;L^p)}=\\big(\\int_0^T\\!\\!\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}|u(t,x)|^p\\,dx\\,dt\\big)^{1/p}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,2}(0,T;L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t u\\in L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in L^2(0,T;H^1(\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span> 的分布意义弱导数空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心假设（H）如下，逐条显式列出，后续每个命题将指明所用到的子集。</p>\n<p>(H1) <strong>漂移正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f(x,t)\\|\\le C_f(1+\\|x\\|)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 成立（线性增长）；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto f(x,t)$</span> 局部 Lipschitz。</p>\n<p>(H2) <strong>扩散正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C([0,T];\\mathbb{R})$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_*&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\ge g_*$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（非退化）；记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t):=\\tfrac12 g(t)^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\in C([0,T])$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)\\ge \\tfrac12 g_*^2&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(H3) <strong>密度的可积性与正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为概率密度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in L^2(0,T;H^1(\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p\\in L^2(0,T;H^{-1}(\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span>；即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in W^{1,2}(0,T;L^2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\in L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(H4) <strong>通量的可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p f\\in L^1(0,T;L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\nabla p\\in L^1(0,T;L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1(0,T;L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span>。</p>\n<p>(H5) <strong>边界通量消失</strong>：对几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial B_R}\\|J_t(x)\\|\\,dS(x)=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R=\\{x:\\|x\\|&lt;R\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dS$</span> 为球面测度。</p>\n<p>(H3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p\\in L^2(0,T;H^{-1})$</span> 的含义是：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in L^2(0,T;H^{-1})$</span>，使得对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}_T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\!\\!\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\partial_t\\varphi(t,x)\\,p_t(x)\\,dx\\,dt=-\\int_0^T\\langle v(t),\\varphi(t,\\cdot)\\rangle_{H^{-1},H^1_0}\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p>这是分布意义下的弱时间导数，与 (H4) 配合使下面的分部积分合法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-弱解的定义及其与经典解的区别\">弱解的定义及其与经典解的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-弱解的定义及其与经典解的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（弱解）</strong>．设 (H1)–(H4) 成立。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in W^{1,2}(0,T;L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\in L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span> 为 Fokker–Planck 方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t \\tag{FP}$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的<strong>弱解</strong>，若对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}_T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\!\\!\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\Big[\\partial_t\\varphi\\,p_t+\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(p_t f)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot\\nabla p_t\\Big]\\,dx\\,dt=0. \\tag{W}$$</div>\n<p><strong>定义 2（经典解）</strong>．称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1((0,T);C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span> 为经典解，若 (FP) 在每一点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x)\\in(0,T)\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 逐点成立。</p>\n<p><strong>区别</strong>．经典解要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 二阶空间可微、一阶时间可微且方程逐点成立；弱解只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 平方可积、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{-1}$</span>，方程通过测试函数“转移导数”后成立。弱解定义 (W) 中，时间导数落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 上、空间二阶导数落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 上，从而对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正则性要求降到 (H3) 的水平。这与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 是某个 SDE 的解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时刻的密度”这一概率解释相容：SDE 的解密度一般不具备经典解所需的逐点二阶可微性。</p>\n<p>注意 (W) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(p_t f)$</span> 一项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(p f)$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(pf)$</span>；两者通过分部积分等价，但前者不需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p f$</span> 的弱散度存在，只需 (H4) 的可积性。这正是弱解定义相对于“直接要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(pf)\\in L^2$</span>”的放宽之处。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-主定理-弱解与测试函数恒等式\">主定理：弱解与测试函数恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-主定理-弱解与测试函数恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（弱形式恒等式）</strong>．设 (H1)–(H5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为定义 1 意义下的弱解。则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}_T$</span>，恒等式 (W) 成立；反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in W^{1,2}(0,T;L^2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\in L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span> 且 (W) 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}_T$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在分布意义下满足 (FP)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>．先证“弱解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> (W)”。由 (H3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in L^2(0,T;H^1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\in L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span>；由 (H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$pf\\in L^1(0,T;L^1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\nabla p\\in L^1(0,T;L^1)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}_T$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in L^\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi\\in L^\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\varphi\\in L^\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\varphi\\subset K\\times[0,T]$</span> 对某紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>。</p>\n<p>第一步，时间分部积分。由 (H3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p\\in L^2(0,T;H^{-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in L^2(0,T;H^1_0)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑），配对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\partial_t p,\\varphi\\rangle$</span> 可积。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\epsilon&lt;T-\\epsilon$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\langle\\partial_t p_t,\\varphi(t)\\rangle\\,dt$</span> 作分部积分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,T$</span> 附近为零，故无边界项）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\langle\\partial_t p_t,\\varphi(t)\\rangle\\,dt=-\\int_0^T\\!\\!\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t(x)\\,\\partial_t\\varphi(t,x)\\,dx\\,dt. \\tag{1}$$</div>\n<p>这里交换了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{-1}$</span> 配对与空间积分，依据是 Fubini：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in L^2(0,T;H^1_0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,\\partial_t\\varphi\\in L^1(0,T;L^1)$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二步，空间分部积分。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，由 (H4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi\\in L^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(p_t f)\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot\\nabla p_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span> 上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{B_R}\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)\\,\\varphi\\,dx$</span> 作分部积分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{B_R}\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)\\,dx=-\\int_{B_R}\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(p_t f)\\,dx+\\int_{\\partial B_R}\\varphi\\,(p_t f)\\cdot n\\,dS. \\tag{2}$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{B_R}\\varphi\\,a(t)\\Delta p_t\\,dx$</span> 同理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{B_R}\\varphi\\,a(t)\\Delta p_t\\,dx=-\\int_{B_R}a(t)\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot\\nabla p_t\\,dx+\\int_{\\partial B_R}\\varphi\\,a(t)\\nabla p_t\\cdot n\\,dS. \\tag{3}$$</div>\n<p>由 (H5)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}\\|J_t\\|\\,dS\\to0$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 充分大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi|_{\\partial B_R}=0$</span>，故 (2)(3) 的边界项对充分大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 恒为零。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>，由 Dominated Convergence（被积函数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\varphi|\\,\\|p_t f\\|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a|\\nabla\\varphi|\\,\\|\\nabla p_t\\|$</span> 控制，二者均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>）得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)\\,dx=-\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(p_t f)\\,dx,\\quad \\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi\\,a(t)\\Delta p_t\\,dx=-\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}a(t)\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot\\nabla p_t\\,dx. \\tag{4}$$</div>\n<p>第三步，合并。由 (FP) 在分布意义下成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\partial_t p_t,\\varphi\\rangle=\\langle-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)+a(t)\\Delta p_t,\\varphi\\rangle$</span>。将 (4) 代入并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分，再用 (1) 替换时间导数项，即得 (W)。</p>\n<p>再证“反之”。设 (W) 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}_T$</span> 成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in C_c^\\infty((0,T))$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t,x)=\\theta(t)\\psi(x)\\in\\mathcal{D}_T$</span>，代入 (W) 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 分离：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\theta(t)\\Big[\\langle\\partial_t p_t,\\psi\\rangle-\\langle-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)+a(t)\\Delta p_t,\\psi\\rangle\\Big]\\,dt=0.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 任意，括号内对几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为零；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 任意，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f)+a(t)\\Delta p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}'$</span> 意义下成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>．证明中两处交换极限的依据分别是：时间分部积分处用 Fubini（被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>）；空间边界取极限处用 Dominated Convergence（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>）。边界项消失依赖 (H5) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑两个条件，缺一不可——这正是第 10 节反例节要展开的情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-推论-质量守恒与一阶矩恒等式\">推论：质量守恒与一阶矩恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-推论-质量守恒与一阶矩恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1（质量守恒）</strong>．在定理 1 的假设下，对几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t\\,dx=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>．取截断函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi_R\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le\\chi_R\\le1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi_R=1$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\chi_R\\subset B_{2R}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\chi_R\\|_\\infty\\le C/R$</span>。在 (W) 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t,x)=\\theta(t)\\chi_R(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in C_c^\\infty((0,T))$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\theta(t)\\Big[\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\partial_t p_t\\,\\chi_R\\,dx+\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\nabla\\chi_R\\cdot(p_t f)\\,dx-\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}a(t)\\nabla\\chi_R\\cdot\\nabla p_t\\,dx\\Big]dt=0.$$</div>\n<p>由 (H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\chi_R\\cdot(p_t f)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\nabla\\chi_R\\cdot\\nabla p_t$</span> 的积分被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{C}{R}\\|p_t f\\|_{L^1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{C}{R}a\\| \\nabla p_t\\|_{L^1}$</span> 控制，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于零（Dominated Convergence，控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(0,T)$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\theta(t)\\frac{d}{dt}\\int p_t\\,dx\\,dt=0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int p_t=0$</span> 几乎处处。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（一阶矩恒等式）</strong>．在定理 1 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|\\,p_t\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|\\,\\|f(x,t)\\|\\,p_t\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span> 对几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}x\\,p_t(x)\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}f(x,t)\\,p_t(x)\\,dx. \\tag{5}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>．取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t,x)=\\theta(t)\\,\\psi(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(x)=x_i$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\psi\\|_\\infty\\le1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\psi\\subset B_{2R}$</span>。代入 (W)：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\theta(t)\\Big[\\int\\partial_t p_t\\,\\psi\\,dx+\\int\\nabla\\psi\\cdot(p_t f)\\,dx-\\int a\\nabla\\psi\\cdot\\nabla p_t\\,dx\\Big]dt=0.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\psi=e_i$</span>，故第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{B_R}f_i\\,p_t\\,dx$</span>；第三项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\psi=e_i$</span> 使其为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\int_{B_R}\\partial_i p_t\\,dx=a\\int_{\\partial B_R}p_t n_i\\,dS$</span>，由 (H5)（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\nabla p_t\\cdot n$</span> 的球面积分趋于零）当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于零。第一项由 (H3) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 有界，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\partial_t p_t\\,x_i\\,dx$</span>。合并即得 (5)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>(5) 是可检验的恒等式：它把密度的矩演化与漂移场的期望直接联系，且不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>——扩散项对一阶矩无贡献，这与 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=f(X_t,t)dt+g(t)dW_t$</span> 的 Itô 等距性质一致（扩散项的期望为零）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-密度的弱形式验证\">具体例子：一维 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 密度的弱形式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-密度的弱形式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\lambda x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv\\sqrt{2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)\\equiv1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma_t^2}}\\exp\\!\\big(-\\frac{x^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{1}{\\lambda}+(\\sigma_0^2-\\frac{1}{\\lambda})e^{-2\\lambda t}$</span>。这是 OU 过程从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span> 出发的密度，满足经典 FP 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\partial_x(xp_t)+\\partial_x^2 p_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>取测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t,x)=\\theta(t)\\psi(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(x)=e^{-x^2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in C_c^\\infty((0,T))$</span>。逐项计算 (W) 中的三个积分（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\equiv1$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}$</span> 内示意）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时间项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\partial_t\\varphi\\,p_t\\,dx=\\int\\theta'(t)\\psi\\,p_t\\,dx$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分后由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 紧支撑可分部转移至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>。</li>\n<li>漂移项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\psi'(x)(-xp_t)\\,dx=\\int(-2x)e^{-x^2}(-xp_t)\\,dx=2\\int x^2e^{-x^2}p_t\\,dx$</span>。</li>\n<li>扩散项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int\\psi'(x)\\partial_x p_t\\,dx=-\\int(-2x)e^{-x^2}\\partial_x p_t\\,dx$</span>，分部积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\int e^{-x^2}(1-2x^2)p_t\\,dx$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将三项相加，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x^2p_t\\,dx=\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=1$</span>，得被积式恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\sigma_t^2-2\\sigma_t^2+2$</span> 乘以高斯权重下的常数因子；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\sigma_t^2=-2\\lambda\\sigma_t^2+2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span>）知被积式为零。故 (W) 成立。此例说明弱形式在经典解存在时退化为经典方程，且测试函数只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty$</span> 即可完成验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-弱解的唯一性与适定性说明\">弱解的唯一性与适定性说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-弱解的唯一性与适定性说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（弱解唯一性，在能量空间内）</strong>．设 (H1)–(H5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(1)},p^{(2)}$</span> 为两个弱解且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(1)}-p^{(2)}\\in L^2(0,T;H^1_0(\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span>、初值相同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(1)}_0=p^{(2)}_0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(1)}=p^{(2)}$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>．令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=p^{(1)}-p^{(2)}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 满足齐次弱方程。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi=\\theta(t)\\,u(t,\\cdot)$</span> 作为测试函数（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in L^2(0,T;H^1_0)$</span> 以保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 合法；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的紧支撑性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^1_0$</span> 提供）。由 (W) 得能量恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\|u_t\\|_{L^2}^2=-\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\nabla u_t\\cdot(u_t f)\\,dx-a(t)\\|\\nabla u_t\\|_{L^2}^2.$$</div>\n<p>由 (H1) 的线性增长与 Young 不等式，右端第一项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{a(t)}{2}\\|\\nabla u_t\\|_{L^2}^2+C_f\\|u_t\\|_{L^2}^2$</span> 控制（常数依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|$</span> 的增长界）。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\|u_t\\|_{L^2}^2\\le 2C_f\\|u_t\\|_{L^2}^2,$$</div>\n<p>Gronwall 引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|u_t\\|_{L^2}^2\\le\\|u_0\\|_{L^2}^2e^{2C_ft}=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>适定性说明</strong>．命题 1 表明：在能量空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,2}(0,T;L^2)\\cap L^2(0,T;H^1)$</span> 内，弱解由初值唯一确定；存在性由 (H1)(H2) 下 SDE 的强解存在性与密度正则性理论保证（该构造的出处通常归于 SDE 密度演化的一般理论，本节不展开）。因此 FP 方程在弱意义下是适定的：初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^2$</span> 给出唯一的弱解轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto p_t\\in L^2$</span>，且质量守恒（推论 1）与一阶矩恒等式（推论 2）作为可检验的守恒律成立。第 5 节将在此适定性基础上加入边界通量条件，第 6 节讨论平稳分布。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>弱解通过测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(Q_T)$</span> 将时间导数转移至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>、空间二阶导数经分部积分转移至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span>，把对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正则性要求降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,2}(0,T;L^2)\\cap L^2(0,T;H^1)$</span>；定理 1 证明弱形式 (W) 与分布意义下的 (FP) 等价，证明中时间分部积分依据 Fubini、空间边界取极限依据 Dominated Convergence，边界项消失同时依赖 (H5) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑。</li>\n<li>推论 1 与推论 2 给出可检验的守恒律：质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为常数，一阶矩满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int x\\,p_t=\\int f\\,p_t$</span>，扩散项对一阶矩无贡献；一维 OU 例子逐项验证了弱形式在经典解存在时退化为经典方程。</li>\n<li>命题 1 在能量空间内证明弱解由初值唯一确定（Gronwall 引理），配合 SDE 密度存在性给出 FP 方程弱意义下的适定性；该适定性是后续边界通量条件（第 5 节）、平稳分布（第 6 节）与数值格式（第 8 节）讨论的前提。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-弱形式对偶视角-伴随方程与测试函数的选取\">弱形式对偶视角：伴随方程与测试函数的选取<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-弱形式对偶视角-伴随方程与测试函数的选取\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>弱解定义 (W) 的对偶结构值得单独说明，因为它决定了后续第 3 节“生成元的伴随”与第 5 节“边界通量条件”的接口方式。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为弱解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}_T$</span>。把 (W) 改写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\!\\!\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t(x)\\Big[\\partial_t\\varphi(t,x)+f(x,t)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(t,x)+a(t)\\Delta\\varphi(t,x)\\Big]\\,dx\\,dt=0. \\tag{6}$$</div>\n<p>推导如下：由 (W) 出发，漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(p_t f)$</span> 与扩散项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int a\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot\\nabla p_t$</span> 分别作一次空间分部积分（边界项由 (H5) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑消失，依据同定理 1 第二步），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\,f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\,a\\Delta\\varphi$</span>；时间项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\partial_t\\varphi\\,p_t$</span> 保持不动。三项合并即 (6)。</p>\n<p>(6) 的括号内算子正是前节定义的生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 作用在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi(x)=f(x,t)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)+a(t)\\Delta\\varphi(x).$$</div>\n<p>于是 (6) 等价于：对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}_T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\!\\!\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t\\,\\big(\\partial_t+\\mathcal{L}_t\\big)\\varphi\\,dx\\,dt=0. \\tag{7}$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 2（弱解的对偶刻画）</strong>．设 (H1)–(H5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in W^{1,2}(0,T;L^2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\in L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 (FP) 的弱解当且仅当 (7) 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}_T$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>．(6) 与 (W) 的等价性已由上面的分部积分给出，只需验证两次分部积分的合法性。漂移项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi\\in L^\\infty$</span> 且紧支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t f\\in L^1$</span>（(H4)），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(p_t f)\\in L^1(0,T;L^1)$</span>，可积。扩散项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot\\nabla p_t\\in L^1(0,T;L^1)$</span>（(H4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi\\in L^\\infty$</span>），可积。两次分部积分的边界项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span> 上分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}\\varphi\\,(p_t f)\\cdot n\\,dS$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}\\varphi\\,a\\nabla p_t\\cdot n\\,dS$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 充分大时二者为零。反向由 (6) 经同样分部积分回到 (W)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>．命题 2 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t+\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 是<strong>前向</strong>算子（作用于测试函数），而 (FP) 左端的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t-\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 是<strong>后向</strong>算子的伴随；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*\\varphi=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\varphi f)+a\\Delta\\varphi$</span>。弱解定义 (W) 之所以把导数转移到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 上，正是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}$</span> 上良定义且无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的可微性；这与“把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 视为分布、把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 视为分布导数”的表述等价，但前者给出了可逐项验证的积分恒等式。第 3 节已建立的伴随关系在此表现为：(7) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，而 (FP) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，二者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\,\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi=\\int(\\mathcal{L}_t^*p)\\,\\varphi$</span> 配对（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足 (H3)(H4) 时成立）。</p>\n<p>这一对偶视角给出一个直接推论：<strong>弱解的初值在弱意义下被确定</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近为零、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 附近等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，则 (7) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\varphi$</span> 项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int p_0\\varphi\\,dx$</span>（时间分部积分，边界项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的选取消失），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_0\\varphi$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上的值唯一决定。这与命题 1 的 Gronwall 论证互为补充：前者是弱意义下的初值可识别性，后者是能量空间内的唯一性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-测试函数类的扩充-从-C_c-infty-到-W-1-infty-_c\">测试函数类的扩充：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,\\infty}_c$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-测试函数类的扩充-从-C_c-infty-到-W-1-infty-_c\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}_T=C_c^\\infty(Q_T)$</span> 是为了让分部积分无歧义。但在应用中（尤其第 8 节数值格式的收敛性分析），需要允许测试函数属于更大的类。下面的命题说明这种扩充不改变弱解的定义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（测试函数类的稠密性）</strong>．设 (H1)–(H5) 成立。若 (W) 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(Q_T)$</span> 成立，则 (W) 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in W^{1,\\infty}_c(Q_T)$</span>（紧支撑、一阶弱导数本质有界的函数）成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>．取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in W^{1,\\infty}_c(Q_T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\varphi\\subset K\\times[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 紧。由 Sobolev 嵌入与磨光（mollification），存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_n\\in C_c^\\infty(Q_T)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_n\\to\\varphi$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,\\infty}$</span> 弱-<span class=\"math-inline\">$*$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\varphi_n\\subset K'\\times[0,T]$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K'$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的紧邻域）。具体地，取标准磨光核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_n$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_n=\\rho_n*\\varphi$</span> 并乘以截断函数；则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varphi_n-\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\varphi_n-\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_t\\varphi_n-\\partial_t\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\to0$</span>（磨光的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 收敛性）。</p>\n<p>在 (W) 中以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_n$</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，逐项估计差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\int_0^T\\!\\!\\int(\\partial_t\\varphi_n-\\partial_t\\varphi)\\,p_t\\Big|\\le\\|\\partial_t\\varphi_n-\\partial_t\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\|p\\|_{L^1(0,T;L^1)}\\to0,$$</div>\n<p>漂移项与扩散项同理，分别被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\varphi_n-\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\|pf\\|_{L^1(0,T;L^1)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\varphi_n-\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\|a\\nabla p\\|_{L^1(0,T;L^1)}$</span> 控制，由 (H4) 均趋于零。故 (W) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>为何需要这一扩充</strong>．命题 3 的意义在于：弱解定义不依赖于测试函数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 光滑性，只依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\varphi$</span> 的本质有界性与紧支撑。这使 (W) 可以直接用于分段线性测试函数（有限元方法的基函数）与指示函数的光滑逼近（质量守恒的数值验证，见第 14 节）。同时它划定了弱解的“检验边界”：若测试函数仅属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 不可积，则 (W) 中的漂移项与扩散项无定义，弱解概念失效——这正是第 10 节反例节中构造边界通量非零反例的入口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-弱解与-SDE-密度的相容性-一个恒等式\">弱解与 SDE 密度的相容性：一个恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-弱解与-SDE-密度的相容性-一个恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>弱解定义必须与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是 SDE 解的密度”这一概率对象相容。下面的命题给出二者之间的精确桥梁，它也是本章推导链（第 16 节）中“SDE 到密度”一环的弱形式表述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（Itô 公式的弱形式）</strong>．设 (H1)(H2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 为 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=f(X_t,t)dt+g(t)dW_t$</span> 的强解，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim p_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的密度并满足 (H3)(H4)(H5)。则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_s)]=\\int_s^t\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\mathcal{L}_r\\varphi(X_r)\\big]\\,dr. \\tag{8}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>．对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，Itô 公式给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi(X_t)-\\varphi(X_s)=\\int_s^t\\mathcal{L}_r\\varphi(X_r)\\,dr+\\int_s^t g(r)\\nabla\\varphi(X_r)\\cdot dW_r. \\tag{9}$$</div>\n<p>随机积分项为鞅，期望为零（被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 连续有界，故随机积分平方可积）。对 (9) 取期望得 (8)。再将 (8) 写成密度形式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]=\\int\\varphi\\,p_t\\,dx$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{L}_r\\varphi(X_r)]=\\int p_r\\,\\mathcal{L}_r\\varphi\\,dx$</span>。对 (8) 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导（由 (H3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p\\in L^2(0,T;H^{-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in H^1_0$</span>，配对可微），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,p_t\\,dx=\\int p_t\\,\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi\\,dx. \\tag{10}$$</div>\n<p>由命题 2，(10) 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span> 成立即等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 (FP) 的弱解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>恒等式的可检验性</strong>．(8) 是一个不依赖密度正则性的恒等式：左端只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的分布，右端只涉及生成元作用于测试函数的期望。它与推论 2 的一阶矩恒等式一致：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x_i$</span>（需截断，见推论 2 的证明），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi=f_i$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}[X_t^i]=\\mathbb{E}[f_i(X_t,t)]$</span>，扩散项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\varphi=0$</span> 而不出现。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=\\|x\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi=2x\\cdot f+2da(t)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}[\\|X_t\\|^2]=2\\mathbb{E}[X_t\\cdot f(X_t,t)]+2da(t)$</span>——扩散项以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2da(t)=dg(t)^2$</span> 的形式进入二阶矩，这与 Itô 等距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(\\int g\\,dW)^2]=\\int g^2\\,dt$</span> 一致。这两个特例说明 (8) 把弱解的抽象定义与 SDE 的可计算矩演化连接起来，且不需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的逐点二阶可微性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-弱解在时间上的正则性-H--1-导数的意义\">弱解在时间上的正则性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{-1}$</span> 导数的意义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-弱解在时间上的正则性-H--1-导数的意义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(H3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p\\in L^2(0,T;H^{-1})$</span> 这一条需要单独说明，因为它决定了 (W) 中时间分部积分的合法性，也决定了“弱解轨迹” <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto p_t$</span> 的连续性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（弱解轨迹的连续性）</strong>．设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in W^{1,2}(0,T;L^2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\in L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span>。则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的修正使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto p_t\\in L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，且对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|p_t\\|_{L^2}^2-\\|p_s\\|_{L^2}^2=2\\int_s^t\\langle\\partial_r p_r,p_r\\rangle_{H^{-1},H^1}\\,dr. \\tag{11}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>．由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,2}(0,T;L^2)$</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span> 中绝对连续轨道的等价类，其弱导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p\\in L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span>；但 (H3) 只给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p\\in L^2(0,T;H^{-1})$</span>，比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span> 弱。这里需要的是标准的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{-1}$</span> 导数 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^1$</span> 空间正则性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 轨道连续”论证：由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\in L^2(0,T;L^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in L^2(0,T;H^1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^1$</span> 范数平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_t\\|_{H^1}^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可积；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p\\in L^2(0,T;H^{-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in L^2(0,T;H^1)$</span> 配对给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\partial_t p,p\\rangle\\in L^1(0,T)$</span>。对磨光后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\epsilon$</span>（时间磨光）应用链式法则，再令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to0$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p\\in L^2(0,T;H^{-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in L^2(0,T;H^1)$</span> 的配对连续性），得 (11)。轨道连续性由 (11) 右端关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的绝对连续性推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>意义</strong>．命题 5 说明：尽管 (H3) 只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{-1}$</span>，(11) 仍给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数演化的精确恒等式，其右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{-1}$</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^1$</span> 配对。这正是命题 1 中能量恒等式的时间积分形式：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=p^{(1)}-p^{(2)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\partial_t u,u\\rangle$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla u\\cdot(uf)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\|\\nabla u\\|^2$</span> 的配对给出 Gronwall 不等式。若把 (H3) 减弱为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p\\in L^1(0,T;H^{-1})$</span>，(11) 仍成立但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_t\\|_{L^2}$</span> 可能不绝对连续，命题 1 的 Gronwall 论证需改用积分形式；这一减弱在第 8 节数值格式的稳定性分析中会用到。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-一个反例边界-测试函数不紧支撑时弱形式失效\">一个反例边界：测试函数不紧支撑时弱形式失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-一个反例边界-测试函数不紧支撑时弱形式失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为划定弱解定义的适用边界（完整反例见第 10 节），这里只指出一个结构性事实：若放弃 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的紧支撑性，(W) 中的空间分部积分将产生不可控的边界项。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（紧支撑的必要性）</strong>．设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv\\sqrt2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\equiv1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为标准高斯密度。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t,x)=\\theta(t)\\,x^2$</span>（不紧支撑）。则 (W) 的左端一般不为零，尽管 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是 (FP) 的经典解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>．对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi=x^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi=2x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\varphi=2$</span>。代入 (W) 的被积式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\equiv1$</span> 示意）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\partial_t\\varphi\\,p_t\\,dx+\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(p_t f)\\,dx-\\int a\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot\\nabla p_t\\,dx=0+0-2\\int x\\,\\partial_x p_t\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>对高斯密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t=-x p_t/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，故被积式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\int x^2p_t/\\sigma_t^2\\,dx=2$</span>，不为零。原因是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi=2x$</span> 不紧支撑，空间分部积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot\\nabla p_t=-\\int\\Delta\\varphi\\,p_t+\\text{边界项}$</span> 中的边界项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}2x\\,\\partial_x p_t\\cdot n\\,dS$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span> 时不消失（被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim R\\cdot R^{-3}$</span>，球面测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim R^0$</span>，乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim R^{-2}$</span> 可积但边界项本身在分部积分中对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int 2x\\partial_x p_t$</span> 的“端点”贡献，不能丢弃）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>．弱解定义中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的紧支撑不是技术便利，而是分部积分边界项消失的充分条件；命题 3 把测试函数类扩充到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,\\infty}_c$</span> 时仍保留紧支撑，正是为了维持这一条件。第 5 节将把“边界项消失”从测试函数的紧支撑转移到密度本身的边界通量条件上，从而允许非紧支撑的测试函数；第 10 节的反例节将给出边界通量非零时质量不守恒的完整构造。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-边界通量条件\">边界通量条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-边界通量条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为开区域，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 时刻的概率密度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1(\\Omega)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega p_t(x)\\,dx=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\Omega\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移向量场；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为扩散系数，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\ge 0$</span>；概率流定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t(x)=p_t(x)f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t(x).$$</div>\nFokker–Planck 方程的守恒形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu(x)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上的外单位法向量，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega\\in C^1$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 处处有定义且连续。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu$</span>：概率流在边界上的法向分量，称为<strong>边界通量</strong>（boundary flux）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span>：测试函数空间，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}=C_c^\\infty(\\overline{\\Omega}\\times[0,T))$</span> 在适当拓扑下的完备化，具体在第四节已定义；本节只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^\\infty(\\overline{\\Omega}\\times[0,T))$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\varphi\\Subset\\Omega\\times[0,T)$</span> 的子类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_T:=\\partial\\Omega\\times(0,T)$</span>：时空边界柱面。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t):=\\int_\\Omega p_t(x)\\,dx$</span>：时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的总质量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心假设（H）如下，逐条显式列出：</p>\n<p>(H1) <strong>正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1([0,T];L^1(\\Omega))\\cap L^1((0,T);W^{1,1}(\\Omega))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in L^\\infty(\\Omega\\times(0,T);\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p f)\\in L^1(\\Omega\\times(0,T))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C([0,T])$</span>。</p>\n<p>(H2) <strong>迹的存在性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in W^{1,1}(\\Omega)$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，故迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}\\in L^1(\\partial\\Omega)$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有定义（<span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,1}$</span> 的迹定理），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu\\in L^1(\\Sigma_T)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(H3) <strong>边界通量的可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}|J_t\\cdot\\nu|\\,dS\\,dt&lt;\\infty$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dS$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上的面积测度。</p>\n<p>(H4) <strong>散度定理适用</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 为有界开集且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega\\in C^1$</span>，使得对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in W^{1,1}(\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 满足散度定理\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,dx=\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS.$$</div></p>\n<p>这些假设在本节情境下的合理性说明：(H1) 是第四节弱解框架下强解的自然正则性；(H2) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,1}$</span> 迹定理保证，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in W^{1,1}(\\Omega)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega\\in C^1$</span>；(H3) 是本节讨论边界通量的前提，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu$</span> 不可积则通量概念本身无意义；(H4) 是标准散度定理的适用条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega\\in C^1$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 连续从而面积测度良定义。</p>\n<p>本节要回答的问题是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 有边界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 不在边界上消失时，守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 在什么意义下仍然成立？边界通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu$</span> 如何进入质量平衡？何时质量守恒？本节只处理边界通量条件本身，平稳分布与反例分别在第六节与第十节展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-1-边界通量的定义与质量平衡恒等式\">1. 边界通量的定义与质量平衡恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-1-边界通量的定义与质量平衡恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1.1（边界通量）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H4) 成立。对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，称\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi(t):=\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t(x)\\cdot\\nu(x)\\,dS(x)$$</div>\n为时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的<strong>总边界通量</strong>（total boundary flux）。逐点量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu$</span> 称为边界通量密度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.2（质量平衡恒等式）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4) 成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{M}(t)-\\mathcal{M}(s)=-\\int_s^t\\Phi(\\tau)\\,d\\tau.$$</div>\n即总质量的变化率等于负的总边界通量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上积分。由 (H1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1([0,T];L^1(\\Omega))$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_\\Omega p_t\\,dx=\\int_\\Omega\\partial_t p_t\\,dx$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（Leibniz 法则，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t\\in L^1(\\Omega)$</span> 由 (H1) 保证，且时间导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中连续）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal{M}(t)=\\int_\\Omega\\partial_t p_t\\,dx=-\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,dx.$$</div>\n由 (H4) 的散度定理，右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS=-\\Phi(t)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 上积分，由 (H3) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi\\in L^1(0,T)$</span>，得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1.3（质量守恒的充要条件）</strong> 在命题 1.2 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t)\\equiv\\mathcal{M}(0)$</span> 对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)=0$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t)-\\mathcal{M}(0)=-\\int_0^t\\Phi(\\tau)\\,d\\tau$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi=0$</span> a.e. 则积分为零，质量守恒。反之若质量守恒，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\Phi=0$</span> 对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi\\in L^1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi=0$</span> a.e.（Lebesgue 微分定理）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意推论 1.3 只要求<strong>总</strong>边界通量为零，不要求逐点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span>。逐点消失是更强的条件，对应无通量（Neumann 型）边界；总通量为零允许流入与流出相消，对应周期性边界或反射边界。这一区别在数值格式（第八节）与反例（第十节）中至关重要。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-2-三类边界条件的精确表述\">2. 三类边界条件的精确表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-2-三类边界条件的精确表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>边界通量条件在 PDE 理论中以三种标准形式出现，本节将其翻译为概率流语言，并说明各自的数学含义。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega\\in C^1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2.1（吸收边界 / Dirichlet 条件）</strong> 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足<strong>吸收边界条件</strong>，若\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0\\quad\\text{对 a.e. }t\\in(0,T).$$</div>\n此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu$</span> 一般非零，质量不守恒，质量以通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)$</span> 的速率流出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2.2（反射边界 / Neumann 条件）</strong> 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足<strong>反射边界条件</strong>（无通量条件），若\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0\\quad\\text{在 }\\Sigma_T\\text{ 上 a.e.}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)&gt;0$</span> 时这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu=\\tfrac{2}{g(t)^2}p_t f\\cdot\\nu$</span>，即法向概率流为零；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nu=0$</span>（漂移与边界相切）时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span>，即经典 Neumann 条件。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2.3（周期边界）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 为环面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{T}^d$</span>（无边界），则不存在边界通量项，散度定理中的边界积分为零，质量自动守恒。这是定义 2.2 的极限情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega=\\varnothing$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.4（反射条件下质量守恒）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足定义 2.2 的反射边界条件。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t)\\equiv\\mathcal{M}(0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 2.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_T$</span> 上 a.e.，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)=\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS=0$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。由推论 1.3 得质量守恒。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.5（吸收条件下质量严格递减）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足定义 2.1 的吸收边界条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)&gt;0$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 内不恒为零。则对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)\\ge 0$</span>，且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上不恒为零则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu|_{\\partial\\Omega}=-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 内且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span>，由 Hopf 引理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega\\in C^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在边界附近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且非负、在边界点取零最小值），外法向导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu\\le 0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu\\ge 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)\\ge 0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu$</span> 不恒为零，则存在边界点使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu&lt;0$</span>（严格），由连续性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>Hopf 引理的应用需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在边界附近的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 正则性，这由 (H1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1([0,T];L^1)$</span> 联合迹定理给出（对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in W^{1,1}$</span> 且迹为零，椭圆正则性提升为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的正则性，此处 (H1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in L^\\infty$</span> 足够）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,1}$</span> 中，Hopf 引理的严格版本仍适用（弱 Hopf 引理），结论不变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-3-弱形式中的边界项\">3. 弱形式中的边界项<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-3-弱形式中的边界项\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第四节的弱解定义通过测试函数回避了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的逐点正则性。本节说明边界通量如何在弱形式中显式出现，从而将强形式的边界条件翻译为弱形式的边界项。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3.1（弱形式，带边界项）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in L^1((0,T);W^{1,1}(\\Omega))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\in L^1((0,T);L^1(\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p,J)$</span> 为守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p+\\nabla\\cdot J=0$</span> 的<strong>弱解</strong>，若对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega\\times[0,T))$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega p\\,\\partial_t\\varphi\\,dx\\,dt+\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega J\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,dx\\,dt=0.$$</div>\n注意测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 在空间上紧支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 内部，故边界项不出现——这是第四节弱解定义的标准做法。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.2（弱形式与强形式的等价，带边界通量）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为强解。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^\\infty(\\overline{\\Omega}\\times[0,T))$</span>（不要求空间紧支撑），有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega p\\,\\partial_t\\varphi\\,dx\\,dt+\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega J\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,dx\\,dt=\\int_0^T\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}\\varphi\\,J\\cdot\\nu\\,dS\\,dt.$$</div>\n右端为边界项，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上为零时消失，退化为定义 3.1。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p+\\nabla\\cdot J=0$</span> 乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega\\times(0,T)$</span> 上积分：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p\\,dx\\,dt+\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot J\\,dx\\,dt=0.$$</div>\n第一项分部积分（时间方向）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p=-\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega p\\,\\partial_t\\varphi$</span>，边界项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega p\\varphi|_{0}^{T}=0$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\varphi\\Subset\\Omega\\times[0,T)$</span>）。第二项用散度定理的乘积法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\varphi J)=\\varphi\\nabla\\cdot J+J\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot J\\,dx=\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}\\varphi\\,J\\cdot\\nu\\,dS-\\int_\\Omega J\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,dx.$$</div>\n代入得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3.2 表明：<strong>边界通量条件在弱形式中表现为测试函数不紧支撑时的边界项</strong>。若要求弱解对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^\\infty(\\overline{\\Omega}\\times[0,T))$</span> 成立且边界项为零，则等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_T$</span> 上（由测试函数的任意性）。这给出了反射条件的弱表述：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_T$</span> 上作为分布意义下的等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-4-边界通量与生成元伴随的关系\">4. 边界通量与生成元伴随的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-4-边界通量与生成元伴随的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第三节定义了生成元的伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^*$</span>。本节说明边界通量条件正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^*$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中自伴或非自伴的判据。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 为 Itô 扩散的生成元：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}\\varphi=f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta\\varphi.$$</div>\n其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^*$</span> 作用在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 上给出 Fokker–Planck 右端：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}^*p=-\\nabla\\cdot(pf)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.1（伴随的边界项）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,\\varphi\\in C^\\infty(\\overline{\\Omega})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega p\\,\\mathcal{L}\\varphi\\,dx-\\int_\\Omega\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}^*p\\,dx=\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}\\left(pf\\varphi-\\tfrac12 g^2 p\\nabla\\varphi+\\tfrac12 g^2\\varphi\\nabla p\\right)\\cdot\\nu\\,dS.$$</div>\n右端可整理为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}\\left(\\varphi\\,J\\cdot\\nu+\\tfrac12 g^2 p\\,\\partial_\\nu\\varphi\\right)dS$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\cdot\\nu=pf\\cdot\\nu-\\tfrac12 g^2\\partial_\\nu p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接计算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega p\\,f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi=-\\int_\\Omega\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(pf)+\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}\\varphi\\,pf\\cdot\\nu$</span>（分部积分，散度定理）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega p\\,\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta\\varphi=\\int_\\Omega\\tfrac12 g^2\\varphi\\Delta p+\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}\\tfrac12 g^2(p\\partial_\\nu\\varphi-\\varphi\\partial_\\nu p)$</span>（Green 第二恒等式）。两式相加，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^*p=-\\nabla\\cdot(pf)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p$</span>，得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.2（反射条件下的自伴性）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足反射条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\nu\\varphi=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega p\\,\\mathcal{L}\\varphi=\\int_\\Omega\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}^*p$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^*$</span> 在满足相应边界条件的函数空间上互为伴随。</p>\n<p>这一推论说明：反射边界条件使 Fokker–Planck 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^*$</span> 在加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p\\,dx)$</span> 空间中自伴（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为平稳分布时），这是谱理论分析（收敛速率、Poincaré 不等式）的起点。吸收边界条件则破坏自伴性，对应 Dirichlet 拉普拉斯算子的谱理论。本节只陈述这一联系，谱分析留待后续章节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-5-具体例子-一维区间上的通量计算\">5. 具体例子：一维区间上的通量计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-5-具体例子-一维区间上的通量计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 5.1</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=(0,1)\\subset\\mathbb{R}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)\\equiv 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv\\sqrt{2}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2=1$</span>）。Fokker–Planck 方程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p=\\partial_x^2 p$</span>（热方程）。取初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x)=1$</span>（均匀分布）。</p>\n<p>(a) <strong>反射边界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t(0)=\\partial_x p_t(1)=0$</span>。解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=1$</span> 对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=-\\partial_x p_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)=0$</span>，质量守恒 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t)=1$</span>。</p>\n<p>(b) <strong>吸收边界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(0)=p_t(1)=0$</span>。解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\sum_{n\\ge 1}a_n e^{-n^2\\pi^2 t}\\sin(n\\pi x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=2\\int_0^1\\sin(n\\pi x)\\,dx=\\frac{2(1-(-1)^n)}{n\\pi}$</span>。边界通量：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi(t)=-\\partial_x p_t(1)+\\partial_x p_t(0)=-\\sum_n a_n e^{-n^2\\pi^2 t}n\\pi\\cos(n\\pi)+\\sum_n a_n e^{-n^2\\pi^2 t}n\\pi.$$</div>\n对奇数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=4/(n\\pi)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos(n\\pi)=-1$</span>，两项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{4}{n\\pi}e^{-n^2\\pi^2 t}n\\pi(-1)+\\frac{4}{n\\pi}e^{-n^2\\pi^2 t}n\\pi=8e^{-n^2\\pi^2 t}$</span>；对偶数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)=8\\sum_{k\\ge 0}e^{-(2k+1)^2\\pi^2 t}&gt;0$</span>，质量严格递减，与命题 2.5 一致。直接验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t)=\\sum_{k\\ge 0}\\frac{8}{(2k+1)\\pi}e^{-(2k+1)^2\\pi^2 t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal{M}=-\\sum_{k\\ge 0}8(2k+1)\\pi e^{-(2k+1)^2\\pi^2 t}\\cdot\\pi=-\\Phi(t)$</span> 需验算系数；实际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal{M}=-\\sum_k\\frac{8}{(2k+1)\\pi}(2k+1)^2\\pi^2 e^{-\\cdots}=-\\sum_k 8(2k+1)\\pi e^{-\\cdots}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)=8\\sum_k e^{-(2k+1)^2\\pi^2 t}$</span>，两者不直接相等，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的表达式需重新计算。正确的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)$</span> 应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\partial_x p_t(1)+\\partial_x p_t(0)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t(1)=\\sum_n a_n e^{-n^2\\pi^2 t}n\\pi\\cos(n\\pi)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t(0)=\\sum_n a_n e^{-n^2\\pi^2 t}n\\pi$</span>。对奇数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos(n\\pi)=-1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t(1)=-\\sum_k\\frac{4}{(2k+1)\\pi}e^{-\\cdots}(2k+1)\\pi=-\\sum_k 4e^{-\\cdots}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t(0)=\\sum_k 4e^{-\\cdots}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi=-\\partial_x p_t(1)+\\partial_x p_t(0)=8\\sum_k e^{-\\cdots}$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal{M}=-\\sum_k\\frac{8}{(2k+1)\\pi}(2k+1)^2\\pi^2 e^{-\\cdots}=-\\sum_k 8(2k+1)\\pi e^{-\\cdots}$</span>。两者不一致，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\partial_x p_t(1)+\\partial_x p_t(0)$</span> 但符号约定核对如下：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=-\\partial_x p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu(0)=-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu(1)=+1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi=J(0)\\nu(0)+J(1)\\nu(1)=(-\\partial_x p(0))(-1)+(-\\partial_x p(1))(1)=\\partial_x p(0)-\\partial_x p(1)$</span>。代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi=\\sum_k 4e^{-\\cdots}+\\sum_k 4e^{-\\cdots}=8\\sum_k e^{-\\cdots}$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal{M}$</span> 的计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t)=\\int_0^1 p_t=\\sum_k\\frac{8}{(2k+1)\\pi}e^{-\\cdots}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal{M}=-\\sum_k\\frac{8}{(2k+1)\\pi}(2k+1)^2\\pi^2 e^{-\\cdots}=-\\sum_k 8(2k+1)\\pi e^{-\\cdots}$</span>。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi=8\\sum_k e^{-\\cdots}$</span> 不相等，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t)$</span> 的级数表达式有误：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\sin(n\\pi x)\\,dx=\\frac{1-(-1)^n}{n\\pi}$</span>，对奇数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=2k+1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2}{(2k+1)\\pi}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=2\\cdot\\frac{2}{(2k+1)\\pi}=\\frac{4}{(2k+1)\\pi}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 p_t=\\sum_k a_k\\int_0^1\\sin((2k+1)\\pi x)\\,dx=\\sum_k\\frac{4}{(2k+1)\\pi}\\cdot\\frac{2}{(2k+1)\\pi}=\\sum_k\\frac{8}{(2k+1)^2\\pi^2}e^{-\\cdots}$</span>。修正后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal{M}=-\\sum_k\\frac{8}{(2k+1)^2\\pi^2}(2k+1)^2\\pi^2 e^{-\\cdots}=-\\sum_k 8e^{-\\cdots}=-\\Phi$</span>，与命题 1.2 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例验证了命题 1.2 与命题 2.5：吸收边界下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)&gt;0$</span> 且质量递减；反射边界下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi=0$</span> 且质量守恒。同时展示了级数展开中系数核对的重要性——这正是本节要求逐步写出关键等式的理由。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-6-边界通量条件的适定性含义\">6. 边界通量条件的适定性含义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-6-边界通量条件的适定性含义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后说明边界通量条件如何进入适定性讨论。Fokker–Planck 方程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(\\Omega)$</span> 中的适定性依赖于边界条件的选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>反射/周期边界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^*$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(\\Omega)$</span> 中生成强连续压缩半群（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 压缩性，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e^{t\\mathcal{L}^*}\\|_{L^1\\to L^1}\\le 1$</span>，等价于质量守恒），适定性由 Hille–Yosida 定理保证。</li>\n<li><strong>吸收边界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^*$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(\\Omega)$</span> 中生成正压缩半群但非质量守恒，质量以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)$</span> 的速率流失；半群的生成元定义域需包含边界条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span>（迹意义下）。</li>\n<li><strong>一般通量边界</strong>（如 Robin 条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\cdot\\nu=\\kappa p$</span>）：生成元定义域包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\cdot\\nu-\\kappa p=0$</span>，适定性需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\ge 0$</span> 保证正性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节不展开半群理论，只指出：<strong>边界通量条件的选择决定了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^*$</span> 的生成元定义域，从而决定了密度演化的适定性类别</strong>。第八节的数值格式必须与所选边界条件一致，否则离散质量平衡将破坏命题 1.2 的连续对应物；第十节的反例将展示边界通量非零而数值格式误用零通量条件导致的质量不守恒。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>边界通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)=\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS$</span> 精确进入质量平衡恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t)-\\mathcal{M}(s)=-\\int_s^t\\Phi(\\tau)\\,d\\tau$</span>；质量守恒当且仅当总边界通量为零（推论 1.3），逐点零通量是更强的反射条件。</li>\n<li>三类边界条件（吸收、反射、周期）在概率流语言下分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\cdot\\nu=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega=\\varnothing$</span>；反射条件下质量守恒（命题 2.4），吸收条件下质量严格递减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)\\ge 0$</span>（命题 2.5，Hopf 引理）。</li>\n<li>弱形式中边界通量表现为测试函数不紧支撑时的边界项（命题 3.2）；伴随恒等式（命题 4.1）表明反射条件使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^*$</span> 在加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中自伴，边界条件的选择决定生成元定义域与适定性类别。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-7-边界通量的符号约定与流入流出判据\">7. 边界通量的符号约定与流入流出判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-7-边界通量的符号约定与流入流出判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1.2 的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t)-\\mathcal{M}(s)=-\\int_s^t\\Phi(\\tau)\\,d\\tau$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 的外法向约定。为避免后续数值节与反例节在符号上出错，本节将符号约定固定下来，并给出流入/流出的逐点判据。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 7.1（流入与流出集）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H4) 成立。对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，定义边界上的两个可测集\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E_t^{\\mathrm{out}}:=\\{x\\in\\partial\\Omega:\\ J_t(x)\\cdot\\nu(x)&gt;0\\},\\qquad E_t^{\\mathrm{in}}:=\\{x\\in\\partial\\Omega:\\ J_t(x)\\cdot\\nu(x)&lt;0\\}.$$</div>\n称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_t^{\\mathrm{out}}$</span> 为<strong>流出集</strong>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_t^{\\mathrm{in}}$</span> 为<strong>流入集</strong>。由 (H3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu\\in L^1(\\partial\\Omega)$</span>，故两集合的边界测度有限。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.2（流入流出分解）</strong> 在命题 1.2 的假设下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{M}(t)-\\mathcal{M}(s)=\\int_s^t\\int_{E_\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}}|J_\\tau\\cdot\\nu|\\,dS\\,d\\tau-\\int_s^t\\int_{E_\\tau^{\\mathrm{out}}}(J_\\tau\\cdot\\nu)\\,dS\\,d\\tau.$$</div>\n右端第一项为总流入质量，第二项为总流出质量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 7.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(\\tau)=\\int_{E_\\tau^{\\mathrm{out}}}J_\\tau\\cdot\\nu\\,dS+\\int_{E_\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}}J_\\tau\\cdot\\nu\\,dS$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\tau\\cdot\\nu&lt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{E_\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}}J_\\tau\\cdot\\nu\\,dS=-\\int_{E_\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}}|J_\\tau\\cdot\\nu|\\,dS$</span>。代入命题 1.2 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.3（净流入判据）</strong> 在命题 7.2 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t)&gt;\\mathcal{M}(s)$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_s^t\\int_{E_\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}}|J_\\tau\\cdot\\nu|\\,dS\\,d\\tau&gt;\\int_s^t\\int_{E_\\tau^{\\mathrm{out}}}(J_\\tau\\cdot\\nu)\\,dS\\,d\\tau$</span>。</p>\n<p>这一分解在数值验证（第十四节）中是离散质量平衡的直接对应物：数值格式的边界通量求和必须按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E^{\\mathrm{out}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E^{\\mathrm{in}}$</span> 分正负号累加，否则离散质量平衡与命题 7.2 的连续版本不一致。符号约定的固定还排除了一个常见错误：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)&gt;0$</span> 误读为质量增加。由命题 1.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)&gt;0$</span> 对应质量减少（净流出），这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_t^{\\mathrm{out}}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\cdot\\nu&gt;0$</span> 的几何直观一致——外法向指向区域外部，正通量即向外流出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-8-边界通量条件与概率流-ODE-的相容性\">8. 边界通量条件与概率流 ODE 的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-8-边界通量条件与概率流-ODE-的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第十五节将讨论概率流 ODE 与 Fokker–Planck 方程的接口。本节提前给出一个只涉及边界通量的相容性引理，因为它是该接口在边界处的必要条件，且其证明只用到本节已建立的符号。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 为概率流 ODE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dX_t}{dt}=v_t(X_t),\\qquad v_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla\\log p_t$$</div>\n的解流（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 处定义）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 Fokker–Planck 方程，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=J_t/p_t$</span>，即概率流 ODE 的速度是概率流除以密度。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 8.1（边界处速度与通量的关系）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline{\\Omega}$</span> 上（对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足反射边界条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span>。则概率流 ODE 的速度在边界上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=J_t/p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t\\cdot\\nu=(J_t\\cdot\\nu)/p_t$</span>。由反射条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>引理 8.2（吸收边界处速度的奇性）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足吸收边界条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu|_{\\partial\\Omega}\\ne 0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 的一个正测度子集上。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=J_t/p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上无界，概率流 ODE 的解流不能以有限速度到达边界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu\\ne 0$</span> 的边界点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t\\cdot\\nu=(J_t\\cdot\\nu)/p_t$</span> 的分母趋于零而分子非零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|v_t\\cdot\\nu|\\to\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 8.1 与 8.2 说明：反射边界条件下概率流 ODE 的速度与边界相切，解流保持在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline{\\Omega}$</span> 内；吸收边界条件下概率流 ODE 的速度在边界处发散，解流在有限时间内无法到达边界，这与密度的零边界值在概率流 ODE 中表现为“无穷远处”的排斥是一致的。第十五节将把这一观察精确化为概率流 ODE 与 Fokker–Planck 方程在边界处的相容性定理。本节只固定这一接口所需的边界通量条件，不展开 ODE 解流的存在性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-9-非光滑边界与弱通量条件\">9. 非光滑边界与弱通量条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-9-非光滑边界与弱通量条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(H4) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega\\in C^1$</span> 以保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 连续、面积测度良定义。实际应用中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 常为多边形或多面体，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 仅有 Lipschitz 正则性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 在角点处不连续。本节说明边界通量条件在 Lipschitz 边界下的弱表述，并指出 (H4) 在何处被放宽。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.1（Lipschitz 边界下的弱通量条件）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 为有界 Lipschitz 开集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^{d-1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上的 Hausdorff 测度。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足<strong>弱反射条件</strong>，若对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^\\infty(\\overline{\\Omega})$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega J_t\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,dx+\\int_\\Omega\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,dx=0.$$</div>\n即散度定理在分布意义下成立且边界项为零，不要求逐点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu$</span> 有定义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.2（Lipschitz 边界下弱反射条件蕴含质量守恒）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 有界 Lipschitz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1([0,T];L^1(\\Omega))\\cap L^1((0,T);W^{1,1}(\\Omega))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in W^{1,1}(\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足定义 9.1 的弱反射条件。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}(t)\\equiv\\mathcal{M}(0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv 1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline{\\Omega}$</span> 上（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^\\infty(\\overline{\\Omega})$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi=0$</span>）。由定义 9.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,dx=0$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal{M}(t)=\\int_\\Omega\\partial_t p_t\\,dx=-\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,dx=0$</span>，质量守恒。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.2 表明：在 Lipschitz 边界下，弱反射条件（定义 9.1）足以保证质量守恒，无需逐点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span>。这与命题 2.4 的关系是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 边界下逐点条件更强，蕴含弱条件；Lipschitz 边界下逐点条件可能无意义（角点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 不存在），但弱条件仍有意义且足以推出质量守恒。第八节的有限差分格式在多边形区域上运行时，必须验证其离散边界处理满足定义 9.1 的离散对应物，否则角点处的通量累积会导致离散质量漂移。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.3（弱吸收条件的质量递减）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 有界 Lipschitz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^{d-1}$</span> 意义下 a.e. 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)&gt;0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal{M}(t)\\le 0$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span> 与零边界迹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu\\le 0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^{d-1}$</span> 意义下 a.e.（弱 Hopf 引理，Lipschitz 边界版本）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu\\ge 0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^{d-1}$</span> 意义下 a.e.，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)\\ge 0$</span>，由命题 1.2 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal{M}\\le 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-10-边界通量条件的坐标表述\">10. 边界通量条件的坐标表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-10-边界通量条件的坐标表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出边界通量在局部坐标下的表达式，以便第八节的数值格式与第十四节的质量验证在实现时逐项对应。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 局部由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma:U\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\subset\\mathbb{R}^{d-1}$</span> 为参数域，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 为外法向。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.1（局部坐标下的通量积分）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi(t)=\\sum_{j}\\int_{U_j}(J_t\\circ\\gamma_j)(u)\\cdot\\nu(\\gamma_j(u))\\,\\sqrt{\\det(D\\gamma_j(u)^\\top D\\gamma_j(u))}\\,du,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\gamma_j,U_j\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 的有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 参数化覆盖，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\gamma_j$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_j$</span> 的 Jacobi 矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\det(D\\gamma_j^\\top D\\gamma_j)}$</span> 为面积元。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由面积测度的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dS=\\sqrt{\\det(D\\gamma_j^\\top D\\gamma_j)}\\,du$</span> 在参数化片 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_j(U_j)$</span> 上。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)=\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS$</span> 按覆盖分解并逐片换元，得所述表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10.1 的意义在于：数值实现中边界通量的离散求和必须乘以面积元因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\det(D\\gamma_j^\\top D\\gamma_j)}$</span>，否则在曲边界上离散质量平衡与命题 1.2 不一致。对一维区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega=\\{0,1\\}$</span> 为零维流形，面积元退化为计数测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)=J_t(0)\\nu(0)+J_t(1)\\nu(1)=\\partial_x p_t(0)-\\partial_x p_t(1)$</span>（在例 5.1 的符号约定下），与例 5.1 的计算一致。对多维立方体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=(0,1)^d$</span>，每个面为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(d-1)$</span> 维单位立方体，面积元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)$</span> 为各面通量的代数和。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 10.2（曲边界上的通量符号）</strong> 在命题 10.1 的设定下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 为球 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R(0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu(x)=x/R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)=R^{d-1}\\int_{\\mathbb{S}^{d-1}}J_t(R\\omega)\\cdot\\omega\\,d\\sigma(\\omega)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\sigma$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{S}^{d-1}$</span> 上的球面测度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 球面参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(\\omega)=R\\omega$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega\\in\\mathbb{S}^{d-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\gamma=R\\,\\mathrm{Id}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\det(D\\gamma^\\top D\\gamma)}=R^{d-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu(R\\omega)=\\omega$</span>。代入命题 10.1 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 10.2 在第八节的球坐标有限差分格式中直接使用：径向通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_r=J\\cdot\\nu$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=R$</span> 处的离散值乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R^{d-1}$</span> 与球面测度权重，构成离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(t)$</span>。若格式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=R$</span> 处误用零通量条件而真实解有非零径向通量，离散质量将按推论 10.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 漂移，这正是第十节反例的离散版本。</p>\n<p>至此，本节完成了边界通量条件的定义（定义 1.1、7.1、9.1）、质量平衡恒等式（命题 1.2、7.2）、三类边界条件的精确表述与质量守恒判据（命题 2.4、2.5、推论 1.3、9.2、9.3）、弱形式中的边界项（命题 3.2）、伴随恒等式（命题 4.1）、具体例子（例 5.1）、适定性含义（第 6 小节）、与概率流 ODE 的相容性（引理 8.1、8.2）以及坐标表述（命题 10.1、推论 10.2）。这些结果构成后续平稳分布节（第六节）与反例节（第十节）的边界条件基础：平稳分布节将在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 与边界通量条件联合下讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 的存在性，反例节将展示边界通量非零而数值格式误用零通量条件导致的质量不守恒。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-平稳分布\">平稳分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-平稳分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移向量场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为扩散速率（非负），<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(x)=p_t(x)f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t(x)$</span> 为概率流。生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 及其伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 按前节定义，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(x)f(x,t))+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t(x).$$</div>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，先给出定义。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（平稳分布）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)\\equiv f(x)$</span> 均不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（即自治 FP 方程）。称非负函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_\\infty=1$</span>，为平稳分布，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast$</span> 的定义域且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p_\\infty=0\\quad\\text{在分布意义下，即}\\quad \\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty f-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_\\infty$</span>。等价地，对一切测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\big(f(x)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta\\varphi(x)\\big)\\,p_\\infty(x)\\,dx=0.$$</div>\n<p>注意平稳分布与“不变测度”“定态解”的区别：不变测度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t^\\ast\\mu=\\mu$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span> 成立的测度，而定态解仅要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p=0$</span> 在某时刻成立；在自治且半群强连续的条件下二者等价（见推论 2）。与“平衡分布”的区别在于后者额外要求细致平衡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>，而平稳分布只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty$</span> 为非零无散场（环流）。</p>\n<p>本节假设纪律如下，逐条显式列出并在命题中引用。</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f(x)-f(y)\\|\\le L\\|x-y\\|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f(0)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span> 为常数。</p>\n<p>(A3) 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{-V}dx&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\nabla V$</span>（梯度漂移）。此条仅在需要显式构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 的命题中启用；一般存在性命题只用 (A1)(A2) 加 Lyapunov 条件。</p>\n<p>(A4)（Lyapunov 条件）存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W\\ge1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\|x\\|\\to\\infty}W(x)=\\infty$</span>，及常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0,b&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}W\\le -aW+b$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上成立，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}=f\\cdot\\nabla+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A5)（边界通量消失）在需要分部积分的命题中，测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，从而边界项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}\\varphi J_t\\cdot n\\,dS=0$</span> 对足够大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 成立；或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot n=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上（有界域情形）。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在上述假设被明确引用处成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-1-平稳分布的存在性与唯一性\">命题 1（平稳分布的存在性与唯一性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-1-平稳分布的存在性与唯一性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A4)。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：自治 FP 方程存在唯一的概率密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p_\\infty=0$</span>，且对任意初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_0=1$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_t-p_\\infty\\|_{L^1}\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：分三步。</p>\n<p>第一步（存在性）。由 (A4)，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[W(X_T)]\\le W(x_0)+bT$</span>，故族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{P_t(x_0,\\cdot)\\}_{t\\ge0}$</span> 在紧集上一致胎紧（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 强制）。由 Prokhorov 定理，存在子列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k\\to\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{t_k}(x_0,\\cdot)\\Rightarrow\\mu$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，由半群性质与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 的强连续性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\varphi\\,d\\mu=\\lim_{k}\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_{t_k})]=\\lim_k\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_{t_k-s})]\\circ P_s=\\int P_s\\varphi\\,d\\mu.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为不变测度。由 (A1)(A2)，转移核具有关于 Lebesgue 测度的密度（Hörmander 条件或热核估计），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=p_\\infty dx$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_\\infty=1$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=0$</span> 与 FP 方程得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p_\\infty=0$</span>；椭圆正则性（系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span>）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in C^2$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二步（唯一性）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty,q_\\infty$</span> 为两个平稳密度。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=p_\\infty-q_\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int h=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast h=0$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,p_t=\\int\\mathcal{L}\\varphi\\,h=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为常数；由第一步的收敛性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,h=0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>第三步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛）。由 (A4) 与不可约性，半群在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 上为不可约、正则可逆的；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 上的次不变测度唯一性（标准半群理论）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_t-p_\\infty\\|_{L^1}\\to0$</span>。关键等式：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_A p_t=\\int_A\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p_t=-\\int_{\\partial A}J_t\\cdot n\\,dS,$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t&gt;p_\\infty\\}$</span> 时，边界通量项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t,p_\\infty$</span> 的正则性可控，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\|p_t-p_\\infty\\|_{L^1}\\le0$</span> 且严格递减除非相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：若去掉 (A4)，存在性可能失败（漂移把质量推向无穷远）；若去掉 (A1) 的 Lipschitz，唯一性可能失败（漂移不唯一导致多个不变测度）。这些失效情形在第 10 节反例节集中处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-2-定态与不变测度的等价\">命题 2（定态与不变测度的等价）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-2-定态与不变测度的等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in C^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_\\infty=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p_\\infty=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t^\\ast(p_\\infty dx)=p_\\infty dx$</span>；反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t^\\ast\\mu=\\mu$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=p\\,dx$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：正向。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，由 Fokker–Planck 方程与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p_\\infty=0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,p_t=\\int\\mathcal{L}\\varphi\\,p_t=\\int\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p_t.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_\\infty$</span> 得右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,p_\\infty$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t^\\ast(p_\\infty dx)=p_\\infty dx$</span>。这里交换求导与积分用的是 Leibniz 法则，条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^2$</span> 使被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\varphi$</span> 上一致有界且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 局部一致可微。</p>\n<p>反向。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t^\\ast\\mu=\\mu$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,p=\\int P_t\\varphi\\,p$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，两边对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处求导（Leibniz，条件同上）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\mathcal{L}\\varphi\\,p=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p=0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>区别说明</strong>：命题 2 表明，在自治、<span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 正则与测试函数紧支撑的条件下，“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p=0$</span>”与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t^\\ast\\mu=\\mu$</span>”是同一件事的两种写法；但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 不属 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast$</span> 定义域（如仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 正则），则只能谈弱意义下的不变测度，此时需用第 4 节的弱解框架，不能直接写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p=0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-3-梯度漂移下的显式平稳分布与细致平衡\">命题 3（梯度漂移下的显式平稳分布与细致平衡）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-3-梯度漂移下的显式平稳分布与细致平衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\int e^{-2V/g^2}dx&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty(x)=Z^{-1}e^{-2V(x)/g^2}$</span> 是平稳分布，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>（细致平衡）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直接计算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\nabla V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_\\infty=-\\tfrac{2}{g^2}p_\\infty\\nabla V$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_\\infty=p_\\infty f-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_\\infty=p_\\infty(-\\nabla V)-\\tfrac12 g^2\\Big(-\\tfrac{2}{g^2}p_\\infty\\nabla V\\Big)=0.$$</div>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>，满足平稳条件。非负性与归一化由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>可检验恒等式（推论）</strong>：在命题 3 条件下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int \\mathcal{L}\\varphi\\,p_\\infty=\\int\\Big(f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta\\varphi\\Big)p_\\infty=0.$$</div>\n<p>验证：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\nabla V$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_\\infty=-\\tfrac{2}{g^2}p_\\infty\\nabla V$</span> 代入，分部积分（边界项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑消失，用 Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 验证可积性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\varphi|\\,p_\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Delta\\varphi|\\,p_\\infty$</span> 均在紧集上有界）得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,p_\\infty=-\\int\\nabla V\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,p_\\infty=\\int\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(p_\\infty\\nabla V),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta\\varphi\\,p_\\infty=-\\tfrac12 g^2\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot\\nabla p_\\infty=\\int\\varphi\\,\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_\\infty.$$</div>\n<p>两式相加，右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p_\\infty=0$</span>，与直接代入一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（一维）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V(x)=\\tfrac12 x^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\sqrt2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty(x)=\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}e^{-x^2/2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty(-x)-\\tfrac12\\cdot2\\cdot p_\\infty'=-xp_\\infty+p_\\infty x=0$</span>。数值验证：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty(0.3)\\approx0.3814$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty'(0.3)=-0.3p_\\infty(0.3)\\approx-0.1144$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=0.3814\\cdot(-0.3)-1\\cdot(-0.1144)=0$</span>。此例同时验证了命题 3 的恒等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的标度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 展宽，峰高按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{-1}$</span> 缩放。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-4-非梯度漂移下的环流平稳分布\">命题 4（非梯度漂移下的环流平稳分布）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-4-非梯度漂移下的环流平稳分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=(-\\partial_{x_2}H,\\partial_{x_1}H)$</span> 为 Hamilton 向量场（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=\\rho(H(x))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in C^1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_\\infty=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的等值线上，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 为常数（在连通等值线上）。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的等值线为同心圆且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 径向对称，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty$</span> 非零但无散。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_\\infty f)=f\\cdot\\nabla p_\\infty+p_\\infty\\nabla\\cdot f=f\\cdot\\nabla p_\\infty$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=\\rho(H)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_\\infty=\\rho'(H)\\nabla H$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla H=(-\\partial_{x_2}H)(\\partial_{x_1}H)+(\\partial_{x_1}H)(\\partial_{x_2}H)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla p_\\infty=0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=-\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_\\infty$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_\\infty=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 在等值线上为常数；若等值线连通，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 为均匀分布（在紧等值线情形需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_\\infty=1$</span> 限制区域）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与命题 3 的区别</strong>：命题 3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>（细致平衡），本命题中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty f-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_\\infty$</span> 一般非零，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>，即存在稳态环流。这说明“平稳”不等于“无流”，在联合生成与概率流 ODE 的接口（第 15 节）中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty$</span> 的非零部分对应可逆性破缺，不能与得分函数的梯度混淆。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-5-平稳分布的矩恒等式\">命题 5（平稳分布的矩恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-5-平稳分布的矩恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in C^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|^2p_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\int x\\,p_\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\int(x-m)(x-m)^\\top p_\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f(x)\\,p_\\infty(x)\\,dx=0,\\qquad \\int\\big(xf(x)^\\top+f(x)x^\\top\\big)p_\\infty=\\tfrac12 g^2 I_d\\cdot\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\Sigma\\text{ 的精确形式}.$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，对任意常数向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int a\\cdot f\\,p_\\infty=0,\\qquad \\int (a\\cdot x)(a\\cdot f)\\,p_\\infty=\\tfrac12 g^2\\int\\|a\\|^2\\,p_\\infty\\text{ 的散度项}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：取测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=a\\cdot x$</span>（需截断：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_R=\\varphi\\chi_R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi_R\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi_R=1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span> 上，再令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>，用 Dominated Convergence 验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|a\\cdot f|p_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|a\\|^2p_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>）。由平稳性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\mathcal{L}\\varphi_R\\,p_\\infty=0$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\big(a\\cdot f\\,\\chi_R+(a\\cdot x)f\\cdot\\nabla\\chi_R+\\tfrac12 g^2(a\\cdot x)\\Delta\\chi_R\\big)p_\\infty=0.$$</div>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>，后两项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\chi_R,\\Delta\\chi_R$</span> 支撑在环带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{R\\le\\|x\\|\\le2R\\}$</span> 上且被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C/R$</span> 控制，结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|p_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span> 得极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int a\\cdot f\\,p_\\infty=0$</span>。第二式取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=\\tfrac12(a\\cdot x)^2$</span> 同理，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\big((a\\cdot x)(a\\cdot f)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\|a\\|^2\\big)p_\\infty=0,$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(a\\cdot x)(a\\cdot f)p_\\infty=-\\tfrac12 g^2\\|a\\|^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：第二式表明，平稳分布下漂移与位置的协方差由扩散系数与二阶矩锁定；这是检验数值解是否收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 的可计算判据（第 14 节代码验证用此恒等式）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-6-平稳分布对参数的连续依赖\">命题 6（平稳分布对参数的连续依赖）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-6-平稳分布对参数的连续依赖\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 关于参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta\\subset\\mathbb{R}^k$</span> 连续且 Lipschitz 常数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部一致有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\theta&gt;0$</span> 连续。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto p_\\infty^\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 上连续。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,p_\\infty^\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的连续函数（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_\\theta\\varphi$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的连续性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty^\\theta$</span> 的一致胎紧性，用 Prokhorov 与 Portmanteau）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中的稠密性与一致可积性（(A4) 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|p_\\infty^\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部一致有界），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 连续。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>用途</strong>：此命题保证第 8 节数值格式中，参数微扰不会导致平稳分布跳变；也是第 12 节自由能关于参数可微性的前置条件。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>平稳分布定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p_\\infty=0$</span>（等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>），在 (A1)(A2)(A4) 下存在唯一且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛；它与不变测度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 正则下等价，与细致平衡的区别在于是否要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>。</li>\n<li>梯度漂移给出显式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=Z^{-1}e^{-2V/g^2}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>；非梯度 Hamilton 漂移可给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\not\\equiv0$</span> 但无散的环流平稳分布，二者不可混同。</li>\n<li>平稳分布满足矩恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,p_\\infty=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(a\\cdot x)(a\\cdot f)p_\\infty=-\\tfrac12 g^2\\|a\\|^2$</span>，可作为数值解收敛判据；平稳分布对参数连续依赖，为后续数值格式与自由能分析提供接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-7-平稳分布的对数梯度与得分函数的关系\">命题 7（平稳分布的对数梯度与得分函数的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-7-平稳分布的对数梯度与得分函数的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty&gt;0$</span> 处处成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla\\log p_\\infty\\|^2p_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：定义平稳得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty(x)=\\nabla\\log p_\\infty(x)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty$</span> 满足如下恒等式（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 几乎处处意义下）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(x)+\\tfrac12 g^2 s_\\infty(x)=\\frac{J_\\infty(x)}{p_\\infty(x)},$$</div>\n<p>且当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty(x)=-\\tfrac{2}{g^2}f(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty$</span> 的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_\\infty=p_\\infty s_\\infty$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_\\infty=p_\\infty f-\\tfrac12 g^2 p_\\infty s_\\infty=p_\\infty\\Big(f-\\tfrac12 g^2 s_\\infty\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty&gt;0$</span> 得第一式。第二式：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-\\tfrac12 g^2 s_\\infty=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty=\\tfrac{2}{g^2}f$</span>；注意符号：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty f-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_\\infty=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_\\infty=\\tfrac{2}{g^2}p_\\infty f$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty=\\nabla\\log p_\\infty=\\tfrac{2}{g^2}f$</span>。在梯度漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\nabla V$</span> 下即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty=-\\tfrac{2}{g^2}\\nabla V$</span>，与命题 3 的显式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=Z^{-1}e^{-2V/g^2}$</span> 一致。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty=\\tfrac{2}{g^2}f$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty$</span> 定义得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：此命题说明平稳得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty$</span> 与漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的关系仅在细致平衡（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>）时才是简单的线性比例；在环流情形（命题 4）中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 之间差一个非零的无散流项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty/p_\\infty$</span>。这一点在后续第 15 节“与概率流 ODE 的接口”中至关重要：概率流 ODE 的速度场是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=J_t/p_t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty=J_\\infty/p_\\infty$</span>，它一般不为零，且不能与反向 SDE 的漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12 g^2 s_\\infty$</span> 混为一谈。特别地，若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty$</span> 误当作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12 g^2 s_\\infty$</span>，则在环流情形下会得到错误的平稳分布。</p>\n<p><strong>推论（得分与漂移的散度恒等式）</strong>：在命题 7 假设下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot\\big(p_\\infty(f-\\tfrac12 g^2 s_\\infty)\\big)=0\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad \\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0.$$</div>\n<p>这是平稳条件的直接重写；其证明只需将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty(f-\\tfrac12 g^2 s_\\infty)$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>。此恒等式在数值上可作为检验平稳得分估计质量的判据：若学到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_\\theta(f-\\tfrac12 g^2 s_\\theta))\\approx0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 近似平稳。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-8-平稳分布的一阶变分刻画\">命题 8（平稳分布的一阶变分刻画）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-8-平稳分布的一阶变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\int e^{-2V/g^2}dx&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=Z^{-1}e^{-2V/g^2}$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}[p]=\\int p\\log p\\,dx+\\tfrac{2}{g^2}\\int Vp\\,dx$</span> 为自由能泛函（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p=1$</span> 约束下）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 在概率密度集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p\\ge0,\\int p=1\\}$</span> 上的唯一极小点，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}[p_\\infty]=-\\log Z$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p=1$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p/p_\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q\\,p_\\infty=1$</span>。计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{F}[p]-\\mathcal{F}[p_\\infty]=\\int p\\log\\frac{p}{p_\\infty}\\,dx=\\int q\\log q\\,p_\\infty\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>由 Jensen 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\log u$</span> 为凸函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 为概率测度），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int q\\log q\\,p_\\infty\\ge\\Big(\\int q\\,p_\\infty\\Big)\\log\\Big(\\int q\\,p_\\infty\\Big)=0,$$</div>\n<p>等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\equiv1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=p_\\infty$</span>。又</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{F}[p_\\infty]=\\int p_\\infty\\log p_\\infty+\\tfrac{2}{g^2}\\int Vp_\\infty=\\int p_\\infty(-\\log Z-\\tfrac{2}{g^2}V)+\\tfrac{2}{g^2}\\int Vp_\\infty=-\\log Z.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：Jensen 不等式的应用需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\log q\\in L^1(p_\\infty)$</span>，这由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\log p$</span> 有限（假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}[p]&lt;\\infty$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int Vp&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}[p]=\\infty$</span> 则结论平凡。此命题把“平稳分布”与“自由能极小”联系起来，是第 12 节熵与自由能分析的入口；同时说明平稳分布不依赖于初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>，只依赖于势 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 与扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，这与命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛性一致。</p>\n<p><strong>与命题 3 的关系</strong>：命题 3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 的显式形式，本命题给出其变分刻画；两者互为验证。特别地，命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span> 与本命题的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 极小”是同一事实的两种表述：细致平衡是自由能极小的一阶条件（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\infty)$</span> 内积下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p+\\tfrac{2}{g^2}V$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 处为零）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-9-平稳分布的稳定性-小扰动下的-L-1-界\">命题 9（平稳分布的稳定性：小扰动下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-9-平稳分布的稳定性-小扰动下的-L-1-界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 为平稳分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\ge0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_0-p_\\infty\\|_{L^1}=\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(f,g,W)&gt;0$</span> 使对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|p_t-p_\\infty\\|_{L^1}\\le C\\varepsilon e^{-\\lambda t},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span> 由 (A4) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的强制性决定（Poincaré 型不等式常数）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t=p_t-p_\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int h_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t h_t=\\mathcal{L}^\\ast h_t$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\infty^{-1})$</span> 加权内积下（即对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h/p_\\infty$</span> 作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\infty)$</span> 内积），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast$</span> 是对称负定算子当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>；在环流情形需用 Bakry–Émery 型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma_2$</span> 条件。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma_2$</span> 判据：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}\\,V\\ge\\kappa I$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&gt;0$</span>），则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\|h_t\\|_{L^2(p_\\infty^{-1})}^2\\le-2\\kappa\\|h_t\\|_{L^2(p_\\infty^{-1})}^2,$$</div>\n<p>得指数衰减。再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\infty^{-1})$</span> 的插值不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|h\\|_{L^1}\\le\\|h\\|_{L^2(p_\\infty^{-1})}\\cdot\\|p_\\infty\\|_{L^2}^{1/2}$</span>（Cauchy–Schwarz）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_\\infty\\|_{L^2}&lt;\\infty$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的增长），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 指数界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此命题的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的凸性；在非凸 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 下指数衰减可能退化为代数衰减，此时第 10 节反例节给出具体构造。本命题只声明在 (A4) 与凸性附加假设下的稳定性，不声称一般情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-10-平稳分布与时间反演-SDE-的接口\">命题 10（平稳分布与时间反演 SDE 的接口）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-10-平稳分布与时间反演-SDE-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in C^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla\\log p_\\infty\\|^2p_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：考虑时间反演 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dY_t=\\big(-f(Y_t)+g^2\\nabla\\log p_\\infty(Y_t)\\big)\\,dt+g\\,dW_t,$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 也是该 SDE 的平稳分布；且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span> 时，反向漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-f+g^2s_\\infty=-f+2f=f$</span>，即反向 SDE 与原 SDE 同分布（可逆）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\not\\equiv0$</span> 时，反向漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-f+g^2s_\\infty=-f+2(f-J_\\infty/p_\\infty)=f-2J_\\infty/p_\\infty$</span>，与原漂移不同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：反向 SDE 的 FP 方程为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t q_t=-\\nabla\\cdot\\big(q_t(-f+g^2s_\\infty)\\big)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta q_t.$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=p_\\infty$</span>，计算其概率流：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J^{\\mathrm{rev}}_\\infty=p_\\infty(-f+g^2s_\\infty)-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_\\infty=p_\\infty(-f+g^2s_\\infty)-\\tfrac12 g^2p_\\infty s_\\infty=p_\\infty(-f+\\tfrac12 g^2s_\\infty)=-J_\\infty.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J^{\\mathrm{rev}}_\\infty=-\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 为反向 SDE 的平稳分布。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span> 时，由命题 7 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty=\\tfrac{2}{g^2}f$</span>，故反向漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-f+g^2\\cdot\\tfrac{2}{g^2}f=f$</span>，与原漂移相同；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\not\\equiv0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty=\\tfrac{2}{g^2}(f-J_\\infty/p_\\infty)$</span>，反向漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-f+2(f-J_\\infty/p_\\infty)=f-2J_\\infty/p_\\infty$</span>，与原漂移差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2J_\\infty/p_\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与第 15 节的接口</strong>：此命题说明反向 SDE 的漂移与概率流 ODE 的速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty=J_\\infty/p_\\infty$</span> 之间的关系是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^{\\mathrm{rev}}=-f+g^2s_\\infty=f-2v_\\infty$</span>，而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^{\\mathrm{rev}}=-f$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^{\\mathrm{rev}}=v_\\infty$</span>。在生成模型的反向采样中，若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty$</span> 直接当作反向漂移，则采样分布会偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span>；正确的反向漂移必须包含得分项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2s_\\infty$</span>，而得分项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 耦合。这一区分是本节与第 15 节衔接的核心，也是“禁止把反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混为一谈”的具体体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-11-平稳分布的边界通量判据\">命题 11（平稳分布的边界通量判据）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-11-平稳分布的边界通量判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)，有界域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in C^2(\\overline\\Omega)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline\\Omega$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega p_\\infty=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上带反射边界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\cdot n=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span>）的平稳分布，当且仅当</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0\\text{ 在 }\\Omega\\text{ 内},\\qquad J_\\infty\\cdot n=0\\text{ 在 }\\partial\\Omega\\text{ 上}.$$</div>\n<p>若边界条件改为吸收（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 不能为正的平稳分布（质量会持续流失），除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\cdot n$</span> 的积分恰为零且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 在边界附近有界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：正向由第 5 节边界通量条件直接得。反向：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\cdot n=0$</span>，则由散度定理对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^\\infty(\\overline\\Omega)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega\\mathcal{L}\\varphi\\,p_\\infty=-\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\cdot(\\varphi J_\\infty)\\,dx=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}\\varphi J_\\infty\\cdot n\\,dS=0,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast p_\\infty=0$</span> 在弱意义下成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 为平稳分布。吸收边界情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty&gt;0$</span> 在内部，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_\\infty\\cdot n$</span> 在边界上一般非零（由 Hopf 引理，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 在边界取零极小值，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_\\infty\\cdot n&lt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\cdot n=p_\\infty f\\cdot n-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_\\infty\\cdot n=\\tfrac12 g^2|\\nabla p_\\infty\\cdot n|&gt;0$</span>，质量持续流出，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\int p_\\infty=0$</span> 矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与第 10 节反例节的衔接</strong>：本命题的吸收边界情形正是第 10 节“边界通量非零导致质量不守恒”的理论前身；本节只给出判据，具体反例构造（含数值验证）在第 10 节集中处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-12-平稳分布的谱间隙与收敛速率\">命题 12（平稳分布的谱间隙与收敛速率）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-12-平稳分布的谱间隙与收敛速率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}\\,V\\ge\\kappa I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=Z^{-1}e^{-2V/g^2}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：FP 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\infty^{-1})$</span> 上的谱间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1\\ge\\kappa$</span>，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^2(p_\\infty^{-1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_0=1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|p_t-p_\\infty\\|_{L^2(p_\\infty^{-1})}\\le e^{-\\kappa t}\\|p_0-p_\\infty\\|_{L^2(p_\\infty^{-1})}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=p/p_\\infty-1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int h\\,p_\\infty=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t h=\\mathcal{L}^\\ast h/p_\\infty$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\infty)$</span> 内积下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^\\ast$</span> 的二次型为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle h,-\\mathcal{L}^\\ast h\\rangle_{L^2(p_\\infty)}=\\tfrac12 g^2\\int\\|\\nabla h\\|^2p_\\infty+\\int h\\,\\nabla V\\cdot\\nabla h\\,p_\\infty.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}\\,V\\ge\\kappa I$</span> 与 Bakry–Émery 判据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma_2(f,f)\\ge\\kappa\\|\\nabla f\\|^2$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle h,-\\mathcal{L}^\\ast h\\rangle\\ge\\kappa\\|h\\|^2$</span>，故谱间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge\\kappa$</span>，指数衰减成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此命题的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的强凸常数，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 无关；这解释了为什么扩散速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 展宽但收敛速率不变（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\infty^{-1})$</span> 度量下）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 非凸，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 可能为负或零，收敛速率退化为代数或更慢；具体构造见第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-13-平稳分布的乘积结构-可分离势\">命题 13（平稳分布的乘积结构：可分离势）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-13-平稳分布的乘积结构-可分离势\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=d_1+d_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V(x)=V_1(x_1)+V_2(x_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=(x_1,x_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=\\int e^{-2V_i/g^2}dx_i&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty(x)=p_{\\infty,1}(x_1)p_{\\infty,2}(x_2)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\infty,i}=Z_i^{-1}e^{-2V_i/g^2}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{\\infty,1}\\equiv0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{\\infty,2}\\equiv0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 可分离，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla V=(\\nabla V_1,\\nabla V_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-2V/g^2}=e^{-2V_1/g^2}e^{-2V_2/g^2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=Z_1Z_2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 分解为乘积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty$</span> 的分量形式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{\\infty,1}=p_{\\infty,1}p_{\\infty,2}(-\\nabla V_1)-\\tfrac12 g^2p_{\\infty,2}\\nabla p_{\\infty,1}=p_{\\infty,2}J_{\\infty,1}^{(1)}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{\\infty,1}^{(1)}$</span> 为一维子问题的概率流；同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{\\infty,2}=p_{\\infty,1}J_{\\infty,2}^{(2)}$</span>。由命题 3，每个子问题的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{(i)}\\equiv0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\infty,2}J^{(1)}\\equiv0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\infty,1}J^{(2)}\\equiv0$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\infty,i}&gt;0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{(i)}\\equiv0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>用途</strong>：此命题说明平稳分布在可分离势下具有乘积结构，是第 9 节一维闭式例子向多维推广的桥梁；同时说明“细致平衡”在乘积结构下是逐坐标的性质，不能由整体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span> 推出单个坐标的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{(i)}\\equiv0$</span> 之外的信息（因为整体为零已蕴含逐坐标为零）。在联合生成（第 15 节）中，若联合分布可分离，则各坐标的反向 SDE 可独立采样，得分函数逐坐标分解，这与命题 7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\infty=\\tfrac{2}{g^2}f$</span> 逐坐标成立一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-14-平稳分布的矩生成函数与特征函数\">命题 14（平稳分布的矩生成函数与特征函数）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-14-平稳分布的矩生成函数与特征函数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{\\langle\\theta,x\\rangle}p_\\infty(x)dx&lt;\\infty$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在某邻域内成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 的矩生成函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)=\\int e^{\\langle\\theta,x\\rangle}p_\\infty(x)dx$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M(\\theta)=Z^{-1}\\int e^{\\langle\\theta,x\\rangle-2V(x)/g^2}dx,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla M(0)=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\infty}[x]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}\\,M(0)=\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_\\infty}(x)$</span>。特别地，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(x)=\\tfrac12 x^\\top A x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 正定）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\tfrac{g^2}{2}A^{-1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)=\\exp(\\tfrac{g^2}{4}\\theta^\\top A^{-1}\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 的显式形式直接得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla M(0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}\\,M(0)$</span> 由 Leibniz 法则在积分号下求导（条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|e^{\\langle\\theta,x\\rangle}p_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 邻域内一致成立，由假设保证）。二次势情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\tfrac12 x^\\top Ax$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-2V/g^2}=e^{-x^\\top Ax/g^2}$</span>，配方得高斯积分，协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{g^2}{2}A^{-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与命题 5 的关系</strong>：命题 5 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,p_\\infty=0$</span> 与二阶矩恒等式；本命题给出矩生成函数的显式形式，二者在二次势下一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-Ax$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,p_\\infty=-A\\mathbb{E}[x]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(a\\cdot x)(a\\cdot f)p_\\infty=-a^\\top A\\mathrm{Cov}(x)a=-\\tfrac{g^2}{2}\\|a\\|^2$</span>，与命题 5 的第二式一致。此一致性可作为数值验证的交叉检验（第 14 节代码可加入此检查）。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：矩生成函数的存在性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的增长至少为二次；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 增长更慢（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(x)=\\log(1+x^2)$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)$</span> 可能在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\ne0$</span> 处发散，此时只能用特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(\\theta)=\\int e^{i\\langle\\theta,x\\rangle}p_\\infty$</span>，其存在性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in L^1$</span> 保证，无需额外假设。这一区别在第 12 节自由能分析中影响 Legendre 变换的良定义性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-与-Liouville-方程的关系\">与 Liouville 方程的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-与-Liouville-方程的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)$</span> 为漂移场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 为扩散系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 为概率流。前序节已证 Fokker–Planck 方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(x)f(x,t))+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t(x)$$</div>\n<p>及其守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入 Liouville 算子与 Liouville 方程作为对照对象。设相空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>），坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=(x^1,\\dots,x^d)$</span>。给定向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x,t)=(b^1,\\dots,b^d)$</span>，定义<strong>Liouville 算子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_b$</span> 作用于光滑函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_b\\varphi(x,t)=\\sum_{i=1}^d b^i(x,t)\\,\\partial_i\\varphi(x,t)=b(x,t)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x,t).$$</div>\n<p>其伴随（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 内积下形式伴随）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_b^*\\varphi=-\\nabla\\cdot(b\\varphi)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_b^*\\varphi=-\\sum_i\\partial_i(b^i\\varphi)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（Liouville 方程）</strong>：称密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 满足以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 为生成场的 Liouville 方程，若</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t\\rho_t(x)+\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t(x)b(x,t))=0,$$</div>\n<p>等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t=-\\mathcal{L}_b^*\\rho_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t b)$</span>。</p>\n<p>与 Fokker–Planck 方程的区别在于：Liouville 方程不含二阶扩散项，其概率流为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{\\mathrm{L}}_t=\\rho_t b$</span>，是纯输运流；Fokker–Planck 方程的概率流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 含扩散修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span>。本节的核心任务是：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\to 0$</span> 的极限下，将 Fokker–Planck 方程与 Liouville 方程精确对接，并给出对接所需的假设与误差阶。</p>\n<p>本节假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f$</span> 有界；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t$</span> 可积；(A3) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\to0$</span> 极限中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的依赖满足下文引理所述的一致可微性；(A4) 边界通量条件在前序节意义下成立（全空间情形下自动满足，因紧支撑或衰减条件使通量为零）。以下命题逐条标注所用假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-1-零扩散极限-FP-方程退化为-Liouville-方程\">命题 1（零扩散极限：FP 方程退化为 Liouville 方程）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-1-零扩散极限-FP-方程退化为-Liouville-方程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g$</span> 为常数。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(g)}_t$</span> 为 FP 方程以初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C^2\\cap L^1$</span> 的解，并设对每个固定的测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\mapsto\\int\\varphi\\,p^{(g)}_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=0$</span> 处右连续。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(g)}_t$</span> 弱收敛于 Liouville 方程以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=f$</span>、初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span>，即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{g\\downarrow0}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi(x)\\,p^{(g)}_t(x)\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi(x)\\,\\rho_t(x)\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 FP 方程两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上积分，由 (A2) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑，分部积分合法（Leibniz 公式与 Fubini 定理，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\,\\partial_i(p f^i)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\,\\Delta p$</span> 均在紧集上连续且有界，故可交换积分与求导）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,p^{(g)}_t=\\int p^{(g)}_t\\,f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+\\frac{g^2}{2}\\int p^{(g)}_t\\,\\Delta\\varphi.$$</div>\n<p>右端第二项含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2$</span>，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，由 (A2) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(g)}_t\\in L^1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\varphi$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\int p^{(g)}_t\\Delta\\varphi|\\le\\|\\Delta\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\|p^{(g)}_t\\|_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2$</span> 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时趋于零。于是极限方程（在弱意义下）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,\\rho_t=\\int \\rho_t\\,f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi=-\\int\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t f),$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用分部积分并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑使边界项消失。这正是 Liouville 方程的弱形式。由 (A1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f$</span> 有界，该弱解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中唯一（特征线方法，见推论 1）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键点</strong>：扩散项在测试函数意义下以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g^2)$</span> 消失，而非以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g)$</span> 消失；这是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\varphi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2$</span> 相乘。若误将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 而把扩散项当作一阶修正，则与事实不符——扩散项是二阶修正。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-2-特征线与密度输运恒等式\">命题 2（特征线与密度输运恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-2-特征线与密度输运恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=f$</span> 满足全局 Lipschitz 且线性增长，保证流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 全局存在。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0\\in C^1\\cap L^1$</span> 非负。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：Liouville 方程的解由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x)=\\rho_0(\\Phi_{-t}(x))\\,\\exp\\!\\big(-\\int_0^t\\nabla\\cdot f(\\Phi_{-s}(x),s)\\,ds\\big)$</span> 给出，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 为 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=f(x,t)$</span> 的流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{-t}$</span> 为其逆流。等价地，沿特征线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(\\Phi_t(y))=\\rho_0(y)\\exp(-\\int_0^t\\nabla\\cdot f(\\Phi_s(y),s)ds)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：沿特征线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)=\\Phi_t(y)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x(t))$</span> 求全导数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\rho_t(x(t))=\\partial_t\\rho_t(x(t))+f(x(t),t)\\cdot\\nabla\\rho_t(x(t)).$$</div>\n<p>由 Liouville 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t f)=-\\rho_t\\nabla\\cdot f-f\\cdot\\nabla\\rho_t$</span>，代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\rho_t(x(t))=-\\rho_t(x(t))\\,\\nabla\\cdot f(x(t),t).$$</div>\n<p>解此一阶线性 ODE 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x(t))=\\rho_0(y)\\exp(-\\int_0^t\\nabla\\cdot f(x(s),s)ds)$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)=\\Phi_t(y)$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\Phi_{-t}(x)$</span> 代回即得所述公式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（可检验恒等式）</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span>（不可压流）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(\\Phi_t(y))=\\rho_0(y)$</span>，即密度沿流不变；此时 Liouville 方程与 FP 方程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=0$</span> 时均保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 质量且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 范数不增。验证：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\rho_t=\\int\\rho_t f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\rho_t=0$</span>，与公式一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-3-FP-与-Liouville-的算子分解\">命题 3（FP 与 Liouville 的算子分解）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-3-FP-与-Liouville-的算子分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：FP 方程可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\mathcal{L}_f^*p_t+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta p_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_f^*p=-\\nabla\\cdot(pf)$</span> 为 Liouville 算子的形式伴随，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 为 Laplace 算子（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上无坐标表述为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\sum_i\\partial_i^2$</span>）。因此 FP 生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}_{\\mathrm{FP}}=\\mathcal{L}_f^*+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta$</span> 是 Liouville 生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_f^*$</span> 的二阶扰动，扰动算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 上自伴且负半定（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\Delta\\varphi=-\\int|\\nabla\\varphi|^2\\le0$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直接由 FP 方程与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_f^*$</span> 的定义相加即得分解。自伴性与负半定性由分部积分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 的紧支撑给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\Delta\\varphi=-\\int|\\nabla\\varphi|^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>区别说明</strong>：Liouville 生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_f^*$</span> 是一阶算子，其解半群在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 上保质量但不保 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span>）；FP 生成元因含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta$</span>（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 前系数为正，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 本身负半定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 上正半定？需验算符号约定：FP 方程右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot(pf)+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta p$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 内积下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle p,\\Delta p\\rangle=-\\|\\nabla p\\|^2\\le0$</span>，故扩散项耗散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数。这与 Liouville 项可能增长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数形成对照。此处符号必须与前序节 canonical claim 一致，不得改写。）</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-4-具体例子-一维线性漂移下的对接\">命题 4（具体例子：一维线性漂移下的对接）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-4-具体例子-一维线性漂移下的对接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\lambda x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\delta_0$</span>（以磨光近似，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2\\cap L^1$</span> 非负密度，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：FP 方程的解为高斯密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(g)}_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_g(t)^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_g(t)^2=\\frac{g^2}{2\\lambda}(1-e^{-2\\lambda t})$</span>；Liouville 方程（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=0$</span>）的解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x)=e^{\\lambda t}p_0(e^{\\lambda t}x)$</span>，即初值沿流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(y)=ye^{-\\lambda t}$</span> 输运并因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=-\\lambda$</span> 而密度放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\lambda t}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(g)}_t$</span> 弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>验证</strong>：直接代入 FP 方程：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p^{(g)}_t=\\frac{g^2}{2\\lambda}(2\\lambda e^{-2\\lambda t})\\cdot(\\text{高斯导数因子})$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot(pf)+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta p$</span> 逐项比对成立（标准高斯计算，此处省略逐项展开但关键等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_g(t)^2$</span> 的 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma^2=-2\\lambda\\sigma^2+g^2$</span> 必须写出：由 FP 方程对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^2$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}[X_t^2]=-2\\lambda\\mathbb{E}[X_t^2]+g^2$</span>，解之即得）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_g(t)^2\\to0$</span>，高斯弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 的磨光极限，与命题 1 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-5-扩散作为-Liouville-的奇异扰动-误差阶\">命题 5（扩散作为 Liouville 的奇异扰动：误差阶）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-5-扩散作为-Liouville-的奇异扰动-误差阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 光滑且有界导数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 与固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\int\\varphi\\,p^{(g)}_t-\\int\\varphi\\,\\rho_t\\right|\\le C(\\varphi,t)\\,g^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\varphi,t)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Delta\\varphi\\|_\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_0\\|_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{s\\le t}\\|\\nabla\\cdot f(\\cdot,s)\\|_\\infty$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：由命题 1 的弱形式方程，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_g(t)=\\int\\varphi(p^{(g)}_t-\\rho_t)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}D_g(t)=\\int(p^{(g)}_t-\\rho_t)f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+\\frac{g^2}{2}\\int p^{(g)}_t\\Delta\\varphi.$$</div>\n<p>第一项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_g$</span> 的线性泛函，第二项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2\\|\\Delta\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\|p^{(g)}_t\\|_1$</span> 控制。由 (A2) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(g)}_t$</span> 保 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 质量（前序节已证 FP 保质量），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p^{(g)}_t\\|_1=\\|p_0\\|_1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_g$</span> 的 ODE 用 Grönwall 不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}|D_g|\\le L|D_g|+\\frac{g^2}{2}\\|\\Delta\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\|p_0\\|_1$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\sup\\|\\nabla\\cdot f\\|_\\infty\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty$</span>（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 有界，紧支撑保证）。解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|D_g(t)|\\le\\frac{g^2}{2L}\\|\\Delta\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\|p_0\\|_1(e^{Lt}-1)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：此误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g^2)$</span> 是弱意义下的；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 强意义下误差可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g)$</span>（由扩散半群的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收缩性），本节不展开强收敛，因前序节弱解框架已足够。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-6-平稳情形下的对接与不可压条件\">命题 6（平稳情形下的对接与不可压条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-6-平稳情形下的对接与不可压条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数，平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 存在且唯一（前序节已给条件）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：Liouville 方程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span> 时的平稳分布为均匀分布（在紧流形上）或 Lebesgue 测度（在全空间，若可积）；FP 方程的平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty f-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_\\infty$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 弱收敛于 Liouville 平稳分布。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为梯度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\nabla U$</span>，则 Liouville 方程无平稳概率分布（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 常数），而 FP 方程有 Gibbs 平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\propto e^{-2U/g^2}$</span>，此即扩散“正则化”了无平稳态的 Liouville 动力学。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span> 时 Liouville 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho f)=-f\\cdot\\nabla\\rho$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\equiv$</span> 常数（在紧流形上归一化）为平稳解。FP 平稳方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_\\infty f)=\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta p_\\infty$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时由命题 1 的弱收敛得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\to$</span> 常数。梯度场情形：Liouville 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho=\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho\\nabla U)$</span> 无概率平稳解，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho\\,dx$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla U$</span> 有界时被输运至无穷（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>  coercive）；FP 平稳解由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_\\infty\\nabla U)+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta p_\\infty=0$</span> 解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\propto e^{-2U/g^2}$</span>，代入验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_\\infty=-\\tfrac{2}{g^2}p_\\infty\\nabla U$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty(-\\nabla U)-\\tfrac12g^2(-\\tfrac{2}{g^2}p_\\infty\\nabla U)=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-7-守恒量沿-Liouville-流的输运恒等式\">命题 7（守恒量沿 Liouville 流的输运恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-7-守恒量沿-Liouville-流的输运恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足全局 Lipschitz 且线性增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 为其全局流；设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 为 Liouville 方程的解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0\\in C^1\\cap L^1$</span> 非负。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla H=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 沿流为首次积分）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d} H(x)\\,\\rho_t(x)\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d} H(x)\\,\\rho_0(x)\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>即 Liouville 方程保持所有沿流不变量的期望。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 Liouville 方程两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 并积分，由 (A1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 的可积性，分部积分合法（<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\rho_t f$</span> 在无穷远处衰减，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\in L^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 至多多项式增长时需额外假设；此处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 有界以保证边界项消失）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int H\\rho_t=-\\int H\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t f)=\\int \\rho_t\\,f\\cdot\\nabla H=0.$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla H=0$</span>。故积分不随时间变化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与 FP 的对照</strong>：FP 方程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span> 时<strong>不</strong>保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的期望，因为扩散项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\int H\\Delta\\rho_t=\\tfrac12g^2\\int\\rho_t\\Delta H$</span>，一般非零。这给出一个可检验的判别式：若某观测量的期望在 FP 演化下漂移，则其漂移率的一阶项恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta H]$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 光滑有界时由两次分部积分得到）。此恒等式是区分“纯输运”与“输运加扩散”的定量判据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-8-FP-方程作为-Liouville-方程在扩相空间中的投影\">命题 8（FP 方程作为 Liouville 方程在扩相空间中的投影）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-8-FP-方程作为-Liouville-方程在扩相空间中的投影\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数。考虑扩相空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{2d}$</span>，坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,v)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为辅助速度变量。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：定义扩相空间上的 Liouville 向量场</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$B(x,v,t)=\\big(f(x,t),\\;-\\tfrac12g^2\\,\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>并设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varrho_t(x,v)=p_t(x)\\,\\delta\\big(v-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\big)$</span>（Dirac 测度意义下）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varrho_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,v)$</span> 上满足 Liouville 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\varrho_t+\\nabla_{(x,v)}\\cdot(\\varrho_t B)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 FP 方程。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varrho_t$</span> 的 Liouville 方程对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 积分（即取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的边缘），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla_x\\cdot\\!\\Big(p_t\\,f-\\tfrac12g^2 p_t\\nabla\\log p_t\\Big)=0.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\nabla\\log p_t=\\nabla p_t$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 处），故边缘方程即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t)=0$</span>，正是 FP 方程的守恒形式。反向：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 FP，则上述边缘方程成立，配合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varrho_t$</span> 的构造即得扩相空间 Liouville 方程。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>区别说明</strong>：此命题说明 FP 方程可视为“在速度变量被约束到得分函数上的扩相空间 Liouville 方程”。但必须强调：<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的第二分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 本身，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 不是外给定的向量场，而是<strong>自洽场</strong>；这与标准 Liouville 方程中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 外给定有本质区别。因此命题 8 是形式恒等式而非“FP 是某固定 Liouville 方程的特例”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-9-得分函数与-Liouville-速度的不可混同\">命题 9（得分函数与 Liouville 速度的不可混同）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-9-得分函数与-Liouville-速度的不可混同\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：概率流 ODE 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)=f(x,t)-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span> 与反向 SDE 的漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)-g^2\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span> 一般不等，二者相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 满足连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=0$</span>，而反向 SDE 的漂移不满足此连续性方程（其对应的是时间反演的 FP 方程）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t=p_t(f-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t)=p_tv_t$</span>，守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=0$</span>。反向 SDE 漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-g^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，其概率流为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(f-g^2\\nabla\\log p_t)=p_tf-g^2\\nabla p_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span>，故不满足同一连续性方程。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>意义</strong>：此命题划清了本节与后续“与概率流 ODE 的接口”节的边界：Liouville 对接用的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的输运部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tf$</span>，扩散修正 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时消失；而概率流 ODE 用的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span>，它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span> 时含得分项，不能与 Liouville 速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 混同。若误将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 当作 Liouville 速度代入命题 2 的特征线公式，会得到错误的密度缩放因子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-10-时间反演下的-Liouville-对接\">命题 10（时间反演下的 Liouville 对接）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-10-时间反演下的-Liouville-对接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 FP 解且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，定义反演时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=T-t$</span> 与反演密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau(x)=p_{T-\\tau}(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau$</span> 满足以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde f(x,\\tau)=-f(x,T-\\tau)+g^2\\nabla\\log p_{T-\\tau}(x)$</span> 为漂移、扩散系数仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的 FP 方程。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde f\\to-f$</span>，即反向 Liouville 方程以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-f$</span> 为生成场，其流为原流的逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{-\\tau}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 FP 方程作时间替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T-\\tau$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\partial_\\tau\\tilde p_\\tau=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\tilde p_\\tau f)+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta\\tilde p_\\tau$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau\\tilde p_\\tau=\\nabla\\cdot(\\tilde p_\\tau f)-\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta\\tilde p_\\tau$</span>。将右端改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot(\\tilde p_\\tau\\tilde f)+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta\\tilde p_\\tau$</span> 的形式，比对得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde f=-f+g^2\\nabla\\log\\tilde p_\\tau$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau&gt;0$</span> 处）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde f\\to-f$</span>，由命题 2 的特征线公式，反向 Liouville 方程的解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\rho_\\tau(x)=\\rho_T(\\Phi_{-\\tau}(x))\\exp(\\int_0^\\tau\\nabla\\cdot f(\\Phi_{-s}(x))ds)$</span>，与原流互逆。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：反演漂移中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2\\nabla\\log p$</span> 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时消失，故反向 Liouville 方程不含得分修正；这与反向 SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-g^2\\nabla\\log p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>（而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-f$</span>）形成对照——反向 SDE 的时间反演与 Liouville 的时间反演是两种不同的操作，前者反转随机性，后者反转确定性流。此区别在后续“与概率流 ODE 的接口”节将再次出现，本节只作界定，不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-11-Liouville-方程的质量守恒与-FP-质量守恒的等价性判据\">命题 11（Liouville 方程的质量守恒与 FP 质量守恒的等价性判据）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-11-Liouville-方程的质量守恒与-FP-质量守恒的等价性判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 使 FP 方程在全空间有唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 解，边界通量条件在前序节意义下成立（全空间衰减使通量为零）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int p_t=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)=\\tfrac12g^2\\int\\Delta p_t$</span>；后者在全空间由分部积分自动成立（两边均为零），故 FP 保质量。Liouville 方程保质量当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_tf)=0$</span>，在全空间由衰减自动成立；在带边界区域上则要求边界通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t f\\cdot n=0$</span>（前序节边界通量条件）。因此“Liouville 保质量”与“FP 保质量”在全空间均自动，但在有界区域上二者要求相同的边界通量消失条件，扩散项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t\\cdot n$</span> 也须为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int p_t=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot n$</span>。全空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 衰减时边界项为零。有界区域上需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot n=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tf\\cdot n-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t\\cdot n=0$</span>；Liouville 情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=0$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_tf\\cdot n=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>意义</strong>：此命题把本节与前序节“边界通量条件”及后续“反例：边界通量非零导致质量不守恒”节衔接起来：Liouville 对接不改变边界条件的结构，扩散项只是在边界通量中多加一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t\\cdot n$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时该项消失，边界条件连续退化为 Liouville 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_tf\\cdot n=0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-12-一维闭式对照-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-与-Liouville-的显式对接\">命题 12（一维闭式对照：Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 与 Liouville 的显式对接）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-12-一维闭式对照-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-与-Liouville-的显式对接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\lambda x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：FP 解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(g)}_t=\\mathcal{N}(m_t,\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\sigma_0^2e^{-2\\lambda t}+\\frac{g^2}{2\\lambda}(1-e^{-2\\lambda t})$</span>；Liouville 解（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=0$</span>）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x)=e^{\\lambda t}p_0(e^{\\lambda t}x)=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_0^2e^{-2\\lambda t})$</span>。二者方差之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{g^2}{2\\lambda}(1-e^{-2\\lambda t})$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时趋于零，且对任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\int\\varphi(p^{(g)}_t-\\rho_t)|\\le\\|\\varphi''\\|_\\infty\\cdot\\frac{g^2}{4\\lambda}(1-e^{-2\\lambda t})$</span>，与命题 5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g^2)$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：方差 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma^2=-2\\lambda\\sigma^2+g^2$</span> 的解如上；Liouville 解由命题 2 的特征线公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x)=e^{\\lambda t}p_0(e^{\\lambda t}x)$</span> 给出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=-\\lambda$</span>，缩放因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\lambda t}$</span>）。误差估计用二阶 Taylor 展开：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2)}[\\varphi]-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma'^2)}[\\varphi]|\\le\\tfrac12\\|\\varphi''\\|_\\infty|\\sigma^2-\\sigma'^2|$</span>（由高斯分布的二阶矩比较与 Taylor 余项）。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2-\\sigma'^2=\\frac{g^2}{2\\lambda}(1-e^{-2\\lambda t})$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>对照要点</strong>：此例中 Liouville 解的方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 指数收缩（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\lambda x$</span> 汇聚），而 FP 解的方差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{g^2}{2\\lambda}$</span>（平稳方差），即扩散阻止了方差收缩到零。这正是命题 6 中“扩散正则化 Liouville 动力学”的一维显式体现：Liouville 动力学把质量压缩到原点（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0$</span> 极限），FP 动力学则给出非退化平稳分布。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-13-Liouville-对接的算子半群表述\">命题 13（Liouville 对接的算子半群表述）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-13-Liouville-对接的算子半群表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 使 FP 生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}_{\\mathrm{FP}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 上生成强连续半群 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{t\\mathcal{A}_{\\mathrm{FP}}}$</span>，Liouville 生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_f^*$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 上生成强连续半群 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{t\\mathcal{L}_f^*}$</span>（由 (A1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f$</span> 有界与特征线方法保证）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|e^{t\\mathcal{A}_{\\mathrm{FP}}}p_0-e^{t\\mathcal{L}_f^*}p_0\\big\\|_1\\le g^2\\int_0^t\\big\\|e^{(t-s)\\mathcal{L}_f^*}\\Delta e^{s\\mathcal{A}_{\\mathrm{FP}}}p_0\\big\\|_1\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p>此即 Duhamel 公式给出的两半群之差的一阶估计；右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g^2)$</span> 消失（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta e^{s\\mathcal{A}_{\\mathrm{FP}}}p_0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 范数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[0,t]$</span> 一致有界时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 3 的分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}_{\\mathrm{FP}}=\\mathcal{L}_f^*+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta$</span>，两半群之差满足 Duhamel 积分方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e^{t\\mathcal{A}_{\\mathrm{FP}}}p_0-e^{t\\mathcal{L}_f^*}p_0=\\frac{g^2}{2}\\int_0^t e^{(t-s)\\mathcal{L}_f^*}\\Delta\\, e^{s\\mathcal{A}_{\\mathrm{FP}}}p_0\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 范数并用三角不等式即得所述估计。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>意义</strong>：此命题把命题 1 的弱收敛提升为半群层面的定量比较，并明确误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g^2)$</span> 的来源是 Duhamel 公式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 前的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2$</span>。它同时说明：Liouville 半群 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{t\\mathcal{L}_f^*}$</span> 是 FP 半群 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{t\\mathcal{A}_{\\mathrm{FP}}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时的零阶近似，而一阶近似需要解 Duhamel 积分方程，本节不展开（属后续数值格式节的摄动分析范畴）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Liouville 方程是 FP 方程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时的退化极限：在测试函数意义下扩散项以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g^2)$</span> 消失（命题 1、命题 5），FP 生成元可精确分解为 Liouville 生成元加二阶扩散扰动（命题 3）。</li>\n<li>Liouville 方程的解由特征线输运公式给出，密度沿流按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\int\\nabla\\cdot f)$</span> 缩放（命题 2）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span> 时密度沿流不变，此即不可压条件与 FP 平稳分布对接的桥梁（命题 6）。</li>\n<li>扩散不是 Liouville 动力学的一阶修正，而是奇异扰动：它使无平稳概率分布的梯度流获得 Gibbs 平稳分布，并在弱意义下以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g^2)$</span> 误差逼近 Liouville 解；此误差阶的推导依赖 Grönwall 不等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 质量守恒（命题 5），不可误写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g)$</span>。</li>\n<li>Liouville 方程保持沿流不变量的期望（命题 7），而 FP 方程因扩散项产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta H]$</span> 的漂移；此恒等式是区分纯输运与输运加扩散的定量判据。</li>\n<li>FP 方程可形式地视为扩相空间上以自洽场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=(f,-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t)$</span> 为生成场的 Liouville 方程的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>-边缘（命题 8），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 本身，故这只是形式恒等式而非“FP 是固定 Liouville 方程的特例”；概率流 ODE 速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与反向 SDE 漂移不可混同（命题 9），时间反演下的 Liouville 对接以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-f$</span> 为生成场（命题 10）。</li>\n<li>半群层面，Liouville 半群是 FP 半群在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\downarrow0$</span> 时的零阶近似，Duhamel 公式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(g^2)$</span> 的定量误差（命题 13）；一维 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 例显式验证了方差差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{g^2}{2\\lambda}(1-e^{-2\\lambda t})$</span> 与误差界（命题 12），并展示扩散如何阻止 Liouville 动力学的方差收缩至零（命题 6 的显式体现）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-密度演化的数值格式\">密度演化的数值格式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-密度演化的数值格式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已确立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为非负概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为扩散系数（非负），<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_t f-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 为概率流。Fokker–Planck 方程为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(x)f(x,t))+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t(x).$$</div>\n<p>本节引入以下新符号，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>网格：对空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 取有界盒 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\prod_{i=1}^d[a_i,b_i]$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 方向取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i+1$</span> 个节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i^{(j)}=a_i+j h_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0,\\dots,N_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i=(b_i-a_i)/N_i$</span>。记节点多重指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}=(j_1,\\dots,j_d)$</span>，节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}}$</span>，单元体积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|=\\prod_i h_i$</span>（内部单元），边界半单元体积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\prod_i h_i$</span>（角单元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac1{2^d}\\prod_i h_i$</span>）。</li>\n<li>离散密度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta t$</span> 时刻在单元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}$</span> 上的平均密度近似，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P^n\\in\\mathbb{R}^{(N_1+1)\\times\\cdots\\times(N_d+1)}$</span>。</li>\n<li>数值通量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}^n$</span> 表示第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 方向单元界面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}$</span> 处的概率流分量近似，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个坐标单位向量。</li>\n<li>离散质量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^n=\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n$</span>。</li>\n<li>离散算子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}_i^+$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 方向前向差分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}_i^-$</span> 为后向差分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}_i^0=\\tfrac12(\\mathcal{D}_i^++\\mathcal{D}_i^-)$</span> 为中心差分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 (H1)</strong>（正则性）<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f$</span> 有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C([0,T])$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le g(t)\\le g_{\\max}&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (H2)</strong>（盒边界通量消失）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 为外法向。此假设在本节数值格式中通过边界通量置零实现，与第 5 节边界通量条件一致。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (H3)</strong>（时间步长约束）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le \\min_i h_i^2/(2d\\,g_{\\max}^2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le \\min_i h_i/\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span>，保证显式格式的单调性与稳定性。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把连续 FP 方程转化为可计算的离散格式，并证明该格式在 (H1)–(H3) 下保持质量守恒与正性，且与连续方程相容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-1-守恒型有限体积格式的构造\">1. 守恒型有限体积格式的构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-1-守恒型有限体积格式的构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>连续方程已写成守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>（第 2 节）。对单元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}$</span> 积分并用散度定理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}}p_t\\,dx=-\\sum_{i=1}^d\\Big(F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}-F_{i,\\mathbf{j}-e_i/2}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{i,\\mathbf{j}\\pm e_i/2}=\\int_{\\partial\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}\\cap\\{x_i=\\text{const}\\}}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS$</span> 为界面通量。用单元平均密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathbf{j}}$</span> 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\int_{\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}}p_t\\,dx$</span>，并对界面通量取数值近似，得到半离散格式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dP_{\\mathbf{j}}}{dt}=-\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_{i=1}^d\\Big(\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}-\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}-e_i/2}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>数值通量取中心型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}=\\frac{P_{\\mathbf{j}}+P_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}}{2}\\,f_i(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2},t)-\\frac{g(t)^2}{2}\\frac{P_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}-P_{\\mathbf{j}}}{h_i}.$$</div>\n<p>第一项为漂移通量的算术平均，第二项为扩散通量的中心差分。时间离散取显式 Euler：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_{\\mathbf{j}}^{n+1}=P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n-\\frac{\\Delta t}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_{i=1}^d\\Big(\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}^n-\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}-e_i/2}^n\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>边界处理：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}-e_i$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}+e_i$</span> 越出盒边界时，对应数值通量置零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}-e_i/2}=0$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}=0$</span>（若第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i$</span>）。这正是 (H2) 的离散实现。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（质量守恒）</strong> 在 (H2) 的离散边界条件下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{n+1}=M^n$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对格式两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|$</span> 并对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}$</span> 求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M^{n+1}-M^n=-\\Delta t\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}\\sum_{i=1}^d\\Big(\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}^n-\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}-e_i/2}^n\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，内层求和是 telescoping 求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j_i=0}^{N_i}\\Big(\\hat F_{i,\\cdot,j_i+1/2}-\\hat F_{i,\\cdot,j_i-1/2}\\Big)=\\hat F_{i,\\cdot,N_i+1/2}-\\hat F_{i,\\cdot,-1/2}.$$</div>\n<p>由边界条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat F_{i,\\cdot,N_i+1/2}=\\hat F_{i,\\cdot,-1/2}=0$</span>，故每个方向的求和为零，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{n+1}=M^n$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 该证明只用到 telescoping 与边界通量置零，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的具体形式，也不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 的大小。质量守恒是格式的结构性质，与稳定性无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-2-正性与单调性\">2. 正性与单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-2-正性与单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（正性保持）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n\\ge0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathbf{j}}^{n+1}\\ge0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将格式改写为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n$</span> 的线性组合。对内部单元，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{i,\\pm}=f_i(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}\\pm e_i/2},t_n)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=\\tfrac12 g(t_n)^2$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_{\\mathbf{j}}^{n+1}=P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n\\Big(1-\\frac{\\Delta t}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_{i=1}^d\\frac{f_{i,+}-f_{i,-}}{2}\\Big)\n+\\frac{\\Delta t}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_{i=1}^d\\Big[\\Big(\\frac{c}{h_i}-\\frac{f_{i,+}}{2}\\Big)P_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}^n+\\Big(\\frac{c}{h_i}+\\frac{f_{i,-}}{2}\\Big)P_{\\mathbf{j}-e_i}^n\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>系数非负性：(i) 扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c}{h_i}\\pm\\frac{f_{i,\\pm}}{2}\\ge0$</span> 由 (H3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h_i/\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span> 保证（实际只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c/h_i\\ge|f_{i,\\pm}|/2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2/h_i\\ge\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span>，由 (H3) 第一式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 时给出；多维时需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 更小，见 (H3) 第二式）；(ii) 中心系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\frac{\\Delta t}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_i\\frac{f_{i,+}-f_{i,-}}{2}\\ge1-\\Delta t\\sum_i\\|f\\|_\\infty/h_i\\ge0$</span> 由 (H3) 第二式保证。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathbf{j}}^{n+1}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^n$</span> 各分量的非负线性组合，非负性保持。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 压缩）</strong> 在命题 2 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P^{n+1}\\|_{L^1}=\\|P^n\\|_{L^1}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{n+1}=M^n$</span> 且非负），故格式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 等距的。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1 与命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{n+1}=M^n$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^{n+1}\\ge0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P^{n+1}\\|_{L^1}=\\sum|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|P_{\\mathbf{j}}^{n+1}=M^{n+1}=M^n=\\|P^n\\|_{L^1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-3-相容性与截断误差\">3. 相容性与截断误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-3-相容性与截断误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（相容性）</strong> 设 (H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^4(\\overline\\Omega\\times[0,T])$</span> 为 FP 方程的经典解。则半离散格式的截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sum_i h_i^2)$</span>，时间显式 Euler 的截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}})$</span> 代入半离散右端。对漂移项，界面通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathbf{j}},P_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}}),p_t(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i})$</span> 替换，算术平均给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2})+O(h_i^2)$</span>（Taylor 展开中点值）；扩散项的中心差分给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{x_i}p_t(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2})+O(h_i^2)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_i\\Big(\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}-\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}-e_i/2}\\Big)\n=\\sum_i\\partial_{x_i}\\Big(p_t f_i-\\tfrac12 g^2\\partial_{x_i}p_t\\Big)(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}})+O\\Big(\\sum_i h_i^2\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>即半离散格式以二阶精度逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span>。时间方向显式 Euler 的截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{\\Delta t}{2}\\partial_{tt}p_t+O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>。合并得总截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t+\\sum_i h_i^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 相容性只保证格式逼近连续方程，不保证收敛；收敛还需稳定性。命题 2 的正性保持与命题 1 的质量守恒共同给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 的一致界，配合 Lax–Richtmyer 等价定理（线性格式）可得收敛性；本节不展开该定理的完整陈述，只指出稳定性由 (H3) 保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-4-一个可检验的恒等式-离散质量通量\">4. 一个可检验的恒等式：离散质量通量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-4-一个可检验的恒等式-离散质量通量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（离散质量通量恒等式）</strong> 定义离散总通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}^n=\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}\\sum_i|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}^n$</span>（对全部界面求和，含边界）。则在 (H2) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}^n=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{n+1}=M^n-\\Delta t\\,\\mathcal{F}^n$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1 的 telescoping 求和，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|(\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}-\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}-e_i/2})=\\hat F_{i,\\cdot,N_i+1/2}-\\hat F_{i,\\cdot,-1/2}=0$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}^n$</span> 正是把每个界面的通量计一次（每个内部界面被相邻两单元各计一次，但符号相反，求和后抵消；边界界面只计一次且为零）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}^n=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{n+1}=M^n$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式给出数值诊断：在代码中计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}^n$</span> 应恒为零（机器精度内），可作为质量守恒的实现检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-5-与连续弱解的接口\">5. 与连续弱解的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-5-与连续弱解的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（离散格式的弱形式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}}=\\varphi(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}})$</span>。则格式等价于</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\frac{P_{\\mathbf{j}}^{n+1}-P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n}{\\Delta t}\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}}\n=-\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}\\sum_i|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}^n\\frac{\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}-\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}}}{h_i}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对格式两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}}$</span> 求和，对通量项做离散分部积分（Abel 变换）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|(\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}-\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}-e_i/2})\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}}=\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}(\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}}-\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i})$</span>，边界项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 内部而消失。整理即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该弱形式与第 4 节弱解定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p_t=\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot J_t$</span> 的离散对应：左端为时间差分的测试，右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 的离散近似与数值通量的配对。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i,\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 且格式稳定时，离散弱形式收敛到连续弱形式，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^n$</span> 弱收敛到 FP 方程的弱解。完整收敛性证明需紧性论证（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中的 Rellich 定理），本节只给出弱形式的代数恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-6-代码-一维显式格式与质量守恒验证\">6. 代码：一维显式格式与质量守恒验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-6-代码-一维显式格式与质量守恒验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码实现一维 (<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>) 格式，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\alpha x$</span>（线性漂移），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=g_0$</span> 常数，盒 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=[-L,L]$</span>，边界通量置零。初值为高斯密度。运行后打印质量序列与形状，并用 <code>assert</code> 检验质量守恒与正性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef fp_1d(N, L, T, dt, alpha, g0):\n    # 网格\n    h = 2*L/N\n    x = np.linspace(-L, L, N+1)          # 节点\n    xc = 0.5*(x[:-1]+x[1:])              # 单元中心\n    dx = h\n    # 初值：高斯密度在单元上的平均（用中心值近似积分平均）\n    sigma0 = 0.5\n    P = np.exp(-xc**2/(2*sigma0**2))/np.sqrt(2*np.pi*sigma0**2)\n    P = P/P.sum()/dx                     # 归一化为概率密度（离散质量=1）\n    M0 = P.sum()*dx\n    assert abs(M0-1.0) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;初值质量不为1&quot;\n    nsteps = int(T/dt)\n    masses = [M0]\n    for n in range(nsteps):\n        # 界面通量：内部界面 i+1/2, i=0..N-1\n        # 漂移 f=-alpha*x 在界面处取值\n        xf = x  # 界面即节点 x[1..N-1] 为内部界面；边界 x[0], x[N] 通量置零\n        # 构造长度 N+1 的界面通量数组 Fhalf，Fhalf[i] 为 x[i] 处界面通量\n        Fhalf = np.zeros(N+1)\n        # 内部界面 i=1..N-1\n        for i in range(1, N):\n            # 左右单元为 i-1 和 i\n            fL = -alpha*x[i]\n            # 算术平均漂移通量 + 中心扩散\n            Fhalf[i] = 0.5*(P[i-1]+P[i])*fL - 0.5*g0**2*(P[i]-P[i-1])/dx\n        # 边界通量置零：Fhalf[0]=Fhalf[N]=0\n        # 更新\n        Pnew = P - dt/dx*(Fhalf[1:]-Fhalf[:-1])\n        # 正性检验\n        assert np.all(Pnew &gt;= -1e-14), &quot;出现负密度&quot;\n        P = Pnew\n        masses.append(P.sum()*dx)\n    return x, xc, P, np.array(masses)\n\nx, xc, P, masses = fp_1d(N=200, L=5.0, T=0.5, dt=1e-4, alpha=1.0, g0=0.5)\nprint(&quot;shape of P:&quot;, P.shape)\nprint(&quot;mass at t=0:&quot;, masses[0])\nprint(&quot;mass at t=T:&quot;, masses[-1])\nprint(&quot;max deviation of mass:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(masses-1.0)))\nassert np.max(np.abs(masses-1.0)) &lt; 1e-10, &quot;质量不守恒&quot;\nassert np.all(P &gt;= 0), &quot;密度出现负值&quot;\nprint(&quot;质量守恒与正性检验通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape of P: (200,)</code>，<code>mass at t=0: 1.0</code>，<code>mass at t=T: 1.0</code>，<code>max deviation of mass</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-14}$</span> 量级，断言通过。该代码对应命题 1 与命题 2 的数值验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-7-稳定性与离散极值原理\">7. 稳定性与离散极值原理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-7-稳定性与离散极值原理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 只给出正性保持，未给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 界。本节补足稳定性论证，使格式的收敛性链条完整。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（离散极值原理）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H3) 成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\min_{\\mathbf{j}}P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n\\le P_{\\mathbf{j}}^{n+1}\\le\\max_{\\mathbf{j}}P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n,\\qquad \\forall\\mathbf{j}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2 证明中的线性组合表达式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathbf{j}}^{n+1}=\\sum_{\\mathbf{k}}a_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{k}}P_{\\mathbf{k}}^n$</span>，其中系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{k}}\\ge0$</span>。对系数求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{\\mathbf{k}}a_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{k}}=1-\\frac{\\Delta t}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_i\\frac{f_{i,+}-f_{i,-}}{2}+\\frac{\\Delta t}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_i\\Big[\\Big(\\frac{c}{h_i}-\\frac{f_{i,+}}{2}\\Big)+\\Big(\\frac{c}{h_i}+\\frac{f_{i,-}}{2}\\Big)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>逐项化简：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\frac{f_{i,+}-f_{i,-}}{2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\big[-\\frac{f_{i,+}}{2}+\\frac{f_{i,-}}{2}\\big]$</span> 相消，扩散部分给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\frac{2c}{h_i}=\\sum_i\\frac{g^2}{h_i}$</span>。但注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|=\\prod_i h_i$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\sum_i g^2/h_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|$</span> 的量纲匹配需逐方向核对：在一维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|=h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\,g^2/h\\le\\Delta t\\,g^2/h$</span>，由 (H3) 第一式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h^2/(2g_{\\max}^2)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\,g^2/h\\le h/2$</span>，并不直接给出和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。重新计算：在一维，系数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$a_{j,j}=1-\\frac{\\Delta t}{h}\\frac{f_+-f_-}{2},\\quad a_{j,j+1}=\\frac{\\Delta t}{h}\\Big(\\frac{c}{h}-\\frac{f_+}{2}\\Big),\\quad a_{j,j-1}=\\frac{\\Delta t}{h}\\Big(\\frac{c}{h}+\\frac{f_-}{2}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>求和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\frac{\\Delta t}{h}\\frac{f_+-f_-}{2}+\\frac{\\Delta t}{h}\\frac{2c}{h}+\\frac{\\Delta t}{h}\\frac{f_- - f_+}{2}=1+\\frac{2c\\Delta t}{h^2}$</span>。这不为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，说明上述改写并非概率转移形式，而是带源的形式。正确做法是把扩散项写成通量差，重新整理。</p>\n<p>直接对格式做极值论证：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}^*$</span> 取最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\max}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}^*$</span> 为内部单元，则格式右端</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_{\\mathbf{j}^*}^{n+1}=P_{\\mathbf{j}^*}^n-\\frac{\\Delta t}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}^*}|}\\sum_i\\Big(\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}^*+e_i/2}-\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}^*-e_i/2}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathbf{j}^*}\\ge P_{\\mathbf{j}^*\\pm e_i}$</span> 及 (H3) 的系数非负性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}^*+e_i/2}\\ge0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{i,+}\\ge0$</span> 时（漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge0$</span>，扩散项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c}{h_i}(P_{\\mathbf{j}^*}-P_{\\mathbf{j}^*+e_i})\\ge0$</span>）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{i,+}&lt;0$</span> 时漂移项为负，扩散项非负，符号不定。故不能逐界面判断通量符号。</p>\n<p>改用算子分裂视角：把格式写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^{n+1}=(\\mathcal{I}+\\Delta t\\,\\mathcal{L}_h)P^n$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_h$</span> 为半离散算子。稳定性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathcal{I}+\\Delta t\\,\\mathcal{L}_h\\|_\\infty\\le1$</span>。由 Gershgorin 圆盘定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_h$</span> 的特征值落在以对角元为中心、半径为非对角元绝对值之和的圆盘内。对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$= -\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_i\\frac{f_{i,+}-f_{i,-}}{2}$</span>，非对角元绝对值之和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_i\\big(\\frac{c}{h_i}+\\frac{|f_{i,\\pm}|}{2}\\big)$</span>。要保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}+\\Delta t\\mathcal{L}_h$</span> 的谱半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\cdot(\\text{对角元绝对值}+\\text{非对角元和})\\le2$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta t\\cdot\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_i\\Big(\\frac{g^2}{h_i}+\\|f\\|_\\infty\\Big)\\le2.$$</div>\n<p>在一维，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|=h$</span>，条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t(g^2/h+\\|f\\|_\\infty)\\le2h$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le 2h^2/(g^2+h\\|f\\|_\\infty)$</span>。这与 (H3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h^2/(2g_{\\max}^2)$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h/\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span> 合并后更弱，故 (H3) 蕴含谱半径条件。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathcal{I}+\\Delta t\\mathcal{L}_h\\|_\\infty\\le1$</span> 在谱意义下成立，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_\\infty$</span> 范数本身未必 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1$</span>（因非对角元符号不定）。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 严格极值原理需通量单调性（即数值通量对左、右状态单调不减），中心型通量不满足该性质。因此命题 7 不能对中心格式成立；中心格式只保证正性（命题 2）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 守恒，不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 不增。这一点必须显式说明，不能以“适当条件下”含混带过。若需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 稳定性，应改用迎风型通量（漂移项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 符号取单侧），此时单调性成立，极值原理可证。本节采用中心通量是为与第 2 节概率流的中心差分形式一致，代价是放弃 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-8-时间步长的显式界与-CFL-条件\">8. 时间步长的显式界与 CFL 条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-8-时间步长的显式界与-CFL-条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(H3) 给出两个约束。第一个来自扩散：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le\\min_i h_i^2/(2d\\,g_{\\max}^2)$</span>。推导：扩散算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta$</span> 的离散拉普拉斯在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维的谱半径为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2\\sum_i\\frac{4}{h_i^2}=2g^2\\sum_i h_i^{-2}$</span>，显式 Euler 稳定需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\cdot2g^2\\sum_i h_i^{-2}\\le2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le\\big(g^2\\sum_i h_i^{-2}\\big)^{-1}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i=h$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h^2/(2d\\,g^2)$</span>，与 (H3) 一致。</p>\n<p>第二个来自漂移：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le\\min_i h_i/\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span>。推导：漂移算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot(pf)$</span> 的离散对流部分 CFL 条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\max_i\\frac{\\|f_i\\|_\\infty}{h_i}\\le1$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 各分量界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span> 时即得。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（(H3) 的充分性）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 同时满足上述两式，则命题 2 证明中的全部系数非负。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 逐项核对命题 2 的系数。扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c}{h_i}-\\frac{f_{i,+}}{2}\\ge0$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2/h_i\\ge f_{i,+}$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h_i/\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h_i^2/(2g_{\\max}^2)$</span> 联立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2/h_i\\ge g^2\\cdot\\Delta t/(2g_{\\max}^2)\\cdot\\ldots$</span> 直接验证：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h_i^2/(2g_{\\max}^2)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2/h_i\\le g_{\\max}^2/h_i$</span>，不直接给出下界。正确推导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c}{h_i}\\ge\\frac{f_{i,+}}{2}$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2\\ge h_i f_{i,+}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i f_{i,+}\\le h_i\\|f\\|_\\infty\\le\\Delta t\\|f\\|_\\infty^2\\cdot\\ldots$</span> 仍不闭合。实际上该条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h_i/\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h_i^2/(2g^2)$</span> 相乘得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t^2\\le h_i^3/(2g^2\\|f\\|_\\infty)$</span>，不足以推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2\\ge h_i\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span>。故 (H3) 两式联立并不自动保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c}{h_i}\\ge\\frac{|f_{i,\\pm}|}{2}$</span>；需补充第三式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta t\\le\\frac{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}{\\sum_i\\big(g^2/h_i+\\|f\\|_\\infty\\big)}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2},$$</div>\n<p>即命题 7 谱半径条件。本节将 (H3) 修正为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le\\min\\big\\{\\min_i h_i^2/(2d\\,g_{\\max}^2),\\ \\min_i h_i/\\|f\\|_\\infty,\\ \\frac12\\big(\\sum_i(g_{\\max}^2/h_i+\\|f\\|_\\infty)\\big)^{-1}\\big\\}$</span>。第三式在多维时因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|$</span> 与求和量纲匹配而自动蕴含前两式（在一维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\omega|=h$</span>，第三式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h/(2(g^2/h+\\|f\\|_\\infty))$</span>，比前两式更严）。故命题 2 与命题 7 的证明在修正后的 (H3) 下成立。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 这是本节必须显式指出的假设纪律：原 (H3) 不足以支撑命题 2 的系数非负性，修正后的 (H3) 才是充分条件。前文命题 2 的证明引用 (H3) 时应理解为精确形式；此处补足，避免“适当条件下”的含混。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-9-离散熵耗散恒等式\">9. 离散熵耗散恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-9-离散熵耗散恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 12 节将讨论连续熵与自由能。本节给出离散对应，作为数值格式的第二个可检验恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（离散熵耗散）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=0$</span>（纯扩散），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数。定义离散熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^n=\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n\\log P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S^{n+1}-S^n=-\\Delta t\\sum_{i}\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\frac{g^2}{2}\\frac{(P_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}^n-P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n)(\\log P_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}^n-\\log P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n)}{h_i^2}+O(\\Delta t^2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 纯扩散时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}=-\\frac{g^2}{2}\\frac{P_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}-P_{\\mathbf{j}}}{h_i}$</span>。格式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^{n+1}=P^n+\\Delta t\\,\\mathcal{L}_hP^n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_hP_{\\mathbf{j}}=\\frac{g^2}{2}\\sum_i\\frac{P_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}-2P_{\\mathbf{j}}+P_{\\mathbf{j}-e_i}}{h_i^2}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 做 Taylor 展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S^{n+1}-S^n=\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\Big[(P_{\\mathbf{j}}+\\Delta t\\mathcal{L}_hP_{\\mathbf{j}})\\log(P_{\\mathbf{j}}+\\Delta t\\mathcal{L}_hP_{\\mathbf{j}})-P_{\\mathbf{j}}\\log P_{\\mathbf{j}}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(P+\\delta)=\\log P+\\delta/P+O(\\delta^2)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$= \\Delta t\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\mathcal{L}_hP_{\\mathbf{j}}\\big(\\log P_{\\mathbf{j}}+1\\big)+O(\\Delta t^2).$$</div>\n<p>对第一项做离散分部积分（Abel 变换）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\mathcal{L}_hP_{\\mathbf{j}}\\log P_{\\mathbf{j}}=-\\frac{g^2}{2}\\sum_i\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\frac{(P_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}-P_{\\mathbf{j}})(\\log P_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}-\\log P_{\\mathbf{j}})}{h_i^2}$</span>。第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\mathcal{L}_hP_{\\mathbf{j}}=0$</span>（质量守恒）。合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a-b)(\\log a-\\log b)\\ge0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b&gt;0$</span> 成立，右端非正，故离散熵单调不增，与连续情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int p\\log p=-\\frac{g^2}{2}\\int|\\nabla\\log p|^2p$</span> 一致。该恒等式给出数值诊断：纯扩散时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^n$</span> 应单调下降，可用于检验格式的熵相容性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-10-多维张量积结构与计算复杂度\">10. 多维张量积结构与计算复杂度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-10-多维张量积结构与计算复杂度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维格式的更新为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_{\\mathbf{j}}^{n+1}=P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n-\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\prod_i h_i}\\sum_{i=1}^d\\Big(\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}^n-\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}-e_i/2}^n\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>每个方向的通量只涉及该方向相邻两节点，故更新是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 个一维通量差之和。存储 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^n$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_i(N_i+1)$</span> 个浮点数，每步计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\prod_i(N_i+1)$</span> 次通量，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(d\\prod_i N_i)$</span>。边界处理对每个方向独立：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i$</span> 时对应通量置零，与一维情形相同。张量积结构保证多维质量守恒的证明可逐方向 telescoping，与命题 1 完全平行，无需重复。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 多维时 (H3) 的第三式含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i g^2/h_i$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 减小，这是显式格式的固有代价；隐式格式可放松该约束，但需解线性系统，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-11-格式的伴随对称性与离散概率流算子\">11. 格式的伴随对称性与离散概率流算子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-11-格式的伴随对称性与离散概率流算子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 3 节已建立连续生成元的伴随关系：FP 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 是 SDE 生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t\\,dx)$</span> 中的伴随。本节给出离散对应，说明有限体积格式的矩阵结构如何继承这一对称性，并由此得到一个可检验的转置恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 10（离散生成元矩阵）</strong> 设盒域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上节点总数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\prod_i(N_i+1)$</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^n$</span> 展平为向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{P}^n\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N_{\\mathrm{tot}}}$</span>。格式可写成线性形式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbf{P}^{n+1}=\\big(I+\\Delta t\\,L_h^n\\big)\\mathbf{P}^n,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_h^n\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N_{\\mathrm{tot}}\\times N_{\\mathrm{tot}}}$</span> 为离散生成元矩阵，其元素由第 1 节的数值通量组装：对内部单元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}$</span> 与方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(L_h^n)_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{j}}=-\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_i\\frac{f_i(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2},t_n)-f_i(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}-e_i/2},t_n)}{2},$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(L_h^n)_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{j}+e_i}=\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\Big(\\frac{g(t_n)^2}{2h_i}-\\frac{f_i(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2},t_n)}{2}\\Big),\\quad\n(L_h^n)_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{j}-e_i}=\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\Big(\\frac{g(t_n)^2}{2h_i}+\\frac{f_i(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}-e_i/2},t_n)}{2}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其余元素为零；边界单元的越界邻居项被丢弃（等价于通量置零）。这正是命题 2 证明中线性组合系数的矩阵写法。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（离散伴随恒等式）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{u},\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N_{\\mathrm{tot}}}$</span> 为任意向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\mathbf{u},\\mathbf{v}\\rangle_h=\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|u_{\\mathbf{j}}v_{\\mathbf{j}}$</span> 为加权内积。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\mathbf{u},L_h^n\\mathbf{v}\\rangle_h=\\langle (L_h^n)^{\\top}\\mathbf{u},\\mathbf{v}\\rangle_h,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n)^{\\top}$</span> 恰为把漂移场取反、扩散项不变所对应的离散生成元矩阵，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n)^{\\top}=L_h^n\\big|_{f\\mapsto -f}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 逐元素验证。加权内积下，矩阵的伴随为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n)^{\\dagger}_{\\mathbf{k},\\mathbf{j}}=|\\omega_{\\mathbf{k}}|(L_h^n)_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{k}}/|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|$</span>。对对角元，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n)_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{j}}$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n)^{\\dagger}_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{j}}=(L_h^n)_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{j}}$</span>。对非对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{k}=\\mathbf{j}+e_i$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(L_h^n)^{\\dagger}_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i,\\mathbf{j}}=\\frac{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}|}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}(L_h^n)_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{j}+e_i}=\\Big(\\frac{g^2}{2h_i}-\\frac{f_{i,+}}{2}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}|=|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|$</span>（内部单元体积相同）。而把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 取反后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{j}+e_i$</span> 行的左邻居系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}|}\\big(\\frac{g^2}{2h_i}+\\frac{(-f)_{i,-}}{2}\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-f)_{i,-}=-f_i(\\mathbf{x}_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i-e_i/2})=-f_{i,+}$</span>，故该系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{g^2}{2h_i}-\\frac{f_{i,+}}{2}$</span>，与上式一致。右邻居情形对称。对角元在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\mapsto -f$</span> 下变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{(-f)_{i,+}-(-f)_{i,-}}{2}=\\frac{f_{i,+}-f_{i,-}}{2}$</span>，即对角元取反；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n)^{\\dagger}$</span> 的对角元不变，故严格地说 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n)^{\\dagger}$</span> 的对角元与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_h^n|_{f\\mapsto -f}$</span> 的对角元相差一个符号。修正陈述：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n)^{\\dagger}$</span> 等于把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_h^n$</span> 的非对角漂移部分取反、对角漂移部分取反、扩散部分不变，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n)^{\\dagger}=L_h^n|_{f\\mapsto -f}$</span> 在非对角元上成立，对角元需另行核对。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n|_{f\\mapsto -f})_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{j}}=-\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_i\\frac{-f_{i,+}+f_{i,-}}{2}=\\frac{1}{|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|}\\sum_i\\frac{f_{i,+}-f_{i,-}}{2}=-(L_h^n)_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{j}}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n)^{\\dagger}_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{j}}=(L_h^n)_{\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{j}}$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h^n)^{\\dagger}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_h^n|_{f\\mapsto -f}$</span> 在对角元上符号相反。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 上述计算暴露了一个必须显式处理的事实：连续情形下 FP 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(dx)$</span> 中的伴随是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathcal{L}^{\\mathrm{SDE}}$</span>（SDE 生成元的负伴随），其中漂移项取反、扩散项不变，且对角（零阶）项为零（FP 方程无零阶项）。离散格式的对角元来自漂移的散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\mapsto -f$</span> 下取反，这是连续情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^{\\dagger}=-\\mathcal{A}$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}$</span> 含零阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f$</span> 的离散体现。命题 11 的正确陈述应为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\mathbf{u},L_h^n\\mathbf{v}\\rangle_h=\\langle\\tilde L_h^n\\mathbf{u},\\mathbf{v}\\rangle_h$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde L_h^n$</span> 为漂移取反且对角元取反的矩阵。该恒等式可用于代码检验：随机生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{u},\\mathbf{v}$</span>，验证加权内积的转置关系在机器精度内成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-12-时间离散的强稳定性与矩阵指数对照\">12. 时间离散的强稳定性与矩阵指数对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-12-时间离散的强稳定性与矩阵指数对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>显式 Euler 的稳定性由谱半径条件控制（命题 7 注）。本节给出一个更强的结论：在纯扩散且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=0$</span> 的情形，显式 Euler 的放大矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I+\\Delta t\\,L_h$</span> 的特征值可显式写出，从而把 (H3) 的谱半径条件转化为可验证的等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（纯扩散放大矩阵的谱）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数，一维盒域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N+1$</span> 节点，边界通量置零（Neumann 型）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_h$</span> 为三对角对称矩阵，其特征值为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_k=-\\frac{2g^2}{h^2}\\Big(1-\\cos\\frac{k\\pi}{N}\\Big),\\qquad k=0,1,\\dots,N,$$</div>\n<p>对应特征向量为离散余弦模态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}_j=\\cos\\big(\\frac{k\\pi j}{N}\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0,\\dots,N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 纯扩散时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_hP_j=\\frac{g^2}{2}\\frac{P_{j+1}-2P_j+P_{j-1}}{h^2}$</span>（内部），边界处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{-1}:=P_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{N+1}:=P_N$</span>（通量置零的镜像延拓）。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}_j=\\cos(k\\pi j/N)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{(k)}_{j+1}+v^{(k)}_{j-1}=2\\cos\\frac{k\\pi}{N}\\cos\\frac{k\\pi j}{N}=2\\cos\\frac{k\\pi}{N}v^{(k)}_j,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_hv^{(k)}_j=\\frac{g^2}{2h^2}\\big(2\\cos\\frac{k\\pi}{N}-2\\big)v^{(k)}_j=-\\frac{2g^2}{h^2}\\big(1-\\cos\\frac{k\\pi}{N}\\big)v^{(k)}_j$</span>。边界处镜像延拓使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=N$</span> 的差分同样满足该式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}_{-1}=v^{(k)}_1$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos$</span> 为偶函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}_{N+1}=v^{(k)}_{N-1}$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos(k\\pi(N+1)/N)=\\cos(k\\pi+k\\pi/N)=(-1)^k\\cos(k\\pi/N)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}_{N-1}=\\cos(k\\pi(N-1)/N)=(-1)^k\\cos(k\\pi/N)$</span> 一致）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 13（显式 Euler 的稳定性充要条件）</strong> 在上述设定下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I+\\Delta t\\,L_h$</span> 的谱半径为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k|1+\\Delta t\\lambda_k|$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_k\\le0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_N$</span> 最负（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=N$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\cos\\pi=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_N=-4g^2/h^2$</span>），稳定性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k|1+\\Delta t\\lambda_k|\\le1$</span> 等价于</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta t\\le\\frac{h^2}{2g^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1+\\Delta t\\lambda_k|\\le1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_k\\in[-4g^2/h^2,0]$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\le\\Delta t\\lambda_k\\le0$</span>，最严条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\cdot(-4g^2/h^2)\\ge-2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h^2/(2g^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 该界与 (H3) 第一式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 时一致（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2/(2g^2)$</span>）。命题 12 把稳定性从“谱半径估计”提升为“特征值显式计算”，使 (H3) 的充分性在纯扩散情形成为充要条件。含漂移时特征值无闭式，只能用 Gershgorin 圆盘给出充分条件（命题 7 注），这也是 (H3) 第三式必须补充的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-13-数值格式与连续弱解的收敛性接口\">13. 数值格式与连续弱解的收敛性接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-13-数值格式与连续弱解的收敛性接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 6 给出离散弱形式，本节补足其向连续弱解收敛的关键步骤，使“格式收敛”不是断言而是有据的推理链。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14（弱形式收敛）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P^n$</span> 由格式生成，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^0_{\\mathbf{j}}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span> 的单元平均。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i\\to0$</span> 且 (H3) 始终满足。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=\\lfloor t/\\Delta t\\rfloor$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}}\\longrightarrow\\int_\\Omega p_t(x)\\varphi(x)\\,dx,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 FP 方程的弱解（第 4 节定义）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 分三步。</p>\n<p>第一步（紧性）：由命题 1 与命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P^n\\|_{L^1}=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^n\\ge0$</span>；由命题 7 注，中心格式不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 界，但格式的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数可由离散熵恒等式（命题 9）控制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^n\\le S^0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^n\\log P^n$</span> 有下界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P^n\\|_{L^2}$</span> 一致有界（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p^2\\le C(1+\\int p\\log p)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 有界支撑成立）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{P^n\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中弱紧，存在弱收敛子列，极限记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二步（弱形式极限）：对命题 6 的离散弱形式取极限。左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\frac{P_{\\mathbf{j}}^{n+1}-P_{\\mathbf{j}}^n}{\\Delta t}\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}}$</span> 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega\\partial_t p_t\\varphi$</span>（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的弱连续性，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 紧性与时间步长趋于零保证）。右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}\\sum_i|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\hat F_{i,\\mathbf{j}+e_i/2}^n\\frac{\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}-\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}}}{h_i}$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}-\\varphi_{\\mathbf{j}}}{h_i}\\to\\partial_{x_i}\\varphi$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 光滑），数值通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat F$</span> 弱收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的分量（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^n$</span> 弱收敛与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的光滑性，乘积的弱收敛需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的有界性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla P^n$</span> 的弱紧性；后者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 界与离散分部积分得到）。于是右端收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot J_t$</span>，与第 4 节弱解定义一致。</p>\n<p>第三步（唯一性）：FP 方程在 (H1) 下的弱解在概率密度类中唯一（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 压缩性与线性性），故全序列收敛，无需取子列。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 第二步中“乘积的弱收敛”需显式验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P^n\\rightharpoonup p_t$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界连续，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^nf\\rightharpoonup p_tf$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的有界性与测试函数的稠密性）。扩散项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla P^n$</span> 的弱紧性来自离散分部积分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\omega_{\\mathbf{j}}|\\frac{(P_{\\mathbf{j}+e_i}-P_{\\mathbf{j}})^2}{h_i^2}\\le C$</span> 由熵耗散恒等式（命题 9）的右端有界给出，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_hP^n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中有界，弱收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span>。这两点是收敛性证明的关键，缺一不可；本节只给出思路，完整紧性论证（Rellich–Kondrachov 与 Aubin–Lions）留待后续节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-14-格式选择的两条判据\">14. 格式选择的两条判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-14-格式选择的两条判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 1、2、7、9、12，本节给出格式选择的两条可操作判据，供后续代码节（第 13、14 节）直接引用。</p>\n<p><strong>判据 A（质量守恒优先）</strong> 若目标是长时间演化并需严格质量守恒，取守恒型有限体积格式（第 1 节），边界通量置零。质量守恒是结构性质（命题 1），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i$</span> 无关，不依赖稳定性。代价是中心通量不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 单调性（命题 7 注）。</p>\n<p><strong>判据 B（正性与熵相容优先）</strong> 若目标是采样或密度估计并需正性与熵单调，取满足修正 (H3) 的显式 Euler，纯扩散时熵单调不增（命题 9），正性由命题 2 保证。代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 受谱半径条件约束（推论 13），高维时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 减小。</p>\n<p>两条判据不冲突：守恒型格式在修正 (H3) 下同时满足 A 与 B。判据的作用是提醒：若放弃守恒型（如改用非守恒的差分格式），质量守恒不再由结构保证，需在代码中用命题 5 的离散总通量恒等式逐帧诊断；若放弃 (H3)，正性可能失效，需在代码中用命题 2 的断言检验。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>本节从连续守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 出发，构造了盒域上的守恒型有限体积显式格式，数值通量取漂移算术平均与扩散中心差分，边界通量置零实现 (H2)。</li>\n<li>在 (H1)–(H3) 下证明了格式的质量守恒（命题 1）、正性保持（命题 2）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 等距（推论 3）、二阶空间相容性（命题 4）与离散弱形式恒等式（命题 6），并给出可运行的数值验证代码。</li>\n<li>格式的收敛性依赖稳定性与紧性论证，本节只建立代数恒等式与相容性；完整收敛性证明留待后续节与反例节处理边界通量非零导致质量不守恒的失效情形。</li>\n<li>补足了稳定性论证：中心型通量不满足通量单调性，故命题 7 的离散极值原理对中心格式不成立；格式只保证正性（命题 2）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 守恒（命题 1），<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 稳定性需改用迎风通量。这一区分必须显式说明，不能以“适当条件下”含混。</li>\n<li>修正了 (H3)：原两式不足以保证命题 2 的系数非负，需补充谱半径条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le\\frac12\\big(\\sum_i(g_{\\max}^2/h_i+\\|f\\|_\\infty)\\big)^{-1}$</span>；修正后的 (H3) 才是命题 2 与命题 7 的充分假设。</li>\n<li>给出离散熵耗散恒等式（命题 9），证明纯扩散时离散熵单调不增且耗散率与连续情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{g^2}{2}\\int|\\nabla\\log p|^2p$</span> 对应；并说明多维张量积结构的复杂度与质量守恒证明的逐方向平行性。</li>\n<li>建立了离散生成元矩阵的伴随恒等式（命题 11），指出连续情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^{\\dagger}=-\\mathcal{A}$</span> 中零阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f$</span> 的离散对应是矩阵对角元在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\mapsto -f$</span> 下取反；该恒等式可用于代码中转置关系的数值检验。</li>\n<li>在纯扩散情形显式计算了放大矩阵的谱（命题 12）与显式 Euler 稳定性的充要条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le h^2/(2g^2)$</span>（推论 13），把 (H3) 第一式从充分条件提升为充要条件；含漂移时只能用 Gershgorin 圆盘给充分条件，这正是 (H3) 第三式必须补充的根源。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-一维闭式例子\">一维闭式例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-一维闭式例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)$</span> 为漂移场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 为扩散系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)$</span> 为时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(x)=p_t(x)f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\partial_x p_t(x)$</span> 为概率流。本节只处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 情形，空间变量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(x;m,\\sigma^2)$</span>：一维正态密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(x;m,\\sigma^2)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma^2}}\\exp\\!\\big(-\\frac{(x-m)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(z)$</span>：标准正态分布函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(z)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{z}\\mathcal{N}(y;0,1)\\,dy$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{erf}(z)$</span>：误差函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{erf}(z)=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}\\int_0^z e^{-y^2}dy$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(z)=\\tfrac12\\big(1+\\mathrm{erf}(z/\\sqrt2)\\big)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{erfc}(z)=1-\\mathrm{erf}(z)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$H(t)$</span>：时变 OU 过程的方差函数，定义见例 2。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心假设（H1）–（H4）逐条列出，后续每个命题显式引用：</p>\n<p>（H1）漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f(x,t)|\\le C_f(1+|x|)$</span>（线性增长）。</p>\n<p>（H2）扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 连续，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\max}&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\min}\\le g(t)\\le g_{\\max}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（非退化、有界）。</p>\n<p>（H3）初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R})\\cap L^\\infty(\\mathbb{R})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\ge0$</span> 几乎处处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}p_0=1$</span>。</p>\n<p>（H4）在闭式例子中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的选取使 FP 方程的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{2,1}(\\mathbb{R}\\times(0,T))$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}|x|^2p_t(x)\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（保证求导与积分交换合法，见命题 1 的验证）。</p>\n<p>在（H1）–（H4）下，前序节已证：FP 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\partial_x(p_tf)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\partial_x^2 p_t$</span> 存在唯一概率密度解，且守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\partial_x J_t=0$</span> 成立。本节只做闭式求解与验证，不重复适定性证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-例-1-纯扩散-f-equiv0-g-为常数\">例 1：纯扩散（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-例-1-纯扩散-f-equiv0-g-为常数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g_0&gt;0$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x)=\\delta(x-x_0)$</span> 的磨光近似（在（H3）意义下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 逼近，结论对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 初值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 连续性延拓）。FP 方程退化为热方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\,\\partial_x^2 p_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 1（纯扩散闭式解）</strong> 假设（H2）（H3）成立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv0$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}(x;x_0,\\;g_0^2 t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi g_0^2 t}}\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\frac{(x-x_0)^2}{2g_0^2t}\\Big)$$</div>\n<p>是 FP 方程的解，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}p_t=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(x)=-\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\partial_x p_t(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=g_0^2t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}(x;x_0,\\sigma_t^2)$</span>。直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=p_t(x)\\cdot\\Big(-\\frac{1}{2t}+\\frac{(x-x_0)^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot\\frac{g_0^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big)=p_t(x)\\Big(-\\frac{1}{2t}+\\frac{(x-x_0)^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\Big),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_x p_t(x)=-\\frac{x-x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}p_t(x),\\qquad \\partial_x^2 p_t(x)=\\Big(\\frac{(x-x_0)^2}{\\sigma_t^4}-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big)p_t(x).$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\partial_x^2 p_t(x)=\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\Big(\\frac{(x-x_0)^2}{\\sigma_t^4}-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big)p_t(x)=p_t(x)\\Big(\\frac{(x-x_0)^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}-\\frac{1}{2t}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 逐点相等。归一化由高斯积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}\\mathcal{N}(x;x_0,\\sigma_t^2)dx=1$</span> 给出。概率流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_x p_t=-\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_x p_t$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv0$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（质量守恒的显式验证）</strong> 在命题 1 的条件下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}p_t(x)\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}\\partial_t p_t\\,dx=\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\big[\\partial_x p_t\\big]_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}=0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1 的逐点等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{-R}^{R}\\partial_t p_t\\,dx=\\tfrac12g_0^2\\int_{-R}^{R}\\partial_x^2p_t\\,dx=\\tfrac12g_0^2(\\partial_xp_t(R)-\\partial_xp_t(-R))$</span>。由（H4）及高斯衰减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\partial_x p_t(\\pm R)|\\le C_t e^{-R^2/(2\\sigma_t^2)}\\to0$</span>，故极限为零。交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int$</span> 用 Leibniz 法则，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-R,R]\\times[t_1,t_2]$</span> 上连续且有可积控制（高斯型），条件满足。证毕。</p>\n<p>此推论与守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\partial_x J_t=0$</span> 一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\partial_x J_t\\,dx=J_t(+\\infty)-J_t(-\\infty)=0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 在高斯尾部指数衰减。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-例-2-时变-OU-过程-线性漂移-时变扩散\">例 2：时变 OU 过程（线性漂移、时变扩散）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-例-2-时变-OU-过程-线性漂移-时变扩散\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span> 常数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 满足（H2），初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(\\cdot;m_0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>。FP 方程为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=\\partial_x(\\theta x\\,p_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\partial_x^2 p_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 2（时变 OU 闭式解）</strong> 假设（H2）（H3）（H4）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(\\cdot;m_0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>。定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m_t=m_0e^{-\\theta t},\\qquad H(t)=\\sigma_0^2e^{-2\\theta t}+\\int_0^t e^{-2\\theta(t-s)}g(s)^2\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p>则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}(x;\\,m_t,\\,H(t))$$</div>\n<p>是 FP 方程的解，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(t)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}(x;m_t,H_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_t\\equiv H(t)$</span>。计算偏导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_x p_t(x)=-\\frac{x-m_t}{H_t}p_t(x),\\qquad \\partial_x^2 p_t(x)=\\Big(\\frac{(x-m_t)^2}{H_t^2}-\\frac{1}{H_t}\\Big)p_t(x).$$</div>\n<p>漂移项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x(\\theta x\\,p_t)=\\theta p_t+\\theta x\\,\\partial_x p_t=\\theta p_t-\\theta x\\frac{x-m_t}{H_t}p_t$</span>。合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_x^2p_t$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t =\\theta p_t-\\theta x\\frac{x-m_t}{H_t}p_t+\\tfrac12g^2\\Big(\\frac{(x-m_t)^2}{H_t^2}-\\frac{1}{H_t}\\Big)p_t. \\tag{$\\ast$}$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(x;m_t,H_t)$</span> 的通用恒等式（对参数求导）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=p_t(x)\\Big[\\frac{(x-m_t)\\dot m_t}{H_t}+\\frac{(x-m_t)^2-\\!H_t}{2H_t^2}\\dot H_t\\Big]. \\tag{$\\ast\\ast$}$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot m_t=-\\theta m_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot H_t=-2\\theta H_t+g(t)^2$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的定义式求导，用 Leibniz 法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 连续故可积）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot m_t,\\dot H_t$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\ast\\ast)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=p_t\\Big[\\frac{(x-m_t)(-\\theta m_t)}{H_t}+\\frac{(x-m_t)^2-H_t}{2H_t^2}\\big(-2\\theta H_t+g^2\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>展开第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(x-m_t)^2-H_t}{2H_t^2}(-2\\theta H_t)=-\\theta\\frac{(x-m_t)^2}{H_t}+\\theta$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(x-m_t)^2-H_t}{2H_t^2}g^2=\\frac{g^2}{2}\\frac{(x-m_t)^2}{H_t^2}-\\frac{g^2}{2H_t}$</span>。合并：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=p_t\\Big[-\\theta\\frac{(x-m_t)m_t}{H_t}-\\theta\\frac{(x-m_t)^2}{H_t}+\\theta+\\frac{g^2}{2}\\frac{(x-m_t)^2}{H_t^2}-\\frac{g^2}{2H_t}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\theta\\frac{(x-m_t)m_t}{H_t}-\\theta\\frac{(x-m_t)^2}{H_t}=-\\theta\\frac{(x-m_t)(m_t+x-m_t)}{H_t}=-\\theta\\frac{x(x-m_t)}{H_t}$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=p_t\\Big[\\theta-\\theta x\\frac{x-m_t}{H_t}+\\frac{g^2}{2}\\frac{(x-m_t)^2}{H_t^2}-\\frac{g^2}{2H_t}\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\ast)$</span> 逐项相同。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 FP 方程。正性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_t\\ge\\sigma_0^2e^{-2\\theta t}+\\int_0^t e^{-2\\theta(t-s)}g_{\\min}^2ds&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>）。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（平稳分布的闭式极限）</strong> 在命题 2 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g_0$</span> 为常数，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_\\infty=\\lim_{t\\to\\infty}H(t)=\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta},\\qquad p_\\infty(x)=\\mathcal{N}\\Big(x;0,\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 满足平稳条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x J_\\infty=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty(x)=-\\theta x\\,p_\\infty(x)-\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_x p_\\infty(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_\\infty$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t e^{-2\\theta(t-s)}g_0^2ds=g_0^2\\frac{1-e^{-2\\theta t}}{2\\theta}\\to\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}$</span>，首项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2e^{-2\\theta t}\\to0$</span>。平稳性：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=\\mathcal{N}(x;0,H_\\infty)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_\\infty(x)=-\\theta x\\,p_\\infty(x)-\\tfrac12g_0^2\\Big(-\\frac{x}{H_\\infty}p_\\infty(x)\\Big)=\\Big(-\\theta+\\frac{g_0^2}{2H_\\infty}\\Big)x\\,p_\\infty(x)=0,$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_\\infty=g_0^2/(2\\theta)$</span> 使括号为零。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x J_\\infty=0$</span> 平凡成立。证毕。</p>\n<p>此例显式验证了前序节平稳分布命题：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x J_\\infty=0$</span>，且此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>（细节平衡）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-例-3-漂移为零-扩散时变-显式检验守恒形式\">例 3：漂移为零、扩散时变——显式检验守恒形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-例-3-漂移为零-扩散时变-显式检验守恒形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 满足（H2），初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(\\cdot;0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>。此时 FP 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\tfrac12g(t)^2\\partial_x^2p_t$</span> 的解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}\\Big(x;0,\\;\\sigma_0^2+\\int_0^t g(s)^2ds\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 3（时变扩散的方差恒等式）</strong> 在上述设定下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(t)=\\sigma_0^2+\\int_0^t g(s)^2ds$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}x^2p_t(x)\\,dx=g(t)^2,\\qquad \\int_{\\mathbb{R}}x^2p_t(x)\\,dx=V(t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(x;0,V(t))$</span>，二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x^2p_t=V(t)$</span> 直接由高斯积分给出。求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}V(t)=g(t)^2$</span>，用 Leibniz 法则（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 连续）。另一方面，从 FP 方程出发独立验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int x^2p_t=\\int x^2\\partial_t p_t=\\tfrac12g^2\\int x^2\\partial_x^2p_t$</span>。两次分部积分（边界项由高斯尾部衰减消失，用（H4））：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}x^2\\partial_x^2p_t\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}\\partial_x^2(x^2)\\,p_t\\,dx=2\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}p_t\\,dx=2,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int x^2p_t=g^2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(t)$</span> 的导数一致。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题给出一个可检验恒等式：二阶矩的增长率恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2$</span>，与漂移无关（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv0$</span>）。它同时说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 时变时，方差不必线性增长，但增长率逐点等于扩散系数的平方。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-例-4-带线性漂移的边界通量显式计算\">例 4：带线性漂移的边界通量显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-例-4-带线性漂移的边界通量显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv g_0$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(\\cdot;m_0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>。由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(x;m_te^{-\\theta t},H(t))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(t)=\\sigma_0^2e^{-2\\theta t}+\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>。概率流</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t(x)=\\big(-\\theta x\\big)p_t(x)-\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_xp_t(x)=\\Big(-\\theta x+\\tfrac12g_0^2\\frac{x-m_t}{H(t)}\\Big)p_t(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 4（通量在无穷远的衰减速率）</strong> 在上述设定下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|J_t(x)|\\le C_t\\,|x|\\,e^{-x^2/(2H(t))},\\qquad \\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}J_t(x)=0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t&gt;0$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。 consequently <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}\\partial_xJ_t\\,dx=0$</span>，即质量守恒。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)\\le(2\\pi H(t))^{-1/2}e^{-x^2/(2H(t))}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x-m_t)^2\\ge0$</span> 时指数最大在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=m_t$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^0$</span>，但此处需小心：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x-m_t)^2/2H\\ge x^2/2H - m_t^2/H$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\le(2\\pi H)^{-1/2}e^{m_t^2/(2H)}e^{-x^2/(2H)}$</span>，吸收常数）。系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|-\\theta x+\\tfrac12g_0^2(x-m_t)/H(t)|\\le(\\theta+g_0^2/(2H(t)))|x|+g_0^2|m_t|/(2H(t))$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|\\ge1$</span> 控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t|x|$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|J_t(x)|\\le C_t|x|e^{-x^2/(2H(t))}\\to0$</span>。积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{-R}^{R}\\partial_xJ_t=J_t(R)-J_t(-R)\\to0$</span>，用控制收敛（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\partial_xJ_t|$</span> 可积，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 高斯衰减且其导数亦高斯衰减，需（H4））。证毕。</p>\n<p>此例显式展示了前序节边界通量条件：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}$</span> 上无边界，通量在无穷远消失，质量守恒自动成立；第 10 节将构造通量非零的反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-例-5-与-Liouville-方程的对照-g-equiv0-的退化情形\">例 5：与 Liouville 方程的对照（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 的退化情形）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-例-5-与-Liouville-方程的对照-g-equiv0-的退化情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>。FP 方程退化为 Liouville（输运）方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=\\partial_x(\\theta x\\,p_t),\\qquad J_t=\\theta x\\,p_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 5（退化 FP 的闭式解与质量守恒的失效边界）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R})$</span> 具紧支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足（H1）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=e^{\\theta t}p_0(e^{\\theta t}x)$</span> 是 Liouville 方程的解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span> 成立，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 在无穷远一般不为零（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 支撑有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有限时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 支撑有界，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\partial_xJ_t=0$</span> 仍成立）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=e^{\\theta t}x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=e^{\\theta t}p_0(y)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\theta e^{\\theta t}p_0(y)+e^{\\theta t}\\nabla p_0(y)\\cdot\\theta x e^{\\theta t}=\\theta p_t+\\theta x\\,\\partial_xp_t$</span>（链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_xp_t=e^{2\\theta t}p_0'(y)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta x\\partial_xp_t=\\theta xe^{2\\theta t}p_0'(y)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta e^{\\theta t}p_0(y)+e^{\\theta t}\\theta xe^{\\theta t}p_0'(y)$</span> 一致）。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x(\\theta x\\,p_t)=\\theta p_t+\\theta x\\partial_xp_t$</span>，相等。质量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_tdx=\\int e^{\\theta t}p_0(e^{\\theta t}x)dx=\\int p_0(y)dy=1$</span>（换元）。通量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(x)=\\theta x e^{\\theta t}p_0(e^{\\theta t}x)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 紧支撑时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 紧支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\partial_xJ_t=0$</span>。但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 非紧支撑（如高斯），<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 在无穷远不消失，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\partial_xJ_t$</span> 的边界项可能非零——这正是第 10 节反例的种子。证毕。</p>\n<p>此例说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 时 FP 退化为 Liouville，密度沿特征流拉回，质量守恒仍成立（换元），但通量边界条件需单独验证；第 10 节将给出通量非零导致质量不守恒的显式构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-数值可检验的恒等式汇总\">数值可检验的恒等式汇总<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-数值可检验的恒等式汇总\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由命题 1–5，得到以下可在代码中逐项验证的恒等式（供第 13、14 节代码节使用）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>纯扩散：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x^2p_t\\,dx=g_0^2t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=1$</span>。</li>\n<li>时变 OU：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x^2p_t\\,dx=H(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}H(t)=-2\\theta H(t)+g(t)^2$</span>。</li>\n<li>时变扩散：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int x^2p_t=g(t)^2$</span>。</li>\n<li>平稳 OU：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_\\infty=g_0^2/(2\\theta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这些恒等式均为逐点等式经积分得到的可检验推论，其证明已在上述命题中逐步写出，未跳步。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.integrate import quad\n\n# 恒等式 1：纯扩散，g0=1, x0=0, t=0.7，二阶矩应为 g0^2 t\ng0, t = 1.0, 0.7\nvar = g0**2 * t\nf = lambda x: x**2 * np.exp(-x**2/(2*var)) / np.sqrt(2*np.pi*var)\nm2, err = quad(f, -np.inf, np.inf)\nassert abs(m2 - var) &lt; 1e-6, (m2, var)\nprint(&quot;纯扩散二阶矩:&quot;, m2, &quot;预期:&quot;, var)\n\n# 恒等式 2：时变 OU，theta=1.5, sigma0=0.3, g(s)=0.8+0.2*sin(s)\ntheta, sigma0 = 1.5, 0.3\ng = lambda s: 0.8 + 0.2*np.sin(s)\ndef H(t):\n    return sigma0**2*np.exp(-2*theta*t) + quad(lambda s: np.exp(-2*theta*(t-s))*g(s)**2, 0, t)[0]\nfor tt in [0.0, 0.5, 1.0]:\n    h = H(tt)\n    fh = lambda x: x**2 * np.exp(-x**2/(2*h)) / np.sqrt(2*np.pi*h)\n    m2h, _ = quad(fh, -np.inf, np.inf)\n    assert abs(m2h - h) &lt; 1e-6, (tt, m2h, h)\nprint(&quot;时变 OU 二阶矩与 H(t) 一致&quot;)\n\n# 恒等式 3：时变扩散，d/dt E[x^2] = g(t)^2，用中心差分近似导数\ndef V(t):\n    return sigma0**2 + quad(lambda s: g(s)**2, 0, t)[0]\nt0, dt = 0.4, 1e-5\ndV = (V(t0+dt) - V(t0-dt)) / (2*dt)\nassert abs(dV - g(t0)**2) &lt; 1e-4, (dV, g(t0)**2)\nprint(&quot;时变扩散方差导数:&quot;, dV, &quot;预期:&quot;, g(t0)**2)\n\n# 恒等式 4：平稳 OU，H_inf = g0^2/(2 theta)，J_inf 在若干点为零\ng0, theta = 0.9, 1.2\nH_inf = g0**2 / (2*theta)\nxs = np.linspace(-3, 3, 7)\np_inf = np.exp(-xs**2/(2*H_inf)) / np.sqrt(2*np.pi*H_inf)\ndp_inf = -xs/H_inf * p_inf\nJ_inf = -theta*xs*p_inf - 0.5*g0**2*dp_inf\nassert np.allclose(J_inf, 0.0, atol=1e-12), J_inf\nprint(&quot;平稳 OU 通量:&quot;, J_inf, &quot;H_inf:&quot;, H_inf)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在一维、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 线性增长、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非退化有界的假设下，纯扩散、时变 OU、时变扩散三类 FP 方程均有高斯型闭式解，其参数（均值、方差）满足显式 ODE，逐点代入验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\partial_x(p_tf)+\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_x^2p_t$</span>。</li>\n<li>由闭式解导出可检验恒等式：纯扩散二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=g_0^2t$</span>，时变 OU 方差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot H=-2\\theta H+g^2$</span>，时变扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}[x^2]=g(t)^2$</span>；平稳 OU 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_\\infty=g_0^2/(2\\theta)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_xJ_\\infty=0$</span> 的细节平衡情形。</li>\n<li>例 5 表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 时 FP 退化为 Liouville 方程，密度沿特征流拉回、质量守恒由换元保证；通量在无穷远的衰减是质量守恒的关键，其失效情形留待第 10 节反例节集中构造。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-例-6-带吸收边界的一维-FP-方程-通量条件如何进入闭式解\">例 6：带吸收边界的一维 FP 方程——通量条件如何进入闭式解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-例-6-带吸收边界的一维-FP-方程-通量条件如何进入闭式解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前五个例子都在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}$</span> 上讨论，边界通量条件被无穷远衰减自动满足。本小节给出一个<strong>有界区间</strong>上的闭式例子，使前序节定义的边界通量条件在具体公式中显形。取空间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,L]$</span>，漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)\\equiv v$</span> 为常数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>），扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g_0&gt;0$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C^2([0,L])$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^L p_0=1$</span>。FP 方程为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\partial_x(v\\,p_t)+\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\,\\partial_x^2 p_t,\\qquad J_t(x)=v\\,p_t(x)-\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\,\\partial_x p_t(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 6（吸收边界下的显式解与质量亏损率）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C^2([0,L])$</span> 且满足 Dirichlet 边界条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(0)=p_0(L)=0$</span>（相容性），并设解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^{2,1}([0,L]\\times(0,T))$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(0)=p_t(L)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_n\\,e^{-\\lambda_n t}\\sin\\!\\Big(\\frac{n\\pi x}{L}\\Big),\\qquad \\lambda_n=\\frac12 g_0^2\\Big(\\frac{n\\pi}{L}\\Big)^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=\\frac{2}{L}\\int_0^L p_0(y)\\sin(n\\pi y/L)\\,dy$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_0^L p_t(x)\\,dx=J_t(0)-J_t(L)=-\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\,\\partial_x p_t(0)+\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\,\\partial_x p_t(L).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 先验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足方程。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_n(x)=\\sin(n\\pi x/L)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_n''=-(n\\pi/L)^2\\varphi_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_n(0)=\\varphi_n(L)=0$</span>。逐项求导（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{2,1}$</span> 与系数指数衰减下合法，用 Weierstrass M-判别法与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum|a_n|e^{-\\lambda_n t}&lt;\\infty$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge t_0&gt;0$</span> 一致收敛）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\sum_n\\lambda_n a_n e^{-\\lambda_n t}\\varphi_n,\\qquad \\tfrac12 g_0^2\\partial_x^2 p_t=-\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\sum_n a_n e^{-\\lambda_n t}\\Big(\\frac{n\\pi}{L}\\Big)^2\\varphi_n=-\\sum_n\\lambda_n a_n e^{-\\lambda_n t}\\varphi_n.$$</div>\n<p>漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x(v\\,p_t)=v\\,\\partial_x p_t$</span> 一般不为零，故上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> <strong>不是</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\neq0$</span> 时 FP 方程的解——这正是本命题要显式暴露的：Dirichlet 边界与常漂移不相容。为使命题成立，须取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x(vp_t)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_x^2p_t$</span> 逐项成立。系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的正弦展开给出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C^2$</span> 且端点为零保证 Fourier 正弦级数一致收敛）。质量亏损率：由守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\partial_x J_t=0$</span>，积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_0^L p_t=-\\int_0^L\\partial_xJ_t\\,dx=J_t(0)-J_t(L)$</span>，用微积分基本定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in C^1$</span>）。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=-\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_xp_t$</span> 得所述表达式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 6 的假设中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=0$</span> 不是笔误：它精确刻画了“Dirichlet 边界 + 常漂移”的不相容性。若强行取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\neq0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x(vp_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_x^2p_t$</span> 的级数展开不匹配，方程不成立。这一不相容性正是第 10 节反例节要展开的边界通量问题的原型；本节只把它作为闭式解的<strong>边界条件检验</strong>记录下来，不展开反例论证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-例-7-反射边界下的平稳分布-通量条件-left-J_t-right-_-partial-0-的显式实现\">例 7：反射边界下的平稳分布——通量条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\left.J_t\\right|_{\\partial}=0$</span> 的显式实现<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-例-7-反射边界下的平稳分布-通量条件-left-J_t-right-_-partial-0-的显式实现\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,L]$</span>，漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\theta(x-x^\\ast)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast\\in(0,L)$</span> 为漂移中心），扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv g_0&gt;0$</span>。边界取<strong>反射（Neumann）条件</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t(0)=J_t(L)=0\\quad\\text{对所有 }t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 7（反射边界平稳分布）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 如上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C^2([0,L])$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^Lp_0=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 满足相容 Neumann 条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_0(0)=J_0(L)=0$</span>。则 FP 方程存在唯一光滑解，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\to p_\\infty$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1([0,L])$</span> 中，其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\infty(x)=\\frac{1}{Z}\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\frac{\\theta(x-x^\\ast)^2}{g_0^2}\\Big),\\qquad Z=\\int_0^L\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\frac{\\theta(y-x^\\ast)^2}{g_0^2}\\Big)dy.$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,L]$</span> 上。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 平稳性：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 如上。计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_\\infty(x)=-\\theta(x-x^\\ast)p_\\infty(x)-\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_xp_\\infty(x).$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_xp_\\infty=-\\frac{2\\theta(x-x^\\ast)}{g_0^2}p_\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_xp_\\infty=-\\theta(x-x^\\ast)p_\\infty$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty(x)=-\\theta(x-x^\\ast)p_\\infty+\\theta(x-x^\\ast)p_\\infty=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_xJ_\\infty=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 的平稳条件成立，且边界通量条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty(0)=J_\\infty(L)=0$</span> 自动满足。收敛性：将 FP 方程写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_tp_t=\\partial_x\\big(\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_xp_t+\\theta(x-x^\\ast)p_t\\big)$</span>，这是对称化后的梯度流形式；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2([0,L])$</span> 上定义算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}p=\\partial_x(\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_xp+\\theta(x-x^\\ast)p)$</span>，其伴随（在加权测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty dx$</span> 下）为自伴负算子，谱隙为正（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,L]$</span> 紧且系数光滑、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,L]$</span> 上一致有界正）。由谱分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t-p_\\infty=\\sum_k c_ke^{-\\mu_kt}\\psi_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_k\\ge\\mu_1&gt;0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛。此处只引用前序节平稳分布与适定性结论，不重复谱隙证明。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（反射边界的质量守恒）</strong> 在命题 7 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^Lp_t\\,dx=1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由守恒形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_0^Lp_t=J_t(0)-J_t(L)=0$</span>（Neumann 条件），初值归一化给出结论。证毕。</p>\n<p>此例与前序节边界通量条件完全对齐：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t|_{\\partial}=0$</span> 是反射边界的定义，命题 7 显式构造了满足它的平稳解，推论 3 显式验证了质量守恒。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-例-8-漂移为二次势梯度时的一维精确解-非高斯闭式解\">例 8：漂移为二次势梯度时的一维精确解——非高斯闭式解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-例-8-漂移为二次势梯度时的一维精确解-非高斯闭式解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前六个例子的解均为高斯型。本小节给出一个<strong>非高斯</strong>闭式解，用以检验 FP 方程在非二次势下的行为。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\nabla V(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V(x)=\\frac{\\theta}{4}x^4+\\frac{\\kappa}{2}x^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0,\\kappa\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv g_0&gt;0$</span>。FP 方程为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_tp_t=\\partial_x\\big((\\theta x^3+\\kappa x)p_t\\big)+\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_x^2p_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 8（四次势的平稳分布闭式解）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 如上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1\\cap L^\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_0=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|x|^4p_0&lt;\\infty$</span>。则平稳分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\infty(x)=\\frac{1}{Z}\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\frac{2}{g_0^2}V(x)\\Big)=\\frac{1}{Z}\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\frac{2}{g_0^2}\\Big(\\frac{\\theta}{4}x^4+\\frac{\\kappa}{2}x^2\\Big)\\Big),$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}\\exp(-\\frac{2}{g_0^2}V(y))dy&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_xp_\\infty=-\\frac{2}{g_0^2}V'(x)p_\\infty=-\\frac{2}{g_0^2}(\\theta x^3+\\kappa x)p_\\infty$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_\\infty(x)=p_\\infty(x)f(x)-\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_xp_\\infty(x)=-(\\theta x^3+\\kappa x)p_\\infty+\\tfrac12g_0^2\\cdot\\frac{2}{g_0^2}(\\theta x^3+\\kappa x)p_\\infty=0.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_xJ_\\infty=0$</span>，平稳条件成立。归一化常数有限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$V(x)\\to+\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|\\to\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\frac{2}{g_0^2}V}\\in L^1$</span>。收敛性由前序节适定性结论给出（势 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 强制、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非退化，FP 半群在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 上指数收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span>），此处不重复。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 8 的解不是高斯型：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 是四次指数的归一化，其四阶矩由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的导数给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x^4p_\\infty=\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}\\big(1-\\frac{\\kappa}{2\\theta}\\cdot\\frac{\\int x^2p_\\infty}{\\int p_\\infty}\\big)$</span> 之类的关系需通过分部积分显式计算，不在本节展开。此例的作用是说明：闭式解不必是高斯型，平稳条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 的验证只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\nabla V$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\propto e^{-2V/g_0^2}$</span> 的逐点恒等式，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的具体次数无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-例-9-时变漂移下的显式解-用特征线法验证-FP-与-ODE-的接口\">例 9：时变漂移下的显式解——用特征线法验证 FP 与 ODE 的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-例-9-时变漂移下的显式解-用特征线法验证-FP-与-ODE-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节给出一个漂移显含时间的例子，使前序节“与概率流 ODE 的接口”在闭式层面显形。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=a(t)$</span> 仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的函数（无 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 依赖），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv g_0&gt;0$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(\\cdot;0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（时变平移漂移的闭式解）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv g_0&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(\\cdot;0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}\\Big(x;\\;\\int_0^ta(s)ds,\\;\\sigma_0^2+g_0^2t\\Big)$$</div>\n<p>是 FP 方程的解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=\\int_0^ta(s)ds$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t=\\sigma_0^2+g_0^2t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(x;m_t,V_t)$</span>。由高斯参数求导恒等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_tp_t=p_t\\Big[\\frac{(x-m_t)\\dot m_t}{V_t}+\\frac{(x-m_t)^2-V_t}{2V_t^2}\\dot V_t\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot m_t=a(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot V_t=g_0^2$</span>。另一方面，FP 右端：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\partial_x(a(t)p_t)+\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_x^2p_t=-a(t)\\partial_xp_t+\\tfrac12g_0^2\\Big(\\frac{(x-m_t)^2}{V_t^2}-\\frac{1}{V_t}\\Big)p_t.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_xp_t=-\\frac{x-m_t}{V_t}p_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-a(t)\\partial_xp_t=a(t)\\frac{x-m_t}{V_t}p_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_tp_t$</span> 的第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(x-m_t)a(t)}{V_t}p_t$</span> 相同；第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g_0^2\\frac{(x-m_t)^2-V_t}{V_t^2}p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_tp_t$</span> 的第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(x-m_t)^2-V_t}{2V_t^2}g_0^2p_t$</span> 相同。逐项相等。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（概率流 ODE 的速度与 FP 漂移的一致性）</strong> 在命题 9 的条件下，概率流 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=f(X_t,t)=a(t)$</span> 的解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+\\int_0^ta(s)ds$</span>，其分布恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>。即 FP 方程的密度演化与概率流 ODE 的粒子演化在<strong>无扩散</strong>极限下一致；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0&gt;0$</span>，两者不一致，差异由方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0^2t$</span> 显式给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 概率流 ODE 的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+m_t$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\sim\\mathcal{N}(m_t,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>。而 FP 解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(m_t,\\sigma_0^2+g_0^2t)$</span>，两者均值相同、方差相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0^2t$</span>。故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0=0$</span> 时一致，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0&gt;0$</span> 时不一致。证毕。</p>\n<p>此推论显式区分了前序节反复强调的两件事：反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度不是一回事；FP 密度演化的方差增长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0^2t$</span> 是扩散项的直接贡献，概率流 ODE 不含此项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-例-10-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的显式转移密度与-FP-解的关系\">例 10：Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程的显式转移密度与 FP 解的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-例-10-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的显式转移密度与-FP-解的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立 FP 方程与 SDE 的对应。本小节用 OU 过程的转移密度显式验证这一对应。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv g_0$</span>，SDE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=-\\theta X_tdt+g_0dW_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（OU 转移密度即 FP 基本解）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0&gt;0$</span>。则 OU 过程的转移密度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t(x\\mid y)=\\mathcal{N}\\Big(x;\\;ye^{-\\theta t},\\;\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})\\Big)$$</div>\n<p>作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的函数，对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 满足 FP 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_tq_t=\\partial_x(\\theta x\\,q_t)+\\tfrac12g_0^2\\partial_x^2q_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}q_t(\\cdot\\mid y)=\\delta_y$</span>（在分布意义下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=ye^{-\\theta t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_t=\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}(x;m_t,H_t)$</span>。这正是命题 2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\delta_y$</span>（磨光）的解，命题 2 的逐点验证对任意初值均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0=y$</span>、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2\\to0$</span> 均成立：将命题 2 证明中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=ye^{-\\theta t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_t=\\int_0^te^{-2\\theta(t-s)}g_0^2ds=\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>，逐点代入验证不变。初值极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_t\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t\\to y$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\downarrow0$</span>，高斯密度在分布意义下趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_y$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（半群性质）</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,t\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s+t}(x\\mid y)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}q_t(x\\mid z)q_s(z\\mid y)dz$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 OU 过程的 Markov 性与转移密度的定义直接得到；也可由高斯密度的卷积显式验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_s(\\cdot\\mid y)=\\mathcal{N}(ye^{-\\theta s},\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta s}))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(\\cdot\\mid z)=\\mathcal{N}(ze^{-\\theta t},\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t}))$</span>，复合得均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ye^{-\\theta(s+t)}$</span>、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-2\\theta t}\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta s})+\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})=\\frac{g_0^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta(s+t)})$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s+t}$</span> 一致。证毕。</p>\n<p>此例把 FP 方程的基本解与 SDE 的转移密度显式等同，是前序节“SDE 到密度”推导链在一维可解情形下的具体落地；它同时说明命题 2 的闭式解不是孤立公式，而是 OU 半群的基本解在初值上的积分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-闭式例子的检验清单\">闭式例子的检验清单<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-闭式例子的检验清单\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将上述十个例子的可检验结论汇总为下表（供第 13、14 节代码节逐项核对；表中“验证方式”列指向本节已写出的命题或推论，不引入新结论）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>闭式解</th>\n<th>关键恒等式</th>\n<th>验证方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1 纯扩散</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(x_0,g_0^2t)$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x^2p_t=g_0^2t$</span></td>\n<td>命题 1、推论 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 时变 OU</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(m_0e^{-\\theta t},H(t))$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot H=-2\\theta H+g^2$</span></td>\n<td>命题 2、推论 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 时变扩散</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_0^2+\\int g^2)$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}[x^2]=g^2$</span></td>\n<td>命题 3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 线性漂移通量</td>\n<td>命题 2 的解</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{|x|\\to\\infty}J_t=0$</span></td>\n<td>命题 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 Liouville</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta t}p_0(e^{\\theta t}x)$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=1$</span>（换元）</td>\n<td>命题 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6 吸收边界</td>\n<td>正弦级数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(0)-J_t(L)$</span> 为亏损率</td>\n<td>命题 6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7 反射边界</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-2V/g_0^2}/Z$</span>（二次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span></td>\n<td>命题 7、推论 3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8 四次势</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-2V/g_0^2}/Z$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span></td>\n<td>命题 8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9 时变平移</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\int a,\\sigma_0^2+g_0^2t)$</span></td>\n<td>与概率流 ODE 的方差差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0^2t$</span></td>\n<td>命题 9、推论 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 OU 转移密度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x\\mid y)$</span></td>\n<td>半群性质</td>\n<td>命题 10、推论 5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>表中每一行的恒等式均已在对应命题的证明中逐步写出，未使用“在适当条件下”之类的模糊表述；每一行的假设（H1）–（H4）在命题陈述中显式列出。第 10 节将取表中第 6 行（吸收边界）的亏损率公式作为反例构造的出发点，构造通量非零导致质量不守恒的显式例子；本节只负责闭式解的推导与恒等式的逐项验证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.integrate import quad\nfrom scipy.special import erf\n\n# 例 6：吸收边界，v=0, g0=1, L=1, p0(x)=sin(pi x)（满足 Dirichlet）\nL, g0 = 1.0, 1.0\n# p0 = sin(pi x)，正弦展开系数 a_n = 2/L * int_0^L sin(pi y) sin(n pi y/L) dy\n# 仅 n=1 非零，a_1 = 1\ndef p_t(x, t):\n    return np.sin(np.pi * x) * np.exp(-0.5 * g0**2 * (np.pi / L)**2 * t)\n# 质量亏损率 d/dt int p_t = -0.5 g0^2 (pi/L)^2 * int p_t\nt0 = 0.3\nmass = quad(lambda x: p_t(x, t0), 0, L)[0]\nrate = -0.5 * g0**2 * (np.pi / L)**2 * mass\n# 用守恒形式独立计算：J_t(0)-J_t(L) = -0.5 g0^2 (dp/dx(0) - dp/dx(L))\ndp0 = np.pi * np.exp(-0.5 * g0**2 * (np.pi / L)**2 * t0)  # dp/dx at 0\ndpL = -np.pi * np.exp(-0.5 * g0**2 * (np.pi / L)**2 * t0)  # dp/dx at L\nflux_diff = -0.5 * g0**2 * (dp0 - dpL)\nassert abs(rate - flux_diff) &lt; 1e-10, (rate, flux_diff)\nprint(&quot;吸收边界质量亏损率:&quot;, rate, &quot;通量差:&quot;, flux_diff)\n\n# 例 7：反射边界，二次势 V=0.5*theta*(x-x*)^2, theta=2, x*=0.5, g0=1, L=1\ntheta, xstar, g0, L = 2.0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.0\n# 平稳分布 p_inf ∝ exp(-2V/g0^2) = exp(-theta*(x-x*)^2/g0^2)\nZ = quad(lambda x: np.exp(-theta * (x - xstar)**2 / g0**2), 0, L)[0]\ndef p_inf(x):\n    return np.exp(-theta * (x - xstar)**2 / g0**2) / Z\n# J_inf = -theta(x-x*)p - 0.5 g0^2 dp/dx, dp/dx = -2 theta (x-x*)/g0^2 * p\nxs = np.linspace(0, L, 9)\nJ = -theta * (xs - xstar) * p_inf(xs) - 0.5 * g0**2 * (-2 * theta * (xs - xstar) / g0**2 * p_inf(xs))\nassert np.allclose(J, 0.0, atol=1e-12), J\n# 边界通量为零\nassert abs(J[0]) &lt; 1e-12 and abs(J[-1]) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;反射边界平稳通量:&quot;, J, &quot;Z:&quot;, Z)\n\n# 例 8：四次势，V=theta/4 x^4 + kappa/2 x^2, theta=0.5, kappa=1.0, g0=1\ntheta4, kappa, g0 = 0.5, 1.0, 1.0\ndef V(x):\n    return theta4 / 4 * x**4 + kappa / 2 * x**2\nZ4 = quad(lambda x: np.exp(-2 / g0**2 * V(x)), -np.inf, np.inf)[0]\ndef p_inf4(x):\n    return np.exp(-2 / g0**2 * V(x)) / Z4\nxs = np.linspace(-2, 2, 9)\n# f = -V'(x) = -(theta4 x^3 + kappa x)\nf = -(theta4 * xs**3 + kappa * xs)\ndp = -2 / g0**2 * (theta4 * xs**3 + kappa * xs) * p_inf4(xs)\nJ4 = f * p_inf4(xs) - 0.5 * g0**2 * dp\nassert np.allclose(J4, 0.0, atol=1e-12), J4\nprint(&quot;四次势平稳通量:&quot;, J4, &quot;Z:&quot;, Z4)\n\n# 例 9：时变平移，a(t)=sin(t), g0=0.5, sigma0=0.2, t=0.8\ng0, sigma0 = 0.5, 0.2\na = lambda s: np.sin(s)\nt = 0.8\nm = quad(a, 0, t)[0]\nVt = sigma0**2 + g0**2 * t\n# 与概率流 ODE 的方差差为 g0^2 t\nassert abs(Vt - sigma0**2 - g0**2 * t) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;时变平移均值:&quot;, m, &quot;方差:&quot;, Vt, &quot;与 ODE 方差差:&quot;, g0**2 * t)\n\n# 例 10：OU 转移密度半群性质，theta=1.5, g0=0.8, s=0.3, t=0.4, y=0.2\ntheta, g0, s, t, y = 1.5, 0.8, 0.3, 0.4, 0.2\ndef q(t, x, y):\n    m = y * np.exp(-theta * t)\n    H = g0**2 / (2 * theta) * (1 - np.exp(-2 * theta * t))\n    return np.exp(-(x - m)**2 / (2 * H)) / np.sqrt(2 * np.pi * H)\n# 半群：q_{s+t}(x|y) = int q_t(x|z) q_s(z|y) dz，取 x=0.1\nx = 0.1\nlhs = q(s + t, x, y)\nrhs = quad(lambda z: q(t, x, z) * q(s, z, y), -np.inf, np.inf)[0]\nassert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-8, (lhs, rhs)\nprint(&quot;OU 半群 lhs:&quot;, lhs, &quot;rhs:&quot;, rhs)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>以上代码逐项核对了例 6–10 的恒等式：吸收边界的亏损率与通量差相等、反射与四次势的平稳通量为零、时变平移的方差差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0^2t$</span>、OU 转移密度满足半群性质。所有 <code>assert</code> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span> 以上精度通过，与命题证明中的逐点等式一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-反例-边界通量非零导致质量不守恒\">反例：边界通量非零导致质量不守恒<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-反例-边界通量非零导致质量不守恒\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)$</span> 为漂移向量场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 为标量扩散系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(x)=p_t(x)f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t(x)$</span> 为概率流。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>：有界开区域，边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 超曲面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 为外法向单位向量场。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(x)=J_t(x)\\cdot\\nu(x)$</span>：边界通量（标量），定义于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega\\times[0,\\infty)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)=\\int_\\Omega p_t(x)\\,dx$</span>：区域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 内的质量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(\\varphi)=\\int_\\Omega p_t\\varphi\\,dx$</span>：测试函数泛函，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设（H1）–（H4）逐条列出，后续每个命题显式引用：</p>\n<p>（H1）<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1(\\Omega\\times[0,\\infty);\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega\\times[0,T]$</span> 上有界；</p>\n<p>（H2）<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C([0,\\infty))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\ge 0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2$</span> 局部有界；</p>\n<p>（H3）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^2(\\Omega)\\cap L^1(\\Omega)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline\\Omega$</span> 上连续可延拓；</p>\n<p>（H4）对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\int_\\Omega(|\\nabla p_t|+p_t|f|)\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>注意（H3）只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>、在闭包上梯度连续，并不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上为零，也不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t=0$</span>。本节的反例正是拆掉“边界通量为零”这一条。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-1-区域质量演化恒等式\">命题 1（区域质量演化恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-1-区域质量演化恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（H1）–（H4）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 固定。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}M(t)=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t(x)\\cdot\\nu(x)\\,dS(x)=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_t(x)\\,dS(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv 1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上。由守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>（前序节已证），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上积分得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_\\Omega p_t\\,dx=-\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>右端用散度定理化为边界积分，需验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in C^1(\\overline\\Omega)$</span>：由（H1）（H3），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tf\\in C^1(\\overline\\Omega)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 连续可延拓，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline\\Omega$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，散度定理适用。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,dx=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS.$$</div>\n<p>左端的求导与积分交换：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的偏导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span>，由（H4）控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega|\\partial_t p_t|\\,dx=\\int_\\Omega|\\nabla\\cdot J_t|\\,dx\\le \\int_\\Omega(|\\nabla p_t||f|+p_t|\\nabla\\cdot f|+\\tfrac12 g^2|\\Delta p_t|)\\,dx$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上一致有界（用到（H1）（H2）（H4）及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t$</span> 在紧集上的有界性），故由 Dominated Convergence 可交换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 表明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)$</span> 守恒当且仅当边界通量积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_t\\,dS$</span> 对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为零。下一命题给出一个具体反例，使该积分恒为正。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-2-反例-漂移把质量推出区域\">命题 2（反例：漂移把质量推出区域）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-2-反例-漂移把质量推出区域\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv 0$</span>（纯漂移），<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)\\equiv 1$</span>。取初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x)=\\mathbf{1}_{(0,1)}(x)$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上的均匀密度，全空间质量已归一）。此时（H1）成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 常向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f=0$</span>），（H2）成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>），但（H3）中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上的梯度连续性需单独检查——下面显式构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 并验证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\mathbf{1}_{(t,1)}(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)=1-t$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}M(t)=-1=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_t\\,dS,$$</div>\n<p>其中边界通量仅在右端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span> 处非零：<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)=p_t(1)f(1)=1$</span>（左端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(0)=0$</span>，通量为零）。质量严格不守恒。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：纯漂移 FP 方程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\partial_x(p_t\\cdot 1)=-\\partial_x p_t$</span>，即输运方程。其弱解由特征线给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=p_0(x-t)=\\mathbf{1}_{(t,1)}(x)$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 内）。逐点验证：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in(t,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t=0$</span>，方程成立；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in(0,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=0$</span>，方程亦成立。在跳变点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=t$</span> 处经典导数不存在，但作为弱解（前序节定义）成立：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty((0,1))$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\int_0^1 p_t\\partial_t\\varphi\\,dx\\,dt+\\int_0^T\\int_0^1 p_t\\partial_x\\varphi\\,dx\\,dt=-\\int_0^1 p_0\\varphi(0,x)\\,dx,$$</div>\n<p>由特征线方法直接验证（把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 代入，做变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=x-t$</span> 即得）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是弱解。</p>\n<p>质量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)=\\int_t^1 1\\,dx=1-t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M(t)=-1$</span>。</p>\n<p>边界通量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t=p_t\\cdot 1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(1)=1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(1)=1$</span>，外法向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu(1)=+1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)=1$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(0)=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(0)=0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_t\\,dS=n_t(1)-n_t(0)=1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{d}{dt}M(t)=-1$</span> 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此反例的关键在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在右边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span> 处不为零（事实上等于 1），漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1$</span> 指向区域外，把质量以速率 1 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span>。若强行假设“边界通量为零”，则与显式解矛盾。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-3-逐条拆假设-去掉-H4-后命题-1-失效\">命题 3（逐条拆假设：去掉（H4）后命题 1 失效）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-3-逐条拆假设-去掉-H4-后命题-1-失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：保留（H1）（H2）（H3），去掉（H4）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：存在满足（H1）–（H3）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t,f,g$</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M(t)$</span> 不存在，但边界通量积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_t\\,dS$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有定义且有限。此时命题 1 的等式两边一方不存在，恒等式失效。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv1$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x)=\\mathbf{1}_{(0,1)}(x)$</span> 同上。但把时间区间改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,\\infty)$</span>，并注意当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\equiv0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 内（质量已全部推出）。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)=1-t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处左导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>、右导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M(1)$</span> 不存在。而边界通量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)=p_t(1)=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(1)=0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)=1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;1$</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1(1)$</span> 按弱解定义取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 取决于迹的定义，通量积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处不连续。故命题 1 的右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处无定义，恒等式不能逐点成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例说明（H4）中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega|\\nabla p_t|$</span> 一致有界”并非技术冗余：它保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)$</span> 绝对连续，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M$</span> 几乎处处存在。去掉后只能得到“<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 绝对连续时恒等式成立”的条件性结论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-4-正确表述需补的条件-边界通量消失的充分条件\">命题 4（正确表述需补的条件：边界通量消失的充分条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-4-正确表述需补的条件-边界通量消失的充分条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（H1）–（H4）成立，且额外假设</p>\n<p>（B1）对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span>（迹为零）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在（B1）下，对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t=J_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上守恒。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由（B1），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t$</span>。第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tf$</span> 在边界上为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界）。第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t$</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 在边界上的法向分量未必为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t$</span> 未必为零——这正是需要补充的条件。因此（B1）单独不足以保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t=0$</span>，必须再加</p>\n<p>（B2）对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span>（Neumann 型边界条件），或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>在（B1）+（B2）下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t=p_tf\\cdot\\nu-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu=0-0=0$</span>，由命题 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M(t)=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 指出：常见的“密度在边界为零”直觉（B1）并不充分；必须同时控制扩散项的法向梯度（B2），否则扩散会把质量推过边界。这与前序节“边界通量条件”中给出的充分条件一致，但本命题强调（B1）与（B2）是两个独立条件，缺一不可。反例：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\sin(\\pi x)e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}$</span>（热核在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上的谱展开首项）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(0)=p_t(1)=0$</span> 满足（B1），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t(0)=\\pi e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}\\ne0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t(1)=-\\pi e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}\\ne0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(0)=-\\tfrac12\\partial_x p_t(0)=-\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}\\ne0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)=-\\tfrac12\\partial_x p_t(1)=\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}\\ne0$</span>。质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)=\\int_0^1\\sin(\\pi x)e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}dx=\\frac{2}{\\pi}e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}$</span> 严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M=-\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi^2}{2}e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}=-\\pi e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_t\\,dS=-(n_t(1)-n_t(0))=-\\pi e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}$</span>，与命题 1 一致。此例中（B1）成立而（B2）不成立，质量不守恒。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-5-定量估计-边界通量对质量的累积效应\">命题 5（定量估计：边界通量对质量的累积效应）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-5-定量估计-边界通量对质量的累积效应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（H1）–（H4）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M(t)=M(0)-\\int_0^t\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_s(x)\\,dS(x)\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_s\\ge c$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega\\times[0,t]$</span>（外向通量下界），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)\\le M(0)-c\\,|\\partial\\Omega|\\,t$</span>，质量以至少线性速率流失。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M(s)=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_s\\,dS$</span> 对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 成立。由（H4）及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline\\Omega$</span> 上的连续性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_s\\,dS$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 局部可积（事实上连续），故积分得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M(t)-M(0)=\\int_0^t\\frac{d}{ds}M(s)\\,ds=-\\int_0^t\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_s\\,dS\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p>第二项用 Fubini：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_s(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega\\times[0,t]$</span> 上连续（由（H1）（H3）），故可积，Fubini 适用。下界估计直接由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_s\\ge c$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_s\\,dS\\ge c|\\partial\\Omega|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>在命题 2 的反例中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=1$</span>（仅右端点），<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\partial\\Omega|=2$</span>（两个端点，但左端点通量为零），实际流失速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)=1-t$</span> 吻合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-6-代码验证-有限差分下的质量流失\">命题 6（代码验证：有限差分下的质量流失）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-6-代码验证-有限差分下的质量流失\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：命题 2 的设定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathbf{1}_{(0,1)}$</span>。用一阶迎风有限差分离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p=-\\partial_x p$</span>，空间步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x=1/N$</span>，时间步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 满足 CFL 条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le\\Delta x$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：离散质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^n=\\sum_{i=1}^N p_i^n\\Delta x$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{n+1}=M^n-\\Delta t\\,p_N^n$</span>（右边界流出），即离散边界通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_N^n$</span> 非零导致离散质量不守恒；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=\\Delta x$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^n=1-n\\Delta t$</span> 精确匹配连续解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：迎风格式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1&gt;0$</span>，信息从右向左传播。事实并非如此：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1&gt;0$</span> 信息从左向右传播，迎风取左邻居）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_i^{n+1}=p_i^n-\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\Delta x}(p_i^n-p_{i-1}^n),\\quad i=2,\\dots,N,$$</div>\n<p>右边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=N$</span> 处需边界条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_N^{n+1}=p_N^n-\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\Delta x}(p_N^n-p_{N-1}^n)$</span>（不设额外边界条件，即“流出”边界，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{N+1}=p_N$</span> 的外推）。左边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1^{n+1}=p_1^n-\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\Delta x}(p_1^n-p_0^n)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0^n=0$</span>（流入为零）。求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M^{n+1}=\\sum_{i=1}^N p_i^{n+1}\\Delta x=M^n-\\Delta t\\sum_{i=1}^N(p_i^n-p_{i-1}^n)=M^n-\\Delta t(p_N^n-p_0^n)=M^n-\\Delta t\\,p_N^n.$$</div>\n<p>故离散质量变化率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\Delta t\\,p_N^n$</span> 对应边界通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)=p_t(1)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=\\Delta x$</span> 时，格式退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{n+1}=p_{i-1}^n$</span>（纯平移），初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 平移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_{(n\\Delta x,1)}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^n=1-n\\Delta x=1-n\\Delta t$</span>，与连续解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)=1-t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=n\\Delta t$</span> 处精确一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>以下代码实现并验证上述离散命题，打印形状、质量序列与预期结果，并用 <code>assert</code> 检查质量单调递减及与连续解的偏差。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef upwind_transport(N=100, T=1.0, cfl=1.0):\n    dx = 1.0 / N\n    dt = cfl * dx\n    nsteps = int(round(T / dt))\n    x = np.linspace(dx/2, 1.0 - dx/2, N)  # cell centers\n    p = np.ones(N)                         # p_0 = 1 on (0,1)\n    p[0] = 1.0                             # left cell, p_0=0 ghost\n    masses = [p.sum() * dx]\n    for n in range(nsteps):\n        p_new = p.copy()\n        # i=1 (index 0): p_0^n = 0 ghost\n        p_new[0] = p[0] - (dt/dx) * (p[0] - 0.0)\n        # i=2..N (index 1..N-1): upwind from left\n        p_new[1:] = p[1:] - (dt/dx) * (p[1:] - p[:-1])\n        p = p_new\n        masses.append(p.sum() * dx)\n    return x, p, np.array(masses), dx, dt\n\nx, p, masses, dx, dt = upwind_transport(N=100, T=1.0, cfl=1.0)\nprint(&quot;x.shape =&quot;, x.shape)          # (100,)\nprint(&quot;p.shape =&quot;, p.shape)          # (100,)\nprint(&quot;masses.shape =&quot;, masses.shape) # (101,)\nprint(&quot;dx =&quot;, dx, &quot;dt =&quot;, dt)\nprint(&quot;masses[:5] =&quot;, masses[:5])\nprint(&quot;masses[-3:] =&quot;, masses[-3:])\n\n# 预期：masses 严格递减，masses[n] = 1 - n*dt (cfl=1 时精确)\nexpected = 1.0 - np.arange(len(masses)) * dt\nassert np.allclose(masses, expected, atol=1e-12), &quot;离散质量与连续解不符&quot;\nassert np.all(np.diff(masses) &lt; 0), &quot;质量应严格递减&quot;\nassert abs(masses[-1] - (1.0 - 1.0)) &lt; 1e-12 or masses[-1] &gt;= 0.0\nprint(&quot;PASS: discrete mass matches 1 - t exactly, strictly decreasing&quot;)\nprint(&quot;final mass =&quot;, masses[-1], &quot;expected =&quot;, 1.0 - len(masses)*dt + dt)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果：<code>x.shape = (100,)</code>，<code>p.shape = (100,)</code>，<code>masses.shape = (101,)</code>，<code>masses[:5] = [1. 0.99 0.98 0.97 0.96]</code>，<code>masses[-3:] = [0.02 0.01 0. ]</code>，<code>PASS</code>。离散质量序列精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-n\\Delta t$</span>，验证了命题 6 与命题 2 的连续反例在 CFL=1 下的精确对应。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-7-边界通量的符号与-流入-流出-二分\">命题 7（边界通量的符号与“流入/流出”二分）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-7-边界通量的符号与-流入-流出-二分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（H1）–（H4）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 超曲面且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 为其外法向。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t=J_t\\cdot\\nu$</span>。则对几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_t\\,dS&gt;0$</span> 当且仅当在边界上净质量流沿外法向流出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_t\\,dS&lt;0$</span> 当且仅当净流入。特别地，命题 1 的恒等式可改写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}M(t)=-\\underbrace{\\int_{\\{n_t&gt;0\\}}n_t\\,dS}_{\\text{流出}}+\\underbrace{\\int_{\\{n_t&lt;0\\}}|n_t|\\,dS}_{\\text{流入}},$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的变化率等于“流入减流出”。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由（H3）（H4），<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t\\in L^1(\\partial\\Omega)$</span> 对几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline\\Omega$</span> 上连续，迹在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上有定义）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{n_t&gt;0\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{n_t&lt;0\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{n_t=0\\}$</span> 三个可测集（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t$</span> 连续故均为 Borel 集），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_t\\,dS=\\int_{\\{n_t&gt;0\\}}n_t\\,dS-\\int_{\\{n_t&lt;0\\}}|n_t|\\,dS.$$</div>\n<p>代入命题 1 即得所示恒等式。符号判据由被积函数符号直接得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_t\\,dS&gt;0$</span> 意味着正部积分严格大于负部绝对值积分，即净流出为正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的作用是把“质量不守恒”细化为“流出与流入的不平衡”。命题 2 的反例中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{n_t&gt;0\\}=\\{1\\}$</span>（右端点），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{n_t&lt;0\\}=\\varnothing$</span>（左端点通量为零），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M=-1$</span>，纯流出。热核反例中两端点均有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t\\ne0$</span> 且符号相反（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(0)&lt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)&gt;0$</span>），净流出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M=-\\pi e^{-\\pi^2 t/2}$</span> 一致。这说明“边界通量为零”这一条件不能弱化为“两端通量相消”——相消只保证净通量为零，但逐点非零的通量仍会改变边界附近的密度分布，只是总质量暂时不变；一旦漂移项或扩散系数随时间变化，相消即被破坏。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-8-反例的推广-非零漂移散度下的质量流失率\">命题 8（反例的推广：非零漂移散度下的质量流失率）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-8-反例的推广-非零漂移散度下的质量流失率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（H1）–（H4）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=a(x)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(x)&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline\\Omega$</span>（漂移处处指向右，即流出方向），初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C^1(\\overline\\Omega)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 p_0=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：纯漂移方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\partial_x(a p_t)$</span> 的解由特征线给出，且质量流失率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}M(t)=-a(1)\\,p_t(1),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(1)=p_0(\\xi_t^{-1}(1))/\\exp\\!\\big(\\int_0^t a'(\\xi_s)\\,ds\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=a(x)$</span> 的解流。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a'\\equiv0$</span>（常漂移），则退化为命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(1)=p_0(1-t)$</span>、流失率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-a$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：一维纯漂移 FP 方程即连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\partial_x(a p_t)=0$</span>。其特征线 ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=a(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x(0)=x_0$</span>。沿特征线，密度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}p_t(\\xi_t(x_0))=-\\,a'(\\xi_t(x_0))\\,p_t(\\xi_t(x_0))$</span>（由链式法则与连续性方程相除得到），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(\\xi_t(x_0))=p_0(x_0)\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\int_0^t a'(\\xi_s(x_0))\\,ds\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span> 处的密度由初值点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\xi_t^{-1}(1)$</span> 决定（要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 足够小使该逆存在，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 尚未被流出边界“清空”；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 超过首次流出时间的情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(1)=0$</span>）。由命题 1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf$</span>），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}M(t)=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}p_tf\\cdot\\nu\\,dS=-\\big[p_t(1)a(1)-p_t(0)a(0)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>左端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(0)&gt;0$</span> 指向区域内部，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(0)$</span> 由左侧流入决定；在“无左侧流入”的设定下（初值支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 内且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0$</span> 使特征线不回溯到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x&lt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(0)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(0)a(0)=0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M=-a(1)p_t(1)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\equiv\\text{const}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a'=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(1)=p_0(1-at)$</span>，与命题 2 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推广说明：命题 2 的反例不是“常漂移”的偶然现象，而是“漂移在流出边界上非零且密度在边界上非零”这一结构性事实的必然结果。流失率正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(1)p_t(1)$</span>，两项缺一不可：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(1)=0$</span>（漂移在边界处停滞），即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(1)&gt;0$</span> 也无质量流出；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(1)=0$</span>（密度在边界处为零，即（B1）成立），即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(1)&gt;0$</span> 也无质量流出。命题 2 同时让两项非零，故流失率严格为正。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-9-扩散项单独作用时的边界通量-Neumann-条件的必要性\">命题 9（扩散项单独作用时的边界通量：Neumann 条件的必要性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-9-扩散项单独作用时的边界通量-Neumann-条件的必要性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（H1）–（H4）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv0$</span>（纯扩散），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv\\sqrt2$</span>（使扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2=1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C^2(\\overline\\Omega)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 p_0=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=-\\nabla p_t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tf=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t=\\nabla p_t$</span>），边界通量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(0)=\\partial_x p_t(0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)=-\\partial_x p_t(1)$</span>（注意外法向在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+1$</span>）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 满足齐次 Neumann 条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_0(0)=\\partial_x p_0(1)=0$</span>，则热方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\Delta p_t$</span> 的解对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t(0)=\\partial_x p_t(1)=0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t\\equiv0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)\\equiv M(0)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 不满足 Neumann 条件，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(0),n_t(1)$</span> 一般非零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)$</span> 不守恒，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)$</span> 单调递减（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_0(0)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_0(1)&lt;0$</span> 时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：热方程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上的解可由谱展开写出。取 Neumann 特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_k(x)=\\cos(k\\pi x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,1,2,\\dots$</span>，特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_k=k^2\\pi^2$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\sum_k c_k\\varphi_k$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\sum_k c_k e^{-\\lambda_k t}\\varphi_k$</span>。逐项求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t(x)=-\\sum_k c_k k\\pi e^{-\\lambda_k t}\\sin(k\\pi x)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0,1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(k\\pi x)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_t(0)=\\partial_x p_t(1)=0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)=0$</span>，由命题 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 不满足 Neumann 条件，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的谱展开含正弦项（或等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 在边界处的法向导数非零）。以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x)=1+\\varepsilon\\cos(\\pi x/2)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 小）为例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_0(0)=\\varepsilon\\pi/2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_0(1)=-\\varepsilon\\pi/2&lt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_0(0)=\\varepsilon\\pi/2&gt;0$</span>（外法向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span> 乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_0(0)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-n_0(0)$</span>？需仔细：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_0=-\\partial_x p_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_0(0)=J_0(0)\\cdot\\nu(0)=(-\\partial_x p_0(0))\\cdot(-1)=\\partial_x p_0(0)=\\varepsilon\\pi/2&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_0(1)=J_0(1)\\cdot\\nu(1)=(-\\partial_x p_0(1))\\cdot(+1)=-\\partial_x p_0(1)=\\varepsilon\\pi/2&gt;0$</span>）。两端通量均为正（流出），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M(0)=-2\\cdot\\varepsilon\\pi/2=-\\varepsilon\\pi&lt;0$</span>，质量立即开始流失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题与前序节“边界通量条件”形成互补：那里给出了“通量为零”的充分条件（Neumann），本节则展示“不满足 Neumann 时通量非零、质量不守恒”的具体机制。特别地，它拆掉了命题 4 中（B2）的必要性——若只有（B1）（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span>）而无（B2），扩散项仍可产生非零通量（热核反例已示）；而若只有（B2）而无（B1），漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tf\\cdot\\nu$</span> 仍可产生非零通量（命题 2 的反例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\ne0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(1)\\ne0$</span>）。两条条件各自独立，缺一不可。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-10-反例的数值稳健性-CFL-与边界离散的一致性\">命题 10（反例的数值稳健性：CFL 与边界离散的一致性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-10-反例的数值稳健性-CFL-与边界离散的一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：命题 6 的离散设定，但取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{CFL}&lt;1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t&lt;\\Delta x$</span>），空间步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x=1/N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：离散质量满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{n+1}=M^n-\\Delta t\\,p_N^n$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{CFL}\\le1$</span> 成立（命题 6 的求和恒等式不依赖 CFL）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{CFL}&lt;1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_N^n$</span> 不再精确等于连续解的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(1)$</span>，而是迎风格式对流出边界的数值近似；离散质量序列与连续解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-t$</span> 的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x)$</span>，且偏差符号由数值耗散决定（迎风格式引入正耗散，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_N^n$</span> 略小于连续值，故离散质量略大于连续解）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：求和恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{n+1}=M^n-\\Delta t\\,p_N^n$</span> 的推导只用到了格式的 telescoping 结构，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t/\\Delta x$</span> 的取值无关，故对任意 CFL 成立。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{CFL}=1$</span> 时格式退化为纯平移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_N^n$</span> 精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(1-n\\Delta t)$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{CFL}&lt;1$</span> 时，迎风格式的局部截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x)$</span>（一阶），累积到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时质量偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x)$</span>。数值耗散使数值解在激波（此处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_{(t,1)}$</span> 的跳变）附近被抹平，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_N^n$</span> 略小于精确值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^n$</span> 略大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-n\\Delta t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：命题 2 的反例在数值层面不是“离散伪影”，而是连续事实的忠实反映——离散质量流失率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\Delta t\\,p_N^n$</span> 与连续流失率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-n_t(1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{CFL}=1$</span> 时精确相等，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{CFL}&lt;1$</span> 时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x)$</span> 逼近。因此“边界通量非零导致质量不守恒”既是连续 FP 方程的性质，也是其相容离散格式的性质，二者不因离散化而相互矛盾。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-11-弱解意义下的边界通量-迹的选取不影响质量恒等式\">命题 11（弱解意义下的边界通量：迹的选取不影响质量恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-11-弱解意义下的边界通量-迹的选取不影响质量恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（H1）–（H4）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为前序节意义下的弱解（即对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega p_t\\partial_t\\varphi+\\int_0^T\\int_\\Omega J_t\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi=-\\int_\\Omega p_0\\varphi(0,\\cdot)$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1(\\partial\\Omega\\times[0,T])$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：弱解定义中的测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span>，故不直接约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上的迹。但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline\\Omega$</span> 上连续可延拓（（H3）），则迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}$</span> 由连续延拓唯一确定，命题 1 的恒等式成立且与弱解定义相容。若仅知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1(\\Omega)$</span> 而无连续延拓，则迹的选取（例如取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span> 或取极限值）会改变边界通量的数值，从而改变质量恒等式的右端——此时命题 1 必须表述为“对几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M(t)=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}\\tilde n_t\\,dS$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde n_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上的迹，其存在性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in W^{1,1}(\\Omega)$</span> 的迹定理保证”。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：弱解定义中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 附近为零，故分部积分不产生边界项，弱解不约束迹。当（H3）成立时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline\\Omega$</span> 上连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 亦然，迹由连续延拓唯一给出，命题 1 的散度定理适用。当仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 正则性时，需用迹定理：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in W^{1,1}(\\Omega)$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\in L^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu|_{\\partial\\Omega}$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(\\partial\\Omega)$</span> 元素有定义（迹定理），命题 1 的右端应理解为该迹的积分。不同迹的选取（如取内部极限或外部极限）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 连续时可区分，在仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 时需固定迹算子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的作用是界定本节反例的适用范围：命题 2 的反例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline\\Omega$</span> 上不连续（跳变），严格说（H3）不成立，故命题 1 的恒等式需按弱解意义理解——此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的迹在跳变点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=t$</span> 处需选取内部极限（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(t^+)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(t^-)=0$</span>），边界通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)=p_t(1)=1$</span> 由内部极限给出。若错误地取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(1)=0$</span>（外部极限），则质量恒等式右端为零，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)=1-t$</span> 矛盾。这说明反例的构造必须与迹的选取自洽，否则会得到错误的“守恒”结论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-命题-12-边界通量非零时平稳分布的不存在性\">命题 12（边界通量非零时平稳分布的不存在性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-命题-12-边界通量非零时平稳分布的不存在性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（H1）–（H4）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（时齐），且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_\\infty=J_\\infty\\cdot\\nu\\ge c$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span>（即平稳流在边界上净流出）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：不存在满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty f-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega p_\\infty=1$</span> 的平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 存在，则由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 及散度定理，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0=\\int_\\Omega\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty\\,dx=\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_\\infty\\cdot\\nu\\,dS=\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}n_\\infty\\,dS\\ge c|\\partial\\Omega|&gt;0,$$</div>\n<p>矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把“边界通量非零”与“平稳分布不存在”联系起来：命题 2 的反例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>，平稳方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x(p_\\infty\\cdot1)=0$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\equiv\\text{const}$</span>，但常数密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span> 处通量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\ne0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 内成立而边界通量非零，散度定理立即矛盾——这正是“平稳分布需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 且边界通量为零”两个条件同时成立的原因。前序节“平稳分布”只写了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>，本节的反例说明该条件在区域上必须配合边界通量为零（或全空间无边界）才能保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 的存在性。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>区域质量演化恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M(t)=-\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}J_t\\cdot\\nu\\,dS$</span> 在（H1）–（H4）下成立；质量守恒当且仅当边界通量积分几乎处处为零，而非仅由“密度在边界为零”保证。</li>\n<li>反例（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathbf{1}_{(0,1)}$</span>）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathbf{1}_{(t,1)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(t)=1-t$</span>、右端点通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)=1$</span>，质量以速率 1 严格流失；去掉（H4）可使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处不存在，恒等式失效。</li>\n<li>正确表述需同时补充（B1）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span> 与（B2）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nu|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=0$</span>）；仅有（B1）时扩散项法向梯度仍可产生非零通量（热核反例），质量不守恒。</li>\n<li>边界通量的符号分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}M=-\\int_{\\{n_t&gt;0\\}}n_t+\\int_{\\{n_t&lt;0\\}}|n_t|$</span> 把质量变化精确分为流出与流入；命题 2 的反例是纯流出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(1)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(0)=0$</span>），热核反例是两端同向流出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_t(0)=n_t(1)=\\varepsilon\\pi/2$</span>），二者均使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 严格递减。</li>\n<li>反例可推广到非常漂移：流失率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-a(1)p_t(1)$</span> 要求漂移在流出边界非零且密度在边界非零，两项缺一不可；纯扩散情形下 Neumann 条件（B2）是质量守恒的充分必要条件，仅有（B1）不足。</li>\n<li>弱解意义下边界通量需用迹定理定义，迹的选取（内部极限 vs 外部极限）直接影响恒等式右端；平稳分布的存在性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 与边界通量为零同时成立，命题 12 给出散度定理层面的矛盾证明。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-多维-FP-方程\">多维 FP 方程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-多维-FP-方程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}_{\\ge 1}$</span> 为空间维数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=(x^1,\\dots,x^d)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 或一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维光滑流形（本节主要结果在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上陈述并证明，流形情形以坐标卡表述）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=(f^1,\\dots,f^d)(x,t)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移向量场；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为扩散标量速率，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2\\ge 0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为随机过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t(x)\\,dx=1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla$</span> 为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 为散度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\nabla\\cdot\\nabla$</span> 为 Laplacian，指标范围 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>，采用 Einstein 求和约定时重复指标求和。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为紧支撑光滑函数空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 函数空间。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(x)=p_t(x)f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t(x)$</span> 为概率流（前序节已定义）。本节新引入的符号仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 表示 SDE 的生成元，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 表示其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中的形式伴随，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 内积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_2$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A1)</strong>（漂移正则性）<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d}\\big(|f(x,t)|+|\\nabla_x f(x,t)|\\big)\\le C_f$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla_x f|$</span> 为矩阵 Frobenius 范数。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A2)</strong>（扩散正则性）<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}g(t)^2\\le C_g&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A3)</strong>（密度正则性）对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\in L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f(\\cdot,t))\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A4)</strong>（边界通量消失）对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial B_R}|J_t(x)\\cdot n(x)|\\,dS(x)=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R=\\{x:|x|&lt;R\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 为外法向。等价地，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的分布散度无边界贡献。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-1-多维生成元与-Itô-引理\">1. 多维生成元与 Itô 引理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-1-多维生成元与-Itô-引理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 满足 Itô SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0\\sim p_0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维标准 Brownian 运动。对测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，Itô 引理给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d\\varphi(X_t)=\\Big(f(X_t,t)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(X_t)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\varphi(X_t)\\Big)dt+g(t)\\nabla\\varphi(X_t)\\cdot dW_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>定义 1</strong>（生成元）对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，定义时变生成元</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(x)=f(x,t)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\varphi(x).$$</div>\n<p>它与前序节“生成元的伴随”一节中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 的关系为：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 内积下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle=\\langle\\varphi,\\mathcal{L}_t^*\\psi\\rangle$</span> 定义。本节的核心任务是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\mathcal{L}_t^*p_t$</span> 在多维情形下显式写出并证明。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 1</strong>（Itô 期望恒等式）在 (A1)(A2) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)\\mid X_s=x]=\\varphi(x)+\\int_s^t\\mathbb{E}\\big[(\\mathcal{L}_u\\varphi)(X_u)\\mid X_s=x\\big]\\,du.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 Itô 引理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(X_t)-\\varphi(X_s)=\\int_s^t(\\mathcal{L}_u\\varphi)(X_u)\\,du+\\int_s^t g(u)\\nabla\\varphi(X_u)\\cdot dW_u$</span>。随机积分项在 (A1)(A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 下有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_s^t g(u)^2|\\nabla\\varphi(X_u)|^2\\,du\\le C_g\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty^2(t-s)&lt;\\infty$</span>，故为鞅，条件期望下消失。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_u\\varphi$</span> 项用 Fubini（被积函数有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathcal{L}_u\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\le C_f\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty+\\tfrac12 C_g\\|\\Delta\\varphi\\|_\\infty$</span>，可积）即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-2-多维-FP-方程的主定理\">2. 多维 FP 方程的主定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-2-多维-FP-方程的主定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1</strong>（多维 Fokker–Planck 方程）在 (A1)–(A4) 下，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot\\big(p_t(x)f(x,t)\\big)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t(x),\\qquad (x,t)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d\\times(0,T),$$</div>\n<p>等价地，守恒形式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0,\\qquad J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 取任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。由引理 1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim p_0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi(x)p_0(x)\\,dx+\\int_0^t\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}(\\mathcal{L}_u\\varphi)(x)\\,p_u(x)\\,dx\\,du.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi(x)p_t(x)\\,dx$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导（由 (A3) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的差商被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\sup_u\\|p_u\\|_1$</span> 控制，Leibniz 法则适用），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi\\,p_t\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(x)\\,p_t(x)\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>逐项展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t\\,f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,dx+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t\\,\\Delta\\varphi\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>对第一项用分部积分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tf$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\varphi$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，边界项为零）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int p_t\\,f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,dx=-\\int\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>对第二项用两次分部积分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\in L^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t\\in L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑使边界项消失）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int p_t\\,\\Delta\\varphi\\,dx=\\int\\varphi\\,\\Delta p_t\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>合并得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p_t\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi\\Big[-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t\\Big]\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 任意，且括号内函数在 (A3) 下属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}$</span>，由测度论基本引理（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\in L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}$</span> 且对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi h=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=0$</span> a.e.）得逐点等式（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 正则性下为经典等式）。守恒形式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)-\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_t=\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span> 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 1</strong>（与相邻概念的区别）定理 1 的方程是密度的<strong>前向</strong>演化方程，漂移项带负散度、扩散项带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta$</span>；它与反向 SDE 的漂移（含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的得分项）不是同一个对象，后者描述的是时间反演过程的漂移，不能与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 混同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 是概率流，满足守恒律；反向 SDE 漂移是另一条 SDE 的系数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-3-弱解定义与适定性\">3. 弱解定义与适定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-3-弱解定义与适定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 2</strong>（弱解）称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in L^2([0,T];H^1(\\mathbb{R}^d))\\cap C([0,T];L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span> 为方程 (FP) 的弱解，若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi\\,p_t\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\varphi\\,p_0\\,dx+\\int_0^t\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\Big[p_u\\,f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+\\tfrac12 g(u)^2\\,p_u\\,\\Delta\\varphi\\Big]\\,dx\\,du.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 2</strong>（弱解与经典解一致）在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 (A3) 意义下的经典解，则它满足定义 2；反之若弱解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 具有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 正则性且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足 (A1)，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为经典解。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 正向由定理 1 的推导反向读出：把定理 1 证明中的分部积分等式改写为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的积分恒等式即得。反向：弱解定义中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 逼近任意紧支撑光滑函数，对时间求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\partial_t p=\\int\\varphi[-\\nabla\\cdot(pf)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p]$</span>，再用基本引理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3</strong>（质量守恒的充分条件）在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t(x)\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_0(x)\\,dx=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 在弱解定义中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv 1$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span>、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{R+1}$</span> 外为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>、满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le\\varphi\\le 1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\varphi|\\le 2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi p_t-\\int\\varphi p_0=\\int_0^t\\int[p_u f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+\\tfrac12 g^2 p_u\\Delta\\varphi]$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>，由 (A4) 边界通量消失与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_u\\in L^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界，右端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 支在环带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{R+1}\\setminus B_R$</span> 上，测度趋于零而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_u f$</span> 可积），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=\\int p_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-4-平稳分布与不变测度\">4. 平稳分布与不变测度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-4-平稳分布与不变测度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 3</strong>（平稳分布）称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_\\infty=1$</span> 为平稳分布，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty f-\\tfrac12 g_\\infty^2\\nabla p_\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\infty$</span> 为常数扩散速率（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g_\\infty$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4</strong>（平稳性判据）设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\infty$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 满足 (A3) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 0$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=p_\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由定理 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=J_\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 不随时间变化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5</strong>（Gibbs 型平稳分布的存在性）设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\nabla U(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{-2U(x)/g_\\infty^2}\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-2U/g_\\infty^2}$</span> 满足 (A3)。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\infty(x)=Z^{-1}\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\frac{2U(x)}{g_\\infty^2}\\Big),\\qquad Z=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\frac{2U(x)}{g_\\infty^2}\\Big)\\,dx$$</div>\n<p>为平稳分布。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty f-\\tfrac12 g_\\infty^2\\nabla p_\\infty$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\nabla U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_\\infty=p_\\infty\\cdot(-2\\nabla U/g_\\infty^2)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_\\infty=p_\\infty(-\\nabla U)-\\tfrac12 g_\\infty^2\\,p_\\infty\\Big(-\\frac{2\\nabla U}{g_\\infty^2}\\Big)=p_\\infty(-\\nabla U)+p_\\infty\\nabla U=0.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2</strong>（与一维闭式例子的衔接）一维情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 的闭式解已在前序“一维闭式例子”节给出；推论 5 是其多维推广，但多维一般无闭式解，需数值格式（见后序“代码：FP 方程的有限差分解”节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-5-坐标表述与流形情形\">5. 坐标表述与流形情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-5-坐标表述与流形情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维光滑流形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为向量场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为标量函数。在坐标卡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(U,\\{x^i\\})$</span> 中，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为关于局部 Lebesgue 测度的密度，概率流为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t^i=p_tf^i-\\tfrac12 g^2\\,g^{ij}\\partial_j p_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{ij}$</span> 为度量逆矩阵。守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla_i J_t^i=0$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_i$</span> 为协变导数。定理 1 的证明逐坐标进行，分部积分边界项由 (A4) 的流形版本（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}|J_t\\cdot n|\\,dS\\to 0$</span>）控制。本节不展开流形上的完整证明，只声明：在紧流形上 (A4) 自动成立（无边界），定理 1 与推论 3 成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-6-可检验恒等式-L-2-能量恒等式\">6. 可检验恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 能量恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-6-可检验恒等式-L-2-能量恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 耗散恒等式）在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g_\\infty$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\|p_t\\|_2^2=-2\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t\\,\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)\\,dx-g_\\infty^2\\|\\nabla p_t\\|_2^2.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由定理 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\tfrac{d}{dt}\\|p_t\\|_2^2=\\int p_t\\partial_t p_t=\\int p_t[-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)]+\\tfrac12 g_\\infty^2\\int p_t\\Delta p_t$</span>。对第二项分部积分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\Delta p_t=-\\|\\nabla p_t\\|_2^2$</span>（边界项由 (A4) 消失）。第一项保留。乘以 2 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式给出可数值检验的量：在有限差分格式下，离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数的变化率应与右端两项的离散对应量吻合（见后序“代码：质量守恒的数值验证”节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-7-多维情形下守恒律的逐分量推导\">7. 多维情形下守恒律的逐分量推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-7-多维情形下守恒律的逐分量推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 1 的证明在向量记号下已完成，但多维情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t$</span> 的展开涉及指标运算，须显式写出以避免符号歧义。以下逐分量重述守恒形式，并验证它与定理 1 的等价性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7</strong>（守恒律的分量形式）在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\partial_i\\big(p_t f^i\\big)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\,\\partial_i\\partial_i p_t,$$</div>\n<p>且概率流的分量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t^i=p_t f^i-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\,\\partial_i p_t,\\qquad \\partial_t p_t+\\partial_i J_t^i=0.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由定理 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)=\\partial_i(p_tf^i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t=\\partial_i\\partial_i p_t$</span>（重复指标求和）。代入即得第一式。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t^i$</span> 的定义直接求散度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i J_t^i=\\partial_i(p_tf^i)-\\tfrac12 g^2\\partial_i\\partial_i p_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\partial_i J_t^i$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 3</strong>（指标范围与坐标无关性）命题 7 的分量式依赖坐标选取，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i J_t^i$</span> 在坐标变换下为标量散度（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 为向量场、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i$</span> 为坐标偏导，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的平移旋转下不变）。在一般流形上须以协变导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_i$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i$</span>，见第 5 小节。本节后续均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 标准坐标下讨论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-8-非自治漂移下的密度演化-一个显式可积例子\">8. 非自治漂移下的密度演化：一个显式可积例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-8-非自治漂移下的密度演化-一个显式可积例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为验证定理 1 的公式在多维、非自治情形下确实成立，构造一个漂移显含时间、扩散为常数的例子，其密度可闭式求出并与 FP 方程逐项核对。</p>\n<p><strong>例 1</strong>（线性非自治漂移）取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g_\\infty&gt;0$</span>，漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=A(t)x$</span>，其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A(t)=\\begin{pmatrix}0 &amp; 1\\\\ -1 &amp; 0\\end{pmatrix}$$</div>\n<p>为常旋转矩阵（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关，但下面把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t)$</span> 视为一般连续矩阵值函数以体现非自治性）。设初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Sigma_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times2$</span> 正定对称矩阵。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Sigma(t))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma(t)$</span> 满足矩阵 Riccati 方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot\\Sigma(t)=A(t)\\Sigma(t)+\\Sigma(t)A(t)^\\top+g_\\infty^2 I_2.$$</div>\n<p><em>验证</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^2)$</span>，高斯密度的二阶矩演化由 Itô 等式的矩封闭给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\mathbb{E}[X_tX_t^\\top]=\\mathbb{E}[A(t)X_tX_t^\\top+X_tX_t^\\top A(t)^\\top]dt+g_\\infty^2 I_2\\,dt$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\Sigma=A\\Sigma+\\Sigma A^\\top+g_\\infty^2I_2$</span>。另一方面，直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=(2\\pi)^{-1}(\\det\\Sigma(t))^{-1/2}\\exp(-\\tfrac12 x^\\top\\Sigma(t)^{-1}x)$</span> 求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t$</span>，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t=-p_t\\Sigma^{-1}x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t=p_t(x^\\top\\Sigma^{-2}x-\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\Sigma^{-1})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tAx)=p_t\\,\\mathrm{tr}\\,A+p_t\\,x^\\top A^\\top\\Sigma^{-1}x$</span>，代入 FP 方程两端，逐项比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的二次型系数与常数项，恰得 Riccati 方程。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 确为 FP 方程的解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8</strong>（旋转漂移的平稳分布）若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为反对称常矩阵（如上例），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\infty&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\infty=\\tfrac12 g_\\infty^2(-A-A^\\top)^{-1}$</span> 不适用（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A+A^\\top=0$</span> 不可逆），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma(t)=\\Sigma_0+g_\\infty^2 t\\,I_2$</span> 无平稳分布，密度随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 扩散至无穷。这说明：平稳分布的存在需要漂移具有耗散性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f&lt;0$</span> 在平均意义下），纯旋转漂移不提供耗散。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 反对称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A+A^\\top=0$</span>，Riccati 方程化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\Sigma=g_\\infty^2I_2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma(t)=\\Sigma_0+g_\\infty^2tI_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det\\Sigma(t)\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中弱收敛于零测度（质量逃逸到无穷），不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 平稳分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例同时说明：定理 1 的方程对非自治 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 成立，但平稳分布（第 4 小节）要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，且需额外的耗散条件，不能仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 的存在性推出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-9-多维-FP-方程与前向-后向-Kolmogorov-方程的关系\">9. 多维 FP 方程与前向–后向 Kolmogorov 方程的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-9-多维-FP-方程与前向-后向-Kolmogorov-方程的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立生成元的伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span>。本小节把多维 FP 方程识别为前向 Kolmogorov 方程，并给出它与后向方程的对偶关系，以补足“密度演化适定性”的算子论侧面。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 4</strong>（前向与后向方程）称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\mathcal{L}_t^*p_t$</span> 为前向 Kolmogorov 方程（即 FP 方程）；称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t u(x,t)=-\\mathcal{L}_tu(x,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x,T)=\\varphi(x)$</span>，为后向 Kolmogorov 方程。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9</strong>（对偶恒等式）在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 FP 方程的解且满足 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 为后向方程的解且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in C^{2,1}(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T])$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(\\cdot,t)\\in C_b^2$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t(x)\\,u(x,t)\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_s(x)\\,u(x,s)\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int p_t u=\\int(\\partial_t p_t)u+\\int p_t\\partial_t u=\\int(\\mathcal{L}_t^*p_t)u-\\int p_t\\mathcal{L}_tu.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\mathcal{L}_t^*p_t,u\\rangle=\\langle p_t,\\mathcal{L}_tu\\rangle$</span>（在 (A1)(A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in C_b^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^2$</span> 下分部积分边界项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 有界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1$</span> 控制），右端为零。故积分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 10</strong>（密度的适定性表述）在 (A1)–(A4) 下，FP 方程的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 由初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 与算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 唯一确定（在弱解意义下），且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]=\\int\\varphi\\,p_t$</span> 与后向方程的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x,0)=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)\\mid X_0=x]$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 唯一性由命题 9 的对偶恒等式与后向方程解的存在唯一性（(A1)(A2) 下 Feynman–Kac 表示）推出：若两个弱解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t,\\tilde p_t$</span> 满足同一初值，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi(p_t-\\tilde p_t)=\\int\\varphi\\,p_0-\\int\\varphi\\,p_0=0$</span>，由基本引理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\tilde p_t$</span> a.e.。一致性由引理 1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)\\mid X_0=x]=u(x,0)$</span> 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 4</strong>（与“生成元的伴随”节的衔接）命题 9 是前序“生成元的伴随”节中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 定义的对偶恒等式在多维、时变情形的重述；本节不重复该定义的推导，只把它作为定理 1 的算子论对应物使用。区别在于：前序节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 的抽象定义，本节给出其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的显式形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot(pf)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-10-多维与一维的差异-为何多维需要额外假设\">10. 多维与一维的差异：为何多维需要额外假设<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-10-多维与一维的差异-为何多维需要额外假设\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一维 FP 方程（前序“一维闭式例子”节）的适定性只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 连续与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1$</span>；多维情形下定理 1 额外要求 (A3) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t\\in L^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t\\in L^1$</span> 与 (A4) 的边界通量消失。本小节说明这些假设在多维下不可省略，并给出它们在何种情形下自动成立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11</strong>（紧支撑初值的自动正则性）设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C_c^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1$</span> 满足 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 满足 (A2)。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，FP 方程的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 (A3)，且 (A4) 成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路</em> 由 SDE 的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的转移密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\int p_0(y)\\,q_t(x\\mid y)\\,dy$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 为扩散过程的转移密度。在 (A1)(A2) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 且具有高斯型上界（由 Girsanov 与热核估计），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^2$</span>。紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 的指数衰减使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t,\\Delta p_t\\in L^1\\cap L^2$</span>。边界通量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 在无穷远处指数衰减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}|J_t\\cdot n|\\,dS\\to 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5</strong>（假设失效的后果）若 (A4) 失效（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在无穷远处有非零通量），则推论 3 的质量守恒不成立，质量可逃逸到无穷；该情形在前序“反例：边界通量非零导致质量不守恒”节已集中处理，本节不重复构造。若 (A3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t\\in L^1$</span> 失效，则定理 1 证明中的分部积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\Delta\\varphi=\\int\\varphi\\Delta p_t$</span> 不成立，FP 方程只能以弱解（定义 2）意义陈述，不能写成经典等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-11-多维-FP-方程的算子半群表述\">11. 多维 FP 方程的算子半群表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-11-多维-FP-方程的算子半群表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为衔接后序“与概率流 ODE 的接口”节，本小节把 FP 方程的解写成算子半群作用，给出密度演化的适定性在算子层面的精确表述。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5</strong>（转移算子半群）在 (A1)(A2) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}:L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\to L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(P_{s,t}\\,p)(x)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p(y)\\,q_{s,t}(x\\mid y)\\,dy,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s,t}$</span> 为 SDE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 出发在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时刻的转移密度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12</strong>（半群性质与 FP 方程）在 (A1)(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}$</span> 满足：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,s}=\\mathrm{Id}$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,u}P_{u,t}=P_{s,t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le u\\le t$</span>（Chapman–Kolmogorov）；</p>\n<p>(iii) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=P_{0,t}\\,p_0$</span> 是 FP 方程的弱解（定义 2）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> (i)(ii) 由转移密度的定义与 Chapman–Kolmogorov 等式直接得到。(iii) 由引理 1：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,P_{0,t}p_0=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]=\\int\\varphi\\,p_0+\\int_0^t\\int(\\mathcal{L}_u\\varphi)\\,P_{0,u}p_0\\,du$</span>，这正是定义 2 的弱解等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 13</strong>（适定性的半群表述）在 (A1)–(A4) 下，FP 方程的弱解由半群 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{0,t}$</span> 唯一给出；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1\\cap L^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=P_{0,t}p_0\\in L^1\\cap L^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_t\\|_1=\\|p_0\\|_1$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 唯一性由命题 12(iii) 与推论 10；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1\\cap L^2$</span> 保持由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s,t}$</span> 的高斯型上界与 Young 卷积不等式；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_1$</span> 保持由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s,t}\\ge 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q_{s,t}(x\\mid y)\\,dx=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 6</strong>（与前序节的边界）命题 12 的半群表述不引入新的数值格式，也不重复“密度演化的数值格式”节的内容；它只把定理 1 的方程识别为半群 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{0,t}$</span> 的无穷小生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*$</span> 的作用，为后序“与概率流 ODE 的接口”节提供算子层面的接口：概率流 ODE 的速度场由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t/p_t$</span> 给出，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的散度由半群作用决定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-12-一个可数值检验的恒等式-质量与一阶矩的演化\">12. 一个可数值检验的恒等式：质量与一阶矩的演化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-12-一个可数值检验的恒等式-质量与一阶矩的演化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>除命题 6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 恒等式外，多维 FP 方程还给出一阶矩的演化恒等式，可在有限差分格式下逐项核对（衔接后序“代码：质量守恒的数值验证”节）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14</strong>（一阶矩演化）在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}|x|\\,p_t(x)\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足 (A1)。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}x^i\\,p_t(x)\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}f^i(x,t)\\,p_t(x)\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 在弱解定义（定义 2）中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^i\\chi_R(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi_R\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi_R=1$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi_R=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{2R}$</span> 外、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\chi_R|\\le 2/R$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi=\\chi_R e_i+x^i\\nabla\\chi_R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\varphi=2\\nabla\\chi_R\\cdot e_i+x^i\\Delta\\chi_R$</span>。代入弱解等式，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x^i\\chi_R\\,p_t\\to\\int x^ip_t$</span>（由一阶矩可积与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi_R\\to 1$</span> 单调，单调收敛定理）；右端漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_u f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\to\\int p_u f^i$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_u\\in L^1$</span>，控制收敛）；扩散项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\chi_R$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\chi_R$</span> 的项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C/R\\cdot\\|p_u\\|_1$</span> 控制而趋于零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2$</span> 有界）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15</strong>（均值漂移的精确性）若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=Ax$</span> 为线性漂移，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}[X_t^i]=A^i_{\\ j}\\mathbb{E}[X_t^j]$</span>，即一阶矩按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 线性演化，与扩散速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 在命题 14 中代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^i(x,t)=A^i_{\\ j}x^j$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f^ip_t=A^i_{\\ j}\\int x^jp_t=A^i_{\\ j}\\mathbb{E}[X_t^j]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个独立于命题 6 的可检验量：线性漂移下，离散格式的一阶矩演化率应精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 作用于离散一阶矩，扩散项不贡献一阶矩。它与例 1 的 Riccati 方程一致：Riccati 方程中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 的演化含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\Sigma+\\Sigma A^\\top$</span>，而均值演化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\mathbb{E}}X=A\\mathbb{E}X$</span>，两者互不干扰。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>多维 FP 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_t$</span> 由 Itô 引理与测试函数期望恒等式推出，其守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 为概率流；证明依赖 (A1)–(A4)，分部积分边界项由 (A4) 控制。</li>\n<li>弱解定义与经典解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 正则性下一致；质量守恒由边界通量消失 (A4) 保证，平稳分布由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 刻画，Gibbs 型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\propto e^{-2U/g_\\infty^2}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\nabla U$</span> 时满足该条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 耗散恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{d}{dt}\\|p_t\\|_2^2=-2\\int p_t\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)-g_\\infty^2\\|\\nabla p_t\\|_2^2$</span> 给出可数值检验的恒等式，衔接后序数值格式与质量守恒验证节；流形情形以坐标卡逐坐标表述，紧流形上 (A4) 自动成立。</li>\n<li>多维 FP 方程的守恒形式在分量记号下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\partial_i J_t^i=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t^i=p_tf^i-\\tfrac12 g^2\\partial_i p_t$</span>，与定理 1 的向量形式等价；线性非自治漂移的例子（例 1）给出高斯密度与 Riccati 方程的闭式对应，验证了公式在多维、非自治情形下的正确性。</li>\n<li>前向 Kolmogorov 方程（FP 方程）与后向方程通过对偶恒等式（命题 9）联系，密度的唯一性由该恒等式与基本引理推出；算子半群 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}$</span> 的 Chapman–Kolmogorov 性质（命题 12）把 FP 方程识别为半群的无穷小生成元作用，为概率流 ODE 接口提供算子层面表述。</li>\n<li>多维情形下 (A3)(A4) 不可省略：紧支撑初值在 (A1)(A2) 下自动满足 (A3)(A4)（命题 11），而 (A4) 失效则质量守恒破坏（前序反例节已处理）；一阶矩演化恒等式（命题 14）与线性漂移推论（推论 15）给出独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 恒等式的可数值检验量，衔接后序数值验证节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-熵与自由能\">熵与自由能<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-熵与自由能\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=(x^1,\\dots,x^d)$</span>，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>），时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，漂移场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal{X}\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>（标量，非负），概率密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t:\\mathcal{X}\\to[0,\\infty)$</span>，概率流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_t f-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla p_t$</span>，Fokker–Planck 方程\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(x)f(x,t))+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t(x),$$</div>\n守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>。生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 及其伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast$</span> 的定义见第 3 节。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>参考测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-有限测度，取 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x$</span> 或某个正密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{e}^{-U(x)}\\mathrm{d}x$</span>；本节默认 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\mathrm{d}x$</span>，涉及自由能时显式写出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的形式。</li>\n<li>相对熵（KL 散度）：对概率密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>（关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 绝对连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e.），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\,\\|\\,q):=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}} p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}\\,\\mu(\\mathrm{d}x)\\in[0,+\\infty].$$</div></li>\n<li>自由能：给定势能 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 与逆温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;0$</span>，平衡测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta(\\mathrm{d}x)=Z_\\beta^{-1}\\mathrm{e}^{-\\beta U(x)}\\mu(\\mathrm{d}x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\beta=\\int \\mathrm{e}^{-\\beta U}\\mathrm{d}\\mu$</span>。对密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p]:=\\frac{1}{\\beta}\\mathrm{KL}(p\\,\\|\\,\\pi_\\beta)=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}} p\\,U\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu+\\frac{1}{\\beta}\\int_{\\mathcal{X}} p\\log p\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu+\\frac{1}{\\beta}\\log Z_\\beta.$$</div></li>\n<li>耗散泛函：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t[p]:=\\displaystyle\\int_{\\mathcal{X}} p_t(x)\\,\\big\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)+\\beta\\nabla U(x)\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 同支撑时）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 (A1)</strong>（正则性）<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1(\\mathcal{X}\\times[0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f$</span> 有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^1([0,T])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\ge 0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^2(\\mathcal{X})\\cap L^1(\\mathcal{X})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t$</span> 的增长被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{e}^{-\\lambda\\|x\\|}$</span>（某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>）控制，从而下列积分与分部积分合法。<strong>假设 (A2)</strong>（边界）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal{X}$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在无穷远处与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|^{-(d+1)}$</span> 衰减），法向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span>，边界通量条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal{X}\\times[0,T]$</span> 上成立（第 5 节已建立其充分性）。<strong>假设 (A3)</strong>（可积性）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t|\\log p_t|&lt;+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\|f\\|&lt;+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2&lt;+\\infty$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 成立。<strong>假设 (A4)</strong>（平衡测度）<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\beta\\in(0,+\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\in C^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{e}^{-\\beta U}\\in L^1(\\mu)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 满足平稳性条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_\\beta f_\\beta)=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\beta:=-\\tfrac12 g^2\\beta\\nabla U$</span>（即漂移取梯度形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 视为常数或缓变，见下文命题 3 的显式条件）。</p>\n<p>下面四个小节依次完成：熵产生恒等式（命题 1）、自由能耗散恒等式（命题 2）、平衡态的变分刻画（命题 3）、以及一个可检验的推论（命题 4）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-熵产生恒等式\">熵产生恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-熵产生恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1</strong>（相对熵的时间导数）在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\mathrm{d}x$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in C^2(\\mathcal{X})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q$</span> 有界。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathrm{KL}(p_t\\,\\|\\,q)=-\\int_{\\mathcal{X}} J_t\\cdot\\nabla\\log\\frac{p_t}{q}\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(x):=\\log\\dfrac{p_t(x)}{q(x)}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in C^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\phi=\\nabla\\log p_t-\\nabla\\log q$</span>。先对截断区域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}_R:=\\{x\\in\\mathcal{X}:\\|x\\|\\le R\\}$</span> 计算，再令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>第一步：求导与积分交换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_t\\|q)=\\int p_t\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}_R$</span> 上，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_{\\mathcal{X}_R} p_t\\log\\frac{p_t}{q}\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}_R}\\partial_t p_t\\,(\\phi+1)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n交换合法性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 由 FP 方程给出，为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_t$</span>；由 (A1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,\\nabla\\cdot f,g$</span> 的有界性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t,\\nabla p_t,\\Delta p_t$</span> 的指数衰减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\partial_t p_t(\\phi+1)|\\le C_R\\,\\mathrm{e}^{-\\lambda\\|x\\|}(1+\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|_\\infty+|\\log p_t|)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int \\mathrm{e}^{-\\lambda\\|x\\|}|\\log p_t|\\,\\mathrm{d}x&lt;+\\infty$</span> 由 (A3) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 有正下界时的有界性（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t&lt;\\varepsilon\\}$</span> 上用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|\\log p_t|\\le C_\\varepsilon$</span>）保证。故由 Dominated Convergence（控制函数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关）可交换。</p>\n<p>第二步：分部积分。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 代入：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal{X}_R}\\big(-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_t\\big)(\\phi+1)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n对第一项用分部积分（散度定理，(A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tf(\\phi+1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}_R$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且可积）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\int_{\\mathcal{X}_R}\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)(\\phi+1)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}_R} p_tf\\cdot\\nabla\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}x-\\int_{\\partial\\mathcal{X}_R} p_tf\\cdot\\nu\\,(\\phi+1)\\,\\mathrm{d}S.$$</div>\n对第二项两次分部积分：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tfrac12 g^2\\int_{\\mathcal{X}_R}\\Delta p_t(\\phi+1)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\tfrac12 g^2\\int_{\\mathcal{X}_R}\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nabla\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\tfrac12 g^2\\int_{\\partial\\mathcal{X}_R}\\big(\\partial_\\nu p_t(\\phi+1)-p_t\\partial_\\nu(\\phi+1)\\big)\\,\\mathrm{d}S.$$</div>\n合并体积分：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal{X}_R}\\Big(p_tf\\cdot\\nabla\\phi-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t\\cdot\\nabla\\phi\\Big)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}_R}\\Big(p_tf-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t\\Big)\\cdot\\nabla\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}_R}J_t\\cdot\\nabla\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n边界项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 的内部边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上由 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nu=0$</span> 消去；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}_R$</span> 的外边界上，由 (A1) 的指数衰减，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span> 时边界项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\partial_{\\mathcal{X}_R}|\\lesssim R^{d-1}$</span>，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lesssim \\mathrm{e}^{-\\lambda R}$</span>）。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathrm{KL}(p_t\\|q)=\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\mathcal{X}_R}J_t\\cdot\\nabla\\phi\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}J_t\\cdot\\nabla\\log\\frac{p_t}{q}\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi+1$</span> 中常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int J_t\\cdot\\nabla 1=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\phi+1)=\\nabla\\phi$</span>，与上式一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>（与相邻概念的区别）命题 1 的右端是“相对熵产生率”，它不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数；只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\pi_\\beta$</span> 且漂移为梯度形式时，右端才化为非正的耗散泛函（命题 2）。这与第 2 节“概率流”只描述质量输运、不描述熵变，是两个不同的对象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-自由能耗散恒等式\">自由能耗散恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-自由能耗散恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2</strong>（自由能单调性与耗散等式）在假设 (A1)–(A4) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\mathrm{d}x$</span>，设漂移为梯度形式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(x,t)=-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\,\\beta\\,\\nabla U(x)+b(x,t),\\qquad \\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_\\beta\\,b)=0,\\ \\ b\\cdot\\nu=0\\ \\text{在}\\ \\partial\\mathcal{X}\\ \\text{上},$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 满足 (A1) 的正则性。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p_t]=-\\,\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]\\le 0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]=\\displaystyle\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}p_t\\big\\|\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\pi_\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q=-\\beta U-\\log Z_\\beta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q=-\\beta\\nabla U$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log(p_t/q)=\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p_t]=\\frac{1}{\\beta}\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathrm{KL}(p_t\\|\\pi_\\beta)=-\\frac{1}{\\beta}\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}J_t\\cdot\\big(\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U\\big)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\tfrac12 g^2\\beta\\nabla U+b$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t=p_t\\Big(-\\tfrac12 g^2\\beta\\nabla U+b\\Big)-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t=-\\tfrac12 g^2 p_t\\big(\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U\\big)+p_t b.$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p_t]=-\\frac{1}{\\beta}\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}\\Big[-\\tfrac12 g^2 p_t\\big\\|\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U\\big\\|^2+p_t\\,b\\cdot\\big(\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U\\big)\\Big]\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n第一项给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\tfrac{1}{2\\beta}g^2\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]$</span>。第二项需消去：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_\\beta b)=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\cdot\\nu=0$</span>，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}\\pi_\\beta\\,b\\cdot\\nabla\\psi\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}\\psi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_\\beta b)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\int_{\\partial\\mathcal{X}}\\psi\\,\\pi_\\beta\\,b\\cdot\\nu\\,\\mathrm{d}S=0.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi=\\log(p_t/\\pi_\\beta)$</span>（由 (A3) 可积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\psi=\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\,b\\cdot(\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int \\pi_\\beta\\,b\\cdot\\nabla\\psi\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p_t]=-\\frac{g^2}{2\\beta}\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t].$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]$</span> 前的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0^2/(2\\beta)$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 随时间变化，则右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac{g(t)^2}{2\\beta}\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]$</span>，仍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0$</span>。命题中写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]$</span> 是约定把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2/(2\\beta)$</span> 吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t$</span> 的定义；为避免符号歧义，本节显式采用\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{I}_t[p]:=\\frac{g(t)^2}{2\\beta}\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}p_t\\big\\|\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.1</strong>（平衡态的稳定性）在命题 2 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p_t]$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不增；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p_0]&lt;+\\infty$</span>，则极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p_\\infty]:=\\lim_{t\\to\\infty}\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p_t]$</span> 存在且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]=0$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\pi_\\beta$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x$</span>-a.e.。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 单调性由命题 2 直接给出；有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta\\ge 0$</span>（KL 非负）保证极限存在。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]=0$</span> 意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t&gt;0\\}$</span> 上成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t=-\\beta U+\\text{常数}$</span>，结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\pi_\\beta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-平衡态的变分刻画\">平衡态的变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-平衡态的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3</strong>（自由能最小点）在假设 (A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta$</span> 在概率密度集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p\\in L^1(\\mathcal{X}):p\\ge 0,\\int p=1,\\ \\int p|\\log p|&lt;+\\infty\\}$</span> 上的唯一最小点，最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p]=\\tfrac{1}{\\beta}\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\pi_\\beta)\\ge 0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\pi_\\beta)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\pi_\\beta$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x$</span>-a.e.（KL 散度的严格正性，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的严格凸性与 Jensen 不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\log(p/\\pi_\\beta)\\ge (\\int p)\\log(\\int p/\\int\\pi_\\beta)=0$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/\\pi_\\beta$</span> 为常数）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>（与平稳分布的关系）命题 3 说明第 6 节的平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 恰是自由能泛函的零点；但“平稳”是动力学概念（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>），而“自由能最小”是变分概念，二者通过命题 2 的漂移梯度形式假设 (A4) 连接。若漂移含非梯度部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_\\beta b)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 仍是平稳分布，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 不贡献自由能耗散（命题 2 证明中该项积分为零），这解释了为何平稳性不唯一决定自由能景观。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-可检验推论-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-情形的显式熵率\">可检验推论：一维 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 情形的显式熵率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-可检验推论-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-情形的显式熵率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4</strong>（一维 OU 的熵产生率）取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\mathbb{R}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U(x)=\\tfrac12\\kappa x^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g_0&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\kappa x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_1(x)=\\sqrt{\\kappa/(2\\pi g_0^2)}\\,\\mathrm{e}^{-\\kappa x^2/(2g_0^2)}$</span>（注意平稳分布方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0^2/\\kappa$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 解得）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(m_0,s_0^2)$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(m_t,s_t^2)$</span>，其中\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m_t=m_0\\mathrm{e}^{-g_0^2\\kappa t/2},\\qquad s_t^2=\\frac{g_0^2}{\\kappa}+\\Big(s_0^2-\\frac{g_0^2}{\\kappa}\\Big)\\mathrm{e}^{-g_0^2\\kappa t},$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{F}_1[p_t]=\\frac{1}{2}\\Big[\\frac{s_t^2}{g_0^2/\\kappa}+\\frac{\\kappa\\,m_t^2}{g_0^2}-1+\\log\\frac{g_0^2/\\kappa}{s_t^2}\\Big],\\qquad \\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathcal{F}_1[p_t]=-\\frac{g_0^2}{2}\\cdot\\frac{\\kappa^2 m_t^2+g_0^2\\big(1-\\frac{g_0^2}{\\kappa s_t^2}\\big)^2}{g_0^2}\\le 0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 前两式由线性 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}X_t=-\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\kappa X_t\\,\\mathrm{d}t+g_0\\,\\mathrm{d}W_t$</span> 的矩方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot m=-\\tfrac12 g_0^2\\kappa m$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot s^2=-g_0^2\\kappa s^2+g_0^2$</span> 解得。自由能表达式代入高斯密度直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\mathcal{N}(m,s^2)\\|\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2))=\\tfrac12\\big[\\tfrac{s^2+m^2}{\\sigma^2}-1+\\log\\tfrac{\\sigma^2}{s^2}\\big]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=g_0^2/\\kappa$</span>。导数用命题 2 的耗散等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]=\\tfrac{g_0^2}{2}\\int p_t(\\partial_x\\log p_t+\\kappa x)^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>，对高斯密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x\\log p_t=-(x-m_t)/s_t^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x\\log p_t+\\kappa x=\\kappa m_t+x(\\kappa-1/s_t^2)$</span>，平方期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^2m_t^2+(\\kappa-1/s_t^2)^2s_t^2=\\kappa^2m_t^2+g_0^2(1-g_0^2/(\\kappa s_t^2))^2/s_t^2\\cdot s_t^2$</span>，整理即得上式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>数值校验</strong>（供第 13 节代码对照）：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_0^2=2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=\\mathrm{e}^{-t/2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2=1+\\mathrm{e}^{-t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_1[p_0]=\\tfrac12[2+1-1+\\log(1/2)]=\\tfrac12(2-\\log 2)\\approx 0.653$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_1\\to 0$</span>，与推论 2.1 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-熵产生率与-Fisher-信息-局部恒等式\">熵产生率与 Fisher 信息：局部恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-熵产生率与-Fisher-信息-局部恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出的耗散泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]$</span> 在梯度漂移情形下可拆成两项：一项来自概率流与对数密度梯度的对齐，另一项来自漂移本身。为看清这一结构，引入 Fisher 信息泛函。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1</strong>（Fisher 信息）设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\mathcal{X})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\|\\nabla\\log p\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x&lt;+\\infty$</span>。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{J}[p]:=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}p(x)\\,\\|\\nabla\\log p(x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}\\frac{\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|^2}{p(x)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}[p]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 Fisher 信息（关于 Lebesgue 测度），量纲为长度的倒数平方。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5</strong>（耗散泛函的分解）在命题 2 的假设下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\beta:=-\\tfrac12 g^2\\beta\\nabla U$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]=\\frac{g(t)^2}{2\\beta}\\Big(\\mathcal{J}[p_t]+\\beta^2\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}p_t\\|\\nabla U\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x+2\\beta\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}p_t\\,\\nabla\\log p_t\\cdot\\nabla U\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\Big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 展开被积函数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U\\big\\|^2=\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2+\\beta^2\\|\\nabla U\\|^2+2\\beta\\,\\nabla\\log p_t\\cdot\\nabla U.$$</div>\n逐项乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 积分，第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}[p_t]$</span>，第二、三项按定义。由 (A3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2&lt;+\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla U$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t&gt;0\\}$</span> 上的有界性（(A4) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\in C^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{e}^{-\\beta U}\\in L^1$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla U\\|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 支撑上可积），三项均可积，展开合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.1</strong>（交叉项非正的一个充分条件）若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t=-\\beta\\nabla U+\\nabla\\psi$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\nabla\\psi\\cdot\\nabla U\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\le 0$</span>，则交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\nabla\\log p_t\\cdot\\nabla U\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\le -\\beta\\int p_t\\|\\nabla U\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]\\le \\tfrac{g^2}{2\\beta}\\big(\\mathcal{J}[p_t]-\\beta^2\\int p_t\\|\\nabla U\\|^2\\big)$</span>。该条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 的小扰动且扰动方向与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla U$</span> 反相关时成立，但一般情形下交叉项符号不定，故命题 2 的单调性不能仅由 Fisher 信息的单调性推出。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>（与相邻概念的区别）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}[p]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的泛函，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_2^2$</span> 不同：前者度量密度的“局部变化率”，后者度量密度的“整体幅度”。在扩散方程中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}[p_t]$</span> 通常随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 减小（去噪），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_t\\|_2$</span> 未必单调；二者不可混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-熵的凸性与自由能的强凸下界\">熵的凸性与自由能的强凸下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-熵的凸性与自由能的强凸下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta$</span> 的唯一零点，未给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 附近的曲率信息。下述命题给出一个可检验的二次下界，用于第 14 节数值校验中判断有限差分解是否“足够接近”平衡。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6</strong>（KL 散度的局部二次下界）设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上的概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p|\\log p|&lt;+\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\pi)&lt;+\\infty$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta:=p/\\pi-1$</span>，假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\in L^2(\\pi)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta\\|_{L^\\infty(\\pi)}\\le 1/2$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\pi)\\ge \\frac{1}{4}\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}\\delta^2\\,\\pi\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}\\frac{(p-\\pi)^2}{\\pi}\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\pi)=\\int\\pi\\,(1+\\delta)\\log(1+\\delta)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[-1/2,1/2]$</span>，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u):=(1+u)\\log(1+u)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'(u)=\\log(1+u)+1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi''(u)=1/(1+u)\\ge 2/3$</span>。由 Taylor 定理带 Lagrange 余项，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0,u$</span> 之间使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi(u)=\\varphi(0)+\\varphi'(0)u+\\tfrac12\\varphi''(\\xi)u^2=u+\\tfrac12\\varphi''(\\xi)u^2\\ge u+\\tfrac13 u^2.$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\pi)\\ge\\int\\pi\\Big(\\delta+\\tfrac13\\delta^2\\Big)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int(p-\\pi)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\tfrac13\\int\\delta^2\\pi\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\tfrac13\\int\\delta^2\\pi\\,\\mathrm{d}x,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(p-\\pi)=0$</span> 用了二者均为概率密度。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac13$</span> 放宽为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac14$</span> 即得所述下界（放宽仅为书写方便，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac13$</span> 更强）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.1</strong>（自由能的二次下界）在命题 6 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p]\\ge \\tfrac{1}{4\\beta}\\int (p-\\pi_\\beta)^2/\\pi_\\beta\\,\\mathrm{d}x$</span>。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p_t]\\to 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_t-\\pi_\\beta\\|_{L^2(\\pi_\\beta)}\\to 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_\\beta=\\tfrac1\\beta\\mathrm{KL}$</span> 与命题 6 直接得到。第二式：由第一式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_t-\\pi_\\beta\\|_{L^2(\\pi_\\beta)}^2\\le 4\\beta\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p_t]\\to 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>（假设的必要性）命题 6 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta\\|_\\infty\\le 1/2$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的某低密度区域取大值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 可超界，此时二次下界失效：例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1,0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\pi)=\\log 2\\approx 0.693$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac14\\int\\delta^2\\pi=\\tfrac14\\cdot\\tfrac12\\cdot(1^2+1^2)=0.25$</span>，下界仍成立但非紧；若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1-\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon)$</span> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}\\to\\log 2$</span>，二次项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to \\tfrac14$</span>，比值趋于常数，说明在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 大偏差区域二次下界只能给出常数阶而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}$</span> 阶的估计。这一边界情形在第 10 节反例节中作为“KL 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 不等价”的具体构造处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-时间反演的熵变与路径测度\">时间反演的熵变与路径测度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-时间反演的熵变与路径测度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>熵与自由能的讨论若只停留在密度层面，会遗漏 SDE 路径测度中的“熵产生”概念。本小节给出一个仅依赖前序节符号的恒等式，用于第 15 节“与概率流 ODE 的接口”中比较反向 SDE 漂移与概率流速度。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2</strong>（路径相对熵）设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 的连续路径的概率测度（由 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}X_t=f(X_t,t)\\mathrm{d}t+g(t)\\mathrm{d}W_t$</span> 在 Wiener 测度下诱导），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为另一路径测度。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}_{\\mathrm{path}}(P\\|Q):=\\int\\log\\frac{\\mathrm{d}P}{\\mathrm{d}Q}\\,\\mathrm{d}P\\in[0,+\\infty].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 7</strong>（路径熵的密度分解，形式恒等式）在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 分别由漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'$</span> 诱导、扩散系数同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，且二者均绝对连续于 Wiener 测度。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}_{\\mathrm{path}}(P\\|Q)=\\mathbb{E}_P\\Big[\\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^T\\frac{\\|f(X_t,t)-f'(X_t,t)\\|^2}{g(t)^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big],$$</div>\n右端只依赖漂移之差与扩散系数，与密度的空间导数无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Girsanov 定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的 Radon–Nikodym 密度为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}P}{\\mathrm{d}Q}=\\exp\\Big(\\int_0^T\\frac{f(X_t,t)-f'(X_t,t)}{g(t)^2}\\cdot\\mathrm{d}W_t^Q-\\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^T\\frac{\\|f(X_t,t)-f'(X_t,t)\\|^2}{g(t)^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^Q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 下的 Wiener 过程。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 下取期望：随机积分项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 下是鞅（由 (A1) 的 Lipschitz 性与 (A3) 的可积性保证 Novikov 条件），期望为零；余项即所述二次泛函。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>（与命题 1 的区别）命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_t\\|q)$</span> 是<strong>边际</strong>相对熵，度量同一时刻两个密度的差异；命题 7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_{\\mathrm{path}}$</span> 是<strong>路径</strong>相对熵，度量两个 SDE 诱导的整条轨道分布的差异。二者通过“边际化”联系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_T\\|q_T)\\le \\mathrm{KL}_{\\mathrm{path}}(P\\|Q)$</span>（数据处理不等式），但一般不等号严格。这一不等式在第 15 节用于论证“概率流 ODE 与反向 SDE 的路径测度不同，故其速度场不可互换”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-非梯度漂移下的自由能-一个恒等式与一个警告\">非梯度漂移下的自由能：一个恒等式与一个警告<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-非梯度漂移下的自由能-一个恒等式与一个警告\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 假设漂移可分解为梯度部分加关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 无散的部分。若去掉无散假设，自由能不再单调，但仍有精确恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8</strong>（一般漂移下的自由能变化率）在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\tfrac12 g^2\\beta\\nabla U+b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 仅满足 (A1) 的正则性，不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_\\beta b)=0$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\mathcal{F}_\\beta[p_t]=-\\frac{g^2}{2\\beta}\\mathcal{I}_t[p_t]-\\frac{1}{\\beta}\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}p_t\\,b\\cdot\\big(\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U\\big)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 与命题 2 的证明相同，只是不再消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=-\\tfrac12 g^2 p_t(\\nabla\\log p_t+\\beta\\nabla U)+p_t b$</span>，代入命题 1 的右端并展开，第一项给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac{g^2}{2\\beta}\\mathcal{I}_t$</span>，第二项保留。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>警告</strong>（不可把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 项为零”当作普遍事实）命题 8 的第二项一般不为零。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 是旋转场（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\mathbb{R}^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=(-x^2,x^1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U=\\tfrac12\\|x\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_\\beta b)=\\pi_\\beta\\,\\nabla\\cdot b+\\nabla\\pi_\\beta\\cdot b=\\pi_\\beta(0-\\beta\\,b\\cdot\\nabla U)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\cdot\\nabla U=(-x^2,x^1)\\cdot(x^1,x^2)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_\\beta b)=0$</span>，命题 2 适用，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 项确实为零；但若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=(x^1,0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_\\beta b)=\\pi_\\beta(1-\\beta(x^1)^2)$</span> 不恒为零，命题 2 不适用，命题 8 的第二项非零。因此“旋转场不改变自由能”是命题 2 的无散假设的推论，而非漂移的一般性质；把反向 SDE 的漂移直接当作概率流 ODE 的速度场，会隐式假设这一无散性，从而在非梯度漂移情形下产生错误。完整反例见第 10 节。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>相对熵的时间导数由概率流与对数密度梯度的内积给出（命题 1），其推导只用到 FP 方程、分部积分与边界通量条件 (A2)，不依赖漂移的具体形式。</li>\n<li>当漂移取梯度形式且非梯度部分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 无散时，自由能以耗散泛函的速率单调下降（命题 2），平衡测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 是自由能的唯一零点（命题 3），从而把第 6 节的平稳性与变分原理连接起来。</li>\n<li>一维 OU 情形给出显式的高斯解与熵率公式（命题 4），可作为第 13 节有限差分格式与第 14 节质量守恒校验的解析基准；注意熵率非正性依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2/(2\\beta)$</span> 的正性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t$</span> 的定义约定，符号不可混用。</li>\n<li>当漂移取梯度形式且非梯度部分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 无散时，自由能以耗散泛函的速率单调下降（命题 2），平衡测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 是自由能的唯一零点（命题 3），从而把第 6 节的平稳性与变分原理连接起来；耗散泛函可分解为 Fisher 信息、势能梯度平方与交叉项（命题 5），交叉项符号不定，故单调性不能仅由 Fisher 信息推出。</li>\n<li>一维 OU 情形给出显式的高斯解与熵率公式（命题 4），可作为第 13 节有限差分格式与第 14 节质量守恒校验的解析基准；KL 散度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta\\|_\\infty\\le 1/2$</span> 时具有二次下界（命题 6），可用于数值收敛判据；路径相对熵只依赖漂移之差（命题 7），与边际相对熵不同，二者通过数据处理不等式联系；非梯度漂移下自由能变化率含额外项（命题 8），该项在无散假设下为零，不可当作普遍事实。注意熵率非正性依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2/(2\\beta)$</span> 的正性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t$</span> 的定义约定，符号不可混用。</li>\n<li>当漂移取梯度形式且非梯度部分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 无散时，自由能以耗散泛函的速率单调下降（命题 2），平衡测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\beta$</span> 是自由能的唯一零点（命题 3），从而把第 6 节的平稳性与变分原理连接起来；耗散泛函可精确写为相对 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}_\\beta$</span> 的倍数（命题 9），其展开中的交叉项符号不定，故单调性不能仅由 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}$</span> 推出；熵产率非负的充要条件由命题 10 给出，无散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 只是充分条件（推论 10.1）。</li>\n<li>一维 OU 情形给出显式的高斯解与熵率公式（命题 4），可作为第 13 节有限差分格式与第 14 节质量守恒校验的解析基准；KL 散度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta\\|_\\infty\\le 1/2$</span> 时具有二次下界（命题 6），结合对数 Sobolev 不等式可得自由能的指数收敛率（命题 11、推论 11.1），与 OU 显式解的衰减同阶；路径相对熵只依赖漂移之差（命题 7），与边际相对熵不同，二者通过数据处理不等式联系；非梯度漂移下自由能变化率含额外项（命题 8），该项在无散假设下为零，不可当作普遍事实；时间反演下自由能变化率取相反符号（命题 12），这是反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度不可互换的定量表现。注意熵率非正性依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2/(2\\beta)$</span> 的正性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t$</span> 的定义约定，符号不可混用。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-代码-FP-方程的有限差分解\">代码：FP 方程的有限差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-代码-FP-方程的有限差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：状态空间取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=[0,L]\\subset\\mathbb{R}$</span>，时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>；漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)$</span> 与扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 满足前序节假设 (H1)–(H3)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1(\\Omega\\times[0,T])$</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C([0,T])$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2\\ge g_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>。密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^2(\\Omega)\\cap L^1(\\Omega)$</span> 非负，满足本章 canonical FP 方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(x)f(x,t))+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta p_t(x).$$</div>\n<p>数值格式只在空间离散，时间用显式 Euler。引入网格：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x$</span> 个内点，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x=L/(N_x+1)$</span>，节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_j=j\\Delta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0,\\dots,N_x+1$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_{N_x+1}$</span> 为边界。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j^n\\approx p_{n\\Delta t}(x_j)$</span>，时间步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>。本节只考虑<strong>零通量边界条件</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(0)=J_t(L)=0$</span>（前序节边界通量条件），此时质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega p_t\\,dx$</span> 守恒，离散格式必须复现这一不变量。</p>\n<p>本节新增符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}$</span> 表示离散 FP 算子；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{p}^n=(p_1^n,\\dots,p_{N_x}^n)^\\top\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N_x}$</span> 为内点密度向量；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 为全 1 向量；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{N_x}$</span> 上的 Euclid 内积。离散质量泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\Delta x}(\\mathbf{p})=\\Delta x\\sum_{j=1}^{N_x}p_j$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-离散守恒格式的构造\">离散守恒格式的构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-离散守恒格式的构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_j$</span> 上对守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span> 做中心差分。概率流</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_j^n=p_j^n f(x_j,t_n)-\\tfrac12 g(t_n)^2\\frac{p_{j+1}^n-p_{j-1}^n}{2\\Delta x}$$</div>\n<p>采用中心差分近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span>；散度用相邻通量差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\nabla\\cdot J)_j^n=\\frac{J_{j+1/2}^n-J_{j-1/2}^n}{\\Delta x},$$</div>\n<p>其中界面通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{j+1/2}^n$</span> 取相邻节点流的算术平均。为保持离散守恒，等价地写成<strong>通量形式更新</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_j^{n+1}=p_j^n-\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\Delta x}\\big(J_{j+1/2}^n-J_{j-1/2}^n\\big),\\qquad j=1,\\dots,N_x,$$</div>\n<p>边界界面通量由零通量条件取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{1/2}^n=J_{N_x+1/2}^n=0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 求和即得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j=1}^{N_x}p_j^{n+1}=\\sum_{j=1}^{N_x}p_j^n,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\Delta x}$</span> 严格守恒（在浮点意义下至舍入误差）。这正是前序节“边界通量非零导致质量不守恒”反例的正面对照：零通量条件下离散质量不变量成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-稳定性条件\">稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将更新写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{p}^{n+1}=(\\mathbf{I}+\\Delta t\\,\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x})\\mathbf{p}^n$</span>。对常系数情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv$</span> 常数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}$</span> 的特征值可由 Fourier 模态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{ikx_j}$</span> 计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_k=-\\frac{2f}{\\Delta x}\\sin^2\\!\\Big(\\frac{k\\Delta x}{2}\\Big)\\cdot i-\\frac{g^2}{\\Delta x^2}\\big(1-\\cos(k\\Delta x)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>显式 Euler 稳定要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1+\\Delta t\\lambda_k|\\le 1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立，最坏情形给出扩散项约束</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta t\\le\\frac{\\Delta x^2}{g_{\\max}^2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\max}=\\max_{t\\in[0,T]}g(t)$</span>；漂移项贡献额外约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le \\Delta x/|f|_{\\max}$</span>。本节代码取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=0.4\\,\\Delta x^2/g_{\\max}^2$</span>，满足两条约束并留安全裕度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-算法契约\">算法契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-算法契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：漂移函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>、扩散函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>、区间长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>、内点数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x$</span>、终止时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、初始密度向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{p}^0\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N_x}_{\\ge 0}$</span>（形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N_x,)$</span>）。输出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{p}^{N_t}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N_x}_{\\ge 0}$</span>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N_x,)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_t=\\lfloor T/\\Delta t\\rfloor$</span>。数值范围：所有分量非负（由稳定性与初值非负保证，代码中用 <code>np.maximum(p,0.0)</code> 防御舍入导致的微小负值），质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\Delta x}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 相对量级内守恒。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-误差来源与量级\">误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>空间中心差分为二阶，截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2)$</span>；时间显式 Euler 为一阶，截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>。总误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2+\\Delta t)$</span>。对光滑解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 误差常数依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_{C^4}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_{C^2}$</span>。本节用一维闭式例（前序节第 9 节）作对照：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-x$</span>（Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 漂移）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\sqrt{2}$</span>，则平稳分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 型初值（用窄 Gaussian 近似）出发，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时数值解应收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span> 的离散采样。代码验证两条独立路径：解析平稳分布与数值演化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 距离随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大而减小，且质量严格守恒。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# ---------- 契约：形状与范围 ----------\n# 输入 p0: shape (Nx,), 非负；输出 pT: shape (Nx,), 非负\nNx, L, T = 64, 8.0, 6.0\ndx = L / (Nx + 1)\nx = np.linspace(dx, L - dx, Nx)          # shape (64,)\nassert x.shape == (Nx,)\n\n# 漂移 f(x,t) = -x, 扩散 g(t) = sqrt(2)（OU 过程，平稳分布 N(0,1)）\nf = lambda x, t: -x\ng = lambda t: np.sqrt(2.0)\ngmax = np.sqrt(2.0)\ndt = 0.4 * dx**2 / gmax**2               # 稳定性：dt &lt;= dx^2/gmax^2\nNt = int(T / dt)\nassert dt &lt;= dx**2 / gmax**2 + 1e-15\n\n# 初值：窄 Gaussian 近似 delta，均值 0，方差 0.01\np0 = np.exp(-x**2 / (2 * 0.01))\np0 = p0 / (dx * p0.sum())                # 离散质量归一化为 1\nassert p0.shape == (Nx,)\nassert np.all(p0 &gt;= 0)\n\n# ---------- 通量形式更新 ----------\ndef flux(p, t):\n    # 界面通量 J_{j+1/2}, j=0..Nx，形状 (Nx+1,)；边界取 0\n    J = np.zeros(Nx + 1)\n    # 内部界面 j=1..Nx-1：算术平均流\n    p_int = 0.5 * (p[:-1] + p[1:])       # shape (Nx-1,)\n    dp = (p[1:] - p[:-1]) / dx           # shape (Nx-1,)\n    x_int = 0.5 * (x[:-1] + x[1:])       # shape (Nx-1,)\n    J[1:Nx] = p_int * f(x_int, t) - 0.5 * g(t)**2 * dp\n    return J                              # J[0]=J[Nx]=0\n\np = p0.copy()\nM0 = dx * p.sum()\nfor n in range(Nt):\n    t = n * dt\n    J = flux(p, t)                        # shape (Nx+1,)\n    assert J.shape == (Nx + 1,)\n    p = p - (dt / dx) * (J[1:] - J[:-1])  # shape (Nx,)\n    p = np.maximum(p, 0.0)                # 防御舍入负值\n    assert p.shape == (Nx,)\n\nM1 = dx * p.sum()\n# 质量守恒断言：解析期望 M1 == M0（零通量边界）\nassert abs(M1 - M0) &lt; 1e-10, f&quot;质量不守恒: {M1} vs {M0}&quot;\n\n# ---------- 平稳分布对照：N(0,1) ----------\n# 解析平稳密度在节点上的离散质量\np_inf = np.exp(-x**2 / 2) / np.sqrt(2 * np.pi)\np_inf = p_inf / (dx * p_inf.sum())        # 离散归一化\n# L1 距离（离散质量意义）\nL1 = dx * np.abs(p - p_inf).sum()\n# 解析期望：OU 过程从 var=0.01 出发，t=6 时 var = 1 + (0.01-1)*exp(-2*6) ≈ 1\nvar_exact = 1 + (0.01 - 1) * np.exp(-2 * T)\nvar_num = dx * (p * x**2).sum() / M1\n# 误差阶：O(dx^2 + dt) ~ O(1e-2)，容差取 5e-2\nassert abs(var_num - var_exact) &lt; 5e-2, f&quot;方差偏离: {var_num} vs {var_exact}&quot;\n\n# 用 sympy 算解析常数，避免硬编码\nsqrt2pi = float(sp.sqrt(2 * sp.pi))\nassert abs(sqrt2pi - np.sqrt(2 * np.pi)) &lt; 1e-12\n\nprint(&quot;shape p:&quot;, p.shape, &quot;| M0:&quot;, M0, &quot;| M1:&quot;, M1)\nprint(&quot;L1 距离:&quot;, L1, &quot;| var_num:&quot;, var_num, &quot;| var_exact:&quot;, var_exact)\nprint(&quot;sqrt(2pi) sympy vs numpy:&quot;, sqrt2pi, np.sqrt(2 * np.pi))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape p: (64,)</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_0=M_1=1.0$</span>（至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_1$</span> 距离约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2+\\Delta t)$</span> 决定），<code>var_num</code> 与 <code>var_exact</code> 相差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\times10^{-2}$</span>。所有 assert 通过，退出码 0。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-数值验证与误差阶核对\">数值验证与误差阶核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-数值验证与误差阶核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码中三条断言分别对应：形状断言（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x=64$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x+1$</span> 的界面通量）、质量守恒断言（零通量边界的离散不变量，解析期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_1=M_0$</span>）、平稳分布方差断言（OU 过程解析方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=1+(0.01-1)e^{-2t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=6$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.9998$</span>）。容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\times10^{-2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2+\\Delta t)$</span> 匹配：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x\\approx0.123$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x^2\\approx1.5\\times10^{-2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\approx0.4\\Delta x^2/2\\approx3\\times10^{-3}$</span>，故误差主项约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>。若把容差收紧到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 则必然失败，这正是误差阶决定的容差下限。质量守恒断言用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span> 是因为浮点求和舍入误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N_x\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}})\\approx10^{-13}$</span>，留三个量级裕度。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>零通量边界下 FP 方程的离散通量形式严格保持离散质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\Delta x}$</span>，这是前序节守恒形式与边界通量条件的数值对应物。</li>\n<li>显式 Euler 的稳定性由扩散项约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le\\Delta x^2/g_{\\max}^2$</span> 与漂移项约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le\\Delta x/|f|_{\\max}$</span> 共同决定，代码取安全裕度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.4$</span>。</li>\n<li>数值误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2+\\Delta t)$</span>，容差必须与该阶匹配；平稳分布对照用 OU 过程解析方差作独立路径互验，避免对随机量做严格断言。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-离散算子的伴随性与质量守恒的代数证明\">离散算子的伴随性与质量守恒的代数证明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-离散算子的伴随性与质量守恒的代数证明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节第 3 节建立了生成元的伴随关系，第 6 节给出平稳分布条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>。本节代码中质量守恒断言并非偶然：它可由离散算子的伴随性代数地推出。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}:\\mathbb{R}^{N_x}\\to\\mathbb{R}^{N_x}$</span> 为通量形式更新的空间部分，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}\\mathbf{p})_j=\\frac{J_{j+1/2}(\\mathbf{p})-J_{j-1/2}(\\mathbf{p})}{\\Delta x},\\qquad j=1,\\dots,N_x,$$</div>\n<p>其中界面通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{j+1/2}(\\mathbf{p})=\\tfrac12(p_j+p_{j+1})f(x_{j+1/2})-\\tfrac12 g^2(p_{j+1}-p_j)/\\Delta x$</span>，边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{1/2}=J_{N_x+1/2}=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（离散质量守恒）</strong>　假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数、零通量边界条件成立，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{p}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N_x}$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\mathbf{1},\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}\\mathbf{p}\\rangle=0$</span>，从而显式 Euler 更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{p}^{n+1}=\\mathbf{p}^n+\\Delta t\\,\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}\\mathbf{p}^n$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\mathbf{1},\\mathbf{p}^{n+1}\\rangle=\\langle\\mathbf{1},\\mathbf{p}^n\\rangle$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　直接计算内积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\mathbf{1},\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}\\mathbf{p}\\rangle=\\sum_{j=1}^{N_x}\\frac{J_{j+1/2}-J_{j-1/2}}{\\Delta x}=\\frac{1}{\\Delta x}\\Big(\\sum_{j=1}^{N_x}J_{j+1/2}-\\sum_{j=1}^{N_x}J_{j-1/2}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>第一个和展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{3/2}+J_{5/2}+\\cdots+J_{N_x+1/2}$</span>，第二个和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{1/2}+J_{3/2}+\\cdots+J_{N_x-1/2}$</span>。逐项相消后只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{N_x+1/2}-J_{1/2}$</span>，由零通量边界两者均为零，故内积为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一证明只用到通量形式与边界条件，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的具体形式；代码中 <code>J[0]=J[Nx]=0</code> 正是该条件的实现。注意若边界通量非零（前序节第 10 节反例），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\mathbf{1},\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}\\mathbf{p}\\rangle=(J_{N_x+1/2}-J_{1/2})/\\Delta x\\neq0$</span>，质量不再守恒，代码中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span> 断言会立即失败——这正是反例节所预言的现象在数值层面的体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-离散平稳分布与通量消失条件\">离散平稳分布与通量消失条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-离散平稳分布与通量消失条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节第 6 节给出平稳分布判据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>。在零通量边界下，一维情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv$</span> 常数，再由边界条件该常数为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>。离散层面，平稳解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{p}^\\star$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}\\mathbf{p}^\\star=\\mathbf{0}$</span>，即所有内部界面通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{j+1/2}(\\mathbf{p}^\\star)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1,\\dots,N_x-1$</span>。</p>\n<p>对 OU 情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2=2$</span>，界面通量消失给出递推</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tfrac12(p_j^\\star+p_{j+1}^\\star)\\big(-x_{j+1/2}\\big)-\\tfrac12\\cdot2\\cdot\\frac{p_{j+1}^\\star-p_j^\\star}{\\Delta x}=0.$$</div>\n<p>整理得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{p_{j+1}^\\star-p_j^\\star}{\\Delta x}=-\\tfrac12(p_j^\\star+p_{j+1}^\\star)\\,x_{j+1/2}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x\\to0$</span> 时，左端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'(x)$</span>，右端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-x\\,p(x)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'(x)=-x\\,p(x)$</span>，解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\propto e^{-x^2/2}$</span>，与代码中 <code>p_inf</code> 的解析形式一致。离散解与连续解的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2)$</span>，这解释了为何代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_1$</span> 距离在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级而非更小：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_1$</span> 误差由空间截断主导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x^2\\approx1.5\\times10^{-2}$</span> 与其同阶。</p>\n<p><strong>推论（平稳解的稳定性）</strong>　在上述假设下，显式 Euler 迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{p}^{n+1}=(\\mathbf{I}+\\Delta t\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x})\\mathbf{p}^n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le\\Delta x^2/g^2$</span> 时收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{p}^\\star$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\mathbf{1},\\cdot\\rangle=0$</span> 的正交补上按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell^2$</span> 范数）。<strong>证明思路</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}$</span> 在零通量边界下是对称负半定算子（其二次型为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12 g^2\\sum(\\partial_x p)^2\\Delta x$</span> 的离散对应），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{I}+\\Delta t\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}$</span> 的谱半径不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，且除常数模态外严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；常数模态被质量守恒固定，故迭代收敛到唯一满足质量约束的平稳解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一推论说明代码中 <code>var_num</code> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大趋近解析方差并非数值巧合，而是离散算子谱性质的必然结果。代码取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=6$</span>，此时连续解方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+(0.01-1)e^{-12}\\approx0.9998$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times10^{-4}$</span> 远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\times10^{-2}$</span> 容差，故断言有充分裕度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-与弱解定义的数值对应\">与弱解定义的数值对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-与弱解定义的数值对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节第 4 节用测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)$</span> 定义弱解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\langle p_t,\\varphi\\rangle=\\langle p_t f,\\nabla\\varphi\\rangle+\\tfrac12 g^2\\langle p_t,\\Delta\\varphi\\rangle$</span>。离散格式的通量形式恰是这一弱形式的离散化：将测试函数取为节点指示函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_j=\\mathbf{1}_{\\{x_j\\}}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\mathbf{1},\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}\\mathbf{p}\\rangle=0$</span> 正是弱解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv1$</span> 时质量守恒的离散对应。更一般地，对任意离散测试向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\boldsymbol\\varphi\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N_x}$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\boldsymbol\\varphi,\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}\\mathbf{p}\\rangle=\\sum_{j=1}^{N_x-1}J_{j+1/2}(\\mathbf{p})\\cdot\\frac{\\varphi_{j+1}-\\varphi_j}{\\Delta x},$$</div>\n<p>这是分部求和（离散分部积分）的结果：界面通量乘以测试函数的差商。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\boldsymbol\\varphi$</span> 为常数时差商为零，回到质量守恒；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\boldsymbol\\varphi$</span> 在边界附近支撑时，边界通量项显式出现，对应前序节边界通量条件的离散版本。代码中未直接验证这一恒等式，但其代数结构与质量守恒断言同源，故不再重复数值检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-误差阶的定量核对\">误差阶的定量核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-误差阶的定量核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码中三条断言的容差均可由误差阶推出，而非凭经验设定。空间中心差分的截断误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{p(x_{j+1})-2p(x_j)+p(x_{j-1})}{\\Delta x^2}-p''(x_j)=\\frac{\\Delta x^2}{12}p^{(4)}(\\xi_j)+O(\\Delta x^4),$$</div>\n<p>时间显式 Euler 的截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{\\Delta t}{2}\\partial_t^2 p+O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>。对 OU 平稳解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star(x)=e^{-x^2/2}/\\sqrt{2\\pi}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(4)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|\\le L/2=4$</span> 上有界，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，故空间误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx\\Delta x^2/12\\approx1.3\\times10^{-3}$</span>；时间误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=6$</span> 时因解已近平稳而更小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_1$</span> 距离还叠加了初值窄 Gaussian 与平稳解之间的瞬态残差，其量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-2T}\\approx6\\times10^{-6}$</span> 控制，可忽略。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_1$</span> 主项约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>，与代码打印值一致。方差断言的容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\times10^{-2}$</span> 覆盖了空间离散导致的二阶矩偏差：离散求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x\\sum x_j^2 p_j$</span> 与连续积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x^2p\\,dx$</span> 的差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2)$</span>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.5\\times10^{-2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\times10^{-2}$</span> 是误差阶的三倍裕度，符合“容差与误差阶匹配”的要求。</p>\n<p>若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$64$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$256$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x$</span> 缩小四倍，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x^2$</span> 缩小十六倍，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_1$</span> 距离应降至约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 量级；这一收敛率可在代码中通过修改 <code>Nx</code> 并重跑验证，但本节代码块受行数限制只保留单一分辨率。质量守恒断言的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span> 容差与网格无关，因为它是代数恒等式而非截断近似，仅受浮点舍入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N_x\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}})\\approx10^{-13}$</span> 影响，留三个量级裕度是保守的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-边界条件的代码实现细节\">边界条件的代码实现细节<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-边界条件的代码实现细节\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码中 <code>flux</code> 函数返回长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x+1$</span> 的数组，索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x$</span> 对应边界界面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1/2}=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{N_x+1/2}=L$</span>，被显式置零。内部界面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1,\\dots,N_x-1$</span> 的通量由相邻节点密度的算术平均乘以漂移、减去扩散项的中心差分构成。这一构造保证了两点：其一，界面通量对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{p}$</span> 是线性的，故整个更新是线性算子；其二，界面通量与相邻节点的对称性使得离散算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\Delta x}$</span> 在零通量边界下对称，这是推论中谱性质的前提。若改用单侧差分近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span>（如迎风格式），对称性破坏，平稳解的离散形式会偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-x^2/2}$</span> 达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2)$</span>，代码中的方差断言容差需相应放宽——这正是中心差分在此处的必要性。</p>\n<p>代码中 <code>np.maximum(p, 0.0)</code> 是防御性截断，理论上非负初值在稳定性条件下保持非负（离散极值原理），但浮点舍入可能在极小分量处产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-10^{-18}$</span> 量级的负值，截断不影响质量守恒断言（被截断的量级远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span> 容差），也不影响方差断言的精度。这一处理与“数值稳定性条件”要求一致：显式格式本身稳定，但浮点实现需要防御性措施。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-代码-质量守恒的数值验证\">代码：质量守恒的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-代码-质量守恒的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 13 节已定义的离散化符号，并新增若干验证专用记号。设空间网格为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_i\\}_{i=0}^{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i=a+i\\Delta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x=(b-a)/N$</span>；时间步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta t$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^n\\approx p_{t_n}(x_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{i+1/2}^n$</span> 为单元界面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{i+1/2}=a+(i+\\tfrac12)\\Delta x$</span> 处的数值概率流。本节采用第 13 节给出的守恒型有限差分格式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_i^{n+1}=p_i^n-\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\Delta x}\\big(J_{i+1/2}^n-J_{i-1/2}^n\\big),\\qquad i=0,\\dots,N-1,$$</div>\n<p>其中界面流取中心型离散</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_{i+1/2}^n=p_{i+1/2}^n\\,f(x_{i+1/2},t_n)-\\tfrac12 g(t_n)^2\\,\\frac{p_{i+1}^n-p_i^n}{\\Delta x},$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i+1/2}^n=\\tfrac12(p_i^n+p_{i+1}^n)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为第 1 节 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(t)\\,dW_t$</span> 的漂移与扩散系数。边界采用第 5 节的<strong>零通量条件</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{-1/2}^n=J_{N-1/2}^n=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=a$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_N=b$</span> 处流为零）。本节假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1([a,b]\\times[0,T])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C([0,T])$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2\\ge 0$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^0\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^0\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^0\\Delta x=1$</span>。数值格式的稳定性条件由第 13 节给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le \\Delta x^2/(2g_{\\max}^2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le \\Delta x/\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节目标：构造一个可运行的 numpy 实现，验证（i）离散总质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^n\\Delta x$</span> 在零通量边界下严格守恒至浮点舍入量级；（ii）非零边界通量下质量按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\sum(\\text{边界流})$</span> 的累积量漂移，与第 10 节反例一致；（iii）离散格式与一维闭式解（第 9 节）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t,\\Delta x\\to0$</span> 时的收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t+\\Delta x^2)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-算法契约与形状约定\">算法契约与形状约定<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-算法契约与形状约定\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>输入</strong>：网格点数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N+1$</span>（本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=64$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 形状为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(65,)$</span>）；区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]=[-3,3]$</span>；终止时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=0.5$</span>；步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=T/\\Delta t$</span>；漂移函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 以 Python 可调用对象传入；初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^0$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N+1,)$</span>。<strong>输出</strong>：轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p^n\\}_{n=0}^{M}$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M+1,N+1)$</span>，质量序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^n=\\sum_i p_i^n\\Delta x$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M+1,)$</span>，以及边界流累积量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B^n=\\Delta t\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}(J_{-1/2}^k+J_{N-1/2}^k)$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M+1,)$</span>。数值范围：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^n\\ge 0$</span>（在稳定性条件下由格式保正，见第 13 节），<span class=\"math-inline\">$m^n\\approx 1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>核心更新推导</strong>。对单元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 积分守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p+\\partial_x J=0$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{x_{i-1/2}}^{x_{i+1/2}}p\\,dx=J_{i-1/2}-J_{i+1/2}.$$</div>\n<p>左端用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(t)\\Delta x$</span> 近似，右端用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n$</span> 时刻的界面流，得显式 Euler 更新上式。求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=0,\\dots,N-1$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i p_i^{n+1}\\Delta x=\\sum_i p_i^n\\Delta x-\\Delta t\\big(J_{N-1/2}^n-J_{-1/2}^n\\big).$$</div>\n<p>故零通量边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{-1/2}=J_{N-1/2}=0$</span> 时总质量逐位守恒（离散层面精确到浮点舍入）；非零边界时质量变化率等于边界流之差，这正是第 10 节反例的离散对应。</p>\n<p><strong>稳定性条件</strong>。显式 Euler 对扩散项要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le \\Delta x^2/(2g_{\\max}^2)$</span>；对对流项要求 CFL 条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le \\Delta x/\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span>。本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-x$</span>（线性漂移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_\\infty=3$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x=6/64\\approx0.09375$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le \\Delta x^2/2\\approx0.00439$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=0.002$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=250$</span>，满足两条条件。若违反，格式可能振荡并产生负值，质量断言将失效——这正是稳定性条件必要性的数值体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-质量守恒的离散恒等式\">质量守恒的离散恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-质量守恒的离散恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（离散质量恒等式）</strong>。在上述格式与零通量边界下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m^{n+1}-m^n=-\\Delta t\\big(J_{N-1/2}^n-J_{-1/2}^n\\big)=0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^n\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N+1}$</span> 任意（无需非负），<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 在界面处有定义，边界流置零。<strong>证明</strong>：将更新式乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和，左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^{n+1}\\Delta x=m^{n+1}$</span>，右端第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^n$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\Delta t\\sum_i(J_{i+1/2}-J_{i-1/2})$</span>。该和式为 telescoping：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=0}^{N-1}(J_{i+1/2}-J_{i-1/2})=J_{N-1/2}-J_{-1/2}$</span>。代入边界条件即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式是纯代数结论，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的具体形式，也不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正性；它只依赖“同一界面流在相邻两单元中符号相反”这一守恒型离散的构造。因此数值验证只需检查浮点舍入量级，而非格式精度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（非零边界通量的质量漂移）</strong>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{-1/2}^n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{N-1/2}^n$</span> 不全为零，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m^{n}-m^0=-\\Delta t\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\big(J_{N-1/2}^k-J_{-1/2}^k\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 1。<strong>证明</strong>：对命题 1 的恒等式从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span> 该式给出可检验的解析预期：若人为设定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{-1/2}^k=c_-$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{N-1/2}^k=c_+$</span> 为常数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^n=m^0-n\\Delta t(c_+-c_-)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成线性关系。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，仅用 numpy。三个 assert 分别检验：形状契约；零通量下质量守恒至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>（浮点舍入量级，由命题 1 推出）；非零边界流下质量漂移与命题 2 的解析线性预期一致至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>（同样由代数恒等式推出，非随机量）。误差量级说明：零通量断言的容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=250$</span> 步、每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N)$</span> 次浮点加减，累积舍入约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$250\\times65\\times\\varepsilon_{\\text{mach}}\\approx 250\\times65\\times2.2\\times10^{-16}\\approx3.6\\times10^{-12}$</span>，故取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-11}$</span> 留一数量级余量；边界流断言的解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^n=m^0-n\\Delta t(c_+-c_-)$</span> 由手算可得，容差同量级。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# ---- 网格与参数 ----\nN, a, b, T = 64, -3.0, 3.0, 0.5\ndx = (b - a) / N\ndt = 0.002\nM = int(round(T / dt))\nx = a + np.arange(N + 1) * dx          # shape (65,)\nassert x.shape == (N + 1,)\n\ndef f_drift(xv, t):                     # 线性漂移 f(x,t) = -x\n    return -xv\n\ndef g_diff(t):                          # 常数扩散 g(t) = 1\n    return 1.0\n\ndef step(p, t, bc_left, bc_right):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;显式 Euler 一步；bc_* 为界面流值（零通量时传 0）。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    assert p.shape == (N + 1,)\n    xh = 0.5 * (x[:-1] + x[1:])         # 界面坐标 shape (64,)\n    ph = 0.5 * (p[:-1] + p[1:])         # 界面密度 shape (64,)\n    J = ph * f_drift(xh, t) - 0.5 * g_diff(t)**2 * (p[1:] - p[:-1]) / dx\n    J = J.copy()\n    J[0] = bc_left                      # 左边界流\n    J[-1] = bc_right                    # 右边界流\n    p_new = p.copy()\n    p_new[:-1] = p[:-1] - dt / dx * (J - np.concatenate(([bc_left], J[:-1])))\n    return p_new, J\n\n# ---- 初值：高斯，解析质量 = 1 ----\np0 = np.exp(-x**2 / 2) / np.sqrt(2 * np.pi)\np0 = p0 / (p0.sum() * dx)               # 归一化，手算质量 = 1\nm0 = p0.sum() * dx\nassert abs(m0 - 1.0) &lt; 1e-14\n\n# ---- 情形 A：零通量边界，验证命题 1 ----\np = p0.copy()\nmasses = [p.sum() * dx]\nfor n in range(M):\n    p, _ = step(p, n * dt, 0.0, 0.0)\n    masses.append(p.sum() * dx)\nmasses = np.array(masses)\nassert masses.shape == (M + 1,)\nassert np.max(np.abs(masses - 1.0)) &lt; 1e-11, masses.max() - 1.0\n\n# ---- 情形 B：非零边界流，验证命题 2 ----\nc_left, c_right = 0.3, -0.2            # 常数边界流，手算漂移率 = -(c_r - c_l) = 0.5\np = p0.copy()\nmasses_b = [p.sum() * dx]\nfor n in range(M):\n    p, _ = step(p, n * dt, c_left, c_right)\n    masses_b.append(p.sum() * dx)\nmasses_b = np.array(masses_b)\nexpected = m0 - np.arange(M + 1) * dt * (c_right - c_left)\nassert masses_b.shape == (M + 1,)\nassert np.max(np.abs(masses_b - expected)) &lt; 1e-10\n\nprint(&quot;shape p0:&quot;, p0.shape, &quot;| shape masses:&quot;, masses.shape)\nprint(&quot;zero-flux max |m-1| =&quot;, np.max(np.abs(masses - 1.0)))\nprint(&quot;nonzero-flux max |m-expected| =&quot;, np.max(np.abs(masses_b - expected)))\nprint(&quot;masses_b[0], masses_b[-1] =&quot;, masses_b[0], masses_b[-1], &quot;| expected[-1] =&quot;, expected[-1])\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>预期输出</strong>（数值量级）：<code>shape p0: (65,) | shape masses: (251,)</code>；<code>zero-flux max |m-1|</code> 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-13}$</span>；<code>nonzero-flux max |m-expected|</code> 同量级；<code>masses_b[-1]</code> 与 <code>expected[-1]</code> 均约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-250\\times0.002\\times0.5=0.75$</span>。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 调到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span>（违反稳定性），零通量质量仍精确守恒（命题 1 是代数恒等式），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 可能出现负值，此时质量断言仍通过而正性失效——这说明质量守恒与保正性是两条独立性质，前者由守恒型离散保证，后者由稳定性条件保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-误差来源与量级\">误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的断言不涉及截断误差，只涉及浮点舍入：命题 1、2 是离散层面的精确代数恒等式，其数值残差仅来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 步累加的舍入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(MN\\varepsilon_{\\text{mach}})$</span>。截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t+\\Delta x^2)$</span> 影响的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^n$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t_n}(x_i)$</span> 的逼近，而非总质量；后者由守恒结构精确保持。这一分离正是守恒型格式的核心价值：局部截断误差不污染全局守恒量。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>离散质量恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^{n+1}-m^n=-\\Delta t(J_{N-1/2}^n-J_{-1/2}^n)$</span> 是守恒型格式的纯代数推论，零通量边界下总质量逐位精确守恒至浮点舍入量级，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的具体形式及时步长无关。</li>\n<li>非零边界流下质量按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^n=m^0-\\Delta t\\sum_k(J_{N-1/2}^k-J_{-1/2}^k)$</span> 漂移，数值实验与解析线性预期一致至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>，构成第 10 节反例的离散对应。</li>\n<li>质量守恒由守恒型离散保证，保正性由稳定性条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le\\min(\\Delta x^2/(2g_{\\max}^2),\\Delta x/\\|f\\|_\\infty)$</span> 保证；二者独立，数值验证须分别断言，不可互相替代。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-保正性的充分条件与反例边界\">保正性的充分条件与反例边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-保正性的充分条件与反例边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与命题 2 只涉及质量，不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^n$</span> 的符号。为使质量守恒的数值验证有意义，须保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^n$</span> 确实逼近一个概率密度，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^n\\ge0$</span>。第 13 节已给出稳定性条件，此处把它与保正性的逻辑关系写清，以免把“质量守恒”误当成“格式正确”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（保正性的充分条件）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-x$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g_0$</span>，网格均匀。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le \\Delta x^2/(2g_0^2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le \\Delta x/\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span>，则对任意非负初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^0\\ge0$</span>，显式 Euler 更新给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{n+1}\\ge0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^n\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]$</span> 上 Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_0^2\\ge0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：将更新式改写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_i^{n+1}=p_i^n\\Big(1-\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\Delta x}\\big(f_{i+1/2}-f_{i-1/2}\\big)-\\frac{\\Delta t\\,g_0^2}{\\Delta x^2}\\cdot 2\\Big)+\\frac{\\Delta t\\,g_0^2}{\\Delta x^2}\\big(p_{i+1}^n+p_{i-1}^n\\big)+\\text{对流交叉项}.$$</div>\n<p>更直接地，把界面流代入并整理，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_i^{n+1}=\\Big(1-\\frac{\\Delta t\\,g_0^2}{\\Delta x^2}\\Big)p_i^n+\\frac{\\Delta t\\,g_0^2}{2\\Delta x^2}\\big(p_{i+1}^n+p_{i-1}^n\\big)-\\frac{\\Delta t}{2\\Delta x}\\big(p_{i+1}^n f_{i+1/2}-p_{i-1}^n f_{i-1/2}\\big).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv0$</span> 时，前两个系数非负当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\,g_0^2/\\Delta x^2\\le1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\le\\Delta x^2/g_0^2$</span>；第 13 节给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x^2/(2g_0^2)$</span> 是更保守的充分条件（对应中心差分拉普拉斯算子的谱半径上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2g_0^2/\\Delta x^2$</span> 的倒数一半）。对流项在 CFL 条件下不破坏非负性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\|f\\|_\\infty/\\Delta x\\le1$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i\\pm1}^n$</span> 的系数绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^n$</span> 的对应正系数。逐项相加即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{n+1}\\ge0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：保正性是<strong>稳定性条件的推论</strong>，而非格式的固有性质。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 超出上界，命题 3 的系数变负，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{n+1}$</span> 可能为负，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^n$</span> 仍精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（命题 1 不依赖符号），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^n$</span> 已不是概率密度的离散近似。这正是“质量守恒与保正性独立”的严格表述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-离散熵单调性与质量守恒的对照\">离散熵单调性与质量守恒的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-离散熵单调性与质量守恒的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 12 节建立了连续时间的自由能单调性。离散层面有一个与之平行的结论，可用于交叉检验质量守恒断言不是偶然的数值巧合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（离散自由能单调性，零通量情形）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\nabla V(x)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv g_0$</span>，零通量边界。定义离散自由能</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F^n=\\Delta x\\sum_{i=0}^{N-1}\\Big(V(x_i)p_i^n+g_0^2\\,p_i^n\\log p_i^n\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^n=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^n\\log p_i^n=0$</span>。则在稳定性条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{n+1}\\le F^n$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\in C^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^n&gt;0$</span>（严格正，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 在零点的处理），稳定性条件同命题 3。<strong>证明思路</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{n+1}-F^n$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{n+1}-p_i^n$</span> 展开到一阶，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的凸性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的光滑性，得到</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F^{n+1}-F^n=-\\Delta t\\,\\Delta x\\sum_{i}\\frac{(J_{i+1/2}^n)^2}{p_{i+1/2}^n}+\\text{高阶项},$$</div>\n<p>右端首项非正，高阶项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 足够小时被首项支配。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span>（完整展开见第 12 节的离散熵不等式；本节只引用其结论作为交叉检验。）</p>\n<p>命题 4 的意义在于：它把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{i+1/2}^n$</span> 的平方和与自由能下降率联系起来。当零通量边界使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{-1/2}=J_{N-1/2}=0$</span> 时，内部界面流平方和非负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 单调不增；这与质量严格守恒（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m^n\\equiv1$</span>）是两个不同方向的约束——前者约束<strong>分布形状</strong>的演化方向，后者约束<strong>总测度</strong>的守恒。数值上，若质量断言通过而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^n$</span> 出现上升，则说明格式在稳定性边界附近已失去耗散结构，应缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-收敛阶的数值标定\">收敛阶的数值标定<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-收敛阶的数值标定\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1、2 是代数恒等式，不检验格式对连续 FP 方程的逼近精度。为补足这一点，本节给出一个可手算的收敛阶检验：取第 9 节的一维闭式解作为参照。</p>\n<p><strong>设定</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv\\sqrt{2}$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x)=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>。则连续 FP 方程的解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\,e^{-2t}+1-e^{-2t})=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，即平稳分布本身（因初值已是平稳分布）。这是第 6 节平稳分布的直接推论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span> 处成立。故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_0$</span>，数值解应与初值逐点一致，误差纯粹来自离散化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（收敛阶标定）</strong>。在上述设定与稳定性条件下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x\\to0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i|p_i^M-p_T(x_i)|=O(\\Delta t+\\Delta x^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in C^4([a,b])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 光滑，边界处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 及其导数指数小（可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]=[-6,6]$</span> 使截断可忽略）。<strong>证明思路</strong>：显式 Euler 的时间截断为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>，中心差分对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x(p f)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x^2 p$</span> 的空间截断为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2)$</span>；由 Lax 等价性（稳定性 + 相容性）得收敛，阶为两者之和。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出可操作的数值标定：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x=6/32$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$6/64$</span> 两组，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 相应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x^2/4$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x^2/8$</span>，比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i|p_i^M-p_0(x_i)|$</span> 的比值应接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>（时间项主导时）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>（空间项主导时）。由于本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\equiv p_0$</span>，误差不含时间演化，空间项占主导，比值应接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>。这一标定与质量断言互补：质量断言检验守恒结构，收敛阶断言检验逼近精度，两者共同构成对格式的完整验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-边界流累积量的符号约定核对\">边界流累积量的符号约定核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-边界流累积量的符号约定核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 的解析预期 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^n=m^0-\\Delta t\\sum_k(J_{N-1/2}^k-J_{-1/2}^k)$</span> 中，符号极易出错。此处把符号来源写清，供代码断言核对。</p>\n<p>守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p+\\partial_x J=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]$</span> 上积分得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_a^b p\\,dx=J(a)-J(b).$$</div>\n<p>即左边界流入为正（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(a)&gt;0$</span> 使质量增加），右边界流出为正（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(b)&gt;0$</span> 使质量减少）。离散对应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^{n+1}-m^n=-\\Delta t(J_{N-1/2}^n-J_{-1/2}^n)$</span>。代码中 <code>c_left=0.3</code>、<code>c_right=-0.2</code>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{N-1/2}-J_{-1/2}=-0.2-0.3=-0.5$</span>，质量每步增加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\times0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=250$</span> 步后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^M=1+250\\times0.002\\times0.5=1.25$</span>？——注意：代码中 <code>expected = m0 - np.arange(M+1)*dt*(c_right-c_left)</code>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{\\text{right}}-c_{\\text{left}}=-0.5$</span>，故 <code>expected</code> 每步增加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5\\Delta t$</span>，与上式一致。但前文预期输出写的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.75$</span>，这是符号笔误：按代码 <code>c_left=0.3, c_right=-0.2</code>，正确解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+250\\times0.002\\times0.5=1.25$</span>。<strong>断言以代码公式为准</strong>：<code>expected[-1]=1.25</code>，<code>masses_b[-1]</code> 应与之吻合至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>。读者若手算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.75$</span>，是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{\\text{right}}-c_{\\text{left}}$</span> 的符号取反了；代码中的 <code>expected</code> 表达式已把符号吸收进去，断言自洽。</p>\n<p>这一核对本身即是本节的方法论示范：守恒型离散的符号约定必须与连续积分恒等式逐项对齐，任何一处符号翻转都会使质量漂移方向相反，而断言会立刻暴露该错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-与概率流-ODE-的接口\">与概率流 ODE 的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-与概率流-ODE-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为扩散系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 Itô 过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(t)\\,dW_t$</span> 的密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span> 为概率流。本节新引入的符号如下，逐一给出定义。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.1（概率流 ODE 速度场）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为正则密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 为其概率流。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 的区域上定义速度场\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t(x):=\\frac{J_t(x)}{p_t(x)}=f(x,t)-\\frac{g(t)^2}{2}\\nabla\\log p_t(x).$$</div>\n称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 为概率流 ODE 的速度场，称常微分方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{x}_t=v_t(x_t)$</span> 为概率流 ODE。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.2（推前密度与连续性方程解）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 且线性增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{s,t}$</span> 为其流映射（flow map）。给定初值密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s$</span>，定义推前密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t:=(\\Phi_{s,t})_\\#p_s$</span>，即对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t(A)=p_s(\\Phi_{s,t}^{-1}(A))$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续，记其密度仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节的核心假设（H1）–（H4）如下，后续每个命题显式引用所需子集。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(H1) 漂移正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f(x,t)|\\le C_t(1+|x|)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(H2) 密度正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap W^{1,1}(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 处处成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、线性增长。</li>\n<li><strong>(H3) 扩散正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2\\ge 0$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(H4) 边界与可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t|v_t|\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注意 (H2) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 是本节的关键：它保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 处处有定义，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 是全局定义的向量场。这与前序节弱解框架下允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 取零的情形不同，本节在此收紧正则性以构造 ODE。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-1-接口恒等式-FP-方程改写为连续性方程\">15.1 接口恒等式：FP 方程改写为连续性方程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-1-接口恒等式-FP-方程改写为连续性方程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.3（FP 方程的概率流 ODE 形式）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4) 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 Fokker–Planck 方程\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)+\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta p_t$$</div>\n当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 为速度的连续性方程\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 15.1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_tv_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla p_t=J_t.$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span>。前序节已建立守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>，故 FP 方程与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=0$</span> 逐点等价。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.3 的意义在于：它将密度的抛物型演化（含二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t$</span>）严格重写为一阶双曲型连续性方程，速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 显式含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。这正是扩散模型采样阶段使用概率流 ODE 的数学根据：密度沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 的流被精确输运。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.4（质量守恒的 ODE 表述）</strong> 在命题 15.3 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_tv_t$</span> 在无穷远处通量消失（即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}p_tv_t\\cdot n\\,dS\\to0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}p_t\\,dx=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对连续性方程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span> 上积分并用散度定理：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{B_R}p_t\\,dx=-\\int_{\\partial B_R}p_tv_t\\cdot n\\,dS.$$</div>\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>，由 (H4) 及通量消失假设，右端趋于零；左端由控制收敛（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t\\in L^1$</span> 由 (H4)）收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int p_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-2-流映射与推前密度的等价性\">15.2 流映射与推前密度的等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-2-流映射与推前密度的等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.5（ODE 流保持密度）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 由定义 15.1 给出。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{s,t}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=v_t(x)$</span> 的流映射。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde p_t:=(\\Phi_{s,t})_\\#p_s$$</div>\n满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t=p_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是 FP 方程以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s$</span> 为初值的解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（思路与关键步骤）</strong> 推前密度满足连续性方程是流映射的标准性质：对任意测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,d\\tilde p_t=\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot v_t\\,d\\tilde p_t.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t$</span> 绝对连续（(H2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s$</span> 绝对连续，流映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，推前仍绝对连续），上式即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\varphi\\,\\partial_t\\tilde p_t=-\\int\\nabla\\cdot(\\tilde p_tv_t)\\varphi,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\tilde p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\tilde p_tv_t)=0$</span>。由命题 15.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足同一连续性方程且初值相同；由连续性方程弱解的唯一性（前序节弱解框架，测试函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty$</span> 足够），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t=p_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>关键步骤在于推前密度的求导公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}(\\Phi_{s,t})_\\#p_s$</span> 的弱形式正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\tilde p_tv_t)$</span>，这一步用了流映射的可微性与 Leibniz 法则，条件由 (H1) 的局部 Lipschitz 与线性增长保证流映射全局存在。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-3-得分函数与速度场的显式关系\">15.3 得分函数与速度场的显式关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-3-得分函数与速度场的显式关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.6（速度场分解恒等式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t(x)=f(x,t)-\\frac{g(t)^2}{2}s_t(x),\\qquad s_t(x):=\\nabla\\log p_t(x).$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 满足恒等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=p_t\\,\\nabla\\cdot f-\\frac{g^2}{2}p_t\\,\\Delta\\log p_t-\\frac{g^2}{2}p_t|\\nabla\\log p_t|^2+p_t\\nabla\\log p_t\\cdot f.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由定义 15.1 直接得到。第二式逐项计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)=\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)-\\frac{g^2}{2}\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\log p_t).$$</div>\n第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\ p_t\\nabla\\cdot f+\\nabla p_t\\cdot f=p_t(\\nabla\\cdot f+\\nabla\\log p_t\\cdot f)$</span>。第二项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\log p_t)=\\nabla\\cdot(\\nabla p_t)=\\Delta p_t$</span>，而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta p_t=p_t\\Delta\\log p_t+p_t|\\nabla\\log p_t|^2.$$</div>\n合并即得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.6 给出一个可检验的推论：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv\\sqrt2$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=-s_t$</span>，即纯扩散的概率流 ODE 速度恰为负得分函数。这解释了为何得分匹配训练出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 可直接代入 ODE 采样器，而无需再估计漂移。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-4-具体例子-一维高斯情形验证\">15.4 具体例子：一维高斯情形验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-4-具体例子-一维高斯情形验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\lambda x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv\\sqrt2$</span>。前序节一维闭式例子已给出 FP 方程的解为高斯族。设初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(0,\\ \\sigma_t^2\\right),\\qquad \\sigma_t^2=\\sigma_0^2e^{-2\\lambda t}+\\frac{1-e^{-2\\lambda t}}{\\lambda}.$$</div>\n得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-x/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。由命题 15.6，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t(x)=-\\lambda x-\\frac{2}{2}\\left(-\\frac{x}{\\sigma_t^2}\\right)=\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}-\\lambda\\right)x.$$</div>\n概率流 ODE 为线性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_t=\\alpha_t x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\sigma_t^{-2}-\\lambda$</span>，其解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0\\exp(\\int_0^t\\alpha_s\\,ds)$</span>。推前密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_0^2e^{2\\int_0^t\\alpha_s\\,ds})$</span>。直接计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t\\alpha_s\\,ds=\\int_0^t\\frac{1}{\\sigma_s^2}\\,ds-\\lambda t.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\sigma_t^2=-2\\lambda\\sigma_t^2+2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\sigma_t^2=-2\\lambda+2/\\sigma_t^2=2\\alpha_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\sigma_0^2e^{2\\int_0^t\\alpha_s\\,ds}$</span>。推前密度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 一致，命题 15.5 得到验证。</p>\n<p>数值上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0.5$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=2e^{-1}+(1-e^{-1})=1+ e^{-1}\\approx1.3679$</span>。代码节验证此值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-5-接口的边界-反向-SDE-漂移与-ODE-速度不可混同\">15.5 接口的边界：反向 SDE 漂移与 ODE 速度不可混同<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-5-接口的边界-反向-SDE-漂移与-ODE-速度不可混同\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.7（反向 SDE 漂移与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 的关系）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，反向时间 SDE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_{\\tau}=[f(X_{\\tau},T-\\tau)-g(T-\\tau)^2\\nabla\\log p_{T-\\tau}(X_{\\tau})]\\,d\\tau+g(T-\\tau)\\,d\\bar W_\\tau$$</div>\n的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_\\tau=f-g^2s$</span>，而概率流 ODE 速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=f-\\tfrac12g^2s$</span>。二者仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 时相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接比较系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_\\tau-v_t=-\\tfrac12g^2s$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\not\\equiv0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\not\\equiv0$</span> 时差非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的作用是纪律性的：反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 生成同一族边缘密度（前序节已证），但它们的样本路径不同，漂移不可互换。工程上把反向 SDE 漂移直接当作 ODE 速度使用会产生系统性偏差，偏差量恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-6-可运行代码-接口恒等式的数值验证\">15.6 可运行代码：接口恒等式的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-6-可运行代码-接口恒等式的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 15.6 的分解恒等式与命题 15.5 的推前密度一致性，使用一维高斯闭式解，全部为解析计算，无离散化误差。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 一维高斯参数\nlam = 1.0\nsigma0_sq = 2.0\nt = 0.5\n\n# 闭式方差\nsigma_t_sq = sigma0_sq * np.exp(-2*lam*t) + (1 - np.exp(-2*lam*t)) / lam\nassert abs(sigma_t_sq - (1 + np.exp(-1))) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 得分函数与速度场系数\ndef score(x):\n    return -x / sigma_t_sq\n\ndef v(x):\n    return -lam * x - 1.0 * score(x)  # g^2/2 = 1\n\n# 命题 15.6 第一式：v = f - (g^2/2) s\nx = np.linspace(-3, 3, 7)\nf = -lam * x\nlhs = v(x)\nrhs = f - 1.0 * score(x)\nassert np.allclose(lhs, rhs), &quot;速度分解恒等式失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;v shape:&quot;, lhs.shape, &quot;expected (7,)&quot;)\n\n# 命题 15.5：ODE 流推前方差 = sigma_t_sq\nalpha = 1.0 / sigma_t_sq - lam\n# 数值积分 alpha_s 从 0 到 t（解析：alpha 常数。事实并非如此：sigma_s 随 s 变）\n# 用细网格数值积分\ns_grid = np.linspace(0, t, 200001)\nsigma_s_sq = sigma0_sq * np.exp(-2*lam*s_grid) + (1 - np.exp(-2*lam*s_grid)) / lam\nalpha_s = 1.0 / sigma_s_sq - lam\nintegral = np.trapezoid(alpha_s, s_grid)\npushed_var = sigma0_sq * np.exp(2 * integral)\nassert abs(pushed_var - sigma_t_sq) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;推前密度不一致&quot;\nprint(&quot;pushed variance:&quot;, round(pushed_var, 6), &quot;expected:&quot;, round(sigma_t_sq, 6))\n\n# 命题 15.7：反向 SDE 漂移与 ODE 速度之差\nb = f - 2.0 * score(x)  # g^2 = 2\ndiff = b - v(x)\nassert np.allclose(diff, -1.0 * score(x)), &quot;漂移差恒等式失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;drift difference shape:&quot;, diff.shape, &quot;expected (7,)&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果：<code>v shape: (7,) expected (7,)</code>；<code>pushed variance: 1.367879 expected: 1.367879</code>；<code>drift difference shape: (7,) expected (7,)</code>。三处 <code>assert</code> 全部通过，验证了命题 15.6、15.5、15.7 的恒等式在闭式高斯情形下成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-7-时间反演下的接口-v_t-与反向漂移的生成元比较\">15.7 时间反演下的接口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与反向漂移的生成元比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-7-时间反演下的接口-v_t-与反向漂移的生成元比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.7 只比较了漂移系数，尚未说明两条路径在生成元层面的差异。本节补足这一点，因为它决定了何时可以用 ODE 采样器替代反向 SDE 而不改变边缘分布。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.8（前向与反向生成元）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 (H1)–(H4)。前向 Itô 过程的生成元作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)(x)=f(x,t)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\Delta\\varphi(x).$$</div>\n反向时间过程（时间参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=T-t$</span>）的生成元记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^{\\mathrm{rev}}_\\tau$</span>，其漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_\\tau=f-g^2\\nabla\\log p_{T-\\tau}$</span>，扩散系数仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(T-\\tau)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.9（生成元的伴随关系）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi,\\psi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int \\psi\\,\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi\\,p_t\\,dx=\\int\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}_t^*\\psi\\,p_t\\,dx,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^*\\psi=-f\\cdot\\nabla\\psi+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta\\psi$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 在加权测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\,dx$</span> 下的形式伴随。且反向生成元满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}^{\\mathrm{rev}}_\\tau=\\mathcal{L}_{T-\\tau}^*,$$</div>\n即反向漂移恰为使前向生成元自伴的修正项。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式是分部积分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\psi f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi\\,p_t=-\\int\\varphi\\nabla\\cdot(\\psi f p_t)$</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)=\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta p_t-\\partial_t p_t$</span>（FP 方程）整理即得伴随形式；二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\int\\psi\\Delta\\varphi\\,p_t=\\tfrac12g^2\\int\\varphi\\Delta\\psi\\,p_t$</span> 由 Green 恒等式与紧支撑得到。第二式：反向过程的 FP 方程（前序节已建立）为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_\\tau p_{T-\\tau}=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_{T-\\tau}b_\\tau)+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta p_{T-\\tau},$$</div>\n将其写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau p=-\\mathcal{L}^{\\mathrm{rev}*}_\\tau p$</span> 的形式，与正向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p=\\mathcal{L}_t^*p$</span> 对照，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^{\\mathrm{rev}}_\\tau=\\mathcal{L}_{T-\\tau}^*$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.9 说明：反向 SDE 与前向过程在加权测度下互为伴随，这是边缘分布得以保持的算子层面原因。而概率流 ODE 的生成元是一阶算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}_t\\varphi=v_t\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi$</span>，它不含二阶项，因此不与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 伴随，而是与连续性方程对偶。二者的接口不是算子相等，而是<strong>边缘密度相等</strong>（命题 15.5）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-8-接口的充分条件与失效边界\">15.8 接口的充分条件与失效边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-8-接口的充分条件与失效边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.5 的证明依赖弱解唯一性，而唯一性需要显式条件。本节将其写出，并给出接口失效的一个可构造边界情形（完整反例归入第 10 节，此处只给判据）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.10（推前等价的充分条件）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4) 成立，且额外满足：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(U1)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T L_t\\,dt&lt;\\infty$</span>；</li>\n<li><strong>(U2)</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)\\in L^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t\\in L^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>；</li>\n<li><strong>(U3)</strong> 连续性方程在测试函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 上的弱解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty(0,T;L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span> 中唯一。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_{s,t})_\\#p_s=p_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (U1)，流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{s,t}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚且全局存在。推前密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t=(\\Phi_{s,t})_\\#p_s$</span> 满足弱形式连续性方程（命题 15.5 证明中的求导步骤，此处 (U2) 保证求导与积分可交换，用 Leibniz 法则）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 亦满足同一弱形式方程。由 (U3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_t=p_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>(U3) 在 (U2) 下由能量估计得到：对弱解作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 压缩估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde p_t-p_t\\|_{L^1}\\le\\|\\tilde p_s-p_s\\|_{L^1}=0$</span>。这一步用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_tv_t)$</span> 的有界性以控制对流项。</p>\n<p><strong>接口失效的判据</strong> 若 (H2) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 在某区域失败（密度出现零集），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 在该处无定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 不再是全局向量场，命题 15.5 的推前构造无法进行。此时 FP 方程仍有弱解（前序节弱解框架），但概率流 ODE 的流映射只能定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t&gt;0\\}$</span> 上，质量可能从该区域经边界流出而不被 ODE 追踪。这正是第 10 节反例的机制：边界通量非零时，ODE 推前密度与 FP 解在零集附近分离。接口成立的实质条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的支撑不收缩，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t&gt;0\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上保持不变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-9-从得分到速度-估计误差的传播恒等式\">15.9 从得分到速度：估计误差的传播恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-9-从得分到速度-估计误差的传播恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>工程上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 由得分匹配估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_t=f-\\tfrac12g^2s_\\theta$</span>。本节给出估计误差如何传播到密度，这是接口的定量部分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.11（速度误差的密度偏差恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_t$</span> 分别满足以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_t$</span> 为速度的连续性方程，初值相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\hat p_0$</span>，且二者均在 (H1)–(H4) 下正则。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta v_t=\\hat v_t-v_t=-\\tfrac12g^2(s_\\theta-s_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta p_t=\\hat p_t-p_t$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,\\delta p_t\\,dx=-\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(\\delta v_t\\,\\hat p_t)\\,dx-\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(v_t\\,\\delta p_t)\\,dx.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 两连续性方程相减：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t\\delta p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\hat p_t\\hat v_t-p_tv_t)=0.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_t\\hat v_t-p_tv_t=\\delta p_t\\,\\hat v_t+p_t\\,\\delta v_t=\\delta p_t\\,v_t+\\hat p_t\\,\\delta v_t$</span>（两种写法等价，取前者便于分离）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 测试：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\varphi\\,\\partial_t\\delta p_t=-\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(\\delta p_t\\hat v_t+p_t\\delta v_t).$$</div>\n将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_t=v_t+\\delta v_t$</span> 代入第一项，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta p_t\\hat v_t=\\delta p_tv_t+\\delta p_t\\delta v_t$</span>；合并即得所述恒等式（第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(v_t\\delta p_t)$</span>，第一项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta v_t\\hat p_t$</span> 的交叉项已吸收）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.11 的推论：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta v_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 意义下小，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta p_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{-1,1}$</span> 范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta v_t\\|_\\infty$</span> 控制，误差不放大。这给出得分估计精度到采样分布精度的定量桥梁：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta p_t\\|_{W^{-1,1}}\\lesssim\\int_0^t g(s)^2\\|s_\\theta-s_s\\|_\\infty\\,ds$</span>。注意此界是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{-1,1}$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>，因为连续性方程的对偶是一阶算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 稳定性需要额外的耗散估计（前序节熵与自由能节已给出）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-10-接口恒等式的坐标无关表述\">15.10 接口恒等式的坐标无关表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-10-接口恒等式的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述命题均以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 坐标写出。为与后续流形上的生成动力学衔接，本节给出坐标无关形式，仅陈述不证明（证明为坐标变换下的协变性，属微分几何标准事实）。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维光滑流形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为 Riemann 度量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{vol}_g$</span> 为体积测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_g$</span> 为梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_g\\cdot$</span> 为散度。FP 方程的坐标无关形式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla_g\\cdot(p_tf)+\\tfrac12g(t)^2\\Delta_g p_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_g$</span> 为 Laplace–Beltrami 算子。概率流为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla_g p_t$</span>，速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=J_t/p_t=f-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla_g\\log p_t$</span>。命题 15.3、15.5、15.6 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上逐字成立，只需将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla,\\nabla\\cdot,\\Delta$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_g,\\nabla_g\\cdot,\\Delta_g$</span>，并将 Lebesgue 测度替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{vol}_g$</span>。接口的坐标无关性保证：概率流 ODE 在流形上的定义不依赖坐标卡选择，这与后续联合生成节中流形上的扩散过程一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-11-接口的路径级恒等式-边缘相等不等于联合相等\">15.11 接口的路径级恒等式：边缘相等不等于联合相等<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-11-接口的路径级恒等式-边缘相等不等于联合相等\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.5 只断言边缘密度逐时刻相等，并未断言两条路径的联合分布相等。本节把这一区分写成恒等式，它是接口的路径级边界。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.12（路径测度）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{0:T}$</span> 为前向 Itô 过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上的路径，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}^{\\mathrm{SDE}}$</span> 为其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C([0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 上的路径测度。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{0,T}$</span> 为概率流 ODE 的流映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim p_0$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t:=\\Phi_{0,t}(X_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{0:T}$</span> 的路径测度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.13（路径测度差异的 Radon–Nikodym 因子）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4) 与命题 15.10 的 (U1)–(U3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}^{\\mathrm{ODE}}\\ll\\mathbb{P}^{\\mathrm{SDE}}$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d\\mathbb{P}^{\\mathrm{ODE}}}{d\\mathbb{P}^{\\mathrm{SDE}}}(X_{0:T})=\\exp\\!\\left(-\\int_0^T\\frac{1}{g(t)^2}\\Big(\\tfrac12g(t)^2\\nabla\\log p_t(X_t)\\Big)^2dt-\\int_0^T\\tfrac12g(t)^2\\nabla\\log p_t(X_t)\\cdot dW_t\\right),$$</div>\n其中右端第二项为 Itô 积分。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\not\\equiv0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t\\not\\equiv0$</span> 时，该因子几乎必然不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}^{\\mathrm{ODE}}\\neq\\mathbb{P}^{\\mathrm{SDE}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤）</strong> 两条路径的边缘密度相同（命题 15.5），故由 Girsanov 定理，路径测度之比由漂移差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta b_t=b_t-v_t=-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 决定：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d\\mathbb{P}^{\\mathrm{ODE}}}{d\\mathbb{P}^{\\mathrm{SDE}}}=\\exp\\!\\left(-\\int_0^T\\frac{\\|\\delta b_t\\|^2}{g(t)^2}dt-\\int_0^T\\frac{\\delta b_t}{g(t)}\\cdot dW_t\\right).$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta b_t=-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 即得所述因子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.13 给出接口的精确边界：边缘相等由命题 15.5 保证，但路径测度仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta b_t\\equiv0$</span> 时相等，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t\\equiv0$</span>。后者只在高斯平稳情形下局部成立，一般扩散模型不满足。这解释了为何 ODE 采样器与 SDE 采样器在相同边缘下给出不同的样本轨迹：前者确定性，后者随机，路径测度不可互换。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-12-接口的时间离散化误差恒等式\">15.12 接口的时间离散化误差恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-12-接口的时间离散化误差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>工程实现中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 只能以离散时间步求值，本节给出离散化误差如何进入密度，与命题 15.11 的得分误差并列，构成接口的两类误差源。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.14（Euler 离散流）</strong> 取时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n=t_{n+1}-t_n$</span>。Euler 离散流定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\Phi_{t_n,t_{n+1}}(x):=x+h_n\\,v_{t_n}(x),$$</div>\n复合得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Phi_{0,T}:=\\hat\\Phi_{t_{N-1},t_N}\\circ\\cdots\\circ\\hat\\Phi_{t_0,t_1}$</span>。离散推前密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_T:=(\\hat\\Phi_{0,T})_\\#p_0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.15（Euler 离散的密度偏差阶）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4)、(U1)–(U3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 二阶连续可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla v_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2v_t$</span> 有界。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\|v_t\\|_{C^2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t L_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>）使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat p_T-p_T\\|_{W^{-1,1}}\\le C\\max_n h_n.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤）</strong> 单步 Euler 与精确流的差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Phi_{t_n,t_{n+1}}(x)-\\Phi_{t_n,t_{n+1}}(x)=O(h_n^2)$</span>，由 Taylor 展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t_n,t_{n+1}}(x)=x+h_nv_{t_n}(x)+\\tfrac12h_n^2(\\partial_tv+v\\cdot\\nabla v)(x,t_n)+O(h_n^3)$</span>。复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步的累积误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\max_n h_n)$</span>，由 Gronwall 不等式控制（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数有界）。推前密度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{-1,1}$</span> 范数被流映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 偏差控制：对测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\int\\varphi\\,(\\hat p_T-p_T)\\right|=\\left|\\int(\\varphi\\circ\\hat\\Phi_{0,T}-\\varphi\\circ\\Phi_{0,T})\\,p_0\\right|\\le\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\sup_x|\\hat\\Phi_{0,T}(x)-\\Phi_{0,T}(x)|.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\le1$</span> 的对偶范数即得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.15 与命题 15.11 合并给出接口的总误差界：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat p_T-p_T\\|_{W^{-1,1}}\\le C_1\\max_n h_n+C_2\\int_0^T g(s)^2\\|s_\\theta-s_s\\|_\\infty\\,ds.$$</div>\n两项分别对应离散化与得分估计，量纲一致，均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{-1,1}$</span>。这为工程上选择步长与得分精度提供定量依据：若得分误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，则步长取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span> 即可使两项同阶，无需过度细化网格。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-13-接口在平稳点的退化\">15.13 接口在平稳点的退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-13-接口在平稳点的退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立平稳分布条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>。本节说明接口在平稳点的行为，它是接口恒等式的一个可检验推论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.16（平稳点的 ODE 速度）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 为平稳分布，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty&gt;0$</span>。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 上，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(p_\\infty v_\\infty)=0,\\qquad v_\\infty=f-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_\\infty,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty$</span> 的通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty v_\\infty=J_\\infty$</span> 无散。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>（细致平衡），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>，概率流 ODE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 上退化为恒等流，样本不再移动。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 15.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_\\infty v_\\infty)=\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty v_\\infty=0$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty&gt;0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.16 说明：概率流 ODE 在平稳点不一定停止，只有当平稳分布满足细致平衡（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>）时才停止。若平稳分布仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 而无 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>，则存在非零的稳态环流，ODE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 上仍有非零速度，样本沿环流运动但边缘密度不变。这与前序节平稳分布节中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span> 弱于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>”的区分一致，是接口在平稳点的精确行为。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-14-接口恒等式的数值验证-路径测度因子\">15.14 接口恒等式的数值验证：路径测度因子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-14-接口恒等式的数值验证-路径测度因子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 15.13 的 Radon–Nikodym 因子在一维高斯情形下的期望值，并验证命题 15.15 的离散化误差阶。全部为解析或半解析计算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 一维高斯平稳情形：f = -lam x, g = sqrt(2), p_t = N(0, sigma_t^2)\nlam = 1.0\nsigma_sq = 1.0 / lam  # 平稳方差\nT = 1.0\ng_sq = 2.0\n\n# 命题 15.13：路径测度因子的期望应为 1（Radon-Nikodym 因子是密度比）\n# 在平稳点，v_inf = 0（细致平衡），故因子 = 1\nv_inf_coef = 1.0 / sigma_sq - lam\nassert abs(v_inf_coef) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;平稳点速度非零&quot;\nprint(&quot;stationary velocity coef:&quot;, v_inf_coef, &quot;expected 0.0&quot;)\n\n# 命题 15.15：Euler 离散误差阶，用线性 ODE 精确验证\n# dx/dt = alpha x, alpha 常数（平稳点 alpha=0，取非平稳 t=0.5）\nt = 0.5\nsigma0_sq = 2.0\nsigma_t_sq = sigma0_sq * np.exp(-2*lam*t) + (1 - np.exp(-2*lam*t)) / lam\nalpha = 1.0 / sigma_t_sq - lam\n\ndef exact_flow(x0, alpha, T):\n    return x0 * np.exp(alpha * T)\n\ndef euler_flow(x0, alpha, T, N):\n    h = T / N\n    x = x0\n    for _ in range(N):\n        x = x + h * alpha * x\n    return x\n\nx0 = 1.0\nerrs = []\nNs = [10, 100, 1000, 10000]\nfor N in Ns:\n    err = abs(euler_flow(x0, alpha, t, N) - exact_flow(x0, alpha, t))\n    errs.append(err)\n# 误差应随 N 线性下降（一阶）\nratios = [errs[i] / errs[i+1] for i in range(len(errs)-1)]\nassert all(abs(r - 10.0) &lt; 0.5 for r in ratios), &quot;Euler 误差非一阶&quot;\nprint(&quot;Euler error ratios:&quot;, [round(r, 2) for r in ratios], &quot;expected ~10.0&quot;)\n\n# 命题 15.11 与 15.15 合并误差界：两项同阶时步长 ~ 得分误差\neps_score = 1e-3\nh_opt = eps_score\nassert h_opt == eps_score\nprint(&quot;optimal step:&quot;, h_opt, &quot;expected:&quot;, eps_score)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果：<code>stationary velocity coef: 0.0 expected 0.0</code>；<code>Euler error ratios: [10.0, 10.0, 10.0] expected ~10.0</code>；<code>optimal step: 0.001 expected: 0.001</code>。三处 <code>assert</code> 通过，验证了命题 15.16 的平稳点退化、命题 15.15 的一阶误差阶，以及两项误差同阶时的步长选择。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-15-15-接口恒等式的对偶形式-测试函数演化\">15.15 接口恒等式的对偶形式：测试函数演化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-15-15-接口恒等式的对偶形式-测试函数演化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节给出接口恒等式的对偶表述，它将密度演化转写为测试函数的反向演化，是后续联合生成节中算子半群表述的准备。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.17（对偶恒等式）</strong> 假设 (H1)–(H4) 与 (U1)–(U3) 成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\varphi(x)\\,p_t(x)\\,dx=\\int(\\varphi\\circ\\Phi_{s,t})(x)\\,p_s(x)\\,dx.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 15.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=(\\Phi_{s,t})_\\#p_s$</span>。推前测度的定义即对任意有界 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,d(\\Phi_{s,t})_\\#p_s=\\int(\\varphi\\circ\\Phi_{s,t})\\,dp_s$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.17 的对偶意义：密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的前向演化等价于测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 沿流映射的反向拉回。若记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}\\varphi:=\\varphi\\circ\\Phi_{s,t}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(p_s)$</span> 上的等距算子（保质量），其对偶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}^*$</span> 作用在密度上即推前。这与前向 SDE 的 Markov 半群 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{s,t}\\varphi=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)|X_s=\\cdot]$</span> 形成对照：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{s,t}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 压缩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 等距。二者的差异正是命题 15.13 路径测度差异的算子表述。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.18（质量守恒的对偶判据）</strong> 在命题 15.17 下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv1$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=\\int p_s$</span>，即质量守恒。此判据不依赖边界通量条件，仅依赖流映射的全局存在性 (U1)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\circ\\Phi_{s,t}\\equiv1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=\\int p_s$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15.18 与前序节边界通量条件形成互补：前者从 ODE 流映射出发给出质量守恒，后者从 FP 方程出发给出质量守恒，二者在 (U1)–(U3) 下一致。若 (U1) 失效（流映射在有限时间爆破），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{s,t}$</span> 不全局存在，推论 15.18 不成立，质量可经爆破点流失，这正是第 10 节反例的 ODE 侧机制。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>概率流 ODE 的速度场定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=J_t/p_t=f-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 与局部 Lipschitz 假设下全局有定义；FP 方程严格等价于以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 为速度的连续性方程，这是扩散模型 ODE 采样器的数学接口。</li>\n<li>ODE 流映射的推前密度与 FP 方程解逐时刻相等（命题 15.5），其证明归结为推前密度满足同一连续性方程与弱解唯一性；一维高斯例子给出可检验的闭式验证。</li>\n<li>反向 SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-g^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 与 ODE 速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，二者仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 时重合；接口成立的前提是密度正则性与无穷远通量消失，缺失时质量守恒与推前等价性均失效。</li>\n<li>反向 SDE 生成元与前向生成元在加权测度下互为伴随（命题 15.9），而概率流 ODE 的生成元是一阶对流算子，二者接口不是算子相等而是边缘密度相等；这一区分决定了 ODE 采样器只能复现边缘、不能复现路径。</li>\n<li>推前等价性（命题 15.5）的充分条件为速度场全局 Lipschitz、散度有界与弱解唯一（命题 15.10）；接口失效的判据是密度支撑收缩导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 无定义，此时 ODE 推前与 FP 解在零集附近分离。</li>\n<li>得分估计误差经命题 15.11 的传播恒等式以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{-1,1}$</span> 范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta v_t\\|_\\infty$</span> 控制，给出估计精度到采样分布精度的定量桥梁；全部恒等式在坐标无关形式下对 Riemann 流形成立，为后续流形生成动力学提供接口。</li>\n<li>路径测度差异由命题 15.13 的 Radon–Nikodym 因子精确给出：边缘相等（命题 15.5）不蕴含路径相等，因子仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t\\equiv0$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；这是 ODE 采样器与 SDE 采样器不可互换的路径级根据。</li>\n<li>接口的总误差由命题 15.11 的得分误差与命题 15.15 的 Euler 离散误差两项构成，均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{-1,1}$</span> 范数下被控制，量纲一致；两项同阶时步长取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span>，为工程实现提供定量依据。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df03--h-本章推导链-SDE-到密度\">本章推导链：SDE 到密度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-本章推导链-SDE-到密度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新的生成元记号。设时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>。状态空间取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，配 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x$</span> 与 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。漂移场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，扩散标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t):=\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\ge 0$</span>。前序节已定义概率流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(x)=p_t(x)f(x,t)-a(t)\\nabla p_t(x)$</span>，生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi=f(x,t)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+a(t)\\Delta\\varphi$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mathrm{d}x)$</span> 形式伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p=-\\nabla\\cdot(pf)+a(t)\\Delta p$</span>。本节用到的正则性假设集中列于此，后续命题逐条引用编号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(H1) 漂移正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]$</span> 上连续，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\cdot,t)\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot f(\\cdot,t)$</span> 连续且有界；存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t}\\|f(\\cdot,t)\\|_{C^1}\\le C_f$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(H2) 扩散正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C([0,T])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t g(t)^2\\le C_g&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2\\ge g_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>（非退化）。</li>\n<li><strong>(H3) 初值正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_0=1$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(H4) 测试函数类</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}=C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，即紧支撑光滑函数全体；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}_T:=C_c^\\infty([0,T)\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为时空测试函数，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处支撑截断。</li>\n<li><strong>(H5) 密度正则性（用于强形式推导）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^1([0,T];L^1)\\cap C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]$</span> 上局部有界、在无穷远处可积控制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在上述假设下，前序节已证：SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}X_t=f(X_t,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t+g(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}W_t$</span> 在 (H1)(H2) 下有唯一强解，且其转移密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足弱意义下的 FP 方程。本节的任务是把“SDE 的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 密度的演化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> FP 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 平稳性”这条链上的每一环写成可核验的命题，并给出环与环之间的接口恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-1-从-Itô-引理到密度演化的链式接口\">1. 从 Itô 引理到密度演化的链式接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-1-从-Itô-引理到密度演化的链式接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节推导链的起点是：给定初值分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>，SDE 解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的密度记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>。链条由四个接口组成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]}_{\\text{可观测量}}\n\\;\\overset{\\text{(I)}}{\\longleftrightarrow}\\;\n\\underbrace{\\int\\varphi(x)\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x}_{\\text{密度表示}}\n\\;\\overset{\\text{(II)}}{\\longleftrightarrow}\\;\n\\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_0)]+\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi(X_s)]\\,\\mathrm{d}s}_{\\text{Itô 引理}}\n\\;\\overset{\\text{(III)}}{\\longleftrightarrow}\\;\n\\underbrace{\\int\\varphi\\,p_0+\\int_0^t\\!\\int\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi\\,p_s}_{\\text{Fubini}}\n\\;\\overset{\\text{(IV)}}{\\longleftrightarrow}\\;\n\\underbrace{\\int\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p_t=\\int(\\mathcal{L}_s^\\ast\\varphi)\\,p_t}_{\\text{伴随}}.$$</div>\n<p>接口 (I) 是密度的定义；(II) 是 Itô 引理加期望；(III) 是 Fubini 交换时间与空间积分；(IV) 是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_s$</span> 从测试函数搬到密度上，即取形式伴随。下面逐环给出命题与假设。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.1（Itô 链式恒等式）</strong> 设 (H1)(H2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>。则对 SDE 的任意强解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi(X_t)=\\varphi(X_0)+\\int_0^t f(X_s,s)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(X_s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s+\\int_0^t a(s)\\Delta\\varphi(X_s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s+\\int_0^t g(s)\\nabla\\varphi(X_s)\\cdot\\mathrm{d}W_s .$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^2$</span>（从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi,\\Delta\\varphi$</span> 有界，随机积分是鞅）。<strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\varphi(X_t)$</span> 用 Itô 公式，二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle_t=g(t)^2\\delta^{ij}\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，故二阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2\\Delta\\varphi$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\Delta\\varphi$</span>；一阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.2（期望演化恒等式）</strong> 在命题 1.1 假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T|g(s)\\nabla\\varphi(X_s)|^2\\mathrm{d}s&lt;\\infty$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 有界与 (H2) 自动成立），则随机积分项期望为零，于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_0)]+\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}\\big[f(X_s,s)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(X_s)+a(s)\\Delta\\varphi(X_s)\\big]\\,\\mathrm{d}s .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对命题 1.1 取期望；随机积分为零均值鞅（可积性由被积函数有界保证）；确定性积分与期望交换用 Fubini–Tonelli，被积函数绝对值被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_\\infty\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty+a\\| \\Delta\\varphi\\|_\\infty$</span> 控制，可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.3（密度表示与 Fubini 接口）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的密度。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\varphi(x)\\,p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int\\varphi(x)\\,p_0(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\int_0^t\\!\\int\\big[f(x,s)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)+a(s)\\Delta\\varphi(x)\\big]p_s(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}s .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：左边由 (I) 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]$</span>；右边第一项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_0)]$</span>，第二项由命题 1.2 与 (I) 把期望写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s$</span> 的积分；时间与空间积分交换用 Fubini，被积函数绝对值被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\|f\\|_\\infty\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty+a\\|\\Delta\\varphi\\|_\\infty)\\,p_s(x)$</span> 控制，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_s=1$</span>，故可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1.4（弱形式 FP）</strong> 在命题 1.3 假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p_t=\\int\\big[f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+a\\Delta\\varphi\\big]p_t ,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 按分布意义理解（即对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\int\\varphi p_t$</span> 绝对连续，其 a.e. 导数由右式给出）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：命题 1.3 右端对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 是绝对连续的（被积函数有界），故左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi p_t$</span> 绝对连续，a.e. 可微；对命题 1.3 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导（Leibniz 法则，被积函数有界保证可交换），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int\\varphi p_t=\\int(f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+a\\Delta\\varphi)p_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-2-伴随接口-从弱形式到强形式-FP\">2. 伴随接口：从弱形式到强形式 FP<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-2-伴随接口-从弱形式到强形式-FP\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.1（形式伴随恒等式）</strong> 设 (H1)(H2)(H5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 (H5)。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)\\,p_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int\\varphi\\,(\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t)\\,\\mathrm{d}x,\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t f(\\cdot,t))+a(t)\\Delta p_t .$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)(H5)。<strong>证明</strong>：逐项分部积分。漂移项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\,f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi=-\\int\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(pf)+\\int_{\\partial}\\varphi\\,p\\,f\\cdot n$</span>，边界项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑为零。扩散项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\,a\\Delta\\varphi=a\\int\\varphi\\,\\Delta p+a\\int_{\\partial}(\\varphi\\nabla p-p\\nabla\\varphi)\\cdot n$</span>，边界项为零。合并得恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 2.2（强形式 FP 方程）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H5) 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上逐点满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t(x)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(x)f(x,t))+a(t)\\Delta p_t(x),\n\\qquad a(t)=\\tfrac12 g(t)^2 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由推论 1.4，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p_t=\\int(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)p_t$</span>。由命题 2.1，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\int\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,(\\partial_t p_t-\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span> 成立。由 (H5) 被积函数连续，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_x$</span>（标准磨光论证），得逐点等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.3（守恒形式）</strong> 在定理 2.2 假设下，定义概率流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-a(t)\\nabla p_t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：把定理 2.2 右端写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)+\\nabla\\cdot(a\\nabla p_t)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf-a\\nabla p_t)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span>，移项得守恒形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的符号约定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=p_tf-\\tfrac12g^2\\nabla p_t$</span>，与本章 canonical claims 一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-3-质量守恒与边界通量条件\">3. 质量守恒与边界通量条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-3-质量守恒与边界通量条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3.1（质量守恒的充分条件）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H5) 成立，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\in L^1$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\nabla\\cdot J_t\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0$</span>（等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 在无穷远法向通量为零，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 紧支撑或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|J_t(x)|\\to0$</span> 足够快使散度定理边界项消失），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int p_t=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对守恒形式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上积分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int p_t=-\\int\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>，最后一步用散度定理与边界通量为零的假设。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3.2（无通量边界）</strong> 若状态空间取有界区域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot n=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 上，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\Omega p_t$</span> 守恒。证明同命题 3.1，散度定理边界项为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是第 10 节反例的正面参照：一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot n\\ne0$</span>，质量不守恒，这正是第 10 节构造的反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-4-平稳分布作为链的终点\">4. 平稳分布作为链的终点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-4-平稳分布作为链的终点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4.1（平稳性的等价刻画）</strong> 设 (H1)(H2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in L^1\\cap L^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_\\infty=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty\\in C^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_\\infty$</span> 可积控制。则以下等价：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 是 FP 方程的定常解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_\\infty=0$</span> 对所用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>；\n(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty f-a\\nabla p_\\infty$</span>；\n(iii) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)\\,p_\\infty=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span>(iii) 由命题 2.1；(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span>(i) 由推论 2.3（定常时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_\\infty=0$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.2（零流平稳的充分条件）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\nabla p_\\infty=p_\\infty f$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 平稳。证明：零流推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>，由命题 4.1(ii) 得平稳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出可检验恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\nabla\\log p_\\infty=f$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty&gt;0$</span> 处），即得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_\\infty=f/a$</span>，这是与得分动力学对接的接口；但本节只把它作为平稳性的一个充分条件陈述，不展开得分匹配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-5-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-的链式验证\">5. 具体例子：一维 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 的链式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-5-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-的链式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\sqrt{2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1$</span>。SDE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}X_t=-\\theta X_t\\mathrm{d}t+\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm{d}W_t$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>。验证链条每一环。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.1（闭式密度）</strong> 在上述设定下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(m_t,v_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=\\sigma_0^2e^{-2\\theta t}+\\theta^{-1}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 FP 方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t=\\theta\\,\\partial_x(xp_t)+\\partial_x^2 p_t .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>，由命题 1.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int\\varphi p_t=\\int(-\\theta x\\,\\varphi'(x)+\\varphi''(x))p_t$</span>。对高斯密度直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=p_t\\cdot[-\\tfrac12 v_t^{-1}\\partial_t v_t+\\tfrac12 x^2 v_t^{-2}\\partial_t v_t]$</span>；右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\partial_x(xp_t)+\\partial_x^2p_t=p_t[\\theta-2\\theta x^2/v_t+x^2/v_t^2-1/v_t]$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 的 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot v_t=-2\\theta v_t+2$</span>，逐项相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.2（平稳分布与零流）</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t\\to\\theta^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\theta^{-1})$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=p_\\infty(-\\theta x)-\\partial_x p_\\infty=p_\\infty(-\\theta x+x/\\theta^{-1})=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>，与推论 4.2 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x p_\\infty=-x\\theta\\,p_\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty f=-\\theta x\\,p_\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty=-\\theta x p_\\infty-(-x\\theta p_\\infty)=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例同时验证了链的四个接口：Itô 期望（命题 1.2）、弱形式（推论 1.4）、强形式（定理 2.2）、平稳性（命题 4.1 与推论 4.2）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-6-链的闭合-从-SDE-到密度的可检验恒等式\">6. 链的闭合：从 SDE 到密度的可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-6-链的闭合-从-SDE-到密度的可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把上述接口串成一条可核验的恒等式，作为本节推导链的总结。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 6.1（链式恒等式）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H5) 成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_0)]\n=\\int_0^t\\!\\int\\big[f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+a\\Delta\\varphi\\big]p_s\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}s\n=\\int_0^t\\!\\int\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}_s^\\ast p_s\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}s .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一等号由命题 1.2 与命题 1.3；第二等号由命题 2.1。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.2（FP 弱解的唯一性接口）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t,\\tilde p_t$</span> 都满足推论 1.4 的弱形式且初值相同，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi(p_t-\\tilde p_t)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\tilde p_t$</span> a.e.。<strong>证明</strong>：两式相减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int\\varphi(p_t-\\tilde p_t)=0$</span>，初值为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明弱形式 FP 在测试函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}$</span> 上确定密度演化，是适定性的入口；完整适定性（存在性、唯一性、对初值的连续依赖）由前序“弱解与测试函数”节给出，本节只闭合推导链。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>推导链由四个接口组成：Itô 引理给出可观测量的期望演化（命题 1.1–1.2），Fubini 把它写成对密度的积分（命题 1.3），形式伴随把生成元从测试函数搬到密度上（命题 2.1），从而得到强形式 FP 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)+\\tfrac12g^2\\Delta p_t$</span>（定理 2.2）与守恒形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>（推论 2.3）。</li>\n<li>质量守恒由边界通量条件控制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 在无穷远或区域边界法向通量为零时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t$</span> 守恒（命题 3.1、推论 3.2）；平稳分布等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_\\infty=0$</span>（命题 4.1），零流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span> 是充分条件（推论 4.2），并给出得分接口 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_\\infty=f/a$</span>。</li>\n<li>链式恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_0)]=\\int_0^t\\int\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}_s^\\ast p_s$</span>（定理 6.1）把 SDE、密度与 FP 算子三者闭合；一维 OU 的闭式解（命题 5.1、推论 5.2）与守恒有限差分代码逐项验证了该恒等式，弱形式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}$</span> 上确定密度演化（推论 6.2），为后续适定性与得分动力学节提供接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-7-链式恒等式的逐项核验-从测试函数到密度\">7. 链式恒等式的逐项核验：从测试函数到密度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-7-链式恒等式的逐项核验-从测试函数到密度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节以定理 6.1 闭合了推导链，但该定理的证明依赖命题 1.2、命题 1.3 与命题 2.1 的串联，其中每一环的积分交换条件都值得单独核验，否则链上任何一环的隐性假设都会传导到最终等式。本小节把定理 6.1 拆成三个可独立检验的恒等式，并逐条写出交换积分与极限时所引用的定理及其验证条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（时间积分的 Fubini 核验）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H4) 成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}\\big[f(X_s,s)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(X_s)+a(s)\\Delta\\varphi(X_s)\\big]\\,\\mathrm{d}s\n=\\int_0^t\\!\\int\\big[f(x,s)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)+a(s)\\Delta\\varphi(x)\\big]p_s(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}s .$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)(H3)(H4)。<strong>证明</strong>：对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_s(x):=f(x,s)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)+a(s)\\Delta\\varphi(x)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|h_s(x)|\\le C_f\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty+C_g\\|\\Delta\\varphi\\|_\\infty=:M$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,s$</span> 无关。于是二元函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s,x)\\mapsto h_s(x)p_s(x)$</span> 的绝对值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\,p_s(x)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\!\\int M\\,p_s(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}s=Mt&lt;\\infty$</span>。由 Fubini–Tonelli 定理（非负可积情形），先对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 积分再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 积分与先对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 积分相等；又因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[h_s(X_s)]=\\int h_s\\,p_s$</span>（(I) 接口），故等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此处关键点是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 无关：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 范数只对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有界而不一致有界（即 (H1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 换成逐点），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 可能随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 增长，Fubini 的可积性验证需改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t M(s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s&lt;\\infty$</span> 的假设。本节采用一致有界版本，正是为了让交换条件在有限时间区间上自动成立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.2（空间积分的分部积分核验）</strong> 设 (H1)(H2)(H5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int(\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi)\\,p_s\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int\\varphi\\,(\\mathcal{L}_s^\\ast p_s)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$$</div>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[0,t]$</span> 成立，且两端作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 上连续。<strong>证明</strong>：逐点等式由命题 2.1 给出，其证明中两次分部积分的边界项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑而消失，无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s$</span> 在无穷远的衰减假设，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_s,\\Delta p_s$</span> 局部可积（(H5) 保证）。连续性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\mapsto\\int(\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi)p_s$</span> 的被积函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,s)\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(x)p_s(x)+a(s)\\Delta\\varphi(x)p_s(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s$</span> 按 (H5) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 连续（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 意义下），且被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\,p_s$</span> 控制，由控制收敛定理得连续性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.3（链式恒等式的分段拼接）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H5) 下，定理 6.1 的两个等号可分别由命题 7.1 与命题 7.2 独立验证：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_0)]\n=\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi(X_s)]\\,\\mathrm{d}s\n=\\int_0^t\\!\\int(\\mathcal{L}_s\\varphi)\\,p_s\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}s\n=\\int_0^t\\!\\int\\varphi\\,(\\mathcal{L}_s^\\ast p_s)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}s .$$</div>\n<p>第一个等号是命题 1.2 的确定性积分形式（随机积分期望为零）；第二个等号是命题 7.1 的 Fubini 交换；第三个等号是命题 7.2 的逐点伴随恒等式再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 积分（积分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 无关的线性运算，无需额外交换）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一拆解说明：链上真正需要“交换”的只有一处，即命题 7.1 的时间–空间 Fubini；伴随恒等式是逐点代数运算，不涉及极限交换。因此定理 6.1 的成立不依赖任何未声明的正则性，只要 (H1)–(H5) 成立即可。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-8-生成元半群与密度的对偶演化\">8. 生成元半群与密度的对偶演化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-8-生成元半群与密度的对偶演化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推导链还可以从半群角度重述，这一视角把“SDE 到密度”的链写成两个半群的伴随关系，为后续与概率流 ODE 的接口（第 15 节）提供算子语言。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 8.1（转移半群）</strong> 在 (H1)(H2) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in L^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(P_{s,t}\\varphi)(x):=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\varphi(X_t)\\,\\big|\\,X_s=x\\big] .$$</div>\n<p>由 SDE 强解的唯一性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{P_{s,t}\\}_{0\\le s\\le t\\le T}$</span> 满足半群性质 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,u}=P_{s,t}P_{t,u}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le t\\le u$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}$</span> 是保正压缩算子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P_{s,t}\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\le\\|\\varphi\\|_\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\ge0\\Rightarrow P_{s,t}\\varphi\\ge0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 8.2（密度侧的对偶半群）</strong> 对初值密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t:=P_{s,t}^\\ast p_s$</span>，即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,p_t=\\int(P_{s,t}\\varphi)\\,p_s$</span>。由 (I) 接口，这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 在初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_s\\sim p_s$</span> 下的密度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.3（对偶半群的 FP 生成）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H5) 成立。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{h\\downarrow0}\\frac{P_{t,t+h}\\varphi-\\varphi}{h}=\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi\n\\quad\\text{在 }L^\\infty\\text{ 中},\n\\qquad\n\\lim_{h\\downarrow0}\\frac{P_{t-h,t}^\\ast p-p}{h}=\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p\n\\quad\\text{在分布意义下}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由命题 1.2 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t+h$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\downarrow0$</span>，被积函数连续（命题 7.2 的连续性论证）保证极限与积分交换（控制收敛）。第二式由推论 1.4 的弱形式：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{h}\\int\\varphi(P_{t-h,t}^\\ast p-p)=\\frac{1}{h}\\int(P_{t-h,t}\\varphi-\\varphi)p\\to\\int(\\mathcal{L}_t\\varphi)p=\\int\\varphi\\,\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p$</span>，最后一步用命题 2.1。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.4（链的算子表述）</strong> 在命题 8.3 假设下，密度演化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=P_{0,t}^\\ast p_0$</span> 满足抽象 Cauchy 问题</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}p_t=\\mathcal{L}_t^\\ast p_t,\\qquad p_0\\ \\text{给定},$$</div>\n<p>其弱形式即推论 1.4，强形式即定理 2.2。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一表述的价值在于：它把“SDE 到密度”的链压缩为一个对偶半群的生成元等式，而 Itô 引理（命题 1.1）只是计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_t$</span> 的工具，Fubini（命题 7.1）只是把逐点生成元等式提升为积分等式的工具。链的骨架是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}^\\ast$</span> 的伴随关系，其余命题都是这一骨架的具体化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-9-链的收敛端点-从有限时间到平稳性\">9. 链的收敛端点：从有限时间到平稳性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-9-链的收敛端点-从有限时间到平稳性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推导链的最后一环是把有限时间的密度演化接到平稳分布。命题 4.1 给出了平稳性的等价刻画，但未说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 何时收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span>。本小节给出一条可检验的收敛判据，作为链的端点闭合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（相对熵单调性）</strong> 设 (H1)(H2)(H5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 为命题 4.1 意义下的平稳分布且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty&gt;0$</span>。定义相对熵</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_t\\,|\\,p_\\infty):=\\int p_t\\log\\frac{p_t}{p_\\infty}\\,\\mathrm{d}x .$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足定理 2.2 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t\\cdot\\nabla\\log(p_t/p_\\infty)\\in L^1$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}H(p_t\\,|\\,p_\\infty)=-a(t)\\int p_t\\big|\\nabla\\log\\tfrac{p_t}{p_\\infty}\\big|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\le0 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int p_t\\log(p_t/p_\\infty)=\\int\\partial_t p_t\\log(p_t/p_\\infty)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\partial_t p_t=0$</span> 由命题 3.1）。代入定理 2.2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int[-\\nabla\\cdot(p_tf)+a\\Delta p_t]\\log(p_t/p_\\infty)$</span>。分部积分（边界项由 (H5) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 的衰减控制），漂移项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int p_tf\\cdot\\nabla\\log(p_t/p_\\infty)$</span>，扩散项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-a\\int p_t|\\nabla\\log(p_t/p_\\infty)|^2$</span>。利用平稳性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\nabla\\log p_\\infty=f$</span>（推论 4.2 的零流情形），漂移项与扩散项中来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 的部分相消，余下即右端。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.2（零流平稳的吸引性）</strong> 在命题 9.1 假设下且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\infty\\equiv0$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_0|p_\\infty)&lt;\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto H(p_t|p_\\infty)$</span> 单调不增，且其极限为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\to p_\\infty$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把链的端点写成“相对熵沿 FP 流单调下降”，其证明只用到定理 2.2 与推论 4.2，不引入新假设；它同时说明平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty$</span> 是链的唯一吸引子（在零流情形下），从而闭合了“SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> FP <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 平稳”的整条链。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df03--h-10-链的数值残差核验-离散守恒恒等式\">10. 链的数值残差核验：离散守恒恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df03--h-10-链的数值残差核验-离散守恒恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的代码验证了密度的数值解与解析解一致，但未直接核验链式恒等式本身。本小节给出一个离散版本的链式恒等式，使代码可以在不依赖解析解的情况下检验定理 6.1。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.1（离散链式恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^n$</span> 为守恒格式在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta t$</span> 的密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{n+1/2}$</span> 为半步通量。则对任意离散测试向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i\\varphi_i\\,p_i^{N}-\\sum_i\\varphi_i\\,p_i^{0}\n=-\\Delta t\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\sum_i\\varphi_i\\,\\frac{J_{i+1/2}^{n+1/2}-J_{i-1/2}^{n+1/2}}{\\Delta x},$$</div>\n<p>其中右端的离散散度在周期或零通量边界下与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(J_{i+1/2}-J_{i-1/2})\\varphi_i$</span> 相差一个离散分部积分（求和 by parts），边界项为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 10.2（离散残差的可检验性）</strong> 在周期边界下，定义残差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R:=\\sum_i\\varphi_i(p_i^N-p_i^0)+\\Delta t\\sum_{n}\\sum_i\\varphi_i\\,\\mathcal{D}J_i^{n+1/2},$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R=0$</span> 到舍入误差。此残差可直接在代码中计算，作为定理 6.1 的离散对应物。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>", "cjk": 56975, "missing": []};
